window.FWN_LEGEND_OF_SWORDSMAN_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_LEGEND_OF_SWORDSMAN_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":5901,"title":"Chapter 5901: The Path to Godhood","paragraphs":["Chapter 5901: The Path to Godhood","His path was not dictated by others but by his own desires.","Perhaps he had truly reached his limit.","The divine beings, the gods beyond the Tribulation, they were his destination.","“Alright, I’ve said my piece. You can continue your fight!” Weiss’ voice echoed as his form transformed into a rainbow, blending into the fabric of space, completely disappearing. Before them stood no trace of Weiss’s presence, not even a hint of his departure.","No one knew where Weiss had gone, but they knew Jian Wushuang was acquainted with him. “Friend Jian Wushuang, you know such a powerful god?” Divine Wood King now believed that Jian Wushuang’s background was not simple.","Although Elder Blu had a sharp tongue, he had been put in his place by Weiss, acknowledging Jian Wushuang’s strength.","Weiss was right; it was just the limited information they had received.","Jian Wushuang hesitated for a moment, then glanced at the others.","He awkwardly smiled and said, “There’s no need to worry. He won’t come out again. We just met by chance.”","He didn’t have the audacity to use Weiss to intimidate them.","When Weiss left, he made it clear: he could act as he pleased, and he wouldn’t care if anyone here died.","It was merely a correction of Elder Blu’s words.","At the same time, Weiss mentioned the title of Realm King.","This was the first time Jian Wushuang had heard of it, but Divine Wood King had long been","aware.","These powerful beings seemed unprepared to act now but instead began discussing matters concerning the gods.","“I suggest we share all the information we have about the gods and then discuss the rest!” Divine Wood King proposed.","Elder Blu agreed immediately, and Lord Hengmu hesitated for a moment before nodding in agreement.","Then, they all looked at Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang naturally had no reason to refuse.","He was eager to learn about the rumors surrounding the gods, especially since he knew Weiss -that was his biggest advantage.","“Let me start. My acquaintance with the Realm King mentioned by the esteemed person just now happened within the Wanliu. I attracted the attention of the Realm King when I was studying the rules of the Nine Tribulations...” Elder Blu spoke in detail, and everyone listened intently.","Elder Blu was originally a native powerhouse within the Wanliu Divine Wood, a Special Life Form that didn’t need to undergo Tribulation.","So, he sought to break through the rules of the Nine Tribulations.","But it wasn’t easy; he couldn’t find a breakthrough.","So, he went mad, slaughtering and plundering within the Wanliu Divine Tree, seeking to strengthen himself, wanting to break through all barriers.","This scene was precisely observed by the Realm King, who then reminded everyone of it and appointed him as the Guardian of the God of Life.","In the Northern Spacetime, which encompasses nine major spacetimes, there was a vacant position for the God of Life. This position would be filled in the future, a future that was now unfolding.","Following the monk’s speech, it was Lord Hengmu’s turn.","He didn’t know much about the gods, but he had some knowledge about the path to godhood.","The path to godhood lay within the Wanjie Divine Tree.","However, Lord Hengmu wasn’t particularly concerned about it.","He hadn’t thought about becoming a god; he just wanted the treasure that Divine Wood King would snatch away.","This treasure was somehow related to the path to godhood.","It was the same treasure he stumbled upon within the Wanliu Divine Tree, leading him to discover it.","From Lord Hengmu’s words, Jian Wushuang understood that Lord Hengmu was originally a native powerhouse within the Wanjie Divine Tree, merely using the name of an insignificant outsider.","Many powerful beings had entered the Wanliu Divine Realm in the past.","Among them was a Universe Master of the Third Tribulation realm who entered with a large group but perished, only to be replaced by the current Lord Hengmu.","Both Divine Wood King and the monk had known this, and Jian Wushuang had suspected it","before.","It was Wu Li who was the last to realize this.","He too was a native powerhouse within the Wanliu Divine Tree, but Lord Hengmu had let him go because he was just a child.","Within the barrier set up by the monk, after Lord Hengmu finished speaking, everyone turned to look at Divine Wood King, one of the oldest Eight Tribulation realm powerhouses in the Ancient Moon Spacetime, who should have the most knowledge.","“Hmm, what I know is similar to what Lord Hengmu knows, but there are some rumors you might not be aware of!” Divine Wood King paused for a moment before continuing, “You should be aware of the founder of the Ancient Moon Spacetime, the former Celestial Maiden, a Nine Tribulation Realm powerhouse. You might call her a god, and I believe she is, in a sense, a God of Creation. Although we never met, when I and the first generation Pope of the Ancient Moon Temple entered the core of the Spacetime Origin Source, we saw her figure. She didn’t truly perish; her essence merged with the Ancient Moon Spacetime, becoming one with","this world.”","This matter was actually well-known among the higher-ups.","It did satisfy Jian Wushuang, this kind of insignificant figure in the lower ranks.","Since the first time he entered the Ancient Moon Spacetime, he encountered the Celestial","Maiden, blocking his way.","There was speculation that she might not have perished.","Even those in the Seventh Tribulation realm could plan for what happens after death.","Let alone a powerful figure in the Ninth Tribulation realm.","There must be some undisclosed secrets.","What Divine Wood King said afterward seemed quite casual.","Initially, the Celestial Maiden only informed them that there were gods beyond the Ninth","Tribulation realm.","And these gods were not only classified by type but also by rank.","It’s just that how this ranking was divided was unknown.","After hearing the words of Divine Wood King, they felt like he hadn’t said anything at all.","Since it was an exchange of information before the battle, it all depended on each person’s","sincerity.","No one dared to ask further.","Perhaps the next moment would be a fight to the death.","Finally, everyone’s gaze converged on Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang was concocting a story in his mind.","Seeing everyone looking at him, he cleared his throat and began, “My story... I actually don’t know much about it myself. As you all must be aware, I am not a native powerhouse of the Ancient Moon Spacetime. I come from the other side of the Starry Sky, which is closer to the realm of the gods. By a stroke of luck, I encountered...”","His story was somewhat absurd.","But everyone listened intently, without a hint of suspicion.","They found it quite engaging.","Jian Wushuang even admired his own storytelling skills.","In short, he encountered Weiss because of his great future achievements, and Weiss was just","making some early investments in him.","Just gave him a few pointers casually.","Divine Wood King listened intently, somewhat curious, and asked, “Friend Wushuang, did this Lord Weiss mention where your path to godhood lies?”"]},{"number":5902,"title":"Chapter 5902: This Damned Pressure","paragraphs":["Chapter 5902: This Damned Pressure","“This is indescribable, but he will come eventually,” Jian Wushuang said with a feigned depth.","The crowd nodded repeatedly.","Among those present:","Lord Hengmu was here for the treasure.","Divine Wood King sought godhood.","The old monk was a Dao Guardian, walking to protect the way.","Each had a clear purpose.","As for Jian Wushuang himself, he had no goals.","He just wanted to leave this place now.","Let them all fight it out!","Danbao had a Dao Guardian, so he didn’t need protection.","Wu Li even found a godfather.","Although he didn’t know why this godfather was a monk, he finally had a powerful backing.","Instead, this time, he didn’t gain anything.","But he had achieved his goal of coming to Wanliu in advance.","Breaking through the Tribulation realm and becoming the Universe Master was done in one go.","That could be considered a profit.","The old monk had said all that needed to be said and waved to remove the barrier.","The elders of the Ancient Wood Sect, however, were clueless.","They still thought these big shots were negotiating.","Little did they know, as soon as the barrier disappeared, the old monk launched a fierce attack on Lord Hengmu.","Even the nearby Divine Wood King was frightened.","Lord Hengmu erupted one after another, but his divine power, even if restored to its peak, couldn’t withstand the old monk’s current strength.","“Hmph, I should have killed you long ago!” The old monk snorted angrily, rising thousands of feet into the air.","The light on his body enveloped the entire world.","Zuo Yehui and You Yenbai, by Lord Hengmu’s side, hurriedly helped him resist the old monk’s attacks.","Jian Wushuang, to avoid being affected, quickly retreated.","And Wu Li, on the side, was quick to follow suit.","As were Blu and Danbao.","The awakened Divine Wood King, on the other hand, looked at Danbao, then at the old monk.","His mind was plotting something.","The old monk, on his side, unilaterally suppressed the two great war beasts.","The two great war beasts couldn’t hold on at all.","Lord Hengmu was also starting to panic, feeling very unsettled.","He couldn’t quite fathom why the old monk harbored such hatred towards him.","The issue of enslavement, in truth, stemmed from personal animosity.","Now that the old monk had become a guardian of the way, there was no need to kill him.","“Wait a minute!” Lord Hengmu suddenly realized.","There was a resonance between the mysterious treasure within Danbao and his own treasure.","Just because a little kid couldn’t notice it didn’t mean that the Dao Guardian, the old monk, wouldn’t know.","With this in mind, he figured it out and shouted to the Divine Wood King, “Divine Wood King, this big monk is after the treasure on me. If I die, you alone won’t be a match for him.”","This statement woke up Divine Wood King.","He was also after the treasure on Hengmu to embark on the path to godhood.","After realizing this, a sly smile crept onto his face as he immediately charged towards Jian Wushuang and the others.","The old monk paused momentarily on his side.","His plan had been somewhat hasty.","He had thought he could swiftly deal with Hengmu, but he had underestimated the two great","war beasts.","He had no choice but to come back to protect Danbao.","But at that moment...","A blur streaked across the sky, followed by the descent of a massive cosmic ship.","What was just a blur moments ago became real instantly.","Beneath the cosmos stood a colossal beast.","Hum!","Accompanied by the ancient toll of a bell, wild beast roars, and deafening thunder.","Before Divine Wood King could make a move towards Jian Wushuang, a step away from reaching them, the old monk also halted.","A formidable beast with an oppressive presence instantly launched an attack.","With crimson skin and neat lines across its chest, emanating a terrifying divine power.","In an instant, it stood before Jian Wushuang.","At this moment, even Divine Wood King was stunned, but how could he retract the fist he had already thrown?","He wanted to directly attack this mysterious intruder.","His divine power erupted in that instant. Initially, he didn’t need such immense divine power","to deal with Jian Wushuang and the others, but facing the sudden appearance of the","mysterious intruder, a trace of unease crept into his heart.","So he unleashed his peak divine power.","However, when his fist struck the face of the mysterious intruder, the latter remained","unmoved.","Divine Wood King was utterly dumbfounded.","“Get lost!”","A furious roar, and the mysterious intruder’s aura exploded, directly sending Divine Wood","King flying thousands of miles away.","Even the hastily arriving old monk was pushed back.","Deep down, they couldn’t help but be shocked by the identity of the intruder.","Just moments ago, through those exchanges, he roughly grasped the current situation in the","Ancient Moon Spacetime.","Divine Wood King had already reached the peak of strength, surpassing even those mighty Universe Masters at the Eighth Tribulation realm.","The prowess of a Universe Master lay in their native universe. At the Eighth Tribulation realm, they could bring their native universe along, gaining an additional battlefield.","Their divine power would multiply.","However, no matter how he looked, he couldn’t discern the appearance of a battlefield here.","Yet, with just one angry shout, the opponent managed to repel both him and Divine Wood","King.","Everyone present was utterly stunned.","Especially Wu Li, who had just been secretly pleased with how invincible his own father was.","When he witnessed this scene, his face froze in shock.","Even the Lord Hengmu, protected by two great battle beasts, stared fixedly at the cosmic ship","above.","He recognized this aura.","Moreover, it was from an old acquaintance.","But he never expected that this former acquaintance would have such a powerful ally.","Initially, outside the Yongheng Kingdom, he only sensed the aura of an Eighth Tribulation","realm. How did they become so strong now?","Clearly, it surpassed the divine power of the Eighth Tribulation realm.","Elder Blu, holding Danbao, was equally nervous.","So much had happened in just one day.","The Grand Elder fell.","He and Danbao were forced into exile.","Just as they had acquired a Dao Guardian, they had thought that peace would follow.","But what followed was an even greater threat.","Even if he had become a perfect Dragon God Warrior now, he couldn’t catch his breath facing","that figure.","The intense oppression made it hard for even Elder Blu, let alone Jian Wushuang, to refrain","from retreating.","Their faces turned even paler.","That figure.","Had sharp, elongated spikes on its back.","He couldn’t forget.","“It’s over!”","This time, they really messed up big.","They had momentarily forgotten the most troublesome person.","Without even looking at the cosmic ship above, he knew it was Babidi who had come.","Because that figure appeared here.","“Chi Jiuxiao!”","The Death Giant God Clan.","Without any hesitation, he turned around to use the Three Quake Universe to prepare for","escape, only to be blocked by another familiar figure.","“Hun Tian!”","Seeing Jian Wushuang’s terrified gaze, Hun Tian sneered, “Jian Wushuang, I used to envy you,","but why are you so ignorant, daring to betray Lord Babidi!”","As soon as the words were out, a fist came crashing down.","Jian Wushuang directly unleashed the Super Eternal Ancient Transformation, his divine power","exceeding 2 million. With both hands protecting his chest, he forcibly withstood the blow.","Boom!","Withstood it, but his divine body began to crack.","Fortunately, he didn’t need to conceal his Life force, allowing him to rapidly recover as if no","one else was around.","“Tsk tsk, the power of Life, truly miraculous!” After throwing a punch, Hun Tian did not","strike again. Instead, he retreated, reaching the edge of the cosmic ship and bowing to the","cabin door."]},{"number":5903,"title":"Chapter 5903: Babidi’s Extravagance","paragraphs":["Chapter 5903: Babidi’s Extravagance","Jian Wushuang grimaced.","It seemed like the other party had developed an addiction to playing the role of a dog!","Nevertheless, even in the worst-case scenario, Babidi wouldn’t act against him.","But he couldn’t guarantee the same from others.","While Babidi hadn’t emerged yet, he intended to communicate with the old monk and Divine Wood King.","But before he could transmit any message, the other party had already found him.","“Cooperation?”","“Cooperation?”","“Cooperation!”","The three parties instantly reached an agreement.","Then, they turned their gaze toward Lord Hengmu’s direction.","He nodded in agreement as well.","Taking Danbao by the hand, he approached the old monk.","Regardless of anything else, the old monk was Danbao’s Dao Guardian, and he was more inclined to trust him.","Divine Wood King and Lord Hengmu, along with their followers, also joined them.","Chi Jiuxiao paid no attention. His task was simply to stop the fighting.","Buzz!","The door of the cosmic ship’s cabin opened.","Swish! Swish!","Several figures walked out of the cabin in perfect formation, then divided into two groups.","They waited in silence for Babidi to make his appearance.","They had really gone all out with their grandeur, leaving no room for anyone else to match.","Seeing these people, the elders of the Ancient Wood Faction couldn’t hold themselves together.","Each one was a familiar face.","And as they sensed the aura emanating from them, their expressions stiffened even more. At the same time, Jian Wushuang and his group also noticed something unusual.","“Could it be that the secret technique has already been created?” he found it hard to believe.","If it had truly been created, then all the experts in the Scattered Tribulation realm would become Babidi’s lapdogs.","At the same time, he thought of Weiss’s words.","And those spoken by the old monk.","The path to godhood.","It seemed he wasn’t the only one walking it.","There was also Babidi!","“Hehe!”","Even before the person emerged, a sinister laugh rang out.","Following it, a thin, large-headed dwarf stepped out of the cabin.","But beneath his feet floated a disc.","No need to say more; it was none other than Babidi.","There was even a golden light shimmering around him.","It seemed to be some sort of divine power shield.","Accompanying Babidi was the familiar Dylan.","But the current Dylan, his divine aura wasn’t weaker than that of Hun Tian.","He had become Babidi’s guinea pig, the first person on the road to resurrection.","You could say he was a pioneer!","“I don’t see anything special about this guy!” The old monk glanced disdainfully at Babidi, but his wariness was mostly directed at Chi Jiuxiao.","Jian Wushuang didn’t hide anything from them and promptly explained the situation with Babidi.","Lord Hengmu seemed aware of it and didn’t seem too surprised.","Although Divine Wood King had some knowledge, he was unaware of what happened before Babidi’s revival of Chi Jiuxiao.","He had initially thought the disappearance of the Yongheng Kingdom was just a minor issue.","He hadn’t expected the emergence of such a figure.","“Resurrection!”","Divine Wood King was taken aback.","Could someone really do such a thing?","Wouldn’t that mean becoming a god?","Jian Wushuang regretted saying too much. He truly feared that Divine Wood King, for the sake","of resurrection, would reignite his path of cultivation and join forces with Babidi against","them.","However, he underestimated Divine Wood King.","Divine Wood King had probably considered such matters before.","However, he lacked the broad-mindedness of Babidi.","Resurrection was merely a thought for him, hoping to be resurrected and become a god.","“Everyone, it’s better not to talk about this matter, or else we’ll be enemies with all the Scattered Tribulation!” Jian Wushuang reminded everyone in a low voice.","The old monk exclaimed, “Isn’t that too exaggerated? Resurrection is not so easy. Only after becoming a god can it be achieved. The aura of that Babidi is quite ordinary, he shouldn’t be a god!”","“It’s not now, but it doesn’t mean it won’t be in the future!” Lord Hengmu spoke up at this moment. “Babidi’s path is actually quite simple. He is walking the path of a demigod, intending to rely on faith to become a demigod, so he came up with the idea of resurrection.” Jian Wushuang nodded inwardly, hearing some things he hadn’t heard before.","There was actually talk of demigods.","But thinking about it, it made sense.","Babidi lacked the power of Life.","It had nothing to do with the God of Life.","The God of Life, mastering life, naturally could achieve resurrection.","Now, there was no God of Life in the Northern Spacetime, so the path of scattered tribulations","was cut off.","In this case, the path became clear.","Divine Wood King was also pondering his own situation.","If resurrection was related to the God of Life.","Then it would be best for him to turn to Danbao now.","Turning to him to compete for it seemed futile.","Now there was a common enemy again.","Chi Jiuxiao alone could defeat all of them.","How could they compete in this situation?","It would be better to follow the old monk, wait to secure Danbao and become a god, and then","he could resume his cultivation path.","But if he gave up his plan, he would only be able to slowly cultivate again.","Lord Hengmu was already a Special Life Form, not a Universe Master.","Naturally, he didn’t need to be resurrected.","Him following along was just making trouble, but he couldn’t bear to part with his treasures.","His heart wavered.","But if he joined forces with Babidi, he would have no way out.","Babidi wouldn’t help him.","And his bargaining chip was not enough!","For a moment, everyone harbored their own thoughts.","Only Jian Wushuang felt very passive.","He didn’t know what use he had here.","If these people needed his power of Life to unlock the Wanliu.","He would cooperate.","And then give each of them a large amount of divine power, hoping to leave safely himself.","But this idea was too naive.","Babidi, surrounded by the crowd, came to the front of everyone, staring at them as if they","were clowns, saying, “I’ll give you two choices now, cooperate or die.”","This sentence was very familiar.","It was similar to what Divine Wood King had said before.","Just a bit more domineering. “Who do you think you are?” The old monk’s temper exploded, he couldn’t listen anymore","and directly retorted.","Babidi frowned, and Chi Jiuxiao beside him immediately rushed over.","The old monk’s aura suddenly exploded, surpassing tens of millions of divine power,","resisting Chi Jiuxiao.","But after only persisting for a moment, he was smashed away by Chi Jiuxiao with a punch.","Divine Wood King hurried forward to help.","Now he couldn’t just stand by and watch, they couldn’t be picked off one by one.","Lord Hengmu was the most cunning, letting You Yenbai go to help Divine Wood King and the","old monk.","He himself, with Zuo Yehui, wanted to sneak attack Babidi.","At the same time, he also called Elder Blu.","Elder Blu gave Jian Wushuang a glance, indicating to protect Danbao was enough.","He directly transformed into his true dragon form, bursting out with over 2 million divine","power, to attack Babidi.","However, Jian Wushuang shook his head secretly.","He had been keeping an eye on Babidi’s divine power shield.","To be able to stand in front of them like that, they must be extraordinary.","Attempting to ambush Babidi wasn’t so simple.","Just the presence of the Eighth Tribulation realm powers like Hun Tian and Dylan posed a","formidable challenge.","Upon seeing Lord Hengmu leading the charge, Babidi remained unfazed and calmly said,","“Step aside, let him come!”","Lord Hengmu’s and Elder Blu’s divine powers were similar.","Both were around 2 million.","To Babidi with his shield, their attacks were like a nice massage.","Zuo Yehui, with his top-notch Eighth Tribulation realm divine power, launched fierce attacks","against the shield but received no response."]},{"number":5904,"title":"Chapter 5904: Oracle’s Position","paragraphs":["Chapter 5904: Oracle’s Position","Seeing this, Jian Wushuang had a premonition deep within.","“It looks like it’s up to me this time!” With a flip of his palm, he produced a token and shouted, “Chi Jiuxiao, do you recognize this!”","This token was given to him by Frolasa.","It was useful whenever encountering the Giant God Clan.","He didn’t know if the controlled Chi Jiuxiao would recognize it.","The moment he produced the token, Chi Jiuxiao paused his attack, startled.","Neither Divine Wood King nor the old monk dared to seize the opportunity to attack, as they were both unable to shake Chi Jiuxiao.","Following their gaze, they looked at Jian Wushuang.","“Argh!” At the sight of the token, Chi Jiuxiao’s eyes burst open, then he grabbed his head and let out a painful howl.","There was a hint of consciousness tearing within him.","The usually composed Babidi panicked at this sight.","His biggest trump card was the publicly known Chi Jiuxiao.","If Chi Jiuxiao had a problem, he would be finished.","“Chi Jiuxiao!” Babidi disregarded everything and rushed towards Chi Jiuxiao.","But the frenzied Chi Jiuxiao suddenly increased his aura, almost breaking through the Ninth Tribulation realm.","Divine Wood King and the old monk both retreated.","As Babidi rushed forward, Chi Jiuxiao casually waved his hand, sending him flying far away.","Cracks appeared on Babidi’s shield.","Realizing the seriousness of the situation, Babidi hastily shouted to Hun Tian and the others, “Go kill Jian Wushuang.”","Hun Tian and the others naturally didn’t hesitate and immediately rushed over.","But they were intercepted by Zuo Yehui alone.","One person made Hun Tian and the others retreat.","“Useless!” Babidi cursed angrily.","At this moment, Divine Wood King and the old monk also turned around and charged towards Babidi.","They also knew that if they killed Babidi, the threat of Chi Jiuxiao would be eliminated.","“Hmm!” Jian Wushuang noticed a flicker on the token as if it were erasing a mark.","“Not good!”","He hurriedly put away the token.","But it was too late.","Chi Jiuxiao completely erased his identity as a member of the Giant God Clan from the token.","This wasn’t because he was controlled by the token.","It was because there was a karmic connection with the Giant God Clan above.","He wanted to dissolve that karmic connection.","Now that the karmic connection was dissolved, he wouldn’t be restricted.","Babidi’s command had completely entered Chi Jiuxiao’s consciousness. “Kill everyone!”","Buzz!","The sky instantly ruptured.","Chi Jiuxiao grabbed Divine Wood King and the old monk directly.","Jian Wushuang swallowed hard, thinking to himself, “Am I going to be beaten to death?”","He felt like he was doomed.","He had no cards left to play.","There was no escape.","“Weiss!” The last straw!","On Tianqing Mountain in the Origin Source Universe.","Jian Wushuang’s incarnation descended.","Before he could speak, Weiss voiced his thoughts.","“I won’t lend a hand to anyone!” A decisive refusal left Jian Wushuang utterly hopeless.","There was no room for negotiation.","Seeing Jian Wushuang’s face turn pale, Weiss changed his tone, saying, “However, I can give you some advice. The candidate for the God of Life beside you is your lifeline!”","“What do you mean?” Jian Wushuang hurriedly approached.","“It’s simple, just tell that Babidi, as long as he helps Danbao become the God of Life, he can create a perfect path of resurrection. This is a normal thing in other spacetimes!” Weiss said casually, but it puzzled Jian Wushuang.","He didn’t even believe what he was saying.","How could Babidi believe it?","And they still had to protect Danbao.","Why not try it himself?","“No, this old fox definitely won’t believe what I say!” Jian Wushuang shook his head","helplessly.","Weiss remained silent and directly teleported him out.","“I...” Jian Wushuang was speechless.","This was his universe!","But he was being teleported out like an outsider.","However, as he was leaving, Weiss, voice sounded in his ear.","“I will teleport you out before you die!”","This was like a quick-acting lifesaver.","With this sentence, it was like his life was secured.","He instantly felt relieved.","But Weiss added another sentence afterwards.","“My appearance fee is expensive. Helping you once means you need to fall a realm!”","This statement might not be believed by others, but Jian Wushuang was 100 percent sure it","wasn’t a joke.","Just as he relaxed, he felt deflated again.","However, at least he learned one thing from Weiss.","That was, perhaps Danbao, as a candidate for godhood, could automatically initiate the","power of resurrection.","If he told this to Babidi, it would be a disaster.","If Danbao became the God of Life, he could embark on the path of resurrection.","Then, what would Babidi need to do?","At that time, the clown would be Babidi.","He could only find a breakthrough from another direction.","Chi Jiuxiao, without any worries, was invincible.","Even the old monk and Divine Wood King couldn’t withstand him.","But Babidi was excited; this was Chi Jiuxiao’s first true move.","Before, it had all been minor scuffles, not worthy of mention.","But now, Chi Jiuxiao grew stronger with each battle. Even if an Eighth Tribulation Universe Master came, it wouldn’t matter.","In the entire Ancient Moon Spacetime, no one could stop his resurrection plan.","“Babidi!” Lord Hengmu spoke up at this moment.","Jian Wushuang paused, feeling that the other party might betray them and prepared to retreat","at any moment.","“Hengmu, don’t be anxious!” Babidi grinned, remembering the sneak attack by Hengmu just","now.","“Haha, I’m not in a hurry, but you might be in a hurry later!”","Lord Hengmu didn’t show any weakness; madness gleamed in his eyes.","If they didn’t fight now, they would really be doomed.","You Yenbai had already been severely injured several times, then revived by Danbao and sent","back into battle.","Zuo Yehui was the same.","If they continued like this, they would die for sure.","Seeing Lord Hengmu so confident, Babidi became interested, taunting, “Oh, it seems you still","have some cards up your sleeve, why not show them?”","“Ignorant fool!” Lord Hengmu’s gaze was icy; he raised his left hand and reached straight for","his own chest.","This scene truly caught everyone off guard.","Jian Wushuang was also startled.","“Hengmu, it’s not necessary. Even if we die together, it’s fine. There’s no need for you to","commit suicide!”","Such madness made Jian Wushuang feel a sense of desperation.","He wanted to persuade him.","But unexpectedly, Lord Hengmu revealed a shattered sphere from his chest.","“For heaven’s sake, stop talking!” Lord Hengmu was on the verge of tears. With one hand","clutching the sphere and the other covering his wound, he gasped for breath, then turned to Danbao and said, “Kid, if you become the God of Life in the future, remember the sacrifice I made for you today. You must grant me the position of Oracle, or else I’ll take this treasure","with me to my death!”","“Oracle?” Danbao didn’t understand.","Jian Wushuang was also unclear about this.","But the fact that Lord Hengmu would do such a thing obviously indicated its significance."]},{"number":5905,"title":"Chapter 5905: Forging a God","paragraphs":["Chapter 5905: Forging a God","The old monk, who was struggling against Chijiu Xiao, widened his eyes when he heard the word “Oracle”.","He understood this very well.","The position of a god. But it wasn’t just for one person.","Dao Guardians could also follow the path of the gods and become a demigod.","Simply put, it was like “every man achieving immortality, even his chickens and dogs ascend to heaven.”","If Danbao became the God of Life, then the old monk, as the Dao Guardian, could become a demigod Dao Guardian.","Below the Dao Guardian, there were other positions, akin to messengers of the gods.","However, these positions were limited and equally precious.","“Master, agree to his terms!”","The old monk didn’t hesitate at this moment.","Normally, he wouldn’t share such benefits with these people without external threats.","But now, with the interference of Babidi, the situation was different.","Upon hearing the old monk’s words, Danbao didn’t know what to do.","He could only make a solemn oath.","After hearing Danbao’s oath, Lord Hengmu was resolute and directly threw the treasure to Danbao.","“Swallow it. This treasure is the key to your ascension to godhood!” Lord Hengmu said, his heart bleeding as he uttered these words.","This treasure was the opportunity for him to reach the Ninth Tribulation realm.","But now, he had to let it go.","However, the position of Oracle wasn’t bad either.","Although it was living under someone else’s roof, it was still a position.","Many Universe Masters of the Eighth Tribulation realm didn’t even have the qualifications to aspire to it.","Moreover, he had observed Danbao’s character.","Following such a God of Life, the future would also be quite free.","After receiving the treasure, Danbao didn’t hesitate.","He directly swallowed it.","The incomplete sphere crazily rotated within Danbao’s body, and Danbao’s innate power of All Things immediately turned into the innate power of Life.","This powerful Life force was even purer than Jian Wushuang’s.","Danbao’s figure also instantly grew taller, and there was a sharpness between his eyebrows. Turning to look at the heavily injured old monk and Divine Wood King, he took out a dry wooden scepter from his sleeve, pointed it towards the sky, and exclaimed, “Holy Radiance Nebula!”","Buzz!","The world changed.","Everyone felt a warmth enveloping them.","Except for Babidi’s lackeys.","Even the elders of the Ancient Wood Sect felt a surge of powerful Life force within them.","This power not only restored their vitality but also temporarily boosted their combat power.","Divine Wood King was in a situation similar to the old monk.","Both had suffered heavy injuries, causing their divine powers to regress.","However, beneath this nebula, their divine powers surged in an instant.","Their combat capabilities also ascended to a new level.","For a moment, they could actually rival the prowess of Chi Jiuxiao.","“Is this the power of the God of Life?” Divine Wood King exclaimed.","Simultaneously, the treasure within him began to resonate.","Recalling what Lord Hengmu had just done, he instantly understood.","This treasure.","Or rather, it was a true divine treasure.","It was the key to ascension!","This was something he already knew.","But now, he understood that what didn’t belong to him should not be his.","With determination in his heart, he chose the old path of Lord Hengmu.","He directly snatched the treasure obtained from Lord Hengmu and forcibly extracted it from","his divine body.","“Danbao, this time it’s up to you!” Divine Wood King trusted Danbao even more, so he directly threw the treasure to him without any conditions.","The position of Oracle.","For him, it was actually a limited improvement.","But resurrection, he was greatly interested in that.","Cooperating with Babidi was like being a dog.","But investing in Danbao was different.","Not only could they form a bond, but they could also treat each other as equals.","They could still distinguish between good and bad.","Following Danbao, at least he could maintain his dignity from the past.","For a strong individual, this was most important.","Although Divine Wood King lost the treasure, his combat power did not decrease at all.","The treasure was used to cultivate divine power.","The enhancement of divine power was fundamental.","The treasure was ultimately just one method of enhancement.","After receiving the treasure thrown by Divine Wood King, Danbao’s hands couldn’t help but","tremble.","Jian Wushuang, who was watching on the side, felt a bit envious.","A pure green beam of light soared into the sky.","At this moment, Danbao illuminated the entire world.","“The Source of Life!”","Jian Wushuang stared fixedly at the core of Origin Source emanating from Danbao’s body.","Originally, Danbao didn’t possess any Origin Source.","But at this moment, the core of Origin Source had condensed within him.","The treasure that Lord Hengmu had high hopes for, only when it merged with Danbao, could","it be considered truly complete.","“Chi Jiuxiao, don’t bother with those two trash, kill this kid first!” Babidi noticed something","amiss.","Coming from the Starry Sky, he had a deeper understanding of godhood and divinity.","The radiant light of Buddha emanated from the old monk, his hands stretched out to directly block Chi Jiuxiao’s path.","“A mortal body, comparable to a demigod, yet acting as a dog for an ant like this, truly shameful!” The old monk taunted in an attempt to provoke Chi Jiuxiao and detain him.","But Chi Jiuxiao wasn’t buying it.","With a punch that split the heavens, he sent the old monk, who was about to increase his","divine power again, flying.","Divine Wood King also attempted to intervene but was blasted away.","They could withstand Chi Jiuxiao, but stopping him was nearly impossible.","Watching Chi Jiuxiao about to charge towards Danbao, Elder Blu couldn’t stand still, ready to","transform into a true dragon and attack.","However, Jian Wushuang stopped him.","“You stay, I’ll go!” His gaze was determined, though the reason for this moment was unclear.","But he had to step forward.","Perhaps it was because of the words of the Elder Patriarch back then!","Or perhaps those said by the old monk.","The path of godhood is not singular, but it demands singular dedication.","Words and actions must be aligned.","To achieve unity of knowledge and action.","Clang! Jian Wushuang stepped forward, effortlessly drew out the Wanjie Sword, and faced the","terrifying Chi Jiuxiao without a trace of fear.","At this moment, the amplification on his body reached its peak.","The Origin Source Universe descended in an instant!","The Super Ancient Eternal Transformation also reached its pinnacle.","His divine power soared to 2 million.","The hundred thousand black holes in the Origin Source Universe simultaneously operated,","elevating his Origin Source to its zenith.","“Life!”","“Death!”","Two terrifying Sword Intents reached their peaks and converged on the Wanjie Sword.","The Wanjie Sword, from an unpredictable angle, merged these two powerful Sword Intents","together.","Instantly, an irreversible force was triggered.","That force rotated.","Neither willing to yield to the other.","Each wanting to devour the other.","But neither could defeat the other.","This vortex instantly condensed onto the tip of the sword.","Jian Wushuang’s expression became even more ferocious. He still couldn’t completely control","this force even now; this was the true power of Reincarnation.","“Starry Sky Chronicles, Third Sword Move!”","“Reincarnation!”","Swish!","This wasn’t just a sharp and decisive sword technique.","It was a dreadful destruction.","Reincarnation was being constructed.","Destruction was rising.","As the Wanjie Sword descended, it unleashed a huge vortex.","Instantly, the surrounding area shifted, turning everything into a flat ground.","This power directly reached the Eighth Tribulation realm.","Chi Jiuxiao, who rushed over, reached out to stop it but couldn’t intervene in this vortex."]},{"number":5906,"title":"Chapter 5906: One Sword Strike, Reincarnation","paragraphs":["Chapter 5906: One Sword Strike, Reincarnation","His figure plunged directly into it.","“What is this?” Divine Wood King exclaimed in shock!","The power of Life was already precious enough.","But another force, it turned out to be death.","Life is precious!","But what about Death?","If Life is the vitality of the Tribulation realm, the pinnacle of All Things.","Then Death is the end of All Things.","The collision of beginnings and endings.","The power condensed from it.","It’s not just a simple equivalence.","The power reversed by both sides is enough to deter all Eighth Tribulation experts.","Divine Wood King’s gaze flickered, looking at Jian Wushuang.","In addition to amazement, there was astonishment in his heart!","There’s also a bit of luck.","Fortunately, he and Jian Wushuang are now in a cooperative relationship.","Otherwise, this move would have fallen on his head.","The old monk is different from Divine Wood King. When he saw this power, the first thing he thought of was reincarnation.","Because he knows the God of Life better.","He thought of a godly position one level higher than the God of Life.","Reincarnation!","If Jian Wushuang mastered reincarnation, then it would be just like what Weiss said.","God is not singular, Jian Wushuang still has hope.","This is the best proof.","One sword, Reincarnation.","From giving Life to causing death.","All under this one sword.","Chi Jiuxiao at the center of the vortex was completely trapped.","Life and Death, both turned into sword shadows, constantly swirling around Chi Jiuxiao.","No matter how Chi Jiuxiao tried to destroy the attack, he couldn’t break free.","When Babidi saw this, he was completely stunned.","Not because Chi Jiuxiao was trapped.","But surprised that Jian Wushuang had not yet mastered the power of Death, but had already developed the power of Reincarnation.","In fact, this power of Reincarnation is not pure.","Because now Jian Wushuang’s power of Life is too powerful, the Death power condensed afterwards is weak, and very weak.","To gather into the power of Reincarnation, the two powers must be unified.","Simply put, it’s the fusion of similar powers.","If one side is strong and the other is weak.","Then it will fail.","If Jian Wushuang’s power of Death is as strong as the power of Life.","Then his display of the Reincarnation Sword.","Even the gods would have to bow down, let alone Chi Jiuxiao.","But that’s a long way off.","At least it’s not solvable now.","“Jian Wushuang, have you devoured Mie Sheng?” Babidi asked incredulously.","In his opinion, only by devouring Mie Sheng could one condense Reincarnation!","At this moment, Jian Wushuang didn’t even have time to catch his breath.","There was no time to explain this to Babidi.","With this sword move, he forcibly increased its power.","If it weren’t for the strength of the source, he would have long exhausted himself and","perished.","Fortunately, the Sacred Radiance Nebula of Danbao had been shining upon him, enabling him to hold on until now.","“How much longer, Danbao!” he gritted his teeth, turning to look at Danbao.","The other party was still condensing the source of Life.","But he was running out of time.","This sword move couldn’t kill Chi Jiuxiao.","He could only trap the other party first.","For Jian Wushuang, who perhaps had limited strength, even trapping was proving to be quite difficult.","“Benefactor, just let him come!” Danbao held the scepter, his expression calm, without a hint of fear.","As if at this moment, he had truly become the God of Life.","Seeing Danbao so calm, Jian Wushuang naturally didn’t want to force it.","But it was a good opportunity to truly condense the Reincarnation Sword.","Let’s see how powerful it is.","He controlled two sword shadows with his Qi and forcefully merged them together.","The vortex disappeared at this moment.","Chi Jiuxiao also charged over fiercely.","But this time, he wouldn’t be facing the vortex.","Instead, it would be a real Reincarnation Sword.","The reincarnation in the vortex was just some debris.","This was the real Reincarnation Sword.","A huge sword shadow confronted Chi Jiuxiao.","Its power could even kill someone in the Eighth Tribulation realm.","Divine Wood King and the old monk both felt a chill.","But Chi Jiuxiao just raised his hand to block, intending to shake off the Reincarnation Sword.","With just this block, his arm was shattered.","“Ah!” Chi Jiuxiao was stunned.","This was the first time he had been injured.","Then he became serious.","He directly grasped the Reincarnation Sword with both hands.","Divine power erupted, forcibly blocking the Reincarnation Sword.","“Ah!” a roar shook the heavens.","The Seventh Tribulation realm powerhouses who were still on their way were all suppressed.","They all looked towards the Wanliu Divine Realm.","Countless powerhouses from the Nine Heavens and Ten Lands heard this roar.","In the Black Heaven.","Several Eighth Tribulation realm experts came out, sensing the disturbance from the Ancient","Wood Continent.","“I’ve sent a message to Divine Wood King, but there’s been no response!”","“It seems something has happened in Wanliu!”","“Tsk tsk, Wanliu is involved in a big way, I have to go and see. I’ve been in seclusion for so","long, it’s just right to go out for a stroll!”","“Night Owl King, are you going personally?”","The highest of the Nine Heavens.","White Heaven!","The headquarters of the Ancient Moon Divine Sect.","After feeling the disturbance from the Ancient Wood Continent, the current pope of the","Ancient Moon Divine Sect also emerged from seclusion.","This generation’s pope was a woman.","Her beauty was not extraordinary.","Her demeanor lacked the majesty of an emperor.","But there was an extraordinary aura about her.","She slowly walked towards the peak of the Ancient Moon Divine Mountain, looking up at the","Ancient Wood Continent, her eyes filled with a hint of melancholy.","What she saw.","Was not Wanliu.","But a terrifying existence that was slowly growing.","“Who exactly is shrouding the Ancient Wood Continent?”","The pope of the Ancient Moon shook her head with a sigh, unable to see through even as an","Eighth Tribulation Universe Master.","She was a genuine Eighth Tribulation Universe Master.","Almost an invincible existence in the Ancient Moon Spacetime.","Even she couldn’t see through it!","If outsiders knew, it would surely cause panic.","The tremors within the Nine Heavens had alarmed many old folks.","The same was true within the Ten Lands.","The Ancient Moon Ruins!","Even Hu Qing, in the core area, felt the terrifying aura rising, feeling unsettled.","“Ah, Brother Wushuang, we really shouldn’t have come here in the first place!” Hu Qing shook","his head, playing with the Buddhist beads in his hand.","It could be seen that he had not yet reached the Tribulation Realm.","He was still an Emperor.","Not only did he not grow, but he also seemed to have weakened considerably.","The whole person looked somewhat haggard.","The Ancient Moon Spacetime, one of the top three terrifying ruins.","“The Wuhua Secret Realm!”","Here, someone also noticed the situation in the Ancient Wood Continent.","He squinted towards the direction of the Ancient Wood Continent, feeling a hint of unease.","And behind him, there was a man in a yellow robe and tall hat, drinking heavily and casually","asking, “Realm King, you old bat, after my seclusion this time, is there anything new happening in the outside world? Like how’s my old friend Wushuang doing!”","North Realm King!","If the strong in the Ancient Moon Spacetime knew about it, they would probably be shocked.","That man in the yellow robe and tall hat actually called him Realm King.","“Hehe, your little old friend of yours isn’t doing well now, and there’s a terrifying existence appearing in the Ancient Wood Continent. This terrifying existence is continuously growing in divine power and will be a threat to the entire Ancient Moon Spacetime in the future. You","kid should hurry up and cultivate. When you’re done, we have to leave the Ancient Moon","Spacetime!”"]},{"number":5907,"title":"Chapter 5907: Wu Zuo and Realm King!","paragraphs":["Chapter 5907: Wu Zuo and Realm King!","The man in the yellow robe and tall hat paused for a moment, furrowing his brow as he said, “How terrifying is it? Can it defeat someone at the Seventh Tribulation realm?”","“Too small-minded. I, surpassing the Ninth Tribulation as a Realm King, when I say terrifying, how strong do you think he’ll be?” Realm King felt somewhat speechless, thinking he had taken on an ignorant disciple who understood nothing.","And this disciple was none other than Wu Zuo, who had come from the Qishen Temple.","Having entered the Ancient Moon Spacetime, he had been trapped in the Wuhua Secret Realm. Later, he came into contact with Realm King and quickly became a Universe Master.","Inside the spiritual time house constructed by the Realm King, he had cultivated for a million epochs in one go, and now he was almost at the level of a Fifth Tribulation Universe Master.","Apart from Jian Wushuang, he was the fastest cultivator among the ten this time.","And his luck was top-notch.","Although Jian Wushuang cultivated faster.","But it was at the cost of his life.","Wu Zuo followed Realm King, either cultivating in seclusion or going hunting with him. It was all fun and games.","Before they knew it, he had reached the Fifth Tribulation realm.","“You’re just boasting. Last time, you couldn’t even handle a wild beast at the level of the Fifth Tribulation realm, I had to step in!” Wu Zuo was short-haired and lacked experience, completely disregarding Realm King.","He thought the other party was just a true spirit, or perhaps the consciousness left behind by a fallen strong individual.","Without any combat power.","Although they had a master-disciple relationship, the two of them had no airs about them and would often banter with each other.","“Hmph, that’s because I didn’t go all out!” Realm King blushed with embarrassment, feeling displeased at being exposed.","...","At that moment, all the powerhouses in the Ancient Moon Spacetime turned their gaze towards the Ancient Wood Continent.","Many powerhouses had already begun to move, wanting to explore the Ancient Wood Continent.","However, the aura they sensed was not coming from Chi Jiuxiao.","Nor from Jian Wushuang and the others.","It could even be said that it wasn’t within the Wanliu Divine Realm.","But in the Sixteen Kingdoms of Qingchao.","Within the borders of Yue Kingdom.","An uninhabited land for thousands of miles.","Not a single cultivator within billions of miles.","It became a deserted city.","And also in the Shi Kingdom!","After the Patriarch of Shi Kingdom made a move, there were few powerhouses left in the Shi Kingdom.","There was only one dying at the Seventh Tribulation realm.","That dying Seventh Tribulation realm powerhouse had now completely perished.","Stepping on the body of this Seventh Tribulation realm powerhouse, a monster was continuously growing.","Except for Daughter Kigndom, where Queen Yun Zhi was present, none of the Sixteen Kingdoms were spared.","“Hehe, it’s time to go to the secret realm!”","Because he could feel countless eyes watching him.","All coming for him.","But it would still take some time for them to arrive.","Before leaving the Sixteen Kingdoms of Qingchao, the monster shed a heavy shell.","Its appearance also underwent a complete transformation.","...","In the Divine Realm of Wanliu.","Jian Wushuang’s Reincarnation Sword once again intercepted Chijiu Xiao’s attack. However, due to the subsequent lack of origin, it was eventually securely received by Chi Jiuxiao.","The objective had been achieved, leaving the rest to Danbao.","Jian Wushuang, who had retreated behind the others, looked towards Danbao. He was also","curious about how powerful Danbao had become.","He also wanted to see the might of the gods.","The only god he had seen so far was Weiss.","Back when he was crossing the Tribulation, Weiss’s two hands had stunned him.","If Danbao had that kind of ability, he could truly walk unhindered.","Chi Jiuxiao took a large step forward, his hand forming a claw as he reached for Danbao.","Everyone retreated, waiting silently for Danbao to make his move.","Buzz!","Before the giant claw could touch Danbao, it was blocked by a shield formed by a green Origin","Source.","It securely received the claw.","“Back!” Danbao waved his hand, his scepter pointing directly at Chi Jiuxiao.","The latter actually took a step back.","But then he attacked again.","His sharp claws relentlessly hammered against the shield.","Babidi, in the distance, was furious.","He had thought that with Chi Jiuxiao’s arrival, everything could be resolved.","He didn’t expect to be stopped by a mere child.","“Never mind him, go kill the others!” Babidi had to shift his attention again.","Chi Jiuxiao, who had received the command, did not hesitate at all.","He turned and charged towards Jian Wushuang.","This frightened Jian Wushuang, who hurriedly tried to evade.","But at that moment, Danbao’s shield expanded directly.","Enveloping them all.","Chi Jiuxiao once again encountered the shield.","“Can it really be like this?” Jian Wushuang looked up at the shield.","A shield that could withstand Chi Jiuxiao.","Wouldn’t that make it invincible?","Even when an Eighth Tribulation Universe Master arrived, there was nothing they could do.","The old monk was also excited, loudly proclaiming, “Rest assured, everyone, the young master has already grasped the path to godhood. As long as he enters the Wanliu Divine Realm again, he will truly ascend to the position of god.”","Hearing this, Elder Blu was very pleased.","This time, their Polunga Clan could truly exist eternally.","They no longer needed to rely on the protection of others.","Divine Wood King and Lord Hengmu, however, felt a mix of emotions.","The former was envious.","The latter was apprehensive.","Envious that the other could ascend to godhood.","Jealous of why they couldn’t.","Fortunately, both could reap corresponding benefits.","Although Lord Hengmu felt jealousy, he had never intended to ascend to godhood in the first","place, and certainly did not want to see others ascend.","His original pursuit was the Ninth Tribulation realm.","With the treasure for refining pills, he had the opportunity to reach the Ninth Tribulation","realm.","Now that the treasure was gone, but he had gained the position of a Oracle, it wasn’t bad","either.","It could barely be considered not a loss.","It’s just that his mood was somewhat gloomy.","Seeing others becoming powerful was harder to bear than dying for oneself.","Especially Danbao, that little brat.","Compared to Lord Hengmu, Divine Wood King’s ambition was much greater.","God of Life.","That was the God of Life of the Northern Spacetime!","The life of the Nine Great Spacetimes belonged to Danbao’s jurisdiction.","Even if he didn’t get to be an Oracle or whatever, he could still break away from the Ancient","Moon Temple with Danbao’s relationship.","Leaving the sect, he could still have a chance at reincarnation.","And the chance was almost a certainty.","He was quite happy.","The most uncomfortable person on the field was undoubtedly Babidi, who also sought","godhood.","But not as a true god, but as a demigod.","Only mastering the secret method of reincarnation.","He didn’t care about the position of God of Life.","With the method of reincarnation, he could indirectly control all Scattered Tribulation","cultivators.","Wouldn’t he become the ruler of the nine great spacetimes?","“Damn it!” Babidi gritted his teeth, but he was helpless.","At present, he was already behind.","Even if he entered the Wanliu Divine Wood and ascended the divine staircase, he still couldn’t","compare to Danbao.","But now he was already on this stove, he had to move forward, with no way out!","And this path was not one he could choose to walk.","Now, the initiative was completely in Danbao’s hands.","All because of that treasure.","The green sphere on the scepter.","Dan Bao looked down on all beings, calmly saying, “I have no desire to contend, but the great","way presses upon me!”","“Since that’s the case, let’s enter the Wanliu and ascend the divine staircase!”"]},{"number":5908,"title":"Chapter 5908: Weiss’ Promise","paragraphs":["Chapter 5908: Weiss’ Promise","The old monk took the lead, saying loudly, “Very well, we are willing to follow our master for eternity.”","Divine Wood King and Lord Hengmu quickly bowed.","Wu Li even knelt down directly.","Jian Wushuang shook his head, silently acknowledging that they were indeed family. He didn’t express anything.","Becoming a god had nothing to do with him. Right now, he just wanted to leave.","With so many people protecting Danbao, he wasn’t needed anymore.","It would be better to leave and find Wu Zuo or Zhen Wuyang.","Just as he was about to take advantage of the situation to leave, Weiss stopped him again. “Leaving now would be the most foolish thing to do. You don’t need to do anything to enter Wanliu; you can witness the arrival of a god, and most importantly, you can receive the blessing of the gods. That’s crucial. There will also be some special treasures bestowed upon you. You have a good relationship with this little guy; you shouldn’t waste it.”","Weiss’s words left him stunned.","The blessing of the gods? And special treasures too.","He wasn’t sure about that.","But if even Weiss said they were special treasures, then they must be valuable.","But lying down and winning, he really couldn’t bring himself to do such a thing.","Besides, he didn’t lack treasures now.","With the bones of Dong Jun in his possession, he could still improve.","If he needed treasures, he would go and get them himself.","What was the point of following others?","If he hadn’t become the Universe Master, pressured by the threat of extinction, he might have done so.","But now, he was already a Sixth Tribulation Universe Master. There was no need to do such things anymore.","He had plenty of time to do other things to improve his strength.","“No need, I have my own path to walk!”","Weiss looked surprised but then decided not to dissuade him. He said calmly, “I didn’t expect you to be so resolute. Since that’s the case, do me a favor. In Wanliu, help me find something. After it’s done, I’ll give you the first half of the Utmost Freedom Intent Technique.”","“Utmost Freedom Intent Technique!”","Jian Wushuang widened his eyes in disbelief and asked, “Aren’t I supposed to challenge the Nine Tribulations Tower? How can you just give it away?”","“Hehe, I’m a god; there’s nothing I can’t do!” Weiss chuckled, covering his mouth.","“Since you’re already a god, why do you still need treasures from Wanliu?”","This question actually stumped Weiss. After thinking for a moment, he honestly replied, “It’s not that I need that treasure, it’s this cat of mine that needs it!”","After speaking, he reached down and touched the purple kitten in his arms.","“What the heck?” Jian Wushuang couldn’t quite understand. What kind of god was Weiss? Not only could he change the highest Law Rules, but he also sent him to Wanliu to find treasures for a cat.","The purple kitten was quite small, with no aura around it.","But he could be sure that this cat wasn’t a god.","It might just be an ordinary cat with purple skin, and it didn’t even have fur.","“This cat is the first life purified from your universe. Helping it is equivalent to helping yourself!”","“If you put it that way, doesn’t it mean I’m taking advantage of you?”","Although Jian Wushuang maintained a tough exterior, upon hearing that the cat was a life form from his own universe, there was a flicker of joy in his heart.","Even though his universe was currently being toyed with by Weiss.","But Weiss was a god, and whatever games he played would ultimately benefit Jian Wushuang.","As for whether or not to go to Wanliu, he was still somewhat conflicted.","Glancing at Danbao, he seemed to see a reflection of Hu Qing in the other’s innocent eyes.","Their personalities were quite similar.","Kind, innocent!","And not inclined towards conflict.","Such people becoming gods, Jian Wushuang could somewhat accept.","However, if he were to enter Wanliu now, not only would he miss out on opportunities, but he might also become a burden.","The strongest individuals entering Wanliu at the moment were all at least at the Seventh Tribulation realm.","Including Wu Li, the Sixth Tribulation Universe Master, Jian Wushuang was barely ranked second to last.","Of course, in terms of actual combat power, he might be able to compete within the top ten.","But he couldn’t sway the course of battle.","There might even be major battles once inside.","What would he do then?","Just as he was deliberating, Elder Blu approached.","“Benefactor, given the current situation, what are your plans?” Blu surveyed the","surroundings as he arrived.","He felt that both Divine Wood King and Lord Hengmu were not good people.","He wasn’t entirely trusting of the sudden appearance of the monk either.","In the end, he came to Jian Wushuang seeking advice.","This made Jian Wushuang quite pleased, and he made a decision in his heart right away.","He would go!","He must go in.","Since others were giving him face like this, he might as well make a trip.","Even if he couldn’t help much, offering suggestions would suffice.","Sometimes, strategy was more effective than strength.","Back then, helping Zhen Ling, taking care of Shen Ling Frolasa, wasn’t it all thanks to his","strategy?","Perhaps entering Wanliu wouldn’t be about fighting, but about social etiquette.","Danbao eased his posture and also moved closer to Jian Wushuang.","The others seeing this, also gathered around.","Jian Wushuang swallowed his saliva, scanned the group, then spoke up, “Since Danbao can open Wanliu, let’s pay a visit. But what about Babidi? Will he keep tagging along?”","Currently, he was quite concerned about Babidi.","Even though Danbao could hold back Chi Jiuxiao, he was only a shield.","Not true combat power.","He had a bad feeling about this.","It would be best to shake off Babidi, then enter Wanliu.","“Don’t worry about that. In Wanliu, strength doesn’t determine everything. That Babidi, even","if he brings people along, it doesn’t matter. After all, they don’t have the treasures to open","the path to godhood, so entering Wanliu won’t hinder us.”","The old monk was most familiar with Wanliu, so he promptly dispelled Babidi’s threat.","Jian Wushuang nodded, then continued, “Since that’s the case, let’s go in. But let’s make it clear beforehand. Since we’re all in the same boat, we should establish an oath. It’s beneficial","for everyone!”","“I agree!”","Lord Hengmu was the first to step forward.","He was the first to defect, willing to give up his own treasures.","He gave them to Danbao, only asking for a position as a divine messenger.","“I agree too!”","Soon, those with Divine Wood King also began to give orders to swear oaths.","Becoming a god now seemed hopeless, and Divine Wood King only wanted to master the secret of resurrection.","To reignite the path of cultivation.","That was what he needed most at the moment.","On the side of the old monk, the oath had been made early on, so naturally, there were no","issues.","Except for Wu Li, everyone else swore oaths.","“Cough, I also...”","Before Wu Li could speak, he was interrupted.","Obviously, the others didn’t take him seriously.","The old monk casually embraced Wu Li and comforted him, “Old boy, you’re our lucky star.","You don’t need to swear an oath. But there are still benefits. I’m most familiar with Wanliu, and there’s a treasure inside that can help you reach the Seventh Tribulation realm. After our young master succeeds, I’ll get one for you. By then, when you reach the Seventh Tribulation realm, I’ll find a way to arrange a divine position for you!”"]},{"number":5909,"title":"Chapter 5909: The Origin","paragraphs":["Chapter 5909: The Origin","After those elders from the Ancient Wood Sect finished speaking, they all cast admiring glances towards him.","Wu Li was especially excited.","In this holy gathering, he was the greatest success story.","It was all his doing.","From the Third Tribulation realm, he had climbed all the way to the Sixth Tribulation realm.","And he even acknowledged a new father.","One who was a peak expert at the Eighth Tribulation realm.","Now, he even earned himself the title of the future God of Life.","From now on, he thought it would be difficult to die.","“Since everything is settled, let’s go in!”","“Alright!”","Everyone nodded.","Danbao’s eyes were resolute, as if he felt bestowed with a great responsibility, and his tone was somewhat solemn, “We will rely on all of you this time.”","“It’s nothing!”","“No problem!”","“They’re our own people!”","Unlike this side, Babidi was almost furious.","Although Chi Jiuxiao had destroyed everything, he didn’t have a part in the path to godhood.","“Reincarnation Secret Technique!” Babidi gritted his teeth, his eyes showing signs of fear!","“I swear I won’t retreat, if I follow them, I won’t believe it!”","However, his words didn’t cause any discomfort on Jian Wushuang’s side.","Instead, they treated Babidi as if he were air.","Danbao waved his scepter, and a map appeared in front of them.","“Enter through the entrance of Wanliu, it’s right...”","Everyone looked at the red entrance according to the map.","Jian Wushuang exclaimed, “Infinite Great World?”","The entrance to Wanliu was actually in the Infinite Great World.","This was indeed surprising.","After running around, it turned out to be right where they entered.","At the bottom of the Roman River in the Infinite Great World.","It was the same blessed place where Wu Li had went into seclusion.","“Heavens!”","Lord Hengmu’s eyes almost popped out.","The entrance to the Wanliu Divine Wood was right in front of him, and he actually missed it.","For a moment, there were mixed feelings.","Simultaneously, there was immense regret.","Finally, they fell into calmness.","Everything was destined by fate.","Although surprised, nothing was impossible.","“Let’s go!”","Danbao led the way, a green protective shield always enveloping them.","They weren’t afraid of being attacked by Chi Jiuxiao.","So they proceeded to the Infinite Great World in a grand manner.","On the way, they didn’t encounter any wild beasts, let alone savage beasts.","After leaving the Wanliu Divine Domain, they entered the Infinite Great World.","By now, those external Seventh Tribulation Realm experts had just arrived here.","It happened to meet Jian Wushuang and the others head-on.","The newcomers weren’t strangers.","They were familiar faces to Jian Wushuang, disciples of the Lian Xing.","Seeing each other, he also understood their intentions.","They casually explained that the more people, the better, according to the old monk.","Anyway, in the Wanliu Divine Wood, it didn’t matter how many people entered.","As long as they didn’t oppose them.","Otherwise, these people joining Babidi would be trouble.","After casually explaining the reason to Lian Xing, they naturally agreed.","One by one, they made vows never to betray.","Danbao was also generous, directly pouring out the power of Life to help those Scattered Tribulation experts in the Seventh Tribulation, instantly restoring them to their peak.","This scene made them even more convinced.","Resurrection was right in front of them.","Just as they helped these people restore their combat power.","The Lord of the Celestial Wolves, who had been following Lian Xing and the others all the","way, also arrived.","“Tsk tsk, you really found us!” The Lord of the Celestial Wolves’ face sank.","Then his gaze fell on Jian Wushuang.","But when he saw the strong ones behind Jian Wushuang, his eyeballs almost fell to the","ground.","Forget about Divine Wood King.","The Eighth Tribulation powerhouse was known to all.","But there were also Zuo Yehui, You Yenbai, and the old monk.","Two top Eighth Tribulation realm powerhouses, plus one at the pinnacle of the Eighth","Tribulation.","Among the Seventh Tribulation disasters that the Lord of the Celestial Wolves had brought, the strongest was only at the pinnacle of the Seventh Tribulation.","There were only 20 or so people, and half of them were Scattered Tribulation cultivators.","Originally, they were full of morale, but when they saw the strong ones behind Jian","Wushuang, they all shrank their necks and dared not approach.","Only the Lord of the Celestial Wolves stood at the forefront alone.","Jian Wushuang frowned and stepped forward.","“Celestial Wolf, I heard you were looking for me?”","There was some doubt in his tone, and the old monk and Divine Wood King also sensed that","the visitor was unfriendly, so they stepped forward and stared with wide eyes.","Now, whoever dared to stand in front of them would die.","No one could stop them.","Even if Chi Jiuxiao came, it wouldn’t work.","A mere Celstial Wolf dared to act rashly.","“I...” The Lord of the Celestial Wolves was momentarily speechless.","He didn’t know what to do.","Looking left and right.","It seemed like he was looking for a lifesaving straw.","At that moment, a streak of light approached from the distance.","It was the sect leader of the Ancient Wood Sect, Jiang Menshen!","Seeing Jiang Menshen was like grabbing a lifeline for the Lord of the Celestial Wolves. He hastily pointed at Jiang Menshen and said, “It’s him! He’s the one who let us in to find Jian","Wushuang!”","Jiang Menshen was taken aback, but he didn’t care about these accusations at the moment.","Because Babidi had also followed.","“Celestial Wolf, are you looking for death?” Jiang Menshen flashed to Babidi’s side.","At that moment, the Lord of the Celestial Wolves realized that everyone else had backers. He was the only one without any.","Babidi didn’t even spare him a glance. Right now, he only wanted to follow Danbao and enter","the Wanliu.","Seeing someone blocking their way ahead, they didn’t bother to recruit them, just waved","casually.","There was no need for Chi Jiuxiao to fight. With just one move from Hun Tian, they instantly","broke through.","Grabbing the Lord of the Celestial Wolves by the neck, he reverted him back to his original","form.","What was thought to be a majestic celestial wolf turned out to be nothing more than a dog, silenced by the grip on its neck.","“Let’s go!” Jian Wushuang shook his head and glanced at Divine Wood King. Divine Wood King’s expression was obviously troubled. His sect leader, Jiang Menshen,","turned out to be a traitor.","If it weren’t for other pressing matters, he would have had to deal with him.","In fact, a Seventh Tribulation realm wasn’t much at this point. It couldn’t change the course","of the battle, just a matter of face.","Seeing Jian Wushuang and the others continuing towards the Infinite Great World, Babidi","followed suit.","As for those Scattered Seventh Tribulation realm experts in the secret realms, they were already dispersed and idle where they stood.","Babidi also understood that these Seventh Tribulation realms were useless. Carrying them","would only be a burden.","That was the difference.","Danbao didn’t hesitate and brought along Lian Xing and the others.","The God of Life.","All the same.","The Roman River.","They arrived in almost a quarter of an hour.","Yet when Jian Wushuang first traveled from here to the Dragon God Continent, it took","hundreds of years.","Struggling at the bottom of the Roman River for a long time, even shedding blood and tears.","Fighting all the way.","Now returning to this place.","There couldn’t help but be a long sigh in their hearts.","Thinking back to when they first entered, those people, those things.","Looking back now, only Wu Li remained.","Most of the others had fallen.","Li Sheng was lucky, probably already out of the Infinite Great World by now.","At the gathering point on the outskirts, there were teleportation arrays to leave.","There was also Empress Fengchen.","Although she couldn’t enter the Wanliu like them.","She had preserved her life.","And her strength had improved.","It was already the best outcome.","Further down the road, it would likely mean death."]},{"number":5910,"title":"Chapter 5910: Entering the Wanliu Universe","paragraphs":["Chapter 5910: Entering the Wanliu Universe","And these two individuals, they’ve both slaughtered members of the Polunga Clan.","Not causing trouble for them is already giving them face.","“I’ll lead the way!”","Jian Wushuang took the initiative to dive down, leading the group directly into that familiar deep trench.","From above, it appeared as a deep trench.","Standing below, it resembled a mountain range.","Splash!","Against the rushing water, they moved upstream.","In just a moment, they arrived at the same blessed land as before.","However, unlike in the past, this blessed land had turned into an arena.","When they arrived, there were still savage beasts battling.","However, there were no familiar faces from before.","When Jian Wushuang and the others left, news of this place spread.","Tamu King and several other experts at the Fifth Tribulation realm fell here.","This matter also spread strangely.","It was said that there was treasure inside.","This attracted the attention of many Fifth Tribulation realm experts.","One after another, they entered this place.","What followed was inevitably a fierce battle.","By the time they arrived, a deep layer of bones had formed in this place.","Crack!","Casually trampled upon.","Jian Wushuang glanced around indifferently and said, “Wu Li, it’s up to you!”","“No problem, I’ll handle it!”","With a step forward, Wu Li made the earth tremble.","The savage beasts still struggling in this place suddenly awakened.","They also sensed Wu Li’s aura.","A breath of millions of divine power.","This breath directly frightened many savage beasts in this place into retreat.","Those who couldn’t retreat in time were instantly cut into pieces by the sword aura emanating from Wu Li’s body.","This kind of thing definitely couldn’t be done by Danbao.","He was going to become a God of Life.","He couldn’t dirty his hands.","It had to be done by those below.","Like Wu Li!","Jian Wushuang couldn’t do it either.","Because he himself had mastered the power of Life and couldn’t continue to act so recklessly.","Wu Li was the most suitable for the task.","After clearing out the riffraff, Jian Wushuang raised his hand and condensed his breath, directly evaporating the river water within tens of thousands of miles around, creating a powerful barrier.","With Danbao leading the others, they finally stepped forward.","“This is the place!”","Looking at the desolate bone paradise ahead, Danbao’s eyes gleamed with a hint of light. “Holy Radiance!”","The scepter pointed directly at the heart of the paradise.","A green aura suddenly burst open.","An ancient aura erupted from within.","The entire Roman River trembled.","The unlocking of the Wanliu was at this moment.","Green light penetrated the stone wall, bursting open, and the position emitting the ancient aura was the entrance.","In front of everyone, the ground began to crack.","The Scattered Tr ulation, along with Jian Wu","and Danbao, felt it most keenly.","From the cracks in the ground emanated the power of Life.","This was the place they were looking for.","The source of Life force.","The true innate Origin Source Universe of Life.","The entrance to the Wanliu Universe.","It was also their ultimate goal.","The path to godhood, the stairway of gods.","It’s all inside.","“Let’s go!” Danbao took the lead.","He entered the crack first.","The others didn’t dare to hesitate and followed suit.","Jian Wushuang stayed behind.","After everyone entered, he looked back at the outside world.","In the distant sea, a crimson light appeared.","Babidi had brought Chi Jiuxiao here.","Looking back at the crack again, he felt somewhat trance-like.","This time, everything seemed so unreal.","From entering the Ancient Moon Spacetime to now.","It felt like a cycle.","Entering the Ancient Moon Spacetime, hearing about the Sacred Assembly, and Wanliu.","Until now.","The span was long.","But it was also fast.","“Finally, we’re in!” With a flicker of his figure, he followed suit.","Entering deeper into the crack.","Searching for the source of Life.","There was a huge formation there.","At the core of the formation was a tree root.","Naturally, the tree root was the root of the Wanliu Divine Tree.","From the riverbed to the formation.","There were at least billions of miles.","Plus the depth of the Roman River.","You can imagine how deep this place is.","But the Wanliu Divine Realm is even more remote.","Yet the roots of the divine tree could spread here.","Looking from above the Ancient Wood Continent, any secret universe could be seen.","Only a willow tree could be seen.","This willow tree absorbed the essence of the entire Ancient Wood Continent.","It was also the origin of the Ancient Wood Continent.","The existence of this continent was all thanks to a willow tree.","“Enter the formation!”","Once everyone gathered, Danbao directly activated the formation using the Life force from","his scepter.","In the instant the formation activated, Babidi arrived with his people, albeit a bit late.","Unfortunately, they missed the formation.","However, that didn’t mean they couldn’t enter, as Danbao’s actions just now caught Babidi’s","attention completely.","Life force!","This was something he had in abundance.","After the formation disappeared, another formation descended.","Babidi led his people into the formation. Just like Danbao, he used his Life force to activate it.","Whoosh!","90 percent of the strong individuals on the Ancient Wood Continent vanished in an instant.","This sent shockwaves through the outside world, especially among those strong individuals","who were relatively close to the Ancient Wood Continent.","They were rushing over.","The Wanliu Willow Divine Tree.","Or rather, the Wanliu Universe.","In the moment of entering the universe, everyone felt a warm surge of life.","This warmth enveloped their bodies, making them incredibly comfortable, as if wrapped in a","warm current.","If they looked from another angle, they would be surprised to find that they were indeed","wrapped up!","Danbao and Jian Wushuang both wielded the power of Life.","They regained consciousness the quickest.","Upon opening their eyes, they were startled by the scene before them.","Dozens of vines interconnected like blood vessels, crisscrossing each other.","As for them, they were enveloped in a thin, white membrane, their bodies immersed in a","green liquid.","Jian Wushuang first checked his divine power and, finding no issues, breathed a sigh of relief.","At the same time, his divine power was rapidly increasing.","This green liquid wasn’t just simple life power; it was life divine power.","Unbeknownst to him, he had gained over 10,000 divine power.","If he absorbed all of this liquid, he might gain up to 100,000. While unconscious, absorption was passive, but after regaining consciousness, actively","absorbing it was much faster.","Coupled with his devouring ability, in just a short while, he absorbed all the green liquid.","It turned out to be even more powerful than he had anticipated. After absorption, his divine power increased from 1 million to 1.15 million. “Why haven’t you absorbed it?” Turning his head, Jian Wushuang saw that Danbao had","already broken through the membrane and was holding a bag of green liquid in his hand.","Danbao smiled bitterly, explaining, “It seems I can’t absorb it, and I’m not the fighting type","of Polunga. So, this life divine power is useless to me!”","“Well, that’s a bit of a waste!”","He swallowed a mouthful of saliva, indeed feeling regretful.","But his gaze remained fixed on the bag of green life divine power in Danbao’s hand.","“Since you can absorb it, take it!”","Danbao was usually taciturn, but his mind was sharp. How could he not understand Jian Wushuang’s intention?"]},{"number":5911,"title":"Chapter 5911: Divine Life Power","paragraphs":["Chapter 5911: Divine Life Power","Since it was of no use to him, Jian Wushuang decided to give it to someone who could make use of it.","Jian Wushuang politely declined Danbao’s offer, then proceeded to absorb the bag of divine life power.","The divine power surged, reaching an astonishing 1.2 million.","Just as he entered the life universe of the Wanliu Willow Divine Tree, an opportunity presented itself.","This advancement granted him a direct increase of 200,000 divine power.","Moreover, whether it was cultivating divine power or absorbing treasures that contained it, the speed was considerably faster in this place.","Observing that the other powerful beings around had not yet awakened, Jian Wushuang didn’t mind.","He took out the remaining bones of Dong Jun and began absorbing them with all his might. With 1 million basic divine power, he increased it by another 200,000.","Additionally, he absorbed the surplus divine life power that Danbao didn’t need, which contributed to this increase.","For a powerhouse with a basic divine power of 2 million, the increase might only be less than 1,000.","Figures like Divine Wood King and the old monk, both pinnacle Eighth Tribulation realm powerhouses, had over 10 million divine power, so their increases were even less.","But for Jian Wushuang and Wu Li, this was a stroke of luck.","There was still a large portion of Dong Jun’s bones left.","It took him a full hour to absorb them.","In the outside world, it might have taken a day.","But here, he saved ten times the time.","And his divine power had now reached 1.5 million.","With a basic divine power of 1.5 million, it doubled to 3 million in the state of the Super Eternal Ancient Transformation, reaching the threshold of the Eighth Tribulation realm.","His strength was comparable to that of Hun Tian","Though his realm was at the bottom of the field, being only at the Sixth Tribulation realm, his combat power was unquestionably within the top five.","Naturally, the first was the old monk, followed by Divine Wood King.","The remaining two were Zuo Yehui and You Yenbai, two top-notch Eighth Tribulation realm powerhouses.","Their divine power exceeded 8 million, making them the top of the EighthTribulation realm.","Beyond them were figures like Lord Hengmu.","The threshold of the Eighth Tribulation realm was around 3 million divine power.","5 million was the normal strength of an Eighth Tribulation realm.","At present, with his basic divine power at 1.5 million, Jian Wushuang didn’t feel any pressure.","If he forcefully used treasures to increase it, his state as a Sixth Tribulation realm expert could probably push his basic divine power to 2 million.","Add to that the Super Eternal Ancient Transformation and the Origin Source Dao Arena, and his combat power would probably be comparable to an ordinary Eighth Tribulation realm expert, if not more.","The sword that dealt with Chi Jiuxiao back then was enough to prove it.","When it truly erupted, the instantaneous surge in power was immeasurable.","Of course, at that time, it was still because of the Free Extreme Intent Technique.","This was still Ves’s reward, which reminded him of the Utmost Freedom Intent Technique.","Meet the strong with strength, meet the weak with stronger!","He had seen this route long ago on Broly.","As the opponent grew stronger, his own strength would also continue to soar.","Seemingly endless.","And terrifyingly so.","The Utmost Freedom Intent Technique. He could call it the Extreme Freedom Intent","Technique.","Far more powerful than he had imagined.","Meeting the strong with strength was just one aspect.","There was also the Extreme Freedom Intent Technique’s ability to disregard space and time!","Space-time couldn’t confine it.","This was the secret technique of the gods.","Only the gods could create it.","Previously, it was just the tip of the iceberg, and he already had that kind of eruption.","If he obtained the upper half.","Then he would truly soar.","While others entered the Wanliu Willow for rebirth.","He was different.","He had to fatten up that cat.","Completing Weiss’s instructions and obtaining the upper half of the Extreme Freedom Intent","Technique.","Returning to deal with Mie Sheng would be more certain.","Technically, by now, Fantianfeng should be almost back to the Qishen Temple.","I wonder how things are going.","Crack.","Just at this moment.","The old monk completely absorbed the divine life power and also woke up.","Then Divine Wood King also woke up.","“Hmm?” Divine Wood King was first stunned, then he discovered his increased divine power","and a hint of joy appeared on his face.","Like Jian Wushuang, he felt like a good start had been made.","“Is this the interior of the Wanliu Willow Divine Tree?”","Looking up at the still dancing green vines.","And the space around, warm but tinged with blood.","It felt surreal!","The old monk began to explain, “This is indeed the universe of the Wanliu Divine Tree.","Haven’t you noticed that time here seems to flow faster?”","“What?” Jian Wushuang was taken aback at first.","Then a strand of his origin entered his own Origin Source Universe.","He corresponded the flow of time.","His eyes were confused.","The division of time is complex.","But there is one point of reference.","That is the spacetime of the main universe and his own origin universe.","The spacetime of his origin universe flows fast, and compared to the main universe, its space","is also weaker.","Currently, the flow rate of Jian Wushuang’s origin universe is thousands of times that of the","outside world.","Gravity is also thousands of times stronger.","When the flow of time in his Origin Source Universe is practiced to be equal to that of the main","universe, it can be considered complete mastery of time.","But that standard is too far away.","Currently, only on Tianqing Mountain, because of Weiss’ existence, the flow rate is the same","as the outside world.","The space there is also more stable.","Even more stable than the outside world.","And under Wanyu’s testing, the flow of time inside is actually millions of times faster than","that of his own Origin Source Universe.","Plus the thousands of times of his own universe.","It’s billions of times that of the outside world.","The gap with the outside world is too great.","Even if the universe of Wanliu Divine Tree doesn’t cultivate spacetime.","It shouldn’t be so exaggerated!","“Don’t be surprised. The fast flow of time in Wanliu is because of the severe passage of Life.","In this place, one era is probably equivalent to a change of epoch in the outside world. If there’s still some attachment to the outside world, time must be seized to help our master become the God of Life as soon as possible!” The old monk finished speaking, not forgetting","to flatter Danbao.","Upon hearing this, Jian Wushuang felt a little panicked.","If he really gets trapped here for an era, then Qishen Temple would be finished.","Let alone an era.","Even 10,000 years wouldn’t do.","After listening, Danbao shook his head, with a gleam in his eyes, and said, “It’s not entirely true. I can sense a force of spacetime, separating Wanyu’s universe into two layers, as if opposite to the corresponding spacetime. The flow of time there may be slow, while here it’s","fast.”","“Not in vain is he our master, to sense from such a distance!” The old monk’s eyebrows raised at this moment, growing more excited as he spoke. “Indeed, beneath Wanliu’s universe, there is a vast continent separated from it. That continent has many tribes, including your human race and the dragon race. I once went down there, it’s similar to the Ancient Wood Continent in the outside world, nothing special. I didn’t stay long and have always been in the universe of the Higher Heavens. The continent below is called the Ancient Desolation World.” Jian Wushuang’s eyes changed dramatically upon hearing the words “Upper Realm.” He directly rushed in front of the old monk, astonished, “You said Higher Heavens?”","“Yes! It’s the spacetime we are currently in. How do you know?” The old monk was also surprised. The term “Higher Heavens” was only used in the Wanliu universe, and people from the outside world wouldn’t know."]},{"number":5912,"title":"Chapter 5912: Higher Heaven?","paragraphs":["Chapter 5912: Higher Heaven?","Whoosh!","Lord Hengmu also woke up, and upon hearing about Higher Heavens, he calmly remarked, “Higher Heavens isn’t any stronger than the ancient times. It’s all dominated by that guy called Qian Deng. It’s more comfortable in the era of Ancient Desolation!”","“You mean Qian Deng Ancient Buddha?” the old monk sneered, “When I was around, he was nothing!”","Jian Wushuang listened carefully, but he was deeply shocked!","It would be best if it’s the same name.","If it’s the same place as Mie Sheng’s Higher Heavens.","Then it’s all over.","How could Mie Sheng’s shadow be seen everywhere?","Jian Wushuang was puzzled.","Although unwilling to believe it, he couldn’t help but ask, “Senior, is there a powerful figure named Mie Sheng in Higher Heavens?”","Mie Sheng!","As soon as these words came out, everyone was stunned.","The old monk’s eyes flashed, shaking his head, he said, “Never heard of it. Usually, the acquaintances I have in Higher Heavens are all Eighth Tribulation realm experts. How strong is this Mie Sheng you’re talking about?”","“Maybe I was mistaken. I once knew a friend named Mie Sheng, and he came from Higher Heavens!” Jian Wushuang smiled bitterly and shook his head.","But the doubt in his heart was not dispelled.","He knew the true background of Mie Sheng!","From the Starry Sky.","And he even brought Babidi.","This was stated by Babidi himself.","But Babidi never mentioned Higher Heavens!","And Mie Sheng obviously visited the Nine Great Spacetimes.","Maybe even the Ancient Wood Continent.","Or the universe of Wanliu.","Taking Higher Heavens away from this place.","But now, Higher Heavens was intact.","“Perhaps, the Mie Sheng from the outside world comes from the future!”","The future!","Anything is possible.","If there is a super existence.","Who controls time and space alone.","Not restricted by the supreme Law Rules.","Can travel to the future.","The Mie Sheng from the outside world is from the future.","And the current Higher Heavens is from the past.","The two have no temporal connection.","But causality adds up.","“Quite interesting!” Jian Wushuang’s eyes flickered. Glancing at Danbao.","Perhaps Danbao was more suitable for Mie Sheng.","Because he is the God of Life from the future.","If Mie Sheng is also striving to become a god.","Or perhaps, Mie Sheng was originally a god?","God of Death!","This is the oldest god position.","“Lord Weiss, is there a position of the God of Death in the current North Spacetime?” he couldn’t help but ask Weiss.","Now Weiss had something to ask him, so it shouldn’t be a problem to ask a question.","At this moment, Weiss was leisurely drinking on the highest secret realm of his Origin Source Universe, “Tianqing Mountain.”","Upon hearing this question, he replied calmly, “Yes.”","Straightforward!","Jian Wushuang’s heart stirred, his courage bolstered, and he asked, “Lord Weiss, is the name","of this God of Death Mie Sheng?”","“I don’t know, I don’t deal with such minor gods!”","Minor gods?","This left him speechless.","The God of Death was quite a significant figure, equivalent to the God of Life.","And yet they were considered minor gods.","Weiss’s spectrum seemed a bit too broad!","“Lord Weiss, I’ve always been curious, can beings who control time or true godly power traverse through time and space?”","This time, Weiss sat up straight. Originally bored, seeing Jian Wushuang’s numerous doubts and sincere expression, he opened up.","“Firstly, they’re not true gods, they’re called celestial gods! Secondly, traversing time and space is possible, but altering it is not. Within the divine hierarchy, there’s also a being called the God of Spacetime who regularly cleanses some past timelines. Otherwise, wouldn’t this world fall into chaos?”","Jian Wushuang was even more astonished this time.","He hadn’t expected such unexpected insights.","At the same time, he abandoned his previous plans of traversing time and space.","But that’s a story for later.","Right now, he needed to figure out if the Higher Heavens here had any connection to the","Higher Heavens mentioned by Mie Sheng.","In his view, this was the most important.","And it was very likely there was a connection.","Because this was the universe of life.","Mie Sheng devoured him for the power of Reincarnation.","The limit of the power of Life was the God of Life.","So the limit of the power of Reincarnation would be the god who controls Reincarnation.","This was obviously a position stronger than that of the God of Death.","If that’s the case.","Then he had reason to suspect Mie Sheng was the God of Death.","When he initially traversed time and space, he encountered Moro’s spacetime, not the former","Mie Sheng, but the Mie Sheng who had returned to the original universe.","He deliberately left this layout in the heart demon, waiting to trap him.","For the sake of this illusion.","To make him think it was Mie Sheng who had laid out the plan before.","But it wasn’t the case at all.","This was simply Mie Sheng’s trap.","Coupled with the fact that he himself was the most likely to become the God of Life.","If Mie Sheng was the God of Death.","The moment he became the God of Life, the other party would probably show up.","And then devour him.","Evolve into the God of Reincarnation.","In the past, he didn’t understand the gods.","He thought Mie Sheng was for the power of Reincarnation.","But as he gained more experience, he realized that even with mastery of the power of Reincarnation, it might not be possible to surpass the Ninth Tribulation realm.","Now it seems.","His speculation was correct.","Mie Sheng secretly traveled through time, plundered the future Higher Heavens, and then","moved to the Moro Spacetime.","From that moment on, he began to lay out his plans.","Danbao initially represented the power of All Things.","Just like the former Master of All Things.","Later, when the Master of All Things fell, Mie Sheng saw him through the future and","collaborated with Qishen.","And then there was the matter in the Qishen Temple.","Now he’s at the Wanliu Divine Tree.","Everything is converging on the godly position!","Mie Sheng’s target is not him, but the God of Life.","Plundering the future Higher Heavens was to cultivate the original Master of All Things in the","Moro Spacetime.","The current Higher Heavens.","Most likely it’s where Danbao will find his calling.","Maybe this time he escaped from Mie Sheng.","But Danbao couldn’t escape.","There’s just one thing.","He couldn’t figure it out!","Why is Mie Sheng’s strength so inconsistent?","When he’s strong, he’s terrifying.","But now looking back, Mie Sheng may just be the top Eighth Tribulation realm.","Because Dong Jun’s strength isn’t that great.","Perhaps it’s to hide his strength.","This is just his speculation.","Or it might be just as Weiss said, just a minor god. Seeing Jian Wushuang’s worried expression, Weiss spoke up, “Don’t overthink it. Time travel","isn’t that easy. If it’s your own time, you can travel as you like without anyone caring. But if","you dare to travel in the main timeline, that’s a serious crime. If you can report someone, I’ll","reward you!”","“Really?” Jian Wushuang’s eyes lit up.","Perhaps Weiss’s appearance changed some future scenarios.","The position of the God of Life was originally his.","But with Weiss’s appearance, everything changed.","In the end, the position of the God of Life became Danbao’s.","And Mie Sheng missed out.","“Of course!” Weiss stood up, tapping the ground with his scepter, his voice low, “Gods, after","all, come from mortals. It’s normal for there to be some treacherous ministers and thieves among them. For the sake of becoming stronger and mastering more, sometimes there’s no bottom line at all. Once discovered, I will personally eradicate them!”"]},{"number":5913,"title":"Chapter 5913: Celestial God","paragraphs":["Chapter 5913: Celestial God","With those words in mind, Jian Wushuang finally felt at ease.","If it was indeed Mie Sheng’s plan, Weiss was his ultimate trump card.","With Weiss by his side, he had no worries.","If Mie Sheng wasn’t a grim reaper, then he would meet a far worse fate.","With his current strength, Mie Sheng might not even be his match.","And with the presence of Elder Blu and Divine Wood King, among others, it was even less likely that Mie Sheng would dare to come!","Regardless, he had nothing to lose.","If Mie Sheng truly was a grim reaper, then he would be doomed.","With Weiss’s intervention, he could relax.","And if Mie Sheng wasn’t a grim reaper, it would be even simpler.","Without that sense of threat looming over him, he suddenly felt much lighter.","He took the opportunity to inquire further, “Lord Weiss, when you say that the gods come from mortals, does that mean you’re not a mortal?”","The gods come from mortals.","He understood this.","Danbao had become the God of Life, ascending from a mortal.","According to what Weiss said, could it be that Weiss was naturally a god?","“Hehe, you’re right. I was born a god, a god in the Starry Sky!” Weiss chuckled, covering his mouth as he responded.","Jian Wushuang blinked, feeling like he couldn’t comprehend.","Celestial gods, star gods.","True gods!","He did know about true gods; he himself had once believed he was one.","But unfortunately, he entered the Original Universe.","And discovered the existence of the Emperor.","With the Emperor, there were tribulations and the Universe Master.","Now, various gods were appearing.","He was indeed a bit confused.","He decided to stop worrying about it.","With his increasing strength, the burdens weighing on him were becoming lighter and lighter.","Everything seemed like child’s play to him now.","That was the advantage of having great strength.","He had confidence.","Unlike when he was with the Emperor, unable to even move in the face of Mie Sheng’s pressure.","He couldn’t even catch his breath.","But now, it was different.","The state Mie Sheng was in before couldn’t withstand a single blow from him.","Even if Mie Sheng had tricks up his sleeve, he was confident now.","Once this was over, if Mie Sheng had no connection to this place.","He would set out to find others, or return alone to the Qishen Temple to completely eradicate Mie Sheng.","As for the Nine Great Spacetimes.","He would explore them slowly in the future.","He was still quite attached to his homeland world.","Returning to his hometown, there was an inexplicable sense of security, even though most of the beloved ones were long gone.","The Ancient Wood Continent was not truly his home, and there was always a sense of distance lingering.","Although he met some reliable individuals in the Ancient Wood Continent, it still lacked the warmth and familiarity of his hometown.","For instance, when he met Zhen Wuyang, the latter was still an Immortal, and when he befriended Hu Qing, Hu Qing was just a child, much like Danbao, each entrusted with a lifetime bond.","Such friendships were far stronger than those shallow ones with Wu Li, whose profound schemes naturally led to shallow relationships.","This time, fortunately, nothing went awry.","Or else Wu Li would have faced consequences.","He still remembered being fooled by Lord Hengmu.","Consciousness returned to their true selves, and everyone woke up, their divine powers slightly enhanced, with noticeable changes in the weaker ones.","Like Wu Li, whose divine power now reached 1.5 million, thanks to his influential father who facilitated such growth.","It was strange indeed that a Special Life Force of the Eighth Tribulation realm could produce such effective black pills, enhancing divine power significantly.","Jian Wushuang’s increase, on the other hand, relied solely on the skeleton of Dong Jun.","However, there were no more treasures to devour for further advancement.","Not only did he need to enhance his divine power, but also his Origin Source.","However, he had not found time to attend to the affairs of the Skysight Heavenly Chessboard, where numerous Origin Sources of various ranks awaited consumption, along with chess pieces of commanding ranks, each comparable to the Eighth Tribulation realm’s Origin","Source.","“Origin Source!”","Suddenly, inspiration struck him. If he were to invest these Origin Sources into his Universe Reincarnation, perhaps he could craft a batch of powerful servants.","Yet, reincarnation required more than just Life force. Creating simple demon servants was feasible, but forging the reincarnation bodies of Eighth Tribulation realm beings was beyond","him.","This method required further refinement, time he currently lacked.","Upon leaving, on the way back to the Qishen Temple, he would have ample time to delve into","these matters.","For now, exploring the Wanliu Divine Tree was paramount.","“Follow me, everyone. This place should be a secret realm within the Wanliu, a test from the God of Life left by the Realm King. There are even better things ahead waiting for us!” With a wave of his hand, the big monk led the group along the vines.","Indeed, this space was left behind by the Realm King, but its purpose was not merely for them to absorb the divine life power.","Things often turned out differently from what one expected, much like Jian Wushuang himself, who couldn’t have foreseen becoming the Universe Master so quickly upon entering","the Ancient Moon Spacetime.","Following the great monk, they soon exited this particular space.","They peeled open a larger membrane, revealing the scene outside.","The Higher Heavens of the Wanliu Universe.","Greenery abounded, teeming with vitality.","Everything was so marvelous.","It made everyone’s vitality surge, as if countless ants were crawling and bustling in their","hearts.","First came an irritating discomfort, then that feeling quickly dissipated.","In its place was a potential for life bursting forth.","Everyone’s gaze lit up.","Confidence brimmed.","It felt like they had completely shed their former lifelessness.","Each one was full of vigor.","It sparked a second spring within them.","The feeling here was even better than the previous space.","In this place, Jian Wushuang felt like he could face another Tribulation in his cultivation.","Many others felt the same.","“The feeling here is really nice!”","“We didn’t come in vain. I feel like by cultivating here, we can improve our strength without","resorting to resurrection techniques!”","Divine Wood King turned to glare at those people, his voice cold, “Alright, can you show some","dignity? We’re not just anywhere, right, Brother Monk?”","The monk’s expression darkened, and he cleared his throat.","“It seems like this isn’t the Higher Heavens!”","After he said this, everyone just paused for a moment, then continued discussing the","uniqueness of this place.","They didn’t take the monk seriously at all.","But the monk was getting anxious.","He hadn’t been here before.","He hadn’t been to the previous place either.","He was just guessing blindly.","But he hadn’t been here either. He couldn’t keep blaming it on the Realm King!","In fact, this was the place prepared by the Realm King.","It’s just that the great monk didn’t know.","After some thought, the great monk felt that things were getting a bit serious.","He knew the direction of the stairway to godhood.","Originally, the plan was to directly take Danbao and head to the stairway to godhood.","But now, it seemed like things were truly beyond his expectations.","If it really was the Realm King making arrangements, then it would be troublesome for him.","“Master, this place has exceeded my expectations a bit. It’s best to be cautious. Let’s move forward first!” The great monk came to Danbao with a steady gaze."]},{"number":5914,"title":"Chapter 5914: Realm Monument","paragraphs":["Chapter 5914: Realm Monument","Danbao replied casually, “No problem, let’s just go!”","The others didn’t linger either, following Danbao’s lead.","They set off towards the new world.","The green grassland seemed inviting, tempting one to take a stroll.","As they journeyed, they encountered a rather dismal area.","Yet beauty covered everything.","Not even a single savage beast roamed.","Only some unconscious wild animals.","After flying for a full day.","In contrast to the outside world, it might have been just an epoch.","But this realm showed no signs of change.","If it were indeed so, that would be acceptable.","It could only mean they hadn’t left yet.","However, when Jian Wushuang saw the deer he had encountered several times before, his gaze turned cold.","He was sure that this deer was identical to the one he had encountered half a day ago.","Their life structures were the same.","Danbao also noticed something amiss and halted his steps.","“We’re going in circles!” he exclaimed.","The others were taken aback.","A day’s time was nothing to them.","But Jian Wushuang was always mindful of the outside world, so he was sensitive to the time here.","After flying for such a long time.","Crossing the entire Wanliu Divine Realm was not a problem.","Even within the Wanliu Divine Realm, which could rival the entire Ancient Wood Continent.","There shouldn’t be no changes at all!","Moreover, according to what the old monk said, he had never been here.","Regard it as a mysterious place.","Then they should have flown out long ago.","But the result was still an endless expanse.","Fortunately, they had brought many people this time.","All sorts of experts were present.","Lian Xing volunteered and stepped forward.","“Fellow Daoists, let me try!” As soon as he finished speaking, Lian Xing took out hundreds of small flags and casually scattered them around.","“Sixteen Star Flags!”","“Seventy-two Earth Palaces!”","“Now!”","As the incantation was spoken, a sound of shattering echoed around.","When they looked again, the flags were gone.","Lian Xing looked astonished and exclaimed, “This place is actually isolated from time and space!”","The Land of No Return!","Everyone understood this immediately.","They were somewhat panicked.","If it was true, then everything was cut off.","It would be impossible to leave.","Jian Wushuang, Wu Li, and even Lord Hengmu had encountered such situations.","It was the entrance when they came in.","Where they also encountered the Land of No Return.","That time it was because of the roots of the Wanliu Divine Tree.","This time, it seemed to be the same situation.","The Land of No Return!","But it wasn’t indestructible.","“Don’t panic, everyone, there’s no threat here, we can explore slowly!” Lord Hengmu stepped","forward to take charge.","But just as he finished speaking, a call from ancient times shook them all.","Roar!","It was a roar that soared into the sky.","Definitely the most powerful exotic beast.","Divine Wood King glared at Lord Hengmu and angrily said, “You crow’s mouth, you’re just unreliable.”","He was cursing along with the old monk.","Both of them had been to the Wanliu Divine Tree, knowing the way.","But now, they were trapped and facing a threat.","After the roar sounded.","The earth began to tremble.","Jian Wushuang took a deep breath; he knew it wasn’t that simple.","In the distance, a green boundary monument descended from the sky, crashing heavily onto","the ground.","The wailing ceased.","“Hmm?” Everyone looked at the realm monument, their gazes frozen.","“Could it have crushed something to death!”","“I hope it’s as said!” Jian Wushuang turned his head, showing a hint of a smile to the Seventh Tribulation powerhouse who had just spoken, then swiftly rushed towards the realm","monument.","The crowd didn’t seem surprised.","Because when Jian Wushuang’s figure dashed out, there was no change in his original","position.","It was just a projection of himself.","For Jian Wushuang, whose life force was boundless, it was too simple.","He was willing to take the risk, if it meant a real threat.","Then it was time for the people behind him to get busy.","Fighting wasn’t his forte; escaping came first!","Exploration was also a priority.","As his projection shot out, it reached the enormous stone monument.","On top, there were green patterns.","And some traces left by plants.","Very ancient.","As his figure descended, he wanted to see if there was an ultimate being crushed underneath.","But he found nothing.","Maybe he had just scared himself.","He carefully inspected the surroundings, finding nothing special or any textual clues.","Nor any danger.","For now, at least.","“Come over here!” he waved, signaling for the others to approach.","Only then did the others dare to come closer.","They circled the stone monument three times to the left and three times to the right, but","couldn’t make heads or tails of it.","“This stone monument doesn’t seem particularly special!”","“We shouldn’t be too hasty. Since it appeared in front of us, it must be related to us. Since it’s","not moving, neither should we!”","“You’re quite clever!” Lian Xing said impatiently, “Why bother with an inanimate object? It’s not worth it. Friends, why don’t we take the initiative and let this Danbao friend try his hand!”","“Agreed!”","There was no other way.","They could only rely on Danbao.","He was the protagonist.","Even Jian Wushuang had to step back a bit.","He voluntarily gave up his position, reminding Danbao i a low voice, “Don’t worry, there’s nothing particularly tricky inside the stone monument. I’ve checked it all out. Just use your own Life Origin Source to explore.”","“Got it!” Danbao nodded and approached, using his scepter to touch the stone monument. But before he could even begin his investigation, the monument trembled.","And strange characters appeared on its surface.","Jian Wushuang frowned, looking up at the sky. He recognized the characters.","But the characters didn’t recognize him.","It was the language of the Polunga Clan.","He had seen some similar characters before, but didn’t understand their exact meaning.","Among those present, only Blu and Danbao recognized them.","After a quick glance, Blu looked surprised.","“Brother Blu, what does it say up there?” To be safe, he didn’t directly mention that it was the","language of the Polunga Clan, but privately asked Blu through transmission.","“The content here is asking me to gather a certain type of plant treasure!”","Blu’s answer relieved Jian Wushuang.","Gathering treasures was the simplest task.","As long as it didn’t involve crazy fighting.","Otherwise, it would be exhausting, fighting and fleeing again.","So tiring!","After Danbao finished reading, he pondered for a moment before announcing the task.","“We need to collect Monkey Head Mushrooms. Each of us needs at least three, then we can","leave this place!”","“That’s it?” Many people showed expressions of surprise.","There was nothing else.","No rewards, just Monkey Head Mushrooms.","After collecting them, they had to place them into the stone monument.","It seemed straightforward.","But Jian Wushuang and Danbao noticed one thing.","This was indeed a test.","Originally, they thought that according to the old monk’s words, entering the Wanyan would","lead them to the ladder to godhood.","Now, there was no ladder to be found.","They didn’t know whose trap they had fallen into.","The tests had begun."]},{"number":5915,"title":"Chapter 5915: Monkey Head Mushroom","paragraphs":["Chapter 5915: Monkey Head Mushroom","Danbao explained to everyone once again the appearance of the Monkey Head Mushroom and its approximate aura.","Only three were needed.","Having more wasn’t a big deal.","Jian Wushuang, however, felt somewhat puzzled. It couldn’t be this simple, could it?","Why were both Danbao and Elder Blu so surprised?","Looking at their expressions, it seemed extraordinary.","He even resorted to the dumbest method, counting the characters on the stone tablet, then calculating the number of words the two said, but nothing matched up.","Elder Blu noticed his perplexity and took the initiative to transmit sound, “Benefactor, there’s still one last sentence on this stone tablet that Danbao didn’t mention. The more Monkey Head Mushrooms collected, the greater the rewards. The rewarded treasure is a kind of life fruit, which can increase vitality!”","“Thank you!” Jian Wushuang sighed inwardly.","It might be a good thing for others, but for him, it wasn’t much.","He didn’t seem to need a life fruit that increased Life power.","Actually, there was no need to say it.","Once Danbao became a god, he could obtain the secret method of resurrection during tribulations.","So vitality was useless.","By then, the strong tribulation experts from the outside world wouldn’t be eyeing him anymore.","But what Danbao transmitted next left him stunned.","After Elder Blu finished, Danbao also explained the whole situation.","The vitality contained in the life fruit obtained here could become eternal vitality.","Extremely precious.","This kind of vitality could even revive the Origin Source.","Of course, you needed an Origin Source to revive the origin.","Three Monkey Head Mushrooms could exchange for one life fruit.","Thirty would be ten life fruits.","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang was completely shocked.","Reviving the Origin Source.","Resurrecting the strong.","In his Skysight Heavenly Chessboard, there were so many super Origin Sources.","If each one were to be revived, it would be a large group of strong beings.","Thinking about this, his interest was piqued.","For others, this was a fair competition.","Anyway, three Monkey Head Mushrooms were enough.","So they weren’t very enthusiastic.","They just dragged themselves to collect them.","Danbao and Elder Blu didn’t need to make a move; the old monk and Divine Wood King solved it for them.","This kind of fruit was just a special treasure for others.","It was even more useless for those without an Origin Source Empress-level expert.","Of course, it could be sold for primordial stones.","Danbao had the Origin Source of Life.","Even more unnecessary.","After becoming a god, what couldn’t he have?","Now, life fruit was just a sesame seed!","But for Jian Wushuang, it was a priceless treasure.","In the time of a stick of incense burning, he couldn’t sense the breath of those people anymore, he could only rely on karma induction.","He also relaxed.","In an instant, he transformed into thousands.","Running around.","Searching for Monkey Head Mushrooms.","His main body transformed into tens of thousands.","Clones turned into thousands.","Then hundreds, tens, and individuals.","There were over ten thousand avatars searching simultaneously.","To ensure sufficient concentration, he didn’t divide further.","With over ten thousand avatars, he could find one in two hours.","The area was so vast.","Though he didn’t dare to claim there were ten thousand, a thousand Monkey Head","Mushrooms were still hopeful.","While the avatars pursued Monkey Head Mushrooms, his main body checked the origin pieces inside the Skysight Heavenly Chessboard.","Under the vast expanse of Tianqing Mountain, Jian Wushuang stood before the chessboard.","His figure materialized upon its surface, amidst the grand chess pieces, where soldiers had already vanished, consumed entirely by him.","Those revived initially were feeble and fell to Mie Sheng’s blade.","Even those bearing titles were devoured, though losses were heavier.","Few remained now, with little future impact.","Yet, the royal pieces held significance, especially among the limited few.","He needed to choose carefully.","Among the title-bearing pieces, the weakest were at the Fifth Tribulation level, while the strongest hovered around the Seventh.","Conversely, the weakest royal piece stood at the peak of the Seventh Tribulation, and the strongest neared the pinnacle of the Eighth.","As for the three god-ranked pieces, their essence was almost comparable to spacetime, though slightly inferior within the chessboard’s realm.","“What was my teacher’s intention in leaving me this chessboard?” pondered Jian Wushuang,","lost in thought.","The Skysight Heavenly Chessboard held various functions, like the “General’s Armor”, now redundant since he possessed the Super Eternal Ancient Transformation.","He required stronger artifacts.","However, despite his efforts, mastery over the chessboard eluded him.","It seemed more like an ornament than a treasure.","“Could these pieces be a test for me?”","If so, it would make sense-his Origin Source transformed into pieces, engaging in a match","akin to the First True King’s method, though unsuitable for him.","The chessboard symbolized the cosmos, its deeper meaning intertwined with primordial","origins.","Even now, he couldn’t discern if reviving the pieces aligned with his teacher’s intentions.","At this juncture, he couldn’t conceive of any other utility.","It seemed like the only method available.","“The complexities of Origin Source...”","Jian Wushuang shook his head, a flash of insight sparking in his mind.","Each piece harbored a distinct essence, akin to life and death seemingly irreconcilable yet","logically fusing to become stronger.","Perhaps this was an opportunity!","Jian Wushuang’s eyes gleamed as he casually seized two royal pieces, both at the pinnacle of","the Sixth Tribulation.","Two Origin Source emerged from the pieces-wood and earth.","These complementary essences, when combined, enhanced each other.","With earth, wood flourished; with earth’s essence, wood’s Origin Source thrived!","This was a principle: two Origin Source, without conflicting directions, smoothly merged.","Their fusion elevated the Origin Source’s strength by a tier, barely reaching the threshold of","the Seventh Tribulation.","“Perhaps reviving them one by one isn’t maximizing benefits. Consolidating these Origin Source might not only familiarize me with them but also create stronger ones, aiding future cultivation. Perhaps that was my teacher’s true intent!”","Jian Wushuang marveled at the foresight of Teacher Xuan Yi.","Devouring these Origin Sources was the crudest method, limited to absorbing only two or","three layers at most.","However, through fusion, immediate comprehension of an Origin Source’s application was possible. It resembled a form of practice, offering the greatest assistance.","With determination, Jian Wushuang began categorizing and fusing the Origin Source pieces.","Initially, he focused on the royal pieces-dozens of them, each interwoven with myriad","Origin Sources.","He only needed to condense a peak-level Origin Source of All Things to succeed.","Regrettably, having devoured so many pieces earlier, he now realized the waste. Otherwise, he could have condensed the perfect Origin Source of All Things, facilitating the fastest fusion with the royal pieces."]},{"number":5916,"title":"Chapter 5916: Thinking Too Far Ahead","paragraphs":["Chapter 5916: Thinking Too Far Ahead","The limitation of the past layout was partly to blame.","Back then, the focus was solely on reaching the pinnacle of strength.","But now, with a calm mind, it becomes apparent that the best path is often the one pointed out by a mentor.","Fortunately, his Life power could transform All Things just as effectively.","He could condense the primordial essence of all things before him and promptly restore them to perfection.","Any missing rules could be supplemented at his discretion.","With his current power and understanding, he had mastery over the universe, bordering on the divine level of creation.","Establishing rules, crafting everything anew, he guided the pawns of destiny back to their origins.","Those labeled as “commanders” represented the ultimate destiny of all things.","Life was but a part of it!","It all traced back to what he had seen in the Life Palace years ago, profoundly influencing his life.","He now possessed the power of life.","The power of death, he could wrest from Mie Sheng.","Reincarnation was no longer a concern.","His own origin space was now perfected, and his cultivation time was dedicated to the future.","The framework of time and space had been laid out.","The cycle of time!","If what vise said held true.","Life and death were but minor divine positions.","Reincarnation stood as the second-tier divine position.","Above that was the third-tier, the cycle of time.","But what lay beyond the cycle of time?","“Perhaps I’m overthinking it,” he shook his head.","Mie Sheng’s desire to devour the power of Life was merely a move in the grand scheme of things.","Such magnificence!","As a Universe Master of the Sixth Tribulation realm, he had already surpassed even the significance of time and space.","Somewhat arrogant, Jian Wushuang thought to himself.","In reality, paths can be taken one step at a time. But before reaching the end, one must be prepared to turn in that direction.","It’s always better to be prepared in advance!","He had done such things before, always deciding for himself.","Now, with the presence of the great god Weiss, he felt it appropriate to seek advice.","While his avatar searched for Monkey Head Mushrooms, his Origin Source avatar leisurely entered Weiss’s estate.","The vast estate covered a tenth of Tianqing Mountain’s territory.","The facilities within were still not properly organized.","But Weiss seemed to be enjoying himself immensely.","The spring he had initially acquired was turned into a well, while its pillar became the fountain at the center of the estate.","It was incredibly luxurious.","Jian Wushuang couldn’t help but envy it all.","This was his own universe, but his master hadn’t arranged much in it.","There was only a dilapidated Wind Pavilion, which paled in comparison to Weiss’s grand estate.","Though he could transform it directly, it lacked spirituality and was devoid of some liveliness. He strolled towards the lakeside where Weiss often lingered and indeed found Weiss playing with the cat.","The purple-skinned cat looked pitifully thin.","The first life in the universe had been turned into a cat by Weiss.","Jian Wushuang couldn’t help but laugh and cry at the situation.","“Weiss, my lord!”","Arriving at the lakeside, he didn’t hesitate, simply found a spot and sat down.","After greeting, he observed Weiss amusing himself with the cat, showing no signs of urgency.","This cat was from his universe, yet he couldn’t sense any cat-like aura from it.","It was indeed quite unusual.","“You’ve entered the Wanliu Universe, why do you still have time to come here?” Weiss casually asked as he played with the cat.","“If there’s something, just say it. I’m in a good mood now and might tell you some very mysterious things!”","“This cat?” Jian Wushuang didn’t immediately get to the point but instead inquired about the","cat.","He truly couldn’t understand why Weiss insisted on turning the first life in his universe into a","cat.","“He’s not just a cat, he’s the future God of Destruction!” Weiss picked up the purple, skinny cat, holding it up and continued, “Be careful with your words; he holds grudges!”","“God of Destruction?” Jian Wushuang was surprised. “What kind of god is that?”","God of Destruction!","It was the first time he had heard of it.","A cat, becoming a god!","It sounded absurd no matter how you looked at it.","Even if Weiss had the means to alter the supreme rules, he shouldn’t be able to casually turn a","cat into a god!","“I can tell you now, but you won’t understand. However, there’s one thing I can tell you: originally, you were the chosen one for the God of Destruction, but judging from your","performance, it’s getting worse and worse, and...”","The last words lingered on the tip of his tongue, but Weiss swallowed them back, saying","calmly, “I can only say that perhaps you’ll have a better position!”","“Could it be that I’ll truly become a god in the future?” For a moment, he forgot the purpose","of his visit, consumed by curiosity about his own destiny.","Such curiosity was inevitable.","After all, who wouldn’t be curious about their future?","Otherwise, why would there be so many fortune tellers among the common folk?","Speaking of which, Hu Qing could predict the future with just a glimpse of Zen.","He was favored by time and the finest practitioner of spacetime.","Given the chance in the future, he would have Hu Qing predict for him.","“But don’t dwell on that. Let’s talk about your matter!” Weiss, aware of his purpose, didn’t","dwell on the topic.","This time, Jian Wushuang got straight to the point, expressing his dilemma.","Upon hearing it, Weiss chuckled, covering his mouth.","“You’re not thinking big enough. You should consider the vast expanse of stars above your","universe. That way, your aspirations will broaden!”","“Really?” He became excited instantly.","He knew he must be the chosen one; how could he not be?","But then, Weiss poured a bucket of cold water on his enthusiasm.","“You’re quite audacious in your thoughts. There are indeed hierarchies among the gods, but","these divisions are fixed. If you want to become a stronger god, you need to strive as much as possible in the mortal realm. Moreover, each position you choose may not be vacant. So, don’t be too greedy!” Weiss shook his head, providing an example he had seen.","It was the founder of Ancient Moon Spacetime.","That Celestial Maiden.","Her path was once broad.","Her vision was vast.","But she ultimately failed.","Observing the entirety of Ancient Moon Spacetime, Jian Wushuang could see many","peculiarities.","Like the Wanliu Divine Tree in the Ancient Wood Continent.","It was evidently on par with the Celestial Maiden.","Yet, she managed to leave behind this willow.","Then there was the Wu Hua Secret Realm.","What existed there was also unique.","It was a kind of void power. Clearly similar to the Wanliu Divine Tree.","These powers were within easy reach for the Celestial Maiden.","If she had intervened once.","The power she wielded wouldn’t be ordinary.","It would be a level higher than reincarnation.","“That Celestial Maiden once held many powers. In the end, she aimed to break through into virtual life, replicating another virtual Starry Sky around the central one!” Jian Wushuang’s","eyes widened upon hearing this.","This was many levels higher than what he was currently considering, such as the cycle of","spacetime.","If he were to create another Starry Sky himself.","He had the audacity for it.","But confidence, well, that was another matter.","Yet, the Celestial Maiden dared to replicate an identical Starry Sky within the existing one."]},{"number":5917,"title":"Chapter 5917: Path of the Celestial Maiden","paragraphs":["Chapter 5917: Path of the Celestial Maiden","This is somewhat exaggerated.","To put it bluntly, it’s like picking peaches.","If this expanse of Starry Sky had an owner, would they spare her?","No wonder it fell.","“Since you’re so bold and want to challenge, then go follow the path of the Celestial Maiden. I’ll collect your corpse when the time comes!”","Jian Wushuang shook his head solemnly, firm in his resolve, “I won’t walk someone else’s path. I only want to walk my own. I didn’t expect the Heavenly Maiden’s influence to be so great. Even if I fall, it’s not regrettable.”","“Replicating the Starry Sky, creating two identical individuals, two similar flowers, it wouldn’t be so easy!” Weiss shook his head lightly, a hint of regret still in his eyes.","Here, when he mentions two flowers, he actually refers to two worlds.","One flower, one world.","Representing people brings even more complexity.","This made him think of Jiang Shang again.","The Celestial Maiden and Jiang Shang are intricately connected.","That’s a disaster for him!","It’s not a loss if she dies.","Otherwise, he’d end up dead at her hands sooner or later.","Now, within Wanliu, the stairway to godhood.","And the source of Life’s power are both in Danbao’s control.","It means the end for the Celestial Maiden, with no possibility of turning the tables.","This example was a heavy blow to him.","In the past, he didn’t believe in overpowering all methods with one’s strength, defying the words of the gods.","Now, after hearing this, he believes even less.","His pressure isn’t actually that great.","Becoming the Master of Time and Space is actually quite good.","Controlling time and space, even without traversing the future, he can bear it.","Especially for the current Northern Spacetime.","The three ancient beings at this level are equally invincible.","Even the gods can’t control them.","Unless one courts death, like the Celestial Maiden did.","As long as he doesn’t court death, he won’t die.","All that’s left for him is Mie Sheng.","Kill Mie Sheng and it’s over.","No pressure.","Afterward, he finds Teacher Xuan Yi and they acknowledge each other as teacher and disciple. Perfect!","But the teacher has always invested in him, there must be things he needs his help with.","He just doesn’t want to disappoint him.","He doesn’t want to regret it later.","So he puts pressure on himself.","Looking back, he realizes he’s been thinking too much.","“Your Origin Source on that chessboard is already enough for you to court death. Anyway, it won’t be you who ends up dead in the end. As for your own Origin Source, don’t make too many adjustments. You haven’t even reached the limit under the Law Rules yet. It’s not too late to plan when you reach the Ninth Tribulation!” Weiss finally reminded him.","Using the chessboard to simulate the Origin Source powers he’ll need to integrate in the future.","At least there’s one chance of failure!","Jian Wushuang respectfully bowed.","Then he turned and left.","Back to the foot of the mountain.","Planning his future.","First, it’s the cycle of time and space.","He first integrates the chess pieces’ sources from the Skysight Heavenly Chessboard into the","cycle of time and space.","Then he’ll make other plans.","This is quite difficult for him.","As for the rest, as Weiss said, it can wait until later.","Now is not the time for him to consider it.","He can’t follow in the footsteps of the Celestial Maiden.","Integrating the temperament of the title into the Origin Source of All Things, forming the","Power of All Things.","Then it transforms into the power of Life.","From All Things to Life.","It requires a unified Origin Source to integrate.","The chess pieces marked with the handsome insignia contained the essence of unity.","“It’s rather convenient!”","Jian Wushuang’s mind sank, immediately awakening to the situation. He felt a tremor in his","heart.","“Could it be that this is really Teacher Xuan Yi’s instruction? Perhaps Weiss knows Teacher","Xuan Yi but has been denying it all along!”","He could speculate as such.","Or he could act as if nothing had happened.","Even Weiss had to conceal things, using cryptic and difficult-to-understand matters to","enlighten him.","Perhaps for even greater concealment.","Initially feeling somewhat relaxed, he suddenly felt a surge of pressure.","He still needed to strive.","Otherwise, how could he face his teacher?","He didn’t want the day of teacher-disciple recognition to be a scene of world destruction.","Time passed little by little.","In the blink of an eye, he had been here for a month.","There were indeed quite a few Monkey Head Mushrooms.","His dharma body had searched for thousands of them.","Meanwhile, his main body had integrated a new source of life on the chessboard.","Crack!","As the life chess piece fell onto the Skysight Heavenly Chessboard, it instantly transformed","into a set of green battle armor.","On the chest of the armor, there was a circle inscribed with the word “Tribulation”.","Tribulation Armor!","Replacing the original General Armor.","Originally, he thought there would be subsequent King Armor, God Armor.","He didn’t expect to encounter Tribulation Armor.","He couldn’t wait to summon the Tribulation Armor.","As soon as he put it on, a surge of amplified Life force erupted.","His Life force was increased by a hundredfold.","Not only that.","After putting on the Tribulation Armor, his divine power also increased by a whopping","500,000.","Directly reaching 2 million.","The increase wasn’t in basic divine power.","But he found that after wearing the Tribulation Armor, he could also perform the Super","Eternal Ancient Transformation.","In other words, when he now used the Super Eternal Ancient Transformation, his divine power could soar to 4 million.","It was already the standard power of an Eight Tribulations realm.","This made him even more interested in merging the Origin Source of chess pieces.","Now it was the Life force-dominated Tribulation Armor.","If he could condense a Death force.","The two would merge to become the power of Reincarnation.","The amplified power would be the even stronger power of Reincarnation.","This would have a greater blessing for his third sword in the Starry Sky Chronicles.","Divine power enhancement was just basic.","The most important thing was the blessing of the Origin Source.","This was more important to him.","He finally figured out the function of the Skysight Heavenly Chessboard. Unfortunately, he didn’t know much about the power of Death, otherwise, his Sword of","Reincarnation wouldn’t have been so weak, unable to display its true power.","He still needed to find a breakthrough from Mie Sheng.","In a blink of an eye, he had gone from being watched by Mie Sheng to watching Mie Sheng.","“Phew, take it slow!” Now, he wasn’t in a hurry.","His dharma body returned and merged back into his main body.","Danbao had already informed him that everyone had collected enough Monkey Head","Mushrooms.","He was the only one left.","“6,000!”","They could be exchanged for 2,000 life fruits.","But now his need for life fruits wasn’t so obvious.","Because he couldn’t revive the chess pieces so early.","Those chess pieces needed to help him simulate his own Origin Source endpoint. If successful,","then revival would be cause for celebration.","If he failed, it would be all over.","He would have to seek out other options.","Of course, failure was a thankless endeavor.","He would surely mitigate the losses; if he sensed things weren’t going well, he’d halt, disrupt","the sequence of condensing the Origin Source, and then revive it.","It wouldn’t be considered a waste.","Those three god-level pieces he felt were likely the source of divinity.","Whether his conjecture was correct remained unknown.","If it were true, he’d have to be even more cautious.","Losing even one would be heartbreaking. Taking a step forward, he traversed swiftly. Soon, he arrived at the stone monument.","After exchanging greetings with Danbao and the others, he stepped forward to pay the","required fee.","Seeing the desolation on many faces, he understood that these people probably already knew about the additional rewards."]},{"number":5918,"title":"Chapter 5918: The Movement of Divine Power","paragraphs":["Chapter 5918: The Movement of Divine Power","Actually, it’s not too bad without the life fruit;.","It doesn’t affect the path of resurrection in the future.","It just slows things down a bit.","To prevent jealousy or resentment from these people towards Danbao, he deliberately threw a mustard seed towards the stone monument.","Although these people already suspected that he had been out for so long and must have found quite a few Monkey Head Mushrooms, no one dared to speak out.","Everyone present could tell that Danbao and Elder Blu trusted Jian Wushuang more than any other Dao Protector, making him more reliable.","They didn’t dare to do anything to Jian Wushuang.","After probing into the stone monument, he obtained the life fruit, which also meant the completion of the task.","Even after obtaining more Monkey Head Mushrooms, he couldn’t exchange them for life fruits anymore.","With a clatter, he was the last one.","As he completed his task, the stone monument began to tremble, emitting a buzzing sound.","Everyone shook as the area within thousands of miles around the stone monument suddenly changed. In the next moment, everyone was traversing through space-time, leaving this place behind.","After they left, another group of people arrived, led by Babidi and others, lagging behind Jian Wushuang and the others by a step.","...","When Jian Wushuang and the others reappeared, they found themselves in a quiet mountain forest.","Looking up, they could see faint beams of light descending, blocked by towering trees above. “Great Monk, do you recognize this place?” Divine Wood King leaped onto the top of the towering tree’s leaves, scanning the surroundings.","He was completely unfamiliar with this place, so he naturally looked towards the super powerhouse who emerged from the Wanliu Willow Divine Tree, the old monk.","“I don’t recognize it. We must have entered a special secret realm, arranged by Realm King. As long as we follow the instructions given, we won’t go wrong!” The monk shook his head, offering an explanation.","Lord Hengmu, however, was skeptical, taunting, “Then why don’t you give us a hint? We can’t just wander around like last time!”","“Let’s go check out the mountain ahead first!” Danbao spoke up at this moment, and the others didn’t object.","In fact, they had limited options.","Since there was a mountain ahead, it was better to go and explore than to argue here.","For safety’s sake, Danbao shielded everyone with the Shield of Life as they advanced cautiously.","Although they hadn’t encountered any danger yet, they couldn’t afford to be careless. In the previous space, they had heard a roar.","Although they couldn’t sense the specific aura, the divine power contained in that roar was extremely terrifying.","It was definitely at the level of Eight Tribulations realm.","In the universe of the Wanliu Willow, it was normal for powerful beings of any level to appear.","They still had to be cautious.","Jian Wushuang’s Thought power continued to survey the surroundings, but he hadn’t noticed anything unusual.","Instead, he felt that the structure of this place was deeper than the previous space.","The power here was also extremely special, as evidenced by these towering trees.","Each contained more than 1,000 divine power.","The life structure of these clans surpassed that of the human race by an unknown amount.","Despite their divine powers now starting in the millions, if averaged out, they were definitely inferior to these towering trees.","The grass and trees nurtured by the Origin Source of Life in the universe were so powerful.","If it were material life, it would definitely be stronger.","The common divine power of the human race was less than one.","It was only after embarking on cultivation that they would gradually accumulate divine power.","They were all at the pinnacle of the human race, appearing strong.","In fact, in terms of origin, they were not as good as these grass and tree plant lives.","Of course, except for those Special Life Forms at the cosmic level.","Jian Wushuang was actually a Special Life Form.","However, his uniqueness couldn’t be compared with those at the cosmic level, just like Chishui back then, who had a natural divine power of 10,000.","How could he compare?","He was just a Special Life Form born later.","If he were counted like this, everyone would be a Special Life Form as long as their divine power exceeded 1,000.","Moreover, the current Special Life Forms, such as the Flame God of the Shi Kingdom, were top-notch at the Eight Tribulations realm, comparable to Zuo Yehui.","Their basic divine powers were terrifyingly strong.","There was also Lord Hengmu and the Great Monk, whose basic divine powers were terrifying.","The peak tribes and formidable individuals born from the entire Wanliu Universe were certainly surpassing the entirety of the Ancient Wood Continent.","There were few within the Nine Heavens and Ten Lands that could match their prowess.","Just the appearance of the Great Monk and the two great battle beasts would be enough to make the Ancient Wood Continent feel pressured.","If they were all to emerge, it would probably take the combined might of the nineteen major star sects to suppress them.","Though there was threat, there was also opportunity.","If one could freely come and go from this place, then the lives here would face the formidable","beings of the entire Ancient Moon Spacetime.","In comparison, the Ancient Moon Spacetime held the upper hand.","After all, it was created by the Celestial Maiden.","The Nine Heavens and Ten Lands!","The vast waves surged, attempting to replicate the existence of the Starry Sky.","How could their foundation be lacking?","As they departed from the jungle that obscured the sky, they arrived at the foot of a low","mountain.","The mountain peak was not steep, and its side peaks did not penetrate the clouds. There didn’t seem to be anything special about it.","But the moment they stepped into the foothills, they felt their divine power pulsating throughout their bodies, a sensation akin to a strong urge to seclude themselves for","cultivation.","Everyone was eager to try stepping onto the mountain, and Jian Wushuang was no exception.","Although he primarily cultivated the Origin Source, his divine power was not inferior, almost","on par with the Origin Source.","The 1.5 million units of divine power in his body were all active.","The Beast God Weapon even resonated with the local environment, causing a dragon roar to erupt from his surroundings, creating ripples.","Furrowing his brow, Jian Wushuang felt the Beast God Weapon trembling, suppressed by an even more powerful innate Beast God.","Although innate Universe Treasures were rare, this place gathered the strongest beings of the Ancient Wood Continent, many of whom possessed innate cosmic treasures.","For example, the Moyun Vine of Divine Wood King and Wu Li’s wooden sword, a Universe Treasure bestowed upon him by Lord Hengmu, also resonated and then experienced strong","suppression.","“At last, you’ve noticed, Brother Wushuang?” Wu Li cautiously approached at this moment, whispering, “Could there be some terrifying presence on this mountain? My wooden sword is a branch from the Wanliu Tree, also considered an innate Universe Treasure. I’ve never encountered such a thing before!”","Jian Wushuang shook his head, offering a vague response, “I’m not sure either. But since it’s related to the innate, there must be extraordinary treasures on this mountain. We’ll find out","once we go up.”","This low mountain not only stirred their urge to seclude themselves but also resonated with","innate Universe Treasures.","It had already aroused their curiosity.","There was no reason not to take a look inside.","If there were indeed treasures, it would be up to each individual’s abilities and luck.","Whoever obtained them would claim them, as long as it wasn’t too outrageous, they could","keep them safe with the help of Danbao and the oaths they had sworn.","No one would turn against each other."]},{"number":5919,"title":"Chapter 5919: Working Together Again","paragraphs":["Chapter 5919: Working Together Again","The likelihood of encountering treasures was equal for everyone, but the strength levels varied greatly.","Therefore, no one would yield to another.","Feeling the call, everyone’s gaze turned towards Danbao.","With just a word, they would rush in.","Jian Wushuang, however, wasn’t as urgent.","Sensing his surroundings with his Thought power and finding no danger, he nodded towards Danbao, indicating that it should be safe.","It was better to explore. After all, there was no other path; sooner or later, they would have to go.","Might as well let these people take the lead.","Of course, such words couldn’t be spoken.","They had to go in voluntarily.","Otherwise, it would tarnish the God of Life.","Danbao could only nod.","He was just a child, thrust into this position.","But before these people ascended the mountain, he generously bestowed each of them with a portion of Life force, which moved many.","Jian Wushuang was also surprised.","At this point, he truly admired Danbao.","It was impossible for him to do the same.","Perhaps that’s the difference!","“Let’s go!” Divine Wood King led the charge. With the Moyun Vine, he had the strength of an Eighth Tribulation realm warrior, albeit not as powerful as his true self.","Nevertheless, it was enough for exploration.","The vine extended to scout ahead, searching for treasures and the direction of the call.","Jian Wushuang didn’t hesitate and followed along, as did the others.","Only the Grand Monk and Lord Hengmu, accompanied by two powerful war beasts, stayed behind with the pill treasure at the rear.","Divine Wood King, Jian Wushuang, and a large group of Seventh Tribulation realm experts moved away from Danbao’s Life shield.","Even Wu Li charged to the front, standing side by side with Jian Wushuang.","“Brother Wushuang, the feeling is quite extraordinary. Why don’t we join forces? My three- foot sword has been guiding me. How about we split the treasures we find?” Wu Li suggested with a smile, but Jian Wushuang had a suspicion in his heart.","Although his Beast God Weapon had been called, the sensation wasn’t quite as Wu Li described it.","Guidance was possible!","That resonated deeply.","“Alright, we’ll find an opportunity to break away from Divine Wood King and the others later. But you need to inform your dear old man, let them keep an eye on us, in case of danger, they can come to our rescue!”","Working with Wu Li, there was no way he could lose.","Now, considering Wu Li’s status and strength...","His divine power was at the pinnacle of the Seventh Tribulation realm.","In times of danger, they still relied on him.","Fortunately, they had a strong backing, his dear old man, the most powerful presence among them.","Able to overshadow Divine Wood King.","Even if this place hid some terrifying existence, if they were unlucky enough to encounter it, they could still be saved.","This deal was worth doing.","Since they were here, they couldn’t just sit back.","Moreover, Weiss had instructed him earlier to search for some treasures.","Maybe they could find something here.","“In the crevice on the west side!”","Wu Li suddenly transmitted, and Jian Wushuang didn’t hesitate either, his figure paused for a moment before disappearing into thin air.","Taking Wu Li along, they directly left the group.","Entering a crevice in the mountains.","Divine Wood King at the forefront was momentarily stunned but also wanted to chase after them to take a look.","He knew about Jian Wushuang’s uniqueness.","Maybe he would discover something in advance.","And that innate treasure on Jian Wushuang’s body made him a bit envious.","It might just trigger that call and find the exact location.","But then again, as an Eighth Tribulation realm peak powerhouse, following two Sixth","Tribulation realms, would somewhat damage his pride.","And they were still some distance from the mountaintop.","It would be better to reach the mountaintop first.","Behind him were the Danbao and the Great Monk.","Time couldn’t be wasted.","After weighing the pros and cons, Divine Wood King gritted his teeth, manipulating the Moyun Vine, and continued to climb towards the mountaintop.","Along the way, he also gained something.","Those treasures that had grown in the crevices for who knows how many ages were all","collected by him.","Just a random herb would fetch him a million primordial stones. What a great way to earn","money.","It was like picking them up.","He might not be the Universe Master now, but that didn’t mean there wouldn’t be a universe after he reincarnated.","Whether it was primordial stones or these herbs, they could all enhance his divine power.","The others also obtained some treasures that the Divine Wood King didn’t value.","Worth around 100,000 primordial stones.","For them, it was already very good.","They could pick them up at will without the need for fighting.","It was refining stars that had no interest in herbs.","He collected many expensive essence stones, even buying those he failed to snatch on the","spot.","Many people sold them on the spot too.","Overall, everyone had a good harvest.","Danbao and the others at the rear didn’t care.","Danbao was almost becoming a God of Life; he naturally wasn’t interested in treasures.","Blu was the same; being of the same clan as Danbao, would there be fewer treasures for him in","the future?","As for the Great Monk, as a Dao Guardian, he naturally wouldn’t leave Danbao half a step.","And he was a Special Life Form, an Eighth Tribulation realm peak.","He didn’t lack these treasures either.","Finally, there was Lord Hengmu.","Although he seemed to have suffered heavy losses this time, he actively gave away his","treasures.","But he also made a big gain.","Two powerful war beasts.","Both were enslaved by him.","Each of them was a top force in the Eighth Tribulation realm.","How could he possibly covet those treasures?","Even if there were treasures, he would use them after he reincarnated.","Currently, he didn’t find them appealing.","The Great Monk also received a message from Wu Li at this time.","He frowned slightly but didn’t say anything, feeling uneasy about Wu Li being with Jian","Wushuang.","A thread of Thoguht force followed Jian Wushuang and Wu Li as they entered the crevice.","The crevice near the mountain wasn’t particularly wide but was deep enough, especially leading downwards, to access the true core of the mountain.","Jian Wushuang led Wu Li deeper underground.","It was pitch black all around.","The crevice split open halfway up the mountainside, with no crevice above, just darkness all","around.","Once inside the crevice, after several twists and turns, the entrance’s light was long gone.","“Are we there yet?”","After delving deeper, Jian Wushuang felt a palpable unease and a sense of foreboding below.","He slowed down, intending to ask Wu Li how he was feeling.","At this moment, Wu Li took out his three-foot sword.","Only recently did he learn that the material for this three-foot sword came from the Divine","Wood of Wanliu, making it a natural Universe Treasure.","Entirely green and three feet long, it was capable of cutting through the heavens and splitting","the earth!","“It’s still down there!”","“You sure? The deeper I go, the more desolate my heart feels, like there’s an inexplicable","pressure!”","Voicing his anxiety, he felt like his heart was about to leap out as he delved further.","This place no longer had the serene atmosphere that made him want to cultivate again;","instead, it instilled fear in him.","Upon hearing his words, Wu Li looked surprised, paused for a moment, and then said, “But I","haven’t felt anything!”"]},{"number":5920,"title":"Chapter 5920: Two-Man Team","paragraphs":["Chapter 5920: Two-Man Team","When this statement was made, Jian Wushuang felt that things weren’t as good as he had hoped.","Perhaps the summons below was aimed at Wu Li.","It had nothing to do with him.","So he had to eliminate him.","That was the only possibility.","If he continued like this, he might even be forcibly driven out.","But since he had come this far, he could only grit his teeth and continue downwards.","“Forget it, let’s keep going!”","He decided to forge ahead regardless!","He refused to believe it.","Why was it always him who had the bad luck?","Following the cracks, he continued downward.","A white light burst forth from his body.","It illuminated the path ahead.","The cracks at the foot of the mountain were very damp, with water flowing down the stone walls.","The walls were covered with moss.","The further down they went, the larger the spaces between the cracks became.","Behind Wu Li, he walked at the forefront.","That feeling of palpitation, from pressure to oppression, caused beads of sweat to form on his forehead.","But Wu Li acted as if nothing was wrong, following behind him, his eyes darting around, scanning the surroundings, fearing danger.","They continued for about 15 minutes.","Most of the people outside were almost at the mountaintop.","Finally, they discovered something.","The cracks were no longer descending but sloping forward.","After walking for a while, there was even an upward trend.","The three-foot sword in Wu Li’s hand began to hum.","This meant they were close to their target.","“There’s light!”","Jian Wushuang, who was in the lead, turned a corner and saw light ahead.","He glanced back at Wu Li, and they nodded to each other.","Without hesitation, they increased their speed and rushed toward the source of light.","It wasn’t until they reached the source of light that they realized.","It was actually an exit.","Phew!","Exiting the damp crevice, they entered the sunlight.","They saw everything in front of them.","A huge aerial garden.","Floating above the water surface.","Everything was neatly arranged.","There was not a hint of disorder.","It was definitely man-made.","Jian Wushuang was sure of this.","Seeing this aerial garden, Jian Wushuang didn’t feel that palpitation anymore.","But there was a sense of oppression from the water surface below.","Before he could assess the water’s surface, Wu Li flew uncontrollably outwards.","Towards the aerial garden.","While he remained standing in place, feeling nothing.","Flying in the air, Wu Li finally saw the appearance of this place.","Looking back, there was the low mountain.","They had crossed this low mountain from the crevice, essentially traversing it.","This place was behind the low mountain.","A huge valley.","Mountains surrounded it.","In the middle, there was a huge lake.","Above the lake was the aerial garden.","Jian Wushuang took the initiative to fly out at this moment, intending to catch up with Wu Li, who had also noticed everything.","The rest of the group’s aura was now on the mountaintop, but it would still take some time","for them to reach this place.","In a way, they had taken a shortcut.","It could be considered a gain, being ahead of others.","But there were also downsides.","In case this place was dangerous.","He couldn’t handle it.","“Brother Wushuang, I’ll go in first!”","Wu Li glanced back at Jian Wushuang, then entered the aerial garden on his own.","There, he felt the source of the summons.","“Wait for me!”","Jian Wushuang was anxious, his wings behind him trembling, wanting to catch up.","But the moment he entered the aerial garden, he ran into a barrier.","He found himself unable to get in.","The barrier was green, pulsing with powerful Life force.","He refused to believe it and attempted to break through with the power of Life.","But he found he still couldn’t get in.","“Damn it!”","While Wu Li went in, he couldn’t.","If Wu Li took the treasure for himself, it would be a big loss.","He couldn’t understand why Wu Li could enter while he couldn’t.","If it had to do with the innate treasure of the universe, he should be able to enter too!","But once the power of Life passed through the barrier, it disappeared.","He couldn’t traverse it at all.","Just then, a huge bubble emerged from the lake below.","Jian Wushuang was startled.","His figure quickly ascended.","The oppressive feeling grew closer.","In the blink of an eye, countless eyeballs of a huge beast appeared on the surface of the lake,","directly bursting out of the water.","Countless eyeballs were accompanied by numerous tentacles.","There were also many green vines entwined around its body.","Similar to the Moyun Vine of Divine Wood King.","He was startled by the sudden appearance of this creature and hurried to dodge its attacks.","His aura suddenly changed, turning blue.","Green battle armor also appeared on his body.","His divine power soared from 1.5 million to 2 million in an instant.","Employing the Super Eternal Ancient Transformation, his divine power skyrocketed to 4","million.","Facing the attacks from below, he drew his sword and struck out directly.","With his current strength, he could rival the Eighth Tribulation realm.","It wasn’t a problem to block them.","Those tentacles weren’t as powerful as he had imagined; he easily cut through several of them","with his sword.","But the oppressive feeling remained strong.","This puzzled Jian Wushuang.","He always felt that there was a greater threat lurking, so he didn’t dare to linger in battle.","Dodging the tentacles, he quickly rushed towards the direction of Lowfoot Mountain.","Meanwhile, Divine Wood King had already brought Danbao and the others to the","mountaintop.","On the mountaintop, there was also a huge stone stele.","“City of the Sky!”","The stele was activated by Danbao.","The four characters above were simple.","Having suffered from a lack of education last time, they had figured it out based on the words","on the monument last time.","They had all learned the language of the Polunga Clan.","So, there was no need for Danbao to translate.","“It seems to be the floating city below the mountain!”","The group came to the edge of the cliff together, looking down.","They saw the “aerial garden” that Jian Wushuang had mistaken for.","In fact, it was a city in the sky.","“This time, I’ll take the lead!” Lord Hengmu saw the City of the Sky, joy flickering in his eyes","as he took the initiative to step forward.","The expression of the Great Monk remained unchanged.","He came from the Wanliu Universe and was the most familiar with this place.","He was unfamiliar with other places.","But he had heard of the legends of the City of the Sky.","Or rather, he had some understanding of the rumors about the City of the Sky.","In the Wanliu Universe, there was a legend.","Legend has it that in a hidden realm within the Wanliu Universe, there stood a city in the sky.","It was once the residence of a prominent figure, every item within it holding invaluable benefits, including the treasures and legacies left behind by this figure.","This individual had intricate ties with the Origin Source of Wanliu, known to Lord Hengmu, a","local.","With such knowledge, he dared to venture into the city, accompanied by two formidable battle beasts, both at the peak of the Eighth Tribulation realm, instilling him with confidence. The Great Monk was also aware of this place and had discreetly informed Elder Blu. However, Elder Blu showed little interest in the matter, only considering a visit if it happened","to align with his path, otherwise dismissing it as unnecessary risk. There were opportunities, but also threats, and he saw no need to take unnecessary chances, especially with a sizable entourage in tow."]},{"number":5921,"title":"Chapter 5921: City of the Sky","paragraphs":["Chapter 5921: City of the Sky","But this time, the Great Monk was insistent, continuously persuading Danbao that it would be best to go in.","Perhaps this place had something to do with one of the Realm King.","They had come all this way; surely someone had arranged everything in secret.","Otherwise, why would they end up here instead of directly entering the Higher Heavens of the Wanliu Universe?","Danbao had no choice, especially seeing the determined looks on everyone’s faces,","shimmering with golden light.","Unable to refuse, he could only nod.","Led by Lord Hengmu, the others followed suit.","Divine Wood King was unfamiliar with this place, but seeing Lord Hengmu entering, he followed suit.","Although the Great Monk was very interested in this place, he could still distinguish priorities and remained by Danbao’s side without moving an inch.","“By the way, where’s Jian Wushuang?” Lian Xing, who hadn’t gone down yet, looked around and didn’t spot Jian Wushuang, expressing surprise, “Could he have gotten lost?”","“Perhaps he’s gone in!” The Great Monk added from the side.","He had already sensed Wuli’s aura, entering that City of the Sky.","That’s why he remained so calm.","There were indeed treasures in the sky.","But obtaining them wasn’t so easy.","This legend was widely spread, known from the Eighth Tribulation realm to ordinary people.","But no one had ever found it.","Initially, the Great Monk thought this place was just a legend.","He didn’t expect to see it today.","That also meant his speculation was true.","The path they were walking was arranged in advance by the Realm King.","Through these trials, they could enter the Higher Heavens and then ascend the stairway to godhood at the Universe Sea.","The first stone monument was just about finding the Monkey Head Mushroom.","It wasn’t particularly difficult.","He didn’t know what purpose it served.","But this place was different.","Probably, it led to entering the City of the Sky.","There must be extremely secretive things there.","A strong aura suddenly burst from the valley below at that moment.","“Go!” Danbao’s figure flashed, leading everyone downward.","The aura of a powerful entity emerged.","Lord Hengmu at the forefront had already discerned the threat below.","“Jian Wushuang!”","The first one they spotted fleeing was Jian Wushuang.","Then came countless vines striking.","Seeing Lord Hengmu, Jian Wushuang felt a glimmer of hope and hastily exclaimed, “Hengmu, help me hold him off!”","Before Lord Hengmu could respond, Jian Wushuang dashed past him without even a glance, then ran off.","Lord Hengmu cursed loudly as the vines reached him, forcing him to intercept.","Fortunately, despite their formidable aura, the vines lacked much power.","As a native powerhouse of Wanliu, Lord Hengmu was utterly unfamiliar with these vines.","After resisting for a moment, he found them not much of a threat.","So he let two great battle beasts clear the way and continued flying downward himself.","By now, Jian Wushuang had already spotted Divine Wood King, Danbao, and the others, so he calmed down and waited for everyone’s arrival.","“How is it down there?” Danbao descended with the others and asked Jian Wushuang. “There are some minor ripples, but no significant threats!” Jian Wushuang shook his head, then took a breath and continued, “Wu Li has already entered that sky garden, but when I tried to enter, I was stopped!”","Upon hearing this, everyone was stunned.","Wu Li had gone in, but Jian Wushuang couldn’t.","Many of the powerhouses didn’t know much about Wu Li.","Most of their attention was on Jian Wushuang.","But it was unexpected that Jian Wushuang was stopped while Wu Li entered the City of the Sky","alone.","“You didn’t go in!” Elder Blu was also extremely surprised.","He thought Jian Wushuang had gone in with Wu Li.","But now, Jian Wushuang was outside while Wu Li was inside.","This was indeed beyond his expectations.","“Since there’s no great danger, let’s go down and take a look first!” Danbao’s scepter","trembled, and the shield solidified once again.","They plunged down.","The huge savage beast that burst out of the water was on par with the two great battle beasts.","Indeed, as Jian Wushuang had said, there wasn’t much danger.","Either Elder Blu or Divine Wood King alone could handle it.","If they all joined forces, it probably wouldn’t take more than a few breaths to resolve it.","“What’s this?” Elder Blu’s gaze grew deep.","Lord Hengmu didn’t recognize these vines.","But he did.","Seeing Elder Blu’s surprised expression, Jian Wushuang asked, “Do you recognize them?”","Although these vines weren’t powerful, they were extremely eerie.","They exuded a tremendous pressure, almost nullifying the sensation of divine power","fluctuations.","They couldn’t be underestimated.","If Elder Blu knew the identity of the opponent, that would be best.","Upon hearing Jian Wushuang’s inquiry, Elder Blu didn’t conceal anything. He just looked at Danbao and then spoke, “Young Master, if I’m not mistaken, this should be that old man, Chi Tenggui, a pinnacle Eighth Tribulation realm powerhouse from Higher Heavens. He went mad in search of the City of the Sky and later disappeared. I didn’t expect him to appear here!” After hearing this, Danbao moved his scepter, intending to suppress Chi Tenggui with the power of Life.","If it were a cultivator who had fallen into madness, there was no need to besiege them; it sufficed to drive them away.","But his Life Origin Source, upon touching the Chi Tenggui, had no effect at all.","This left many people puzzled.","In the past, Danbao could use the power of Life to temporarily suppress the Chi Jiuxiao.","Later, Chi Jiuxiao completely broke free from Life and no longer succumbed to Danbao’s","suppression.","How could an ancient cultivator, who hadn’t even reached the peak of the Eighth Tribulation realm, withstand Danbao’s suppression?","Jian Wushuang’s eyes flickered; he always felt that the oppressive feeling was getting","stronger.","Something bad was about to happen.","It turned out to be true.","Danbao couldn’t suppress it at all.","He quickly said to Divine Wood King and the Great Monk, “Since we can’t suppress it, why not","join forces to kill him? It’s also a way to eliminate a disaster!”","Danbao was the God of Life, and this kind of thing wasn’t good for him to do.","So let them handle it!","Divine Wood King and the Great Monk had already planned for this.","Upon hearing Jian Wushuang take the initiative, they immediately nodded in agreement.","And deliberately avoiding Danbao, they went straight down.","Danbao frowned.","Not because he had become the God of Life, he should act like a saint.","In fact, there was no need to do this.","But under the support of everyone, he was too well-protected.","Being protected to become a god.","On the path to godhood, not a drop of blood was allowed to stain him.","When he first saw the Great Monk, he felt that what the other said made some sense.","But now, it seemed a bit off.","Jian Wushuang didn’t think too much about it, patting Danbao’s shoulder and saying, “Don’t","worry, since he doesn’t succumb to your suppression, it means he has long been detached from life. His death has nothing to do with us!”","“Don’t feel too much pressure!” Elder Blu also came to persuade at this time.","Danbao shook his head without saying a word."]},{"number":5922,"title":"Chapter 5922: Chi Tenggui","paragraphs":["Chapter 5922: Chi Tenggui","“Senior Lian Xing, aren’t you going to join in the fun?” Jian Wushuang relaxed at this moment and looked towards Lian Xing.","With a strength at the peak of the Seventh Tribulation realm, over 2 million divine power, and a powerful legion of puppets, Lian Xing had never shown his hand before.","Jian Wushuang couldn’t help but be curious and approached him.","Lian Xing smiled and replied, “With my current strength, it’s not worth the embarrassment. But you, in the blink of an eye, have surpassed me!”","When Jian Wushuang had just erupted, his divine power indeed exceeded that of the other Seventh Tribulation realm experts.","“It’s just luck!” Jian Wushuang scratched his nose and replied softly.","Everyone else just smiled casually.","Just as they were relaxed, the surface of the lake below began to tremble.","This time, it came with the City of the Sky.","Everyone looked down, not worried about the battle below, but afraid of it affecting the City of the Sky.","Jian Wushuang also learned about the City of the Sky from Lian Xing.","He just couldn’t understand why it was called the City of the Sky when its outward appearance was lush like a garden.","Why not call it the Sky Garden?","Or was it because the strong ones in the Wanliu Universe lacked culture and just picked some nice-sounding names!","But the next moment, he understood why it was called the City of the Sky.","Below, the battle on the lake surface.","Chi Tenggui’s figure continued to expand.","And the lush vines on the City of the Sky were receding.","The vines kept retreating and continuously converged onto Chi Tenggui’s body.","At this moment, Chi Tenggui’s strength began to erupt.","From the original 9 million divine power, it instantly broke through to over 10 million divine power.","It was already comparable to Divine Wood King.","And this was just the beginning.","As the vines of the City of the Sky continued to diminish, the red vines of Chi Tenggui kept increasing, and so was its divine power.","The monk completely understood after seeing this.","“Old man, Chi Tenggui, I thought you were truly insane, but I didn’t expect you to actually find the City of the sky and attempt to absorb its divine miracles. You deserve to die!” The Great Monk’s aura surged, no longer hesitating, wanting to end the battle quickly.","But it wasn’t so easy.","Every time he cut off those vines, more vines appeared to obstruct his attack, making it impossible to get close.","Divine Wood King faced the same situation.","The two great war beasts were no longer opponents, and Lord Hengmu had already retreated behind Danbao.","Seeing the danger below, Danbao couldn’t care much anymore and took the initiative to descend, using the Shield of Life to protect the Divine Wood King and the monk.","“Don’t linger in battle with him, let’s enter this City of the Sky!”","After the vines disappeared, Danbao discovered that the City of the Sky had changed and could be entered freely.","Everyone nodded in agreement.","Chi Tenggui’s advancement was too rapid.","His divine power had now increased to 15 million.","Even with Divine Wood King and the Great Monk joining forces, they couldn’t suppress it.","If they waited a little longer, even if the Chi Jiuxiao came, it would be useless.","Moreover, Babidi, accompanied by Chi Jiuxiao, had already followed.","On the mountaintop.","They had spent a long time here.","But Babidi, with Chi Jiuxiao, cleared obstacles all the way, arriving much faster than them.","“Let’s go!”","Danbao didn’t hesitate. With a wave of his scepter, he led everyone into the City of the Sky.","Chi Tenggui lost his target and stood stunned for a moment before countless vines didn’t know where to go.","Finally, it let out a strange cry and once again delved into the vines and aimed at the City of the Sky.","Danbao and the others had already reached the city walls.","After arriving at the City of the Sky, they discovered something.","Here, there was a rule of shrinking space.","It looked small from the outside.","But upon entering the city, they found it was enormous, the size of a world.","“What should we do?” Divine Wood King was also a bit panicked.","They couldn’t win, and they couldn’t escape.","Now that they had entered the City of the Sky, they all knew it was a treasure trove.","But what to do about this enormous threat?","They couldn’t just stand by and watch!","Without the entanglement of the vines of Chi Tenggui, the City of the Sky was just white.","But with the entanglement of the vines, this place was just like what Jian Wushuang said, a sky","garden.","Danbao used the Shield of Life, but it couldn’t stop the spread of the vines.","At that moment, they were at a loss.","Unable to rely on the incarnation of Chi Tenggui, the group had to actively cut down the vines.","But their progress was painfully slow.","Just as they were feeling helpless, a deafening sound erupted from outside.","Black fist shadows permanently imprinted themselves in the space, even etching onto the","timeline.","The group looked up in fear.","A towering crimson giant, with thick palms, gripped the red vines while continuously","pounding its incarnation with clenched fists.","Jian Wushuang couldn’t help but gulp at the sight.","It was beyond belief.","Even if Chi Tenggui weakened its divine power again and tried to attach to the City of the Sky,","it still retained at least tens of millions of divine power.","Yet now, it appeared as vulnerable as a blade of grass before Chi Jiuxiao.","Beaten to a pulp!","If not for the deafening noise of the fight, they might not have noticed.","“Danbao, can your Shield of Life cover the entire City of the Sky?” Jian Wushuang looked","down at Danbao, a thought forming in his mind.","Before he could articulate it, Danbao understood.","“Yes!”","“But it has to be done outside!”","Inside the City of the Sky, this place was like a world unto itself, and Danbao’s current Life","Origin Source wasn’t enough to protect such a large area.","But outside, the place was subject to the laws of compression.","Internally, it was a world, but externally, it was no larger than a small mountain.","Danbao could naturally shield them with the shield of life.","However, this meant Danbao wouldn’t be able to enter the City of the Sky.","Upon hearing this, Jian Wushuang lowered his head, realizing this approach was impractical.","Them going in while Danbao stayed outside to fend off danger-how could that be","acceptable?","Even if Danbao agreed to it, they wouldn’t allow him to do so.","After all, they were all counting on Danbao to ascend to godhood and lift them up with him.","“This place is so vast. Even if that Babidi comes in, it won’t be easy for him to find us. Besides, the Young Master’s Shield of Life can withstand that giant from the Giant God Clan. There’s nothing to fear. We might as well explore together!” The Great Monk remained calm. With continuous good news from Wu Li, there was nothing but treasure waiting for them","below.","There was no need to dwell on these matters.","The others brightened up upon hearing this, seeing it as a viable solution.","Danbao didn’t look at the others but gazed at the black fist shadows in the sky.","“No, we can’t let them in!” Danbao shook his head.","The appearance of the City of the Sky was truly a test.","If they couldn’t defeat Chi Tenggui, so be it.","But now, with the threat of Chi Jiuxiao added to the mix, they couldn’t afford to let him in.","They came here for various reasons.","Even the Great Monk was curious about this place.","Only Danbao grasped the essence of their mission.","Perhaps they had come here to protect the City of the Sky. To protect this divine marvel!"]},{"number":5923,"title":"Chapter 5923: I’ll Block It!","paragraphs":["Chapter 5923: I’ll Block It!","“I’ll go out and hold them off, you guys go investigate the situation inside the city!” With these words, everyone was shaken.","Let Danbao go outside to face the enemy while they reap the benefits inside the city.","This doesn’t seem right at all!","And some things just don’t add up.","Why did they come here?","Certainly not for these ordinary treasures.","But for the path to resurrection.","Danbao, as the god of life, is the opener of the path to resurrection.","Let Danbao take the brunt of it.","Even if they have no face to show.","Even if they were shameless, they wouldn’t dare to do this!","The monk was the first to object.","Divine Wood King also stepped forward to persuade.","The rest were also moved.","Only Jian Wushuang remained silent.","At this moment, Elder Blu also felt that it was unnecessary to act this way.","Why not just let Babi Emperor in?","They could rely on Danbao’s Shield of Life to resist.","Danbao smiled faintly and reassured, “Let them in, I also need to use the Shield of Life, I’ll use it anywhere, might as well use it outside!”","“I agree!” Jian Wushuang stood up and turned to the others, saying, “I think Danbao is right, since we’re all going to rely on the Shield of Life to protect us, why not use it to safeguard the entire City of the Sky outside, which is more important than us in the City of the Sky!”","This last sentence was a bit ruthless.","But it did calm the others down.","Safeguarding the City of the Sky is more important than them.","What if this is the test?","“Danbao, I’ll go out with you!” Elder Blu nodded, choosing to support Danbao’s decision.","The rest going out wouldn’t help.","Although Elder Blu’s strength wasn’t great, he was of the same clan as Danbao.","The two were of one mind.","Seeing this, the Great Monk’s eyes flashed with an imperceptible light, and he also stepped forward.","“Alright, let’s leave it at that!” Danbao interrupted the actions of those who still wanted to go out.","Only taking the great monk and Elder Blu with him, he left the city wall.","Divine Wood King watched the backs of the three, sighing, “Truly worthy of being the God of Life, for him to become a god, I admire him!”","“Divine Wood King, let’s go down and investigate this City of the Sky first. Maybe there are some tricks here, and we can also make Danbao come back sooner!”","Seeing the other party continue talking endlessly, Jian Wushuang quickly interjected to remind everyone that they still needed to enter the City of the Sky.","Time couldn’t afford to be wasted any longer.","The others nodded in agreement.","Seeing this, Divine Wood King began arranging people to search the area, dispersing them for a thorough investigation.","Being the founder of the Ancient Wood Sect, he naturally possessed inherent leadership abilities.","Each person was assigned to cover a specific area with their Thought power, aiming to explore the entire City of the Sky in the shortest possible time.","“Lian Xing, you go to the southeast district with Brother Wushuang to investigate together!”","“No problem!”","Jian Wushuang and Lian Xing exchanged a similar smile before setting off.","Divine Wood King was aware of their close relationship, deliberately pairing them up.","The two of them moved at an extremely fast pace, arriving at a corner of the southeast district","in just the time it takes for an incense stick to burn.","However, the area was already quite extensive, requiring an hour for them to search","thoroughly.","It wasn’t a matter of simply flying around but rather meticulously examining every corner.","“Wushuang, let’s split up and search!”","Jian Wushuang nodded and replied, “Alright!”","The two of them separated and transformed into meteors, entering the city.","As Jian Wushuang landed on the ground, he could finally sense the overwhelmingly","transcendent feeling present.","Divine power pulsed through the area.","Clearly, someone of great power had been here before, perhaps a god.","Merely residing in this place could turn it into an invaluable site for cultivation.","Observing the material of the city walls, Jian Wushuang found nothing special about them.","It was the lingering aura of that influential figure that had influenced the City of the Sky.","As he casually strolled along the deserted streets, a gentle breeze swept up the dry leaves on the white stone pavement, reminiscent of the mundane world.","These leaves were probably left behind by Chi Tenggui, absorbing the power that the previous occupant had left behind.","It was no wonder he was so formidable.","If he were to retract all the vines back into his true form, he might not be inferior to Chi","Jiuxiao.","Unfortunately, before he could retract the vines, he was severely injured by Chi Jiuxiao. He","might be on the brink of falling now.","Jian Wushuang carefully searched each location along the streets.","“Too slow!”","He still felt he was moving too slowly.","So, he split into countless clones, flying out from a small courtyard in all directions, while the main body leisurely walked along the wide streets, casually entering any mansion to search","around.","There were still many movable objects in this area, such as tables, chairs, and lamps, even doors that could be dismantled and taken away.","However, doing so would be sacrilegious.","“Hmm?”","One of his avatars arrived in a courtyard somewhere, finding it impeccably clean with not even","a door in sight.","The windows were gone too!","Someone really dared to do this!","His telepathy spread out.","In an instant, he detected a familiar aura.","In this vicinity, it was just him and Lian Xing.","Lian Xing wouldn’t stoop so low.","So, it must be Wu Li who came in early!","Whoosh!","His figure flashed.","Sensing that aura, his true self instantly teleported in front of Wu Li.","“Jian Wushuang!” Wu Li, startled by someone approaching, jumped a bit.","Then, seeing it was Jian Wushuang, he sighed in relief, complaining, “Can’t you give a heads up before coming, you scared me!”","Seeing the chair Wu Li was holding, Jian Wushuang frowned and said, “That’s enough. While there is indeed someone’s aura on the items here, there’s no need to break in!” “That’s where you’re wrong. If we just absorb them individually, even this chair, it would take you several days to completely absorb the aura above. We don’t have time to wait now. It’s better to take everything and absorb them outside slowly!” Wu Li stepped forward, casually taking down a painting and handing it to Jian Wushuang, comforting him, “Don’t overthink it. Though we both have substantial wealth, we still need to plan for the future. Our divine powers are similar, with basic divine power over a million. You know how troublesome it is to increase divine power later on. Not to mention the treasures spent, just the time wasted on them is significant. These items not only don’t cost you anything, but they also increase your divine power. Just this painting, absorb it well, and you’ll gain at least a hundred divine power. In any random courtyard here, you can find hundreds of similar items, that’s ten thousand divine power. How much of the City of the Sky do you dare to imagine?”","Smack!","Jian Wushuang, frowning, directly tossed the painting away.","“Hey!” Wu Li, however, treasured it as if it were precious, hurriedly picking it up, intending","to continue persuading, but Jian Wushuang interrupted him directly. “You keep yours, I’ll keep mine. Don’t worry about me. I came here not for these things!”","With that said, he vanished in a flash.","What Wu Li said was right. Planning for the future was right."]},{"number":5924,"title":"Chapter 5924: Overlapping Portrait","paragraphs":["Chapter 5924: Overlapping Portrait","Once the Scattered Tribulation was to revive at some point.","By then, the treasures to enhance divine power would probably double in price.","Currently, those still enhancing their divine power were all Universe Masters.","For the Scattered Tribulation experts, it was not only about cultivation but also about maintaining one’s peak state, which was extremely taxing.","Even staying alive had become a luxury.","After resurrection, to cultivate once again and enhance divine power, one would need treasures.","It was feared that other Scattered Tribulation experts, like Wu Li, were also scavenging for these items.","Only he seemed indifferent!","Perhaps there were a few others who were aloof.","Like Lian Xing, he probably looked down on these things.","Divine Wood King looked down even more, overseeing the entire Ancient Wood Sect, he wouldn’t lack such items.","Instead, this time, he did something unusual.","He had always felt that the City of the Sky was not simple.","One shouldn’t lose a watermelon while picking sesame seeds.","Moreover, he didn’t value the improvement of basic divine power so much.","Improving basic divine power bit by bit was too slow.","It was better to perfect the Super Eternal Ancient Transformation.","To create a perfect Super Eternal Ancient Transformation as soon as possible.","Increasing strength a hundredfold in one go.","Currently, with just a fiftyfold increase, his divine power could double.","If it reached a hundredfold.","With a divine power of one and a half million, it could double.","What did that concept mean?","1.5 million, 3 million, 6 million.","And he still had the Life Tribulation Armor, which could increase by 500,000.","So, with a perfect Super Eternal Ancient Transformation, he would have 8 million divine power.","Directly putting him on par with top-tier Eighth Tribulation realm experts.","Plus his Sword Dao Origin Source, he could almost compete with peak Eighth Tribulation realm experts.","That’s why he looked down on these trivial things.","He flew on, continuing his search.","The southeast area was quickly searched clean.","There was nothing special.","Lian Xing happened to meet him at this time.","Seeing each other, they shook their heads.","“Let’s go to the city center. I’ve studied the layout of the City of the Sky. In remote places like this, it’s likely that only ordinary people used to live here. Their things aren’t anything special. It’s only when the aura of a certain big shot lingers on them that they become valuable, attracting even the red vines of Chi Tenggui to absorb them!”","Lian Xing had a deeper understanding of these things compared to Jian Wushuang.","The buildings here didn’t have a single style, representing different residents.","Places where big shots lived would definitely not be here.","“Jian Wushuang, aren’t you curious about who these big shots are?” Lian Xing looked at Jian Wushuang with interest.","They had been searching for special places all along but hadn’t speculated much about who the big shots might be.","Lian Xing brought up the matter now.","Jian Wushuang raised an eyebrow, looking at Lian Xing, knowing that the other party must have guessed something, and asked, “Have you found something, Senior?”","“It’s not exactly a discovery. I just noticed that in some larger courtyards, there are many portraits hanging in the guest halls. This isn’t particularly special, and even the portraits in each guest hall are mostly different, but there are still some overlaps, and one of the most overlapping portraits is unique!” Lian Xing finished speaking and took out several portraits with a wave of his hand.","The figures in the portraits were the same.","Green skin, pointed ears, white hair on their heads, but it was extremely sparse, only dense in the middle, and they wore earrings on their ears.","Jian Wushuang had never seen such a group of people before.","“Each family has this portrait hanging. Could they be some important figures in the Wanliu Universe?”","Lian Xing nodded, “It’s possible, but do you think the people who lived here, where big shots cultivated, would be the same as the natives of the Wanliu Universe?”","This made Jian Wushuang silent.","Indeed!","Almost no one in the powerful figures of the Wanliu Universe could find this place.","Only Chi Tenggui had arrived here.","If the people who had lived here before were from the Wanliu Universe, this place would have","been discovered long ago.","Given the secrecy level of the City of the Sky now.","He didn’t believe that those people here would be natives of the Wanliu Universe.","It was likely that they were brought here by some big shot themselves.","That made sense.","“Let’s meet with Divine Wood King and the others to see if they’ve found anything!” Lian","Xing agreed!","The two disappeared from their original location in a flash.","They didn’t pay attention to Wu Li, who was still scavenging for treasures below.","In fact, there were quite a few who acted like Wu Li.","They just weren’t as greedy as him.","Now, the biggest goal of those Scattered Tribulation survivors was revival and resurrection.","And Wu Li was already a Universe Master, not very interested in revival or even the position of","a demigod.","Increasing his divine power was his biggest need.","From the Third Tribulation realm to the Sixth Tribulation realm quickly.","Once this rapid improvement feeling stopped, it would drive a person insane.","It was like a poor person who struggled for decades, accumulating enough wealth to buy a","courtyard, only to suddenly buy a city because of an opportunity, and then being discovered","to be the heir of a dynasty.","The disparity would be huge.","Once enough wealth was acquired, it would trigger greater greed.","Jian Wushuang understood this well, but it wasn’t easy to remind someone.","In fact, a Universe Master like Wu Li should be low-key.","His old man was already at the peak of the Eighth Tribulation realm.","Now that he had become the guardian of the God of Life, as long as Wu Li hugged his thigh, he","wouldn’t lack these treasures.","He was thinking too small.","After passing through the area where Wu Li was, he didn’t stay, but followed Lian Xing","towards the main city.","The core of the City of the Sky was a vast plaza.","There were no buildings on the plaza, only a series of towering columns, all carved from","white stone and seamlessly integrated into one another.","Here, the presence of any entity was at its strongest.","Not even the tendrils of Chi Tenggui could extend to this place.","At this moment, the scattered experts who had arrived first were all seated in meditation.","With the resurgence of vitality, they could gradually elevate their divine power using this vitality as a foundation.","Though the amount was small, they could still sense the feeling of cultivation in advance.","After all, many of these scattered experts had not cultivated for countless epochs, always secluded to preserve their vitality.","Now, with sufficient vitality at last, they were all eagerly attempting to increase their basic","divine power.","Jian Wushuang descended with Lian Xing and headed straight for Divine Wood King.","Glancing around, it seemed that these people hadn’t noticed anything.","Divine Wood King, along with Lord Hengmu, was pacing near a formation at the center of the","plaza.","Seeing Jian Wushuang and Lian Xing approach, they halted and looked over.","“How is it? Any discoveries?” Lord Hengmu asked.","Lian Xing took out the portrait with the highest number of overlaps and spoke, “I don’t know","if this portrait counts, but have any of you noticed this person depicted here appearing","anywhere?”","Upon seeing the figure in the portrait, Divine Wood King paused for a moment, then his gaze flickered as he turned directly to the massive formation behind them."]},{"number":5925,"title":"Chapter 5925: Projection","paragraphs":["Chapter 5925: Projection","When the Scattered Tribulation resurged, Lord Hengmu seemed to discern something from it. Jian Wushuang and Lianxing quickly approached, gazing at the formation.","It was a massive hexagonal formation, not circular like usual, but still formidable in its complexity.","This formation seemed unified, unlike the intricate ones they were familiar with.","However, its simplicity made it particularly tricky to dismantle, lacking any obvious weaknesses.","“What’s this?” Jian Wushuang stared at the statue at the center of the formation, feeling a sense of recognition. “It looks just like the portrait!”","“It seems this was the residence of a significant figure in the past!” he exclaimed.","Their astonishment drew a crowd.","Jian Wushuang observed the statue, pacing along the edges of the formation. This could be the key to their breakthrough.","Time was running short; the external treasures might not hold off for long.","They had to act swiftly.","While he wasn’t a master of formations, there were surely experts among them, like Lianxing.","“Lianxing, can you decipher the purpose of this formation?” Jian Wushuang whispered, hoping for a breakthrough.","Divine Wood King also turned to Lian Xing, requesting his assistance.","With many eyes on him, Lian Xing stepped forward, studying the formation.","To him, this seemed more like the creation of practitioners rather than something divine.","However, whoever constructed it was immensely powerful, likely a Universe Master of the Eighth Tribulation or beyond, and possibly not alone.","Cracking it would be nearly impossible, but understanding its function was within reach.","After a moment of exploration, Lian Xing infused his divine power into the formation, using his consciousness to comprehend its intricacies.","Suddenly, a hum resounded, and the formation erupted with powerful energy, forcing everyone back.","Fortunately, the burst was brief, sparing them from harm.","“Did you discover anything?” Divine Wood King inquired, noting the burst triggered by Lian Xing’s intervention.","“This formation contains a complete spacetime essence. My probing triggered its defensive mechanism, pushing us away,” Lian Xing explained, pointing to the central statue.","“That statue is the core.”","This revelation wasn’t surprising, but it emphasized the urgency of activating the formation to progress.","Their initial hopes for treasures were fading; the true value lay in relics resonating with the powerful presence they sought.","Despite exhaustive searching, they found no other clues.","Unlike previous endeavors, there were no hints to follow, leaving them at a loss.","Jian Wushuang felt uncertain; having come this far, retreat seemed unthinkable.","“Perhaps we should let Elder Danbao enter,” someone suggested. “We’ve scoured the city to no avail. Maybe his presence will trigger something.”","Trigger something.","Jian Wushuang considered the idea; it seemed reasonable.","Relying solely on themselves was proving futile.","Divine Wood King and Lord Hengmu exchanged glances, realizing they had no better options.","Just as they were about to give up, a white light began to shimmer within the formation.","The light appeared, and this time they were prepared, all stepping back.","They were afraid of being shaken back by that same aura as before.","However, after the light beam expanded this time, there was no similar aura eruption, but rather a projection descending from the sky.","A projection descended!","The formation emitted a buzzing sound.","After a while, it slowly came to a stop.","During this time, everyone also saw the figure in the projection clearly.","A blue, chubby figure, wearing a black hat, with two tentacles on top of his head, looking extremely funny.","“Who is this important person?”","Someone asked cautiously in a low voice.","No one answered!","Jian Wushuang recalled the portrait for a moment, feeling that the figure in the projection, while having the same skin color as the important person who built the City of the Sky, looked very different in appearance.","But now was not the time to dwell on this; what if they were wrong in their guess?","Lord Hengmu was the most decisive. When he saw the projection descending, he knelt down.","Jian Wushuang and Divine Wood King ignored Lord Hengmu, feeling that kneeling down wouldn’t solve the problem.","If it was disadvantageous to them, there was no point in begging for mercy.","If it was advantageous to them, just standing and talking would be enough, so why kneel","down?","“It’s quite lively here!”","A friendly voice came from the projection, and everyone breathed a sigh of relief upon hearing","this gentle voice.","At this moment, Jian Wushuang took the initiative to step forward and said, “Junior Jian Wushuang, I am glad to meet you, Senior!”","Regardless of whether the other party was the important person who built this place or not, they had to be respectful, after all, they were on someone else’s territory.","It was a pity that the Great Monk was not here; otherwise, he could ask the blue chubby figure if he was one of the Realm King.","“Jian Wushuang?” The blue chubby figure walked out of the projection and directly came in front of everyone, to be precise, in front of Jian Wushuang.","He lowered his head and looked carefully at Jian Wushuang, surprised, “Are you Jian","Wushuang?”","When these words were spoken, Jian Wushuang’s expression changed slightly.","He lowered his head and looked at himself, feeling somewhat bewildered.","Not only did he not expect the other party to recognize him, but everyone present was also surprised that Jian Wushuang was related to the person in the projection.","Divine Wood King looked at Jian Wushuang, marveling at how well-connected Jian Wushuang","was.","He seemed to know everyone.","But Jian Wushuang really didn’t recognize the other party, so he could only smile awkwardly","and nod.","“Tsk tsk, just as my disciple said, you are indeed extraordinary!” The blue chubby figure","commented casually.","However, Jian Wushuang was pleasantly surprised.","When he heard the word “disciple” from the other party, his eyebrows twitched, becoming","even more puzzled.","How did another disciple come into the picture?","He knew very few people in Ancient Moon Spacetime.","Some people either perished halfway, or had already arrived here.","Like Wu Li!","Lian Xing was also one."]},{"number":5926,"title":"Chapter 5926: Nameless, Born of Heaven and Earth","paragraphs":["Chapter 5926: Nameless, Born of Heaven and Earth","The rest of them couldn’t quite figure it out.","Queen Yun Zhi had only a casual acquaintance with the other party, merely receiving some guidance from them out of respect for Jincheng.","“Could it be?” Suddenly, something clicked in his mind, and he pointed at the chubby blue figure in surprise. “Could it be them?”","Were they the ones who had come with him from Qishen Temple to the Ancient Moon Spacetime?","Apart from them, he couldn’t think of anyone else.","The chubby blue figure nodded and spoke up, “Yes, you were able to enter the Ancient Moon Spacetime back then because of me!”","With these words, both Jian Wushuang and Divine Wood King were stunned.","So, Jian Wushuang’s identity was completely exposed.","He truly wasn’t a strong figure from the Ancient Moon Spacetime.","In the Northern Spacetime, there were nine core temporal rivers.","Jian Wushuang’s extraordinary strength had made Divine Wood King long suspect whether Jian Wushuang came from even more powerful temporal rivers, but he never had the chance to verify it.","Now, with the confirmation from the mysterious person in front of them, he fully believed it. However, Jian Wushuang didn’t think so.","When they first entered the Ancient Moon Spacetime, it was Zhen Ling who opened the temporal tunnel, which seemed unrelated to the chubby blue figure in front of them.","Although he had doubted Zhen Ling’s abilities, it couldn’t be this coincidental, could it?","Back then, bringing these people was his intention.","Surely, he couldn’t be manipulated even in this matter!","The chubby blue figure smirked as if he had seen through Jian Wushuang’s thoughts and said, “If I hadn’t permitted it back then, how could the temporal tunnel have been opened? In other words, if it were so easy to open the temporal tunnel, why didn’t that Flame God open the tunnel to Qishen Temple?”","This time, Jian Wushuang was completely convinced.","He quickly bowed and replied, “Thank you for your guidance, may I ask for your name, sir?”","“I have no name, born of heaven and earth!”","“I only hold a small title: Realm King!”","Realm King!","Upon hearing the self-proclaimed title, everyone involuntarily knelt down, including Jian Wushuang.","They had heard rumors about the Realm King, but this was the first time they had seen him.","At the same time, they were also puzzled about who was so lucky to become the disciple of the Realm King.","They had thought Fan Tianfeng’s luck was exceptional, but they hadn’t expected someone to be able to become the Realm King’s disciple.","Could it be Tongtian Buddha?","One of the top three talents in the Original Universe.","Zhen Ling had once secretly evaluated him, saying that he could surpass Shang and wasn’t inferior to Hu Qing.","Hu Qing was unlikely because he was still in the Ancient Moon Ruins.","He was clear about the abilities of the others.","Zhen Wuyang’s talent was top-notch when he was at Qishen Temple, always overshadowed by Tongtian Buddha.","Then there were Dongsheng and Wanyan, who weren’t even as good as Zhen Wuyang.","As for the other two from other universes, they weren’t very impressive either.","He reasoned through everyone, but he hadn’t thought of Wu Zuo.","In his view, Wu Zuo’s potential was quite ordinary.","He wasn’t even valued much by Qishen.","Let alone the Realm King.","But this time, he had underestimated Wu Zuo.","After exchanging a few words with Jian Wushuang, the Realm King went straight to the point.","The position of the God of Life was brought up by Realm King.","Being here wasn’t a reunion with Jian Wushuang but rather due to Danbao’s matter. Everyone now was more curious about the Realm King’s intentions in bringing them here.","With hands behind his back, Realm King scanned the crowd, paused for a moment, then with a slight movement of the two antennae atop his head, he sensed the location of Danbao.","“You lot are quite interesting, making Danbao wait outside for that Giant God Clan while you come here yourselves!”","These words made Jian Wushuang and the others feel a bit ashamed.","“But this also fits the criteria set at the beginning!” Realm King nodded in satisfaction.","Only then did everyone breathe a sigh of relief.","They had feared Realm King might blame them at this moment.","Divine Wood King, emboldened at this moment, asked, “Lord Realm King, may I ask why you brought us to this place?”","Then paused before continuing, “Shouldn’t Danbao have entered the stairway to godhood directly after arriving here?”","This was what Great Monk had said.","They didn’t know before.","They wouldn’t have known if it hadn’t been brought up, but upon entering, they found it differed from what Great Monk had said.","“The God of Life concerns the life of the entire Northern Spacetime, it’s not as simple as you think. The reason I set up these checkpoints here is to stop certain individuals!”","Jian Wushuang frowned, speaking up, “Could it be to stop Babidi?”","“Babidi?” The Realm King shook his head, explaining, “I’ve noticed this Babidi fellow, he’s not a threat, he can’t even ascend the stairway to godhood. As for his resurrection secret technique, it’s quite to my liking, he’s quite talented. But unfortunately, being from the Starry Sky, he’s destined not to become a god in our Northern Spacetime!”","Life from the Starry Sky.","Naturally belonged to the Starry Sky.","Coming to the River of Time, not being excluded was good enough, wanting to become a god","as well?","Did they think everyone was from the Giant God Clan?","The Starry Sky also had its own groups.","Jian Wushuang, upon hearing the Realm King’s explanation, pondered.","It was somewhat different from what Great Monk had said initially.","From the Realm King’s expression, it seemed like anyone from the Northern Spacetime had","the chance to become the God of Life.","There weren’t the restrictions Great Monk mentioned.","Perhaps those things were just Great Monk’s own thoughts, pretending to be profound.","He didn’t dwell on it much.","“The people I want to stop, you may know in the future, but not now. The fact that you’re able","to reach this place means there’s no problem with yourselves, and you’re qualified to enter","the stairway with Danbao! The Stairway to Godhood”","Everyone’s faces brightened!","Setting foot on the Stairway to Godhood together, they were also witnesses.","How could they not be happy?","In the future, they might become the first batch of Scattered Tribulation to be resurrected.","Jian Wushuang didn’t feel particularly excited upon hearing this.","Just looking at the Realm King’s figure, he felt puzzled.","The other party was the strongest true god in the Northern Spacetime, yet only a projection","came down.","The real body didn’t even come.","According to him, since the God of Life was so important, why not come in person?","It was a bit illogical.","Just then, Weiss’s voice rang in his mind.","“This chubby guy, he’s using you, be careful!”","Jian Wushuang was startled by this sentence, quickly asking, “Could it be he’s not Realm","King?”","“Who told you Realm King is a good person? Be cautious of anyone, no matter who they are!”","He felt a bit confused.","So, none of them were good people, huh?","But what could he possibly be used for? There were plenty of people stronger than him here.","The Divine Wood King, Great Monk, and those two war beasts.","Where would they need a Universe Master at the Sixth Tribulation realm?","“Don’t believe me?” Weiss’s eyebrows twitched, somewhat unhappy at being doubted, and","with a slight movement, he appeared directly in front of Jian Wushuang. Realm King was still in the midst of a cordial conversation with Divine Wood King when suddenly, he noticed a tall figure, and his chubby body flinched in shock."]},{"number":5927,"title":"Chapter 5927: Star Spirit","paragraphs":["Chapter 5927: Star Spirit","“Star Spirit!”","Jian Wushuang hadn’t expected Weiss to show up, and Weiss seemed to have little regard for this Realm King of the Northern Spacetime.","The Realm King, upon seeing Weiss, appeared even more astonished, his eyes nearly bulging out of their sockets.","Under everyone’s gaze, he immediately knelt down.","“Lord Star Spirit has graced us with his presence, why wasn’t this humble servant informed!” Realm King knelt down with utmost respect.","Divine Wood King was also taken aback, seeing Weiss’s tall figure, he hesitated for a moment, then glanced at Realm King, unsure whether to kneel or stand.","Weiss, who usually smiled before speaking, had a stern expression as he said, “In my presence, why not reveal your true form?”","“Oh, umm!” Realm King was somewhat at a loss.","He actually wanted his true form to come out as well.","But his true form was currently traversing a serpent path deep in the Northern Spacetime.","Northern Spacetime.","Above a vast ancient continent that towered over the nine major spacetimes, countless palaces surrounded it.","That was the closest place to his true form.","It was also the cycle of reincarnation in the Northern Spacetime.","Above the cycle of reincarnation, there was this serpent path.","At this moment, Realm King’s true form was walking on the serpent path.","This serpent path couldn’t be flown through, one could only walk on foot.","Realm King wasn’t alone; he was carrying someone on his back.","Behind him was also a large gorilla.","“Whew!”","When the projection of his true form saw Weiss, he stiffened and stood still.","On his back, Wu Zuo asked in surprise, “Old man, why aren’t you moving?”","Wu Zuo was also helpless; he could only be dragged along by Realm King after walking for a while.","Otherwise, he would be exhausted to death on the serpent path.","At this moment, Realm King suddenly stopped, Wu Zuo looked around and then asked, “Have we arrived?”","“Don’t speak!” Realm King’s true form loudly reprimanded him.","Startled, Wu Zuo jumped.","Realm King, who had never been angry before, was reprimanding him so loudly for the first time, which frightened him. He covered his mouth, afraid to say another word.","...","In the City of the Sky, the projection of Realm King was sweating profusely, unsure how to respond to Lord Weiss’s words.","Seeing Realm King’s silence, Weiss said indifferently, “If you won’t speak, then shall I speak?”","“No, no, Your Highness, I’ll speak!” Realm King got up from the ground, hesitated for a moment, then said dejectedly, “The Wanliu Universe is enveloped by a metallic lifeform. My true form can’t enter!”","“Honest enough!” Weiss nodded, then continued, “This willow tree originally doesn’t belong to your Northern Spacetime. It remained here initially due to the lack of foundation in your Northern Spacetime. But what happened later? You harbored trouble, giving rise to the infamous disciple Celestial Maiden. It was I who cleaned up the mess for you. Now, Wanliu is in trouble again. It seems it truly doesn’t belong to your Northern Spacetime!”","As Weiss spoke, all the surrounding spacetime froze.","Only Realm King and Jian Wushuang could move.","At this moment, not only the spacetime in the City of the Sky froze, but the entire Northern Spacetime was suspended.","However, those cultivators couldn’t perceive that time had been frozen.","Even the gods couldn’t detect it.","This was the power of Weiss.","The area Jian Wushuang’s eyes could see was enveloped by the entire Wanliu Universe.","He was equally astonished by Weiss’s power!","But he didn’t have much interest in Weiss’s investigation into the Wanliu Universe.","He simply thought that the Northern Realm King was too incompetent to even guard a","treasure.","Gods!","They were not invincible after all!","Like the God of Life, he could open the path of reincarnation.","Having the ability to resurrect the dead.","However, he wasn’t particularly skilled in combat; his invincibility lay in his mastery over","Life.","Realm King, governing the entire northern spacetime.","Appearing to be invincible.","In reality, it wasn’t so; he was merely the spokesperson for the Starry Sky.","He only had the ability to operate within the rules, not to alter them.","So when the Celestial Maiden emerged, Realm King was helpless and could only summon stronger gods from the Starry Sky.","Weiss!","That was when he appeared in the Northern Spacetime.","After resolving the issue with the Celestial Maiden, he didn’t immediately leave but stayed to","handle the aftermath.","Of course, he also had his own matters to attend to.","Like waiting for Jian Wushuang’s appearance!","“This time with Wanliu, I won’t intervene. You have to handle it alone. Otherwise, I will reclaim the Wanliu Divine Wood, and as for the position of the God of Life, you’ll have to find another way!” Weiss didn’t give Realm King any face, speaking with a serious tone and no","room for negotiation.","Jian Wushuang also saw Weiss this serious for the first time, and he couldn’t help but be","shaken.","Originally, he acknowledged Weiss’s abilities but didn’t think much of Weiss’s status.","He hadn’t expected that even Realm King wouldn’t dare to raise his head before Weiss.","For a moment, he didn’t dare to speak and just looked on.","Realm King shifted his gaze but didn’t dare to retort. He could only respectfully respond, “Lord Star Spirit, rest assured, I will handle Wanliu’s matter. If...”","“No ‘ifs.’ If any accidents happen, I will take the Wanliu Divine Tree away. But I won’t take away the trouble it causes. That metallic life form is one of the strongest practitioners from the Southern Spacetime. You better think it through!”","“Yes!” Realm King didn’t say anything more and just agreed.","Jian Wushuang listened, feeling stunned. One of the strongest practitioners from the Southern Spacetime, at least that meant they were at the Ninth Tribulation realm!","In the entire Northern Spacetime, there were only three Ninth Tribulation realm experts, those three eternal beings.","But seeing how worried the Realm King was, it seemed that dispatching those three eternal","beings wasn’t simple.","Otherwise, there wouldn’t be such hesitation.","It would be better to directly let the three super beings enter Wanliu and deal with that","metallic life form.","There was no need for them to waste time here.","“I’ve said what needs to be said. I won’t care about what you do!” Weiss stretched lazily,","looking tired.","He turned to Jian Wushuang and said casually, “You should be careful too, careful of that big","monk!”","As soon as he finished speaking, Weiss disappeared from the spot.","He had already entered Jian Wushuang’s Origin Source Universe.","“Be careful of the big monk?” Jian Wushuang’s eyes flickered, thinking to himself, “This old","guy, he’s definitely up to something!”","Ever since Realm King appeared, he had been suspicious of that old monk.","But since the one recommended by Realm King himself, he had no reason to doubt.","However, the old monk came from the Wanliu Universe, and the Wanliu Universe had the","Higher Heavens.","All of this seemed too coincidental.","Before Weiss reminded him, he was still holding onto the fantasy that it was all just a","coincidence.","Now it seemed it was real.","The Higher Heavens where Mie Sheng resided was the same Higher Heavens.","This was probably something even Lord Hengmu didn’t know.","And he also understood some things from Weiss’s words.","For example, the God of Life in the Northern Spacetime only managed the Northern","Spacetime.","The Southern Spacetime also had its own God of Life."]},{"number":5928,"title":"Chapter 5928: Big Deal","paragraphs":["Chapter 5928: Big Deal","Mie Sheng came from the Starry Sky, most likely a god from there!","With this realization, everything fell into place for him.","Mie Sheng sought the power of Life.","He could have easily gone to the Southern Spacetime or the Eastern Spacetime.","There was no need to come to the Northern Spacetime, a realm devoid of the birth of Gods of Life.","His deliberate choice to come to the Northern Spacetime was probably to intercept the God of Life.","By devouring the God of Life of the Northern Spacetime, he could forge reincarnation, and what he forged would be the reincarnation from the Starry Sky.","Only through this could Mie Sheng justify the immense cost and plan everything accordingly.","He glanced at Realm King, unsure if Realm King of the Northern Spacetime knew about Mie Sheng’s scheme.","Realm King must have known that Babidi came from the Starry Sky, so he should also be aware of Mie Sheng’s existence.","But he might not be aware of Mie Sheng’s plot.","Otherwise, he wouldn’t be in such a hurry to obtain the position of the God of Life.","After Weiss left, the spacetime returned to normal.","The Realm King also breathed a sigh of relief, casting a wary glance at Jian Wushuang.","He hadn’t expected Lord Weiss to still be in the Northern Spacetime, and within the Origin Source Universe of the practitioner right before their eyes.","This practitioner was one he had personally introduced.","This time, he had indeed brought trouble upon himself.","Thinking about that metallic lifeform, he felt a headache coming on.","Gritting his teeth, he pondered for a moment before turning to the crowd and saying, “If you can help Danbao become the God of Life this time, help him eliminate all threats, I will personally refine the Origin Source of the universe for you, allowing you to be reborn, and I can guarantee that each of you will reach the Eighth Tribulation realm. If you were already at the Eighth Tribulation realm, I will also refine the treasures needed to cross the Ninth Tribulation for you!”","When those at the Seventh Tribulation realm heard this, their expressions changed.","Divine Wood King was particularly shaken.","To refine treasures into the Ninth Tribulation realm!","This was beyond his expectations.","He had only hoped to reach demi-god status at best.","He never imagined there would be a chance to reach the Ninth Tribulation realm.","Jian Wushuang was also astonished by Realm King’s actions. Clearly, facing the pressure from Weiss, he was unwilling to abandon the Wanjie Divine Wood, nor did he want to confront that metallic lifeform.","It was a colossal disaster.","It not only threatened the Divine of Life but also the entire Northern Spacetime.","Regarding this matter, Realm King spared no expense.","He even directly produced a mustard seed and placed it before everyone.","“Inside here are divine power forbidden fruits. As long as you swallow one, your divine power will double in the next hour. Of course, there will be backlash, but you need not worry about it. As long as the Divine of Life appears, it will help you recover!”","After speaking, he pushed the mustard seed towards the crowd.","Divine Wood King caught it.","There were a total of 76 inside.","Exactly their number.","Even Jian Wushuang and Wu Li each had one.","“All I can do to help you is this. The rest depends on your luck!” Realm King’s gaze swept over everyone with determination. His voice was low, “Remember, you are not fighting for yourselves but for the entire Northern Spacetime. If you win this time, I guarantee that not only can you be resurrected, but you can also enter the Main Spacetime where there are even more powerful inheritances waiting for you!”","Upon hearing this, Divine Wood King’s eyes widened involuntarily, and he couldn’t help but ask, “Could it be the Realm Core Continent?”","“Yes, it is the Continent of Heart. I still have many Realm God Tokens on me. Those who achieve great deeds can naturally obtain them!” Realm King smiled faintly and continued, “As long as your contributions are significant, besides fixed god positions, I can fulfill any request, even the Ninth Tribulation realm!”","Phew!","The crowd took a sharp breath.","Realm King’s words grew more grandiose.","At this moment, they were all extremely excited, eager to go out and fight Babidi to the death.","However, Jian Wushuang didn’t feel too excited. Instead, he felt uneasy.","He was the only one who knew the real situation.","These people had no idea who their true opponent was this time.","If they knew, perhaps they wouldn’t be so excited.","The overt threat was only Babidi.","But secretly, there was still the metallic lifeform capable of threatening the Wanliu Divine","Tree.","And behind that, there was the shadow of Mie Sheng.","This journey to the Wanjie was fraught with danger.","It was far from as simple as they had imagined.","There was also Weiss’s promise.","Tricking him into entering the Wanliu probably wasn’t just to find treasures for his hairless","cat.","There must be something that prompted him to do so.","Otherwise, he wouldn’t have directly imparted the first half of the Extreme Freedom Intent","Technique to him!","Now he understood.","In the universe of Wanliu, there must be some hidden great secret.","The more the other party cared about it, the more afraid he became!","Especially Realm King!","This old man didn’t seem like a good person at all. How could he be so deceitful? Even he","couldn’t handle it, yet he let these cultivators go.","What use were more treasures?","Without life, it’s all empty talk.","Even this divine power forbidden fruit was meant for them to use desperately.","Jian Wushuang took a deep breath.","He was already on the thief’s boat, and there was no turning back. He could only take it one","step at a time.","The rest of them were completely swayed by Realm King, eager to confront Babidi right away. Seeing this, Realm King quickly tried to reassure them, saying, “Remember, the real enemy may not always be obvious. Babidi is not a threat; he’s merely a test. When necessary, we can even cooperate with him. Trust me, Babidi will never become the God of Life!” “Rest assured, Realm King, we understand,” Divine Wood King muttered, still trying to gauge Realm King’s intentions.","Earlier, Realm King had praised Babidi as a talent, leading Divine Wood King to believe that Babidi couldn’t die, but Chi Jiuxiao had to.","Because Death and Life were opposites.","The thoughts of the others were more or less similar.","These old guys had lived through countless eons, yet they still speculated about others.","But this time, they were fooled by Realm King.","Taking a deep breath, Realm King felt that if he said more, they might grasp more, so he cut to the chase, saying, “It’s up to you now. This formation will send you to the Higher Heavens.","It’s all up to you when you get there!”","With that, the projection vanished.","And at that moment, the formation closed its barrier!","They could enter freely, but unlocking it required the power of Life.","That was simple enough; once Danbao arrived, they could easily unlock it.","Even Jian Wushuang himself had the ability to unlock it.","But without Danbao, their unlocking it would be useless.","It was like going to cultivate without bringing one’s brain!","Danbao had to come along.","After briefly inspecting the formation, Divine Wood King turned to Jian Wushuang and said,","“Friend Wushuang, can your Life force also unlock this formation?”","“It can,” Jian Wushuang nodded, uncertain of the other’s intentions. Upon receiving confirmation, Divine Wood grinned and continued, “I have a plan to shake off","Babidi.”"]},{"number":5929,"title":"Chapter 5929: Activating the Grand Array","paragraphs":["Chapter 5929: Activating the Grand Array","“What scheme?”","The crowd gathered around.","Jian Wushuang was also curious.","But after Divine Wood King finished speaking, he regretted agreeing to the other party.","The other side wanted to use his Life force to activate the formation, then inform Danbao to come in, and they could instantly activate the formation and shake off Babidi.","It sounded good.","But in practice, it wasn’t so easy.","The Life force needed for the formation could resurrect a whole universe.","Even he would need a day’s time.","If Danbao activated the formation, maybe the time of an incense stick would be enough.","At this moment, as long as Divine Wood King and the Great Monk bought time outside.","Obviously, Divine Wood King was already afraid of Chi Jiuxiaoo and didn’t dare to take any more risks.","That’s why he asked Jian Wushuang to do it.","Thinking about it, it makes sense.","Realm King had already said not to care about threats like Babidi.","“Okay!” Jian Wushuang nodded, agreeing.","Seeing this, Divine Wood King exclaimed excitedly, “This time, Junior Brother Jian’s contribution is immense. Following Lord Danbao in the future will surely lead to boundless prospects!”","“Don’t waste time, let’s start directly!” Lord Hengmu couldn’t wait any longer.","Jian Wushuang rolled his eyes, ignoring these people, and walked into the formation. Entering the large formation, he first walked to the central statue.","The place to inject Life force was right here.","As long as there was enough Life force, the formation could be activated.","He didn’t rush to inject Life force but carefully observed the sculpture.","Just now, he didn’t look closely from the outside, but now, after a close look, he found that this sculpture was somewhat familiar to Realm King.","Originally thought it was Realm King’s masterpiece, but after Realm King appeared and saw the face clearly, it was different from the sculpture!","Realm King wore a hat and had a relatively plump body.","The sculpture in front of him, however, was somewhat thin and not very tall.","But it was able to build the City of the Sky in the Wanliu Universe.","It must have had a significant background.","The Wanliu Universe, or rather, this Wanliu Divine Tree, was brought over by Weiss to","supplement the foundation of the Northern Spacetime.","So, this Wanliu Divine Tree, in the entire Northern Spacetime, was one of the most top-notch treasures.","Qualified figures for resting in this place.","Apart from the Realm King, he couldn’t think of anyone else.","But now, looking at the carvings, it wasn’t the Realm King, and he was so surprised.","“The secret of this place may be related to this carving!” Jian Wushuang secretly speculated.","After circling around, he didn’t hesitate either, immediately injecting the power of life.","A large amount of Life force entered the carving.","But this carving was like a bottomless pit.","One day, he overestimated himself.","It took almost two days before he injected about 99 percent.","Divine Wood King urged him several times.","If it weren’t for the other party’s strength, he would have wanted to give the other party a sword.","Does he really think his Life force is worthless?","Such a huge Life force, all transformed from the power of all things.","All things!","It needs treasures to condense, how much could he condense by himself?","It’s okay to maintain a fight normally, but if he really wants to output endlessly.","He still needs treasures to replenish.","The treasures he obtained in the Infinite Great World before, as well as his own accumulation,","all went in.","Even the primordial stones were spent.","Now, his pockets are cleaner than his face!","Fortunately, the fruits he obtained were already condensed into the Origin Source chess","pieces in advance, otherwise, he would have lost too much this time.","Now everyone is so excited, they can’t wait to sacrifice themselves for the Danbao and become","gods.","He didn’t even dare to mention his expenses.","He could only swallow it.","It can also be considered as helping Danbao make sacrifices for them!","Since this time he is clinging to the thighs, sacrificing a bit is also good, so that he seems","useful.","“Divine Wood King, you go to support Danbao, I’ll stay here to guard!”","“Okay!”","After making a gesture to the other party, Jian Wushuang breathed a sigh of relief.","Lord Hengmu led the people into the array.","Divine Wood King went to support Danbao.","Outside the City of the Sky!","Danbao’s Shiled of Life resisted for two days and two nights.","Not only was Babidi surprised!","Even Danbao himself didn’t expect that his Life force could be endless.","Although he had the Origin Source of Life.","But nothing came out of thin air.","There will always be times when it can’t hold on.","He hasn’t become a God of Life yet.","Sure enough!","Under the attack of Chi Jiuxiao, cracks appeared in the Shield of Life.","Seeing this, the big monk’s heart sank.","He angrily scolded Divine Wood King and others for dragging things out, saying that one day’s time had been delayed by a day.","“Young Master, let’s retreat!” The great monk’s tone was tense. “If we keep going like this,","within the time it takes for an incense stick to burn, Chi Jiuxiao will be able to shatter this","Shield of Life!”","The time it takes for an incense stick to burn is said to be long.","Once cracks appear, it may be instantly broken.","Danbao also understood, but now if they retreat, all previous efforts will be in vain.","Can only grit his teeth and persevere.","Unmoved.","But the life shield cannot withstand Chi Jiuxiao just by perseverance.","As his Life force continued to decline.","The shield shattered!","Crash!","The Shield of Life broke!","The big monk resolutely stood in front of Danbao.","Blu also followed suit.","“Let’s go, now is not the time for a direct confrontation!” The great monk turned to Blu and","said, “You take the young master and go quickly, leave this to me!”","Seeing this, Blu understood the situation and, grabbing Danbao, headed straight for the City","of the Sky to escape.","The divine power on the great monk surged suddenly, and with a flying kick, he directly intercepted Chi Jiuxiao.","“Tsk tsk, overestimating your abilities!” Babidi sneered.","Behind them, Hun Tian and the others bypassed the great monk and rushed towards Danbao.","Blu transformed into a true dragon, possessing the strength of a Half-Step Eight Tribulation realm, which was already comparable to the Dragon God of the past.","However, facing several peak Seventh Tribulation realm experts and one Eighth Tribulation","realm expert, he still felt powerless.","He could only rely on speed to resist.","The two great war beasts, together with the great monk, barely withstood Chi Jiuxiao, but in","just a breath, they were broken through.","Just when they were in despair.","Divine Wood King arrived!","“After entering the city, find Jian Wushuang. Leave this to me!” Divine Wood King shouted","angrily, and with a shake of his aura, he forced Hun Tian and the others back.","Then he charged towards Chi Jiuxiao at random.","Only with the joint efforts of the big monk could they barely hold back Chi Jiuxiao.","The two great war beasts were like decorations.","Peak Eight Tribulations Realm experts were like ants in front of Chi Jiuxiao.","If it weren’t for the strong defense of the war beasts themselves, Chi Jiuxiao could probably","kill the two war beasts with a single stroke.","It took two peak Eighth Tribulation realm war beasts and two peak Eighth Tribulation realm","experts to barely hold back Chi Jiuxiao.","“Divine Wood, can the formation be activated?” The great monk, in his panic, revealed","something.","The nearby Divine Wood King’s eyes flickered, but his expression remained unchanged as he replied, “The formation can be activated, it only lacks a bit of Life force. If Master Danbao goes forward, it can be activated instantly. We also need to retreat!”"]},{"number":5930,"title":"Chapter 5930: Life Force Depleted?","paragraphs":["Chapter 5930: Life Force Depleted?","Upon hearing that the formation could be activated, the Great Monk’s divine power decreased considerably, giving him some confidence.","On the other side, Danbao had already arrived at the City of the Sky with Elder Blu.","With no pursuers, their journey was remarkably smooth, and before long, they reached the central square of the city.","“Hurry, enter the formation!” Jian Wushuang felt a bit anxious seeing Elder Blu and Danbao coming in a sorry state.","At the same time, he also sensed the oppressive aura from Chi Jiuxiao.","Babidi and his companions also entered the city and were swiftly approaching their location.","Although Divine Wood King and his group managed to block Chi Jiuxiao, they themselves were unable to move.","Babidi, on the other hand, led his people, bypassed Divine Wood King and his group, and followed Elder Blu and Danbao straight to the square.","As Danbao stepped into the formation, Babidi tried to follow right after.","The strong individuals within the formation were all at the Seventh Tribulation realm.","The strongest among them was Lord Hengmu, who wasted no time leading several peak Seventh Tribulation realm experts out.","“You’re injured?” Jian Wushuang placed a hand on Danbao’s shoulder, surprised. “Why is your Life force diminished?”","“It’s nothing, just my Shield of Life has been depleted too much!” Danbao shook his head.","But now, Jian Wushuang had to activate the formation himself since there was a bit of Life force lacking.","He could only turn back and continue to infuse Life force.","With Danbao’s strong spirit, he realized there was still a shortage and stepped forward to infuse Life force together.","At this moment, Wu Li approached and gave the life fruit he obtained to Danbao and Jian Wushuang.","This surprised Jian Wushuang greatly. He hadn’t expected Wu Li to change so much, knowing how to contribute.","“Brother Wushuang, you have to hold on. Whether I can reach the Eighth Tribulation realm depends on you!” Wu Li couldn’t say it directly, so he transmitted his thoughts to Jian Wushuang.","Hearing the other’s true thoughts, Jian Wushuang grinned.","Wu Li was still the same person he knew, unchanged in the slightest.","“Don’t worry!” He didn’t say much and joined Danbao in infusing Life force.","Meanwhile, Lord Hengmu held off Babidi and his group.","Although Hun Tian was powerful, when facing Lord Hengmu, they were evenly matched.","Both were at the Half-Step Eighth Tribulation realm.","As long as Divine Wood King freed up a hand, he could easily cripple his opponent.","Unfortunately, both Divine Wood King and the Great Monk were currently on the defensive, with no room to retreat further, having reached the perimeter of the array.","At this moment, the Life force within the carvings was also at its peak, permeating the entire formation with a greenish hue.","Seeing this, Jian Wushuang felt a surge of joy within him. The Life force of the Danbao was indeed formidable.","Even if just a fraction of it were forcibly extracted, it would surpass his own by countless times.","“Quick, enter the formation, we only have a moment!” he transmitted this message instantly. Lord Hengmu immediately led his people to retreat.","Divine Wood King and the Great Monk exchanged a glance, condensing a large amount of divine power and hurling it towards Chi Jiuxiao simultaneously, before turning to rush into the formation.","Babidi, sensing something amiss, hastily warned, “Chi Jiuxiao, don’t bother with them, break the formation first!”","Chi Jiuxiao, towering, raised his hand to deflect the two clusters of condensed divine power and then raised his fist, smashing fiercely onto the formation.","Everything happened too quickly.","The Divine Wood King and the Great Monk had just entered the formation when they felt a tremendous pressure.","The formation began to decay.","Jian Wushuang was taken aback. Who could have constructed this formation?","Logically speaking, even with Chi Jiuxiao’s Half-Step Ninth Tribulation realm strength, he shouldn’t be able to destroy it!","The ground kept trembling and sinking, making Jian Wushuang struggle to maintain his balance.","Danbao and Wu Li, closest to him, almost stumbled, but he managed to support them.","“Chi Jiuxiao!”","With one hand holding Danbao and the other holding Wu Li, Jian Wushuang looked up at the","sky where Chi Jiuxiao stood, his gaze filled with fear.","A massive shadow of a fist descended once again.","Wu Li shut his eyes directly, while Danbao took a step back.","Jian Wushuang immediately unleashed his Super Eternal Ancient Transformation, ready to swallow the forbidden divine power fruit.","Once the formation was damaged, there would be no way to teleport.","They would have to escape with Danbao.","As for the others, he had no time to spare.","Brum Elder would have to take care of himself.","Boom!","Just before the shadow fell on the formation, it activated completely, and everyone standing","on the formation vanished instantly.","Chi Jiuxiao’s fist also struck the center of the formation.","But there was not a single figure left on the formation.","Babidi was furious, cursing loudly.","This time, the formation was truly destroyed.","They would have no idea when they could catch up again.","“Damn it!”","Babidi’s eyes were ablaze with anger.","Rising into the air, he looked around and saw nothing but chaotic scenes except for the valley.","They had no idea which way to go!","With the formation shattered, even he couldn’t repair it.","To leave this place and find Jian Wushuang and the others, they would have to fly out.","“Ah!” Babidi’s eyes lit up with a flash of insight as he remembered Chi Tenggui defeated by","Chi Jiuxiao.","The opponent was also at about the Half-Step Ninth Tribulation realm.","Unfortunately, they had still lost to Chi Jiuxiao.","But Babidi hadn’t killed the opponent.","It was a great force to be wasted if he did.","As long as he enslaved the opponent and let him fully absorb the aura inside the City of the","Sky, it would be like having another Half-Step Ninth Tribulation realm servant.","How could he bear to kill such a resource?","Now it seemed that the opponent not only was a helper but also possibly knew how to leave","this place.","This time, Babidi’s luck seemed to be good, as he had guessed right.","Chi Tenggui indeed knew how to leave.","But the journey ahead was perilous.","Even Eighth Tribulation realm powerhouses might fall.","But Babidi wasn’t worried at all because he had two Half-Step Ninth Tribulation realm","powerhouses, and no one could stop them.","The next time they encountered Jian Wushuang and the others, it wouldn’t be as simple as","this time.","Being able to break through the Shield of Life meant there was hope.","In this way, they wouldn’t be at a loss.","Meanwhile, Jian Wushuang and the others also realized that relying on Danbao alone was not","enough for their protection.","No wonder Realm King had given them forbidden divine power fruits.","Everything still relied on their own efforts.","Swish!","As the formation activated.","They instantly left the City of the Sky.","They even left that time and space.","Entering the interior of the Wanliu Universe completely due to the destruction of the","formation.","However, an accident occurred when they were being transported.","A fissure opened in the midst of the shuttle’s black hole.","Jian Wushuang dragged Danbao and Wu Li directly into the fissure.","This kind of fissure posed little threat to them.","But being separated from the Divine Wood King and the others was a big trouble.","Seeing Jian Wushuang taking Danbao into the fissure, the Great Monk and Divine Wood King’s","hearts sank.","When they tried to follow, the fissure began to close.","They couldn’t get in at all.","“Get out of the way, let me blast it open!” The Great Monk was the most anxious, pushing","aside Divine Wood King and attacking towards the edge of the black hole."]},{"number":5931,"title":"Chapter 5931: This Is the Battlefield","paragraphs":["Chapter 5931: This Is the Battlefield","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Divine Wood King was greatly alarmed, quickly advising, “Even if you blast your way in, you won’t find Danbao!”","Deep down, he cursed the Great Monk, who seemed to lack even the most basic understanding of space-time.","Within the spatial realm, one could locate targets based on spatial markers.","However, within these space-time black holes, time was entwined.","In just that split second, who knew how many spaces they had traversed.","Yet the Great Monk intended to find Danbao through his unyielding and stubborn methods.","This was utterly absurd.","An Eighth Tribulation realm expert, yet seemingly ignorant of such principles.","Divine Wood King began to suspect if the Great Monk had lost his mind.","“What do you suggest then?” The Great Monk, in a fit of frustration, turned to Divine Wood King.","Elder Blu wasn’t worried, as he had faith in Jian Wushuang.","But the rest had their sights set on Danbao. Now that Danbao had disappeared into a black hole crevice, who would they follow?","No need to panic!","Divine Wood King’s gaze shifted, then he spoke, “We continue onwards. Blu is of the same clan as Danbao, he will inevitably sense Danbao’s aura. We’ll just follow that aura. How vast can a Wanliu Universe be?”","Upon hearing this, everyone breathed a sigh of relief.","Only the Great Monk’s eyes widened, scanning the group, trembling as he said, “Go inside, and you’ll know how vast it is!”","The Wanliu Universe.","Comparable to over half of the Ancient Moon Spacetime.","Truly, to search within, it would take not just years but perhaps decades.","The rules there were unlike those of the Ancient Moon Spacetime.","Speed might be significantly reduced.","If by chance, Danbao wasn’t in the Higher Heavens, they would have to descend to the lower realms.","That would be even slower.","But for now, there was no better option.","Moreover, most of these people still trusted Divine Wood King.","After all, he was the founder of the Ancient Wood Sect and a formidable figure in the Ancient Wood Continent.","Although the Great Monk was powerful, he was merely one of the first to pledge allegiance to Danbao, with some distance remaining.","On the other side.","Jian Wushuang and the others were swept into the black hole crevice, yet they remained calm.","In the chaotic space, he began to sense the aura with his psychic power.","Sensing the breath of life.","Wherever there was the breath of life in that space, that would be the primary space.","“Hmm?” Jian Wushuang’s eyes lit up, looking towards a mirrored space, he said, “It’s here, let’s go in!”","Wu Li and Danbao didn’t hesitate and followed him straight into the fray.","Within that mirrored space, Jian Wushuang not only sensed the breath of life but also felt a powerful divine energy fluctuation.","Moreover, the mirrored space was unstable, evidently in the midst of battle.","The conflict caused space to shatter, but time remained stable, allowing them to take advantage and enter.","As for the threat, they hadn’t really considered it.","Surely they wouldn’t be unlucky enough to encounter an Eighth Tribulation realm expert. Even if they did, with Jian Wushuang’s current strength, he could hold his own in such a battle.","If things got too tough, they could always retreat. As long as they didn’t encounter a Half-Step Ninth Tribulation realm expert, even if facing a peak Eighth Tribulation realm opponent, he could escape in their presence.","Furthermore, he now possessed a divine power fruit.","With the transformation of the Super Ancient times, he had four million units of divine power. Coupled with the doubling effect of the divine power fruit, that amounted to 8 million.","This was already the peak combat power of the Eighth Tribulation realm.","Naturally, he felt confident.","With a tearing sound, he casually ripped through the mirrored space, pulling Danbao and Wu Li along as they entered the space.","Swish!","Buzz!","They had just entered the primary spacetime, the interior of the Wanliu Universe.","What met their eyes was darkness and rumbling.","Countless huge dust particles floated in the sky.","Although called dust, each piece was the size of a fist.","As Jian Wushuang had speculated, there was indeed a battle here.","It could be said that divine beings filled the sky, with boundless divine power.","The battle here wasn’t as simple as one or two individuals fighting.","It resembled more of a national conflict.","The gathering of strong individuals on both sides exceeded billions.","The weakest were Emperor-level powerhouses.","These Emperors battled on the ground.","Each formidable array of monstrous beasts, composed of millions of Emperors, could contend with the Universe Masters.","There were also countless Tribulation realm experts, most of them at the Third Tribulation realm.","Among them were also the auras of Fifth Tribulation realm, even Sixth Tribulation realm.","Jian Wushuang and the others looked around like headless flies.","Their current position was quite awkward.","It seemed like they were right at the core of the battlefield.","Amidst the countless clashes, the three of them seemed insignificant.","Of course, this was because Jian Wushuang had concealed their tracks with his aura.","Otherwise, if their auras were exposed...","Not to mention Danbao, even Wu Li, with his Sixth Tribulation realm aura and over a million units of divine power, was comparable to the Seventh Tribulation realm.","Looking around, the strongest here were only at the Seventh Tribulation realm.","If they suddenly revealed themselves, it would likely startle the opponents.","“Let’s go!” Jian Wushuang wasn’t interested in this battle. After figuring out the direction, he prepared to leave.","But seeing Danbao’s expression, he took a deep breath.","The God of Life witnessed countless powerhouses battling.","Countless lives perishing.","How could they just turn a blind eye and leave!","Even Wu Li, who wasn’t particularly sensitive, could see that.","“Brother Wushuang, this isn’t right. All beings are supposed to be free. Seeing them trapped in such dire circumstances, how can we sit idly by? If you won’t act, then let me!” After speaking, Wu Li directly pulled Jian Wushuang’s aura, his divine power shook, and countless powerhouses around them were instantly shaken away.","Those gathered formations also instantly collapsed.","Millions of Emperors died instantly.","Wu Li awkwardly smiled, “Sorry, I didn’t control it well!”","Those Emperors closest to them were reduced to ashes.","Danbao’s face was ashen.","But he didn’t show any intention to blame Wu Li.","Jian Wushuang secretly chuckled at Wu Li’s flattery, not as good as his old man, who was quick to take advantage of such situations.","Since Wu Li had already stepped forward, he also had to show some gesture.","“Danbao, what do you think?”","He wanted to clarify the meaning of Danbao, preferably by listening to the other party.","To avoid ending up with a thankless task.","But this time, Danbao shook his head and said, “In this world, where there is life, there is death; it’s a cycle we cannot intervene in!”","“This!” Wu Li’s expression changed, not expecting Danbao to say such words.","Jian Wushuang, however, nodded in admiration, but feeling several gazes descend upon them, he calmly said, “It seems we have no choice but to intervene!”","Wu Li’s exposure immediately caught the attention of those at the Seventh Tribulation realm.","And at least three of them emitted the aura of the Seventh Tribulation realm.","One of them was at the peak of the Seventh Tribulation Realm, with divine power of about 1.8 million.","And there were two other Seventh Tribulation realm experts with divine power of 1.5 million.","These three auras were not friendly towards each other.","Clearly, they were in hostile relations.","Swish!!!","Three figures descended from the heavens, instantly appearing in front of Jian Wushuang and the others.","At the same time, they ordered a halt to the fighting.","The billions of experts on both sides each retreated tens of thousands of miles, then looked towards the few individuals in the center of the battlefield."]},{"number":5932,"title":"Chapter 5932: Zhen Wu Dynasty","paragraphs":["Chapter 5932: Zhen Wu Dynasty","Wu Li glanced around calmly, his expression unchanged.","As a Seventh Tribulation realm expert, he remained unruffled.","With Jian Wushuang present, even the arrival of an Eighth Tribulation realm posed little threat.","“Dear fellows, this is the territory of the Zhen Wu Dynasty. May I inquire as to the purpose of your visit?” spoke the foremost Seventh Tribulation realm expert.","The other two Seventh Tribulation realm experts, not to be outdone, retorted angrily, “This land belongs to our Southern Cloud Kingdom. There’s no need for your Zhen Wu Dynasty to interrogate us!”","Their words immediately sowed discord, itching for a fight.","Wu Li watched the scene unfold with interest, almost eager to witness their clash.","After all, even Danbao seemed uninterested in intervening.","Zhen Wu Dynasty!","Upon hearing this familiar name, Jian Wushuang’s heart trembled.","It reminded him of Zhen Wuyang and flashed scenes from his past through his mind, drawing him back to the Great Si Region.","Memories resurfaced of his time in the Great Si Region, a period he considered the worst despite the few friends he made there. It was a time of boredom and adversity, the memory of which almost faded as he ventured into the Great Desolate and then into the Qishen Temple Spacetime.","The last time he recalled the Great Si Region was when Zhen Wuyang informed him of its destruction.","With the Great Si Region gone, memories now revolved around Zhen Wuyang, the noble Emperor, the pride of the Great Si Region, the powerhouse of the Original Universe.","Once glorious but now lost in the void after entering the Ancient Moon Spacetime.","Now, upon hearing the name ‘Zhen Wu” again, his mind involuntarily turned to Zhen Wuyang.","Simultaneously, he couldn’t help but feel a slight affinity towards the Zhen Wu Dynasty. With just a glance, he could sense from their aura that indeed, this was the territory of the Zhen Wu Dynasty.","What if it was a conspiracy by the Zhen Wu Dynasty?","Immediately, they rose into the air, blocking Jian Wushuang and the others’ path.","In the distance, three powerful auras were steadily approaching.","It was evident that the Southern Cloud Kingdom had come prepared.","“What’s the meaning of this?” Jian Wushuang’s expression changed as he also sensed the threatening aura from afar.","At least three top-tier experts at the Seventh Tribulation realm.","The two Seventh Tribulation realm experts from the Southern Cloud Kingdom sneered, their tone unfriendly, “I’ve said it before, this place belongs to the Southern Cloud Kingdom. You can come or leave as you wish, but isn’t this disrespecting the Southern Cloud Kingdom’s face, especially after killing our Imperial Emperor!”","The Seventh Tribulation realm expert from the Zhen Wu Dynasty below took a half step back, preparing to watch the show.","Deep down, there was also a sense of apprehension.","They feared it might be a ploy by the Southern Cloud Kingdom, but being embroiled in a war vortex, surrounded by enemies on all sides, they couldn’t spare extra experts to this place.","He could only hold the fort alone here.","At the same time, he prayed inwardly that the arrival of these three mysterious experts had nothing to do with the Southern Cloud Kingdom.","In that case, if they started fighting each other, he could buy some time.","“Hmph!”","Wu Li’s expression shifted, and he stepped forward directly.","With his current strength at the peak of the Seventh Tribulation realm, how could he fear these two ordinary Seventh Tribulation realm experts?","Seeing them dare to block the way, he immediately surged with divine power, erupting with all his might.","“Huh?” The two Southern Cloud Kingdom experts were also startled to find that Wu Li’s divine power surpassed theirs.","But seeing his realm was only at the Sixth Tribulation realm, they felt somewhat panicked, afraid of hitting a brick wall.","But Wu Li’s outburst made them more convinced that it was a scheme by the Zhen Wu","Dynasty.","“Zhen Wu Marquis, your Zhen Wu Dynasty really hides its cards well, unexpectedly concealing such super experts?”","The Seventh Tribulation realm expert from the Zhen Wu Dynasty, the “Zhen Wu Marquis” didn’t respond, but there was a trace of fear in his eyes.","He immediately gestured for the army of cultivators behind him to retreat.","If a fight broke out between Seventh Tribulation realm experts, this place would be destroyed. Those cultivator armies wouldn’t be able to withstand the shockwaves of divine power. “Nangong Huo, I don’t know what you’re talking about. Since you think it’s a plot by my Zhen Wu Dynasty, why don’t you try your hand against these three friends?” The Zhen Wu Marquis sneered, then stepped back directly.","He couldn’t figure out the other side’s intentions now; he could only retreat with his men","first.","This left the two Seventh Tribulation realm experts from the Southern Cloud Kingdom somewhat puzzled.","“No need to bother with them!” Jian Wushuang shook his head and said calmly, “Let’s just","go!”","There’s no need to waste words with these people.","You hit me, I hit you!","What’s the point?","Their goal wasn’t to waste time here.","“You’re right, they’re just frogs in a well!” Wu Li sneered, retracting his divine power into his","body, disdainfully glancing at the other side.","This infuriated the two Southern Cloud Kingdom experts, who angrily said, “Looking down","on us?”","Although they were angry, they now realized that the other party might have really passed","through this place.","But killing their Emperor was a fact.","Now that they’ve stopped them, they couldn’t just let them go like this!","Unfortunately, they were overthinking.","If Jian Wushuang wanted to leave, not even an Eighth Tribulation realm expert could stop him.","Whoosh!","A pair of dark red wings spread out, covering the sky in an instant."]},{"number":5933,"title":"Chapter 5933: Long Time No See","paragraphs":["Chapter 5933: Long Time No See","With a slight tremble of his Candle Dragon Wings, Jian Wushuang prepared to depart from this place with Danbao and Wu Li.","The massive Candle Dragon Wings, sharp and imbued with the complete Origin Source of Space above, had now fully recovered to their peak state, comparable to a universe treasure of the Eighth Tribulation realm.","The two Seventh Tribulation Realm experts from the Southern Cloud Kingdom were stunned when they saw these wings, especially with the powerful divine aura emanating from above, rendering them breathless.","The sharp aura could instantly kill Universe Masters below the Seventh Tribulation realm. Even Seventh Tribulation realm beings felt a chill in the face of such a powerful treasure. Yet, this was just a part of the Beast God Weapon.","The top Seventh Tribulation realm expert of the Zhen Wu Dynasty also felt extremely wary and couldn’t help but step back.","The wings tore through space, and Jian Wushuang was about to leave.","But he was stopped by a shout.","“Jian Wushuang!”","The voice was familiar to Jian Wushuang, causing him to pause and turn to look at the densely packed army of the Zhen Wu Dynasty.","He found the direction from which the voice came and saw the figure.","Clad in a golden robe exuding an air of nobility, he sat in the middle of the army, his body stained with crimson blood.","Jian Wushuang looked down at the figure.","The figure in the golden robe also looked at Jian Wushuang.","He had noticed Jian Wushuang early on but hadn’t dared to believe it at that time.","But upon seeing those dark-red feathered wings, he was certain that the mysterious figure before him was indeed Jian Wushuang.","The Jian Wushuang who entered the Ancient Moon Spacetime with him.","The same Jian Wushuang who had suggested bringing them into the alternate timeline.","In the vast world of the Higher Heavens, after countless epochs, he finally saw someone familiar.","If it weren’t for Jian Wushuang’s appearance, he would have thought everything was just a dream!","“Wushuang, why have you stopped?”","Wu Li, seeing Jian Wushuang frozen, attempted to reach out to him, but was stopped by Danbao.","Jian Wushuang, ignoring the two beside him, slowly flew towards the army of the Zhen Wu Dynasty.","This scene frightened the ‘Zhen Wu Marquis’ of the Zhen Wu Dynasty.","He turned his head and looked at the figure in the golden robe covered in blood.","“Crown Prince!”","The figure in the golden robe was the Crown Prince of the Zhen Wu Dynasty, the future heir, the current Crown Prince, and a Universe Master of the Fifth Tribulation realm!","He definitely had to be protected, otherwise the Zhen Wu Dynasty would be truly finished.","“Your Highness, if anything goes wrong, the dynasty will accelerate its collapse.”","But he could tell that the Crown Prince seemed to know this mysterious powerhouse. Yet, he didn’t dare to gamble.","Immediately, he rushed towards the center of the army, intending to intercept Jian Wushuang.","However, just as his figure reached Jian Wushuang’s front, he realized it was only a residual image.","He hadn’t intercepted him at all.","Jian Wushuang didn’t even regard him as a threat. His figure flickered continuously, appearing slow but actually already in the midst of the central army.","He arrived in front of the figure clad in golden robes.","Coming to a stop, he looked up at the familiar figure.","“Long time no see!”","The figure in golden robes trembled, hurriedly walking up to Jian Wushuang, standing in front of him unsteadily, and said, “It’s been so many years, do you know how long I’ve been searching for you?”","Jian Wushuang sighed. This was the Wanliu Universe. How could they possibly find him here?","Moreover, this was the vast world beneath the Higher Heavens, where time and space were entirely different.","Seeing the sedimentation of the other party’s aura, he knew that the other had been cultivating here for countless epochs.","In the outside world, he had calculated that it had been just over 10,000 years.","But here, it was likely countless epochs had passed.","From Emperor to the Fifth Tribulation realm.","“Zhen Wuyang!” Jian Wushuang’s voice was low. “How come you’re here?”","This was the Wanliu Universe. Initially, when they entered the Celestial Maiden Spacetime, theoretically, they should have appeared in the Nine Heavens and Ten Lands.","He never would have imagined that Zhen Wuyang would enter the Wanliu Universe.","And it was the Wanliu Universe he had dreamt of entering.","Comparisons were odious.","Some begged to come in, while others begged to leave.","“What do you mean?” Zhen Wuyang was puzzled for a moment.","At this moment, Jian Wushuang explained, “To make a long story short, this place is just a secret realm, or rather, the Origin Source Universe of a super powerhouse!”","“Origin Source Universe!”","Zhen Wuyang’s eyes widened as he heard the words.","He hadn’t expected that this immensely vast celestial world was merely the Origin Source Universe of a super powerful being.","And above the celestial dome, there was still the Higher Heavens.","It was much larger than the Original Spacetime they had been in.","After all, the space here was half the size of the Ancient Moon Spacetime.","It’s worth noting that the Ancient Moon Spacetime was one of the strongest nine spacetime","rivers in the northern region.","The spacetime of the Original Universe was just a tributary upstream and downstream of the Ancient Moon Spacetime.","The space was less than a tenth of the size of the Ancient Moon Spacetime.","Zhen Wuyang, who had never seen the Ancient Moon Spacetime, naturally wouldn’t think that","this place was just some kind of secret realm.","“Some things require a lengthy explanation. There are too many eyes and ears here. It’s better","to change locations!”","To find Zhen Wuyang here was something he had never expected.","He was quite happy about it deep down.","Moreover, the other party’s strength was quite good; he had already reached the Fifth","Tribulation Universe Master.","Of course, this was also related to time.","The inheritance here was stronger than the Ancient Moon Spacetime, and Zhen Wuyang had","practiced for countless eons to become a Fifth Tribulation Universe Master, which was also","within reason.","Among the initial ten, in terms of potential, Zhen Wuyang was in the second tier.","He was much stronger than Dongsheng and Wanyan.","It was reasonable for him to cultivate to the Five Tribulations stage.","“Change locations?” Zhen Wuyang was instantly brought back to reality.","This place was a battlefield.","It was the battlefield between the Zhen Wu Dynasty and the Southern Cloud Kingdom.","He was the crown prince of the Zhen Wu Dynasty, the future Zhen Wu Emperor.","Now!","Could he still leave?","Compared to the time in the Original Universe or in the Great Si Region, it felt more like a","dream.","He had lived here for countless months.","If it weren’t for Jian Wushuang’s sudden appearance, he would have almost forgotten","everything.","He had also forgotten the oath he made in front of Qishen’s tombstone.","Speaking of which, his original aspirations seemed a bit childish now.","So many years had passed, yet he hadn’t felt any backlash from the oath. From this point of view, he felt that everything that had happened before was really just a","dream.","“Forget it!” Zhen Wuyang broke free from Jian Wushuang’s arm and shook his head. “Some things can’t be returned to!”","Jian Wushuang was surprised. “Are you unable to let go of these people?”","He looked around.","One of the top experts of the Zhen Wu Dynasty at the Seven Tribulations stage was standing","behind him.","The other party didn’t know about Jian Wushuang’s relationship with Zhen Wuyang.","“Crown Prince, do you know this Daoist friend?” He looked towards Jian Wushuang.","Now, the Zhen Wu Dynasty was surrounded by enemies on all sides. If they could have one more Seventh Tribulation expert to help, it would increase their chances of victory. However, Zhen Wuyang didn’t have that in mind at the moment.","He didn’t want to acknowledge everything that had happened before, yet he voluntarily","admitted his relationship with Jian Wushuang.","The contradiction between them also represented his conflicted heart."]},{"number":5934,"title":"Chapter 5934: How Can I Forget?","paragraphs":["Chapter 5934: How Can I Forget?","Danbao and Wu Li also flew over. Seeing the solemn expression on Jian Wushuang’s face, they hesitated to speak.","“Are you really not coming with me?” Jian Wushuang asked.","“No, the Great Si Region is long gone, and there’s nothing worth reminiscing about in the Qishen Temple. It’s just that I feel a bit sorry for that Zhen Ling,” Zhen Wuyang shook his head with a bitter smile.","Jian Wushuang took a deep breath. He didn’t blame Zhen Wuyang.","If it were him, he might have also lost himself in the endless years.","But he didn’t understand what was so good about staying here.","Even if there was nothing worth remembering about the Qishen Temple, it was better to leave and continue cultivation in the Ancient Moon Spacetime.","Why waste time between dynasties?","“The Zhen Wu Dynasty!” Jian Wushuang turned to Zhen Wuyang and said, “Anyway, I was the one who brought you here in the first place. Whatever you need, just ask!”","He didn’t want to give up just like that. Perhaps solving the troubles facing the Zhen Wu Dynasty could change Zhen Wuyang’s mind.","The Great Si Region was gone.","But the feelings were still there!","He couldn’t forget that he had almost become Zhen Wuyang’s son-in-law.","And the other party had also helped him a lot.","Even the opening of the Qishen Temple was closely related to Zhen Wuyang.","If it weren’t for Zhen Wuyang punishing him to go to the Great Desolate Wilderness, the Qishen Temple wouldn’t have been opened.","Everything from the past was vivid in his mind.","How could he forget?","“No need, tell me about yourself, how did you end up here?” Zhen Wuyang didn’t know how powerful Jian Wushuang was.","Now the Zhen Wu Dynasty was facing the siege of several kingdoms, and he couldn’t involve Jian Wushuang in this mess anymore.","He had given up his former identity himself, so there was no reason to ask for Jian Wushuang’s help again.","“I came here because of him!” Jian Wushuang turned his head and pointed to Danbao, introducing, “These two are my good friends, Danbao and Wu Li!”","Upon hearing the introduction, both of them politely nodded.","Wu Li became even more curious about Jian Wushuang’s identity. It seemed that he knew people everywhere.","But back in the Wanliu Divine Realm, he had learned that Jian Wushuang came from a different spacetime and was not a practitioner of the Ancient Moon Spacetime.","Perhaps more than one person had come back then!","After Zhen Wuyang nodded in agreement, he awkwardly said, “As you can see, the situation is special this time, and we can’t accommodate you.”","“That’s simple!” Jian Wushuang shrugged, “Just tell me the information about Southern Cloud Kingdom, I’ll help you solve it!”","Upon hearing this, Zhen Wuyang was about to refuse, but Zhen Wuhou, who was standing aside, immediately spoke up with a faint smile, “Thank you, Fellow Daoist, for offering to help. Without Fellow Daoist’s assistance, this time, several Seventh Tribulation experts from Southern Cloud Kingdom attacked our Zhen Wu Dynasty. If it weren’t for their sudden arrival, the Crown Prince would have almost ascended the throne!”","||","“Leave it to me!”","Jian Wushuang’s aura surged, and he looked towards the distance.","The experts from Southern Cloud Kingdom had already arrived.","Upon witnessing the situation, Wu Li whispered, “Brother Wushuang, do you need my assistance?”","With only the three of them present, Danbao’s Life force had almost depleted, slowly recovering without any combat capability whatsoever. At this moment, Wu Li naturally felt the need to offer his help.","“No need, just stay by Danbao’s side!” Jian Wushuang replied before ascending into the air.","He headed towards the vast army of the Southern Cloud Kingdom.","Seeing Jian Wushuang’s decisive actions, the Zhen Wu Marquis felt greatly pleased and immediately communicated with Zhen Wu Yang, “Crown Prince, is this one of the friends you made during your travels?”","After becoming the Universe Master, Zhen Wu Yang had been away from the Zhen Wu Dynasty for nearly a billion epochs. Upon his return, he had already reached the level of a Fifth Tribulation Realm Universe Master, and his personality had undergone changes.","However, his strength and potential had both been fully unleashed, and being the Crown Prince, he was promptly designated as the heir.","Within the dynasty, no one opposed this decision.","The founder of the Zhen Wu Dynasty was only a Half-Step Eighth Tribulations Realm powerhouse, and the number of strong individuals under his command was limited.","Among the younger generation, having a Fifth Tribulation Realm Universe Master was already considered excellent.","In fact, it was similar to the situation in the former Yue Kingdom.","However, in terms of overall strength, it far surpassed the Yue Kingdom.","Throughout the Zhen Wu Dynasty, there were several Seventh Tribulation powerhouses, and the number of Sixth Tribulation realm experts numbered in the hundreds.","Yet, the Zhen Wu lineage’s strong individuals were scarce.","Hence, Zhen Wuyang, a Fifth Tribulation Realm Universe Master, was highly valued.","Moreover, he had now befriended a mysterious Seventh Tribulation powerhouse and had","achieved great feats.","Looking at Jian Wushuang’s departing figure, especially his astonishing wings, Zhen Wu Marquis was certain that he could withstand the Southern Cloud Kingdom’s strong individuals this time.","As long as they held off the Southern Cloud Kingdom, they could catch their breath on other","battlefronts.","This time, being besieged by the five major kingdoms posed the greatest threat to him.","Zhen Wu Marquis!","One of the top three super strong individuals in the Zhen Wu Dynasty.","Taking charge personally.","However, the Southern Cloud Kingdom had only dispatched two ordinary Seventh Tribulation","experts, evidently not daring to engage in direct confrontation.","But upon hearing about the arrival of a mysterious powerhouse, the Southern Cloud Kingdom didn’t dare to underestimate the situation and immediately mobilized all its forces.","This time, in the assault on the Zhen Wu Dynasty, a total of five Seventh Tribulation","powerhouses had come.","Now they were all assembled.","Two ordinary Seventh Tribulation Realm experts.","Two top Seventh Tribulation Realm experts, and one peak Seventh Tribulation Realm","powerhouse.","This lineup was indeed formidable.","Capable of crushing the current forces of the Zhen Wu Dynasty.","Zhen Wu Marquis also came along; after all, he was also a top Seventh Tribulation realm","expert.","“Whoever has a horn on his head is the Lord Jiujian from the Southern Cloud Kingdom. The rest are not worth worrying about; I alone can handle them!”","“Just a few Seventh Tribulation realm experts, you don’t need to intervene, just watch","carefully!”","Jian Wushuang was very confident.","With just these people, he didn’t even need to unleash the Super Eternal Ancient","Transformation.","With the Tribulation Armor on, he had 2 million divine power. Dealing with these Seventh Tribulation realm experts was a piece of cake.","The powerhouses from the Southern Cloud Kingdom, upon seeing Jian Wushuang’s arrival,","exchanged glances.","“It’s him, he seems to be friends with the prince of the Zhen Wu Dynasty; he must be here to","help!”","“His divine power is only 1.5 million, not as strong as you said!”","Behind the Lord Jiujian floated nine short swords, emitting a fierce aura. When he looked at","Jian Wushuang, his gaze was icy.","Although not afraid, since the other party was not from the Zhen Wu Dynasty, it was best not","to take action if it could be avoided. He immediately shouted to Jian Wushuang, “If you leave","now, my Southern Cloud Kingdom will let bygones be bygones!”","“The same goes for you!”","Jian Wushuang smiled faintly and returned the words to the other party.","“What do you mean?”","“Exactly what I said!”","He was wary of the other party, but he wasn’t afraid of them.","As soon as he finished speaking, his divine power suddenly erupted, the Tribulation Armor manifested, and his divine power surged to 2 million, instantly rushing towards the Southern Cloud Kingdom’s army.","Since he chose to help Zhen Wuyang resolve the dynasty’s disputes, he might as well resolve","them all at once.","Since none of them could become the God of Life anyway, he didn’t need to be polite.","His innate desire for slaughter surged, ignoring those Emperor-level figures and easily","shattering countless arrays condensed by them. When the Lord Jiujian reacted, he was furious."]},{"number":5935,"title":"Chapter 5935: Immortal Divine Temple","paragraphs":["Chapter 5935: Immortal Divine Temple","His divine power exceeded 2 million, so he promptly confronted it.","Nine short swords emitted a buzzing sound, converging into a perfect cage from the heavens, prepared to suppress Jian Wushuang.","But in terms of swordsmanship.","Since Jian Wushuang became the Universe Master, especially after creating the Starry Sky Nine Swords, he had subtly become a co-master of spacetime swordsmanship.","Let alone facing a Seventh Tribulation realm expert in swordsmanship, even an Eighth Tribulation realm expert didn’t concern him.","Before the nine short swords could encase him, they were repelled by the power of the Tribulation Armor.","“You dare to call yourself Lord Jiujian? Nine Sword Sovereign?”","Jian Wushuang sneered, his figure flashed, unexpectedly taking the initiative to pursue the nine short swords.","His speed surpassed that of the Universe Treasures; with just one hand, he grabbed one of the short swords, angrily shouted, and crushed it directly.","A Universe Treasure at the Seventh Tribulation realm shattered in his hands like gravel.","“You!”","Lord Jiujian panicked, for a moment not knowing whether to retreat, watching helplessly as Jian Wushuang destroyed his nine great Universe Treasures.","That was a set of Universe Treasures at the Seventh Tribulation realm.","Destroyed just like that.","Jian Wushuang, donning tribulation armor, possessed 2 million divine power, combined with five times the power of the divine beasts, totaling 3 million divine power.","He had reached the strength of the Eighth Tribulation realm threshold.","Destroying a Universe Treasure was effortless.","If it weren’t for the need to destroy that item, he wouldn’t even need to use the power of the Beast God to kill Lord Jiujian.","It’s just that the opponent’s swordsmanship was too lacking, almost painful to watch.","If he didn’t destroy that item, he wouldn’t be able to get past himself.","“You are at the Eighth Tribulation realm!”","Lord Jiujian trembled, pointing at Jian Wushuang, angrily said, “As an eighth tribulation realm cultivator, meddling in the disputes between dynasties, aren’t you afraid of being hunted down by the Immortal Divine Temple’s experts?”","In the vast world above, there was a clear Law Rule.","No interference in the disputes between dynasties.","This rule was to ensure that no one could dominate alone.","Just because of the presence of an Eighth Tribulation realm expert, it couldn’t dominate one region, leading to monopolization of resources.","After hearing this rule, Jian Wushuang quite appreciated the Immortal Divine Temple for it.","Such rules were indeed good.","No matter how powerful a family was, it couldn’t compare to all the beings in the Infinite Great World.","Strong individuals struggled from among the masses.","The strong ones cultivated by families were rarely superior to their predecessors!","The existence of the Immortal Divine Temple was because of this.","To accumulate more strong individuals, it was necessary to control the balance of resources.","So those ancestors of dynasties were all at the Half-Step Eighth Tribulation realm.","Eighth Tribulation realm experts, once defeated, wouldn’t care about worldly matters anymore but would enter the Immortal Divine Temple.","Where all the Eighth Tribulation realm experts of the vast world gathered.","Normally, to see an Eighth Tribulation realm expert, one needed to enter the Immortal Divine Temple.","The Immortal Divine Temple also held regular preaching conferences, inviting some Half- Step Eighth Tribulation realm experts to provide guidance.","All this was just transmitted to him by Zhen Wuyang.","Hearing this, he was somewhat surprised.","If the previous ones were for the sake of resource balance, he could still accept it.","But the latter part was somewhat unreasonable.","There were only so many resources, yet so many Eighth Tribulation realm experts had to be","groomed?","Why?","Without a common threat, they wouldn’t go to such lengths to promote their juniors.","In a complete cultivator’s world, cultivators were comparatively selfish.","Just like the Ancient Wood Continent.","Perhaps Divine Wood King wouldn’t like to see any Eighth Tribulation realm expert surpassing him, or those countries producing new Eighth Tribulation realm experts.","After all, there were only so many resources.","If an additional Eighth Tribulation realm expert emerged, they would have to give up their share.","Unless they thought their treasures were too many, but who would think their resources were too many?","Taking out to nurture the younger generation, wouldn’t that be better?","At least the descendants would listen to oneself and wouldn’t pose a threat.","It could also help maintain one’s position.","That’s how families are built.","When Jian Wushuang was young, he also thought about establishing a family.","But back then, because of Teacher Xuan Yi, he saw a bigger world and gave up on the idea.","To establish a family, one must wait until their strength is strong enough. When it’s no longer possible to improve further, then one can establish a family, stabilize their power, plunder resources, and provide for their own cultivation.","That’s the greatest use of a family.","Unexpectedly, in this vast Great Sky Dome World, there are still such rules.","The Eighth Tribulation realm experts not only refrain from establishing families to prey on","others but also restrain families.","Their mindset is a waste even if they don’t become gods.","“Zhen Wuyang, is there some hidden danger in the Great Sky Dome World that requires Eighth Tribulation realm experts to suppress?”","“I’m not sure. I haven’t heard of the Immortal Divine Temple taking action externally. It’s just that some newly promoted Eighth Tribulation realm experts refuse to join the Immortal Divine Temple and are suppressed. Later, they are mostly released, and after being released, they choose to join the Immortal Divine Temple!”","Jian Wushuang’s eyebrows jumped. This makes sense.","Perhaps there is indeed some kind of threat that requires Eighth Tribulation realm experts to suppress, so they prohibit Eighth Tribulation realm experts from establishing forces.","Zhen Wuyang’s expression changed, hesitated for a moment, and then asked through voice transmission, “Jian Wushuang, are you really in the Eighth Tribulation realm?”","“You can think of it that way!”","His combat power is at the Eighth Tribulation realm, but he has not yet undergone the","Tribulation.","According to the rules of the Immortal Divine Temple, once he reaches the combat power of the Eighth Tribulation realm, he will be forcibly incorporated into the Immortal Divine","Temple.","His realm cannot be seen by others.","After reaching the level of Universe Master, his Origin Source exceeds the normal range of Universe Masters, making it difficult for outsiders to determine his realm.","They will only judge his realm based on his combat power.","They won’t care about whether he’s at the Tribulation realm.","Just like Lord Jiujian in front of him.","So he didn’t need to argue about anything.","“Now that you’ve found out about this, then go to hell!”","Jian Wushuang grinned, gathering divine power in his hands, and a dark red divine power","surged instantly.","With a single finger, he was ready to attack the army of the Southern Cloud Kingdom.","“Wait!”","A crisp shout made Jian Wushuang stop.","Danbao couldn’t bear to watch and stepped forward.","If it were a war between the Zhen Wu Dynasty and the Southern Cloud Kingdom, he might not","intervene.","But with Jian Wushuang taking action, he had to come out to stop it.","Clatter! Jian Wushuang directly retracted the divine power. He knew Danbao would intervene.","The killing intent in his bones also dissipated.","After hearing about the Immortal Divine Temple’s existence, he actually didn’t plan to take","action anymore because it was meaningless.","He couldn’t just overthrow the Immortal Divine Temple for Zhen Wuyang’s sake!","If he didn’t settle things with the Immortal Divine Temple, even if he subdued the Southern","Cloud Kingdom, more forces would be involved.","Everything was as Danbao said, predetermined. Can’t be reversed. Seeing him stop, Danbao also breathed a sigh of relief.","“I’ll spare your lives, but you must swear that you will never set foot in the Zhen Wu Dynasty","again!”","Jian Wushuang’s gaze was icy. If the other party didn’t agree, he wouldn’t mind killing these Seven Tribulation realm experts.","Mainly, he wanted to take Zhen Wuyang away from here."]},{"number":5936,"title":"Chapter 5936: Those Years!","paragraphs":["Chapter 5936: Those Years!","He didn’t want to go back alone when the time came.","“You can stop us, Southern Cloud Kingdom, but you can’t stop the Immortal Divine Temple!” Although Lord Jiujian spoke defiantly, he still made a vow.","He just didn’t believe that Jian Wushuang would dare to oppose the Immortal Divine Temple, to go against this rule.","Jian Wushuang indeed wasn’t prepared to antagonize the Immortal Divine Temple. He just wanted to persuade Zhen Wuyang to leave with him.","He would stubbornly wait until the people from the Immortal Divine Temple came looking for trouble.","After sending away the Southern Cloud Kingdom’s army, the Zhen Wu Dynasty’s army naturally felt excited, winning without a fight.","In fact, it was a win-win situation.","For the weaker ones, at least.","“Let’s go, it’s your territory now. Let me see how you’ve been doing all these years!”","“After you!” Zhen Wuyang waved his hand.","A huge palace descended from the sky.","“Uncle, lead the army to support the king in the south. I’ll entertain our guests!”","“No problem, leave the rest to me!”","The Zhen Wu Marquis, Zhen Wuhou, continued via voice transmission. “If any senior is truly at the Eighth Tribulation realm...”","“Uncle, rest assured, I know what to do!” Zhen Wuyang understood what the other party wanted to say.","If Jian Wushuang was at the Eighth Tribulation realm, it would attract the Immortal Divine Temple.","If Jian Wushuang cooperated, it would be fine, but if not, it would involve them.","Seeing that the other party understood the situation, Zhen Wuhou didn’t say much more.","Thanks to Jian Wushuang’s intervention this time, he drove away the strongmen of the Southern Cloud Kingdom.","In this way, he could lead the army to support other battlefields and also relieve some pressure on the Zhen Wu Dynasty.","Zhen Wuyang glanced at the battlefield, then, accompanied by his guards, entered the palace.","The palace was a flying treasure of the universe.","Its speed was extremely fast.","It would only take a day to reach the capital of the Zhen Wu Dynasty.","After entering the main hall, Jian Wushuang invited the two to sit down casually.","Soon, Zhen Wuyang also walked in.","“Wushuang, thanks a lot this time!” Zhen Wuyang was very polite, even showing a bit of respect when looking at Jian Wushuang.","This was respect for a strong individual.","Jian Wushuang’s displayed strength had already reached the threshold of the Eighth Tribulation realm.","Even those who were familiar with him would show him a bit more respect.","Of course, except for people like Wu Li.","Moreover, it had been a long time since Zhen Wuyang had seen Jian Wushuang.","For Jian Wushuang, it had been over ten thousand years.","But for Zhen Wuyang, it had been countless epochs.","The time and space here were different from the outside world, even different from the Higher Heavens.","It was more like two extremes.","In the Higher Heavens, one day was almost equivalent to an epoch in the outside world.","But in the Great Sky Dome World, spending an epoch here was only a day in the outside world. They belonged to two extremes.","“No need to be so polite, I just dealt with it casually!” Jian Wushuang waved his hand. This kind of thing was too simple for him.","Zhen Wuyang personally brewed tea, poured it for the three of them, and then spoke again, “These years, I’ve actually looked for you many times. I even thought you had fallen!”","“To be honest, I haven’t looked for your whereabouts outside. I’ve been cultivating all along!” Jian Wushuang shook his head, adding, “The flow of time outside is much slower. In fact, it’s only been ten thousand years since we left Qishen Temple!”","“Ten thousand years!” Zhen Wuyang took a deep breath.","He wasn’t surprised by the speed of time flow.","He was shocked that Jian Wushuang, in just ten thousand years, had gone from an Emperor to a powerhouse comparable to someone at the Eighth Tribulation realm.","If this were said, probably no one would believe it.","Wu Li had been following Jian Wushuang all along and hadn’t felt any significant change in","his own strength within the past ten thousand years.","Although it was said to be ten thousand years, in reality, within a hundred years, earth- shattering changes had occurred.","Since encountering Danbao, their speed had increased exponentially.","Facing the Gula of the Frost Demon Clan back then, with just 1 million divine powers, they felt","unprecedented pressure.","But now, with a slight transformation, they could easily crush Gula.","Even if they were left to ponder on their own, they wouldn’t dare to imagine something this","grand.","Jian Wushuang noticed the curiosity in the other party’s eyes and took the opportunity to recount the events of the past ten thousand years.","There wasn’t much to hide because there was nothing worth concealing.","The matters concerning Babidi or the Wanliu Universe were now common knowledge.","Zhen Wuyang listened intently, captivated. He had thought his own world was vast enough, but he hadn’t expected the outside world to be even more thrilling.","For a moment, a hint of longing appeared in his eyes.","Jian Wushuang seized the moment. “Actually, this is just the beginning here. The vast expanse of the outside world is our true journey. As for the Qishen Temple, I am capable of dealing with it. Once I’m done with matters here, I’ll return to the Qishen Temple. How about","we go together?”","“Return?”","A glimmer flashed in Zhen Wuyang’s eyes as he shook his head slowly. “Jian Wushuang, to be honest, I’ve always felt like those past events were like a dream. If it weren’t for seeing you, I","might have taken everything as a dream!”","His determination puzzled Jian Wushuang.","“Is there something in the Zhen Wu Dynasty that you can’t let go of?”","He thought of the current predicament of the Zhen Wu Dynasty, which was due to the","imminent passing of the Zhen Wu Emperor.","In fact, this was simple for him; he could help Zhen Wuyang recover.","“There is!”","At this, Zhen Wuyang stood up abruptly.","They had already arrived at the capital of the Zhen Wu Dynasty.","Within the grand hall, they could see the entirety of the capital.","In the center of the royal city stood a statue of the Zhen Wu Emperor.","Seeing the statue, Jian Wushuang felt a shock in his heart.","“No wonder Zhen Wuyang feels like everything in the past was a dream. The Zhen Wu inheritance he received probably originated from this place!”","He pondered inwardly as the grand hall slowly descended into the ground.","“Let’s go, let’s visit my residence!”","After arriving at the capital, Zhen Wuyang seemed completely transformed, very amiable.","He no longer exuded the imperial majesty he had in the Great Si Region.","There was no sense of superiority.","Instead, he seemed like an extraordinarily ordinary person.","Jian Wushuang observed these changes.","Outside the mansion, there were no guards. As they approached the door, it opened silently.","Before entering the mansion, Jian Wushuang heard the sounds of children playing.","Zhen Wuyang heard the sounds too and glanced at Jian Wushuang, smiling faintly. “Those","must be my grandchildren!”","Grandchildren?","That made sense!","Zhen Wuyang had spent over countless eons in the Great Sky Dome World. It was likely that","his descendants had multiplied for countless generations.","But when he entered the mansion and saw the children, he froze.","The bloodline power of these children was extremely potent. Almost all of them possessed 70 percent of Zhen Wuyang’s bloodline.","This would have been impossible in the outside world or the Original Universe. Seeing Jian Wushuang’s surprised expression, Zhen Wuyang explained, “I was surprised at first too, but later I found out that it’s very difficult for the Universe Masters to have offspring again. However, once they do, the bloodline power becomes even stronger. These little ones, they’re born as Immortals, what we initially thought of as Yan Immortals!”"]},{"number":5937,"title":"Chapter 5937: Family!","paragraphs":["Chapter 5937: Family!","“Ah, I see!” Jian Wushuang listened intently, though he actually didn’t understand any of it.","He hadn’t expected Zhen Wuyang to settle down here.","As a cultivator, how could he comprehend worldly matters?","“Hey, little guy!”","A chubby child, carried by Zhen Wuyang, was affectionately pinched on the cheek.","Several other children with similar features followed behind.","A scene of familial bliss!","Jian Wushuang had no opinion on this because he couldn’t understand it.","Wu Li, on the other hand, was an expert in this regard and looked down upon it.","Because even the family he had built could be abandoned.","He had long been indifferent to familial bonds.","Zhen Wuyang was the same before.","He didn’t pay much attention to his sons and daughters, most of whom were given territories to govern.","Even his own sons dared not be presumptuous in his presence.","But now, he doted on his grandchildren so much.","“Father!”","Not far down the corridor, an elegant lady approached, bowing to Zhen Wuyang and quickly taking the child from his hands.","“These are father’s good friends. Why don’t you greet them?” The noblewoman raised her eyebrows and, turning to Jian Wushuang and the others, also bowed.","Jian Wushuang nudged the dazed Wu Li and, smiling at the woman in front of him, asked, “And who might you be?”","“Forgive my forgetfulness. This is my eldest daughter!” Zhen Wuyang smiled proudly.","This princess didn’t resemble Zhen Wuyang’s other children in the Great Si Region at all.","But her veins carried the purest blood of Zhen Wuyang, and even her child had a quarter of Zhen Wuyang’s blood.","“Oh, right. Let Mu’er come to the Xuanwu Hall. Tell him there are guests!” Zhen Wuyang casually ordered before leading Jian Wushuang and the others into the inner room.","Entering the Xuanwu Hall, they found it wasn’t a grand hall but more like a study.","It was cleverly arranged and cozy.","Books and scrolls were placed nearby, and everyone took their seats.","“Ah!” Jian Wushuang exhaled deeply, feeling impressed. “No wonder you don’t want to leave. I might even want to stay here!”","At this moment, Wu Li interjected, “Wushuang, with your control over the power of Life, you don’t need women. You can create life on your own. There’s nothing special about that.”","“The power of Life!” Zhen Wuyang finally remembered that Jian Wushuang had control over the power of Life.","He hadn’t thought much of it before, but now, after coming here, he understood how crazy it was to face the power of Life during the Tribulation.","According to common sense, the Great Universe shouldn’t lack the power of Life.","But at some point, the power of Life generated here became scarcer.","Because the power of Life in the Sky Dome came from the Higher Heavens, many people thought there was a problem with the Higher Heavens.","But there was no way to verify it.","“The power of Life shouldn’t be used recklessly!” Danbao shook his head, denying Wu Li’s words.","Seeing this, Wu Li kept quiet.","Even his own father treated Danbao with great respect, so he didn’t dare to cause trouble.","It wasn’t like before when he would casually reach out and touch someone’s head.","“Tell us about the ancestor of your Zhen Wu Dynasty!”","Zhen Wuyang’s expression changed slightly at this, sighing, “Greedy!”","“In fact, the ancestor had quite a bit of vitality initially, but because of greed, when he entered the Universal Sea, his vitality rapidly diminished!”","The Universal Sea?","Jian Wushuang nodded slightly.","At present, he had gained some understanding of the Sky Dome from Zhen Wuyang.","The Sky Dome was below, and the Higher Heavens were above.","In between them lay the Universal Sea.","It was fraught with danger but also contained countless treasures.","Among them were mysterious treasures that had disappeared from the outside world.","As well as fruits imbued with divine power.","Some treasures were enough to make even those at the Eighth Tribulation realm covetous.","It was normal for Zhen Wuyyang to be injured and lose vitality due to his adventures.","“Sigh, all because of a treasure!” Zhen Wuyang shook his head.","In fact, such things were quite normal.","Jian Wushuang and the others were also pushing themselves to the limit.","Those who ventured out would eventually meet their downfall.","It was impossible to always be so lucky.","Jian Wushuang had absolute experience in this regard, almost dancing on the edge of a knife","every time.","There were very few instances of having absolute certainty of good fortune.","“I can help you with this matter!” Zhen Wuyang had been silent all along, hesitating.","He was worried about owing Jian Wushuang too much, fearing that he would have to leave","here eventually.","So Jian Wushuang just brought it up directly.","As for whether to return or not, he didn’t insist.","Although he had made a promise with Zhen Ling at the beginning, what Zhen Ling cared about was resolving the threat of Qishen Temple and restoring it to its peak.","Jian Wushuang was confident in helping Zhen Ling achieve this.","So there was no need to drag Zhen Wuyang back with him.","Weren’t there other people?","Moreover, he had dealt with Mie Sheng and the Temple of World Annihilation, leading Qishen","Temple to greater heights.","Zhen Ling wouldn’t care about Zhen Wuyang.","Zhen Wuyang himself felt somewhat embarrassed.","When he entered here, it was Zhen Ling who helped him.","He was able to reach the peak solely because of the opportunities within Qishen Temple.","Now that he was not going back, Jian Wushuang was still helping him like this.","People with self-respect would feel uneasy.","“You don’t need to think too much about it; this is between us!”","“Well then, thank you very much!” Zhen Wuyang’s body trembled slightly, and there was a","gleam in his eyes.","Once Zhen Wuyang regained vitality, the forces attacking Zhen Wu Dynasty would also","retreat.","Everything would be resolved effortlessly.","“However, there’s something I don’t quite understand. Why would you still rely so much on","worldly matters after reaching this level?”","Jian Wushuang voiced his doubts from the bottom of his heart.","Although the previous events were indeed moving, he couldn’t believe that Zhen Wuyang","hadn’t experienced similar things when he was weak.","Although what Wu Li said was somewhat unpleasant to hear, it made sense.","How could they still be obsessed with such matters at their level?","Zhen Wuyang took a deep breath, about to speak, when he sensed a familiar aura approaching","from outside the hall.","Outside the Xuanwu Hall.","A young man who bore a striking resemblance to Zhen Wuyang, with a majestic aura and a","resolute face.","He was Zhen Wuyang’s son, who had only been born for a few epochs but had already reached","the realm of Universe Master at the Third Tribulation level, possessing extremely formidable","strength.","Although he was only a Third Tribulation Universe Master, he had 500,000 units of divine","power.","He could battle across levels.","In the Zhen Wu Dynasty, he was the most outstanding genius among the younger generation.","At this moment, he walked up to the front of the hall, took a deep breath, and entered.","He had heard that this time, his father had summoned a super existence to resist the Southern","Cloud Kingdom and repelled their army.","Now, they were hosting a banquet.","It must be that super existence.","With a curious heart, he entered the grand hall.","At a glance, he saw Jian Wushuang, but he didn’t sense any aura from him, giving the impression of an ordinary person."]},{"number":5938,"title":"Chapter 5938: I Want to Leave Something Behind","paragraphs":["Chapter 5938: I Want to Leave Something Behind","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“Jian Wushuang, let me introduce you. This is my son, Zhen Wuliang. He’s now also a Universe Master at the Third Tribulation realm!” Zhen Wuyang’s eyes gleamed with pride as he saw his son enter.","“Respects to all Seniors!” Zhen Wuliang bowed respectfully.","Jian Wushuang nodded in admiration, saying, “Indeed remarkable. At such a young age, becoming a Universe Master. Your future achievements may surpass even yours!”","Considering the time he had spent cultivating wasn’t long.","“Alright, let’s head to the back hall. I’ve already arranged for a banquet!”","“No trouble at all!”","Jian Wushuang politely responded, then, accompanied by Danbao and Wu Li, followed Zhen Wuyang into the back hall.","At the banquet, Zhen Wuyang’s daughter and wife were also present.","Seeing Zhen Wuyang’s wife, Jian Wushuang understood why Zhen Wuyang cherished his family at this moment so much.","She looked exactly like the woman from his days in the Grand Si Region.","Perhaps it was fate!","During the banquet, they discussed many things, mostly related to the affairs of the Great Sky Dome World.","Jian Wushuang also took the opportunity to inquire about matters regarding the Higher Heavens from Zhen Wuyang.","Even with the power of his bloodline, Danbao couldn’t sense Elder Blu’s whereabouts.","It was likely that the Elder and others had reached the Higher Heavens.","They had unexpectedly entered the Great Sky Dome World.","The most important thing now was to help Danbao become the God of Life.","For Zhen Wuyang, this was just a minor episode.","Since the other party was unwilling to leave, Jian Wushuang saw no need to continue persuading.","After the banquet ended, it was already late at night.","At this time, the high-level experts of the dynasty also arrived at Zhen Wuyang’s mansion.","Their purpose was simple, to understand more about Jian Wushuang.","Taking advantage of this opportunity, Zhen Wuyang took Jian Wushuang to the palace.","There, they met the Emperor Zhen Wu.","Originally, they intended for Danbao to act, but Danbao’s foundation was damaged, rendering him unable to even use the Shield of Life.","Thus, Zhen Wuyang had to personally intervene to help the Emperor Zhen Wu regain vitality.","However, it didn’t require much Life power.","The Emperor was only at the Half-Step Eighth Tribulation realm.","Even for a Universe Master at the Eighth Tribulation realm, it posed no challenge to Jian Wushuang.","The Emperor Zhen Wu’s vitality was restored to its peak.","It also meant that the influence of the Zhen Wu Dynasty had been consolidated.","The forces attacking from all directions, upon learning that Emperor Zhen Wu had regained vitality, were shocked and curious, but dared not attack recklessly anymore.","These were all unspoken rules. As long as there was a Half-Step Eighth Tribulation Realm existence, all forces understood that continuing the fight would be detrimental to everyone.","They quickly withdrew their troops.","At the same time, they speculated whether it was related to the mysterious strongman who defeated the Southern Cloud Kingdom’s army!","After all, right after defeating the Southern Cloud Kingdom’s army, Emperor Zhen Wu regained vitality.","The intricacies of this were known only to those involved.","Having helped Zhen Wuyang fulfill his greatest wish.","Regardless of Zhen Wuyang’s feelings, Jian Wushuang had done his utmost.","Declining Emperor Zhen Wu’s banquet, Jian Wushuang, accompanied by Danbao and Wu Li, prepared to leave directly.","At the city gate.","Jian Wushuang asked Zhen Wuyang’s thoughts for the last time.","“Aren’t you going to leave?”","“Not leaving!”","Zhen Wuyang shook his head, his complexion much better than before.","He turned to Jian Wushuang and said firmly, “Actually, at my stage, I already understand fate. Perhaps this life is all there is. Even if I venture out again, it would only hold you back!”","“How could that be!” Jian Wushuang spread his hands and said, “At least, you’ve already become a Universe Master at the Fifth Tribulation realm!”","“That’s nothing. In the vast sea of beings, the Fifth Tribulation realm is merely a shooting star. At our level, if there’s no room for improvement, what matters most is what we leave behind. I don’t want to look back at this life and find nothing to be proud of when I pass away!”","Jian Wushuang sighed, “Perhaps you’re right!”","Both fell into silence simultaneously.","Zhen Wuyang was right!","Back then, when Qishen reached the Half-Step Eighth Tribulation Realm, he had left behind Qishen Temple and even cooperated with Mie Sheng, all to leave a glimmer of hope.","Now, Zhen Wuyang was doing the same.","It’s just that what they left behind was different.","“I’m leaving!”","Jian Wushuang regained his composure, his figure slowly ascending. He looked down at Zhen Wuyang for the last time, his tone indifferent, “Take care!”","“You too!”","With their final farewell.","Jian Wushuang and his two companions soared into the air, leaving the capital of the Zhen Wu Dynasty in an instant. After flying a distance, they tore through the space and left the Zhen Wu Dynasty.","Feeling the disappearance of their presence, Zhen Wuyang stood on the city wall, not turning around for a long time. His gaze was somewhat murky, only leaving","when he could no longer sense Jian Wushuang’s aura.","Of course, that was just temporary.","Following Jian Wushuang might ignite temporary passion, but alas, such acts are only for the young.","Higher Heavens!","In the icy world surrounded by auroras, the sky was cold and the ground frozen.","It was utterly different from what those cultivators from outside had imagined.","Realm King’s words were spot on.","In the current universe of Wanliu, the Origin Source had already been damaged.","The spaces they initially entered were the true appearance of Wanliu Universe.","Lush with foliage, verdant with life.","But now, it was desolate and silent.","Not a soul in sight.","Whoosh!","Above the Higher Heavens, a thunderous vortex quietly emerged.","Dozens of figures swiftly dashed out from within.","“It’s bad, the entire heavens are in the same state, seems even more serious than what Lord Realm King described!”","The Great Monk furrowed his brows, speaking coldly, “Forget about that, finding the young master is crucial. Since he’s not in the Higher Heavens, he must be in the Great","Sky Dome World below!”","“The Great Sky Dome World?”","“How do we get in?”","Although Lord Hengmu was a native of Wanliu Universe, he had only lived in the Higher Heavens. Apart from hearing about the Great Sky Dome World below, he had never been there.","“It’s simple, we head to the Universe Sea. After all, the Stairway to Godhood is in the Universe Sea, we’ll have to go there sooner or later!”","Divine Wood King and the others could only stare blankly, completely unfamiliar with this place.","“Alright, then lead the way!”","The group quickly made a decision, with the Great Monk leading the way towards the Universe Sea.","The Universe Sea was actually the sea of the Origin Source of Life.","It was also the buffer between the Higher Heavens and the Great Sky Dome World.","All the treasures of Wanliu Universe flowed out from there.","It was also the core of Wanliu Universe.","The land of the Origin Source.","Most likely, the metallic life form that Realm King spoke of was there!","They had to deal with this trouble before they could help Danbao ascend the Stairway to Godhood.","Divine Wood King and the others set off towards the Universe Sea.","Jian Wushuang was doing the same.","With Danbao and Wu Li, he left the Zhen Wu Dynasty, swiftly advancing towards the entrance of the","Universe Sea.","The original plan was to directly ascend the Stairway to Godhood.","But Realm King’s appearance disrupted the plan.","They had to deal with the trouble of metallic life form.","Naturally, they had to make the most of their time."]},{"number":5939,"title":"Chapter 5939 Entrance to Universe Sea","paragraphs":["Chapter 5939 Entrance to Universe Sea","“Wushuang, is the entrance to the Universe Sea really as those old folks described?” Wu Li’s tone carried a hint of skepticism.","When they were helping Emperor Zhen Wu recover, they learned about the entrance to the Universe Sea and how it formed from the Emperor himself.","Jian Wushuang took the opportunity to inquire about the Higher Heavens, but the Emperor didn’t seem to know much about it either.","The highest authority in the Great Sky Dome World was still the Immortal Temple.","Perhaps the Emperor knew, but he didn’t recognize a particular person, so there was no way to ask further.","They decided to let it go.","The meeting with Great Monk and the others might not require their concern after all.","Both Great Monk and Lord Hengmu were natives of the Wanliu Universe and practitioners of the Higher Heavens.","They must know something.","The strong individuals of the Sky Dome World could all enter the Universe Sea, let alone the Higher Heavens.","If necessary, they could forcibly enter the Universe Sea by shattering the spacetime tunnel.","The entrance to the Universe Sea in the Sky Dome World appeared because two super beings accidentally opened it during their battle.","So Wu Li was somewhat skeptical.","He felt that Emperor Zhen Wu might be exaggerating.","After they arrived in this world, they had long since understood the spacetime intensity here.","It was definitely not the Origin Source Universe of ordinary practitioners.","Even in the Ancient Moon Spacetime, they could easily break through the Origin Source Universe of a peak Eighth Tribulation Universe Master.","Of course, it was only breaking through spacetime, and only creating a small opening.","Complete destruction was impossible.","Even an Eighth Tribulation Universe Master couldn’t destroy it even if they let them attack freely.","That’s the power of an Eighth Tribulation Universe Master.","The key was, they wouldn’t just let you attack.","It’s likely they’d suppress you with their will as soon as they appeared.","What they encountered now were just Scattered Tribulations.","Maybe they thought an Eighth Tribulation realm was nothing special.","It’s well known that Scattered Tribulations and Universe Masters are two different concepts.","Now Jian Wushuang’s divine power could erupt twice as strong, coupled with the Starry Sky Sword Dao, he could defeat ordinary Eighth Tribulation realms, or even contend with the top-tier Eighth Tribulation realm experts.","But when encountering Universe Masters of the Eighth Tribulation realm, their divine power was inexhaustible, coupled with their Origin Source Dao Arena, even the weakest Eighth Tribulation Universe Master had tens of millions of divine power.","Suppressing Jian Wushuang would be as easy as lifting a hand.","Their personal strength did not represent the spatial strength of the Origin Source Universe.","Regardless, it was still at the level of the universe.","It was not comparable to the Spacetime Origin Source of the River of Time.","Jian Wushuang remembered Zhen Ling from before.","With Zhen Ling’s strength, they were able to open the tunnel connecting to the Ancient Moon Spacetime back then, even though Realm King secretly intervened.","It was quite challenging.","With the power of a peak Half-Step Seven Tribulation realm at best, coupled with the Qishen Temple itself, possessing the strength of Seventh Tribulations realm was already commendable.","Even with such strength, one could open a spacetime tunnel.","However, in the Wanliu Universe, Jian Wushuang’s strength was undoubtedly much stronger than Zhen Ling of the past.","Yet, it couldn’t even shake the spacetime of the Wanliu Universe.","The Wanliu Universe!","The spatial structure it formed.","It was even more formidable than the spacetime river outside.","Wu Li and the others were unaware of this.","But he knew that the Wanliu Divine Tree was brought over by Weiss, even Realm King didn’t have the qualifications to manipulate it.","It must be much stronger than spacetime.","Within this universe, wanting to create an entrance to the Universe Sea through battle was indeed strange.","Unless there had been a Ninth Tribulation realm within the Wanliu Divine Tree!","If there had really been a Ninth Tribulation realm, the Great Monk would have known.","But he had never mentioned it.","Jian Wushuang pondered for a moment and said helplessly, “Don’t worry about it too much. We’re not here to study the Wanliu Universe. Let’s enter the Universe Sea first. There may be countless treasures there. With some luck, we might even hit the jackpot!”","“Great minds think alike!” Wu Li licked his lips.","They were all ordinary people, inevitably fascinated by treasures.","With Danbao about to ascend to godhood, they naturally looked down on these treasures.","By helping Danbao ascend to godhood, they would be able to obtain a large number of treasures.","Although the danger level of entering the Wanliu Universe this time was much higher, the probability of obtaining treasures was almost a certainty.","And there was the promise of Realm King.","Now, everyone was eagerly anticipating it.","While they were envisioning their future, at the peak of the Sky Dome World, there floated a grand hall that had remained motionless for countless ages.","It was observing every move of Jian Wushuang and the others.","Inside the gloomy hall, upon sensing that Jian Wushuang and the others’ goal was the Universe Sea, an ancient sigh echoed.","“Two at the Sixth Tribulation realm, one unfathomable. None of them are native powerhouses of the Sky Dome World!”","Buzz!","After the voice inside the grand hall sounded, thrones rose from the ground, each with towering figures sitting atop them.","Three grand thrones were at the topmost level.","Click.","A crisp sound pierced the air, and three pairs of eyes snapped open!","They all turned to the person who spoke.","“Chaoge, are you the one guarding the Undying Temple this time?”","“My lord!”","The young figure, now known as Chaoge, emerged from the shadows and bowed slightly to the three thrones.","These were the three divine spirits of the Immortal Divine Temple.","They were also the superbeings who originally founded the Immortal Divine Temple.","Chaoge was merely an executor of this generation’s Immortal Divine Temple.","Encountering an anomaly, he summoned the three ancient divine spirits.","And he disclosed what he had been monitoring.","The three divine spirits sat atop their thrones, unmoving.","After hearing Chaoge’s report, they became somewhat uneasy.","“Sixth Tribulation realm, surpassing the pinnacle of the Seventh Tribulation realm?”","“Yes, and there’s another Sixth Tribulation realm who hasn’t made a move yet, but their divine power exceeds 1.5 million!”","Chaoge recounted one by one.","To him, the most mysterious was the green-skinned youth that even the Immortal Divine Temple couldn’t fathom.","Danbao!","After deliberating for a while, the three divine spirits spoke, “Since they’re not from the Sky Dome World, they probably came from the Higher Heavens. It’s perfect timing to capture them and inquire about some matters from the Higher Heavens. Don’t let them enter the Universe Sea. You shall handle this personally!”","“Yes!” Chaoge accepted the command.","For years, the life springs of the Sky Dome World had dried up.","They had been considering how to ascend to the Higher Heavens.","Encountering three practitioners who seemed to have come from the Higher Heavens naturally meant they had to capture and interrogate them.","A Sixth Tribulation realm rivaling the strength of the Eighth Tribulation realm.","This was the first time they had encountered such a situation.","And there was one whom even the Immortal Divine Temple couldn’t monitor, obviously extraordinary.","Either it was a being beyond their understanding or they possessed some kind of treasure.","If it was an existence beyond their understanding, all the better, they could seek advice instead of simply capturing them.","So when Chaoge went forth this time, he had to be careful.","First, ascertain the opponent’s details, then take action.","These matters didn’t require instructions from the three divine spirits.","He could figure them out himself.","Summoning ten slumbering Eighth Tribulation realm divine spirit envoys from the temple, Chaoge set off in the direction of Jian Wushuang and the others.","Immortal Divine Temple.","Established by the three divine spirits."]},{"number":5940,"title":"Chapter 5940: Universe Supertravel","paragraphs":["Chapter 5940: Universe Supertravel","In every era, there emerges a Universe Master of the Eighth Tribulation realm who leads the way.","In this era, it is Chaoge who commands the Immortal Divine Temple.","Moreover, as long as one enters the Immortal Divine Temple at the Eighth Tribulation realm, they will never fall.","The origin of the Immortal Divine Temple is also due to this.","Eternal existence.","Divine power is immortal.","This is closely related to a source within the Immortal Divine Temple.","Within it, the power of Life continuously births. As long as one slumbers within the Immortal Divine Temple, not only will they not lose vitality, but they will also gradually regain it. Unfortunately, it’s unclear when the source of the Immortal Divine Temple began to wither. Although a considerable amount of Life force was stored initially, it proved insufficient.","So, strong individuals were dispatched to the Universe Sea to seek Life treasures to invest in the Immortal Divine Temple.","It’s akin to planting trees for future generations to enjoy the shade.","All preparations are made for the future.","The Eighth Tribulation Universe Masters of today venture into the Universe Sea, and the life force they harvest is all freely given to the Immortal Divine Temple.","When they fail their tribulation, they can then settle in the Immortal Divine Temple.","Chaoge summoned the ten great divine spirit envoys.","They are all Eighth Tribulation Universe Masters who failed their tribulations in the past. Without a universe now, they are essentially no different from the Scattered Tribulation strong individuals in the outside world.","It’s just that the Eighth Tribulation strong individuals from the outside world, by the time they reach their age, are highly likely to have perished.","The birth of the Wanliu Universe is many times older than the Ancient Moon Spacetime.","The divine spirit envoys summoned are all Eighth Tribulation strong individuals from countless eras ago.","The departure of these strong individuals is very secretive.","It wasn’t until they approached Jian Wushuang and the others that they were noticed.","“Someone’s behind us!”","The first to notice was Danbao.","His sensitivity to life is even stronger than Jian Wushuang’s.","He was the first to discover the strong individuals from the Immortal Divine Temple behind them.","Jian Wushuang and the others have just arrived above the ocean of stars where the Universe Sea is located.","There is still an hour’s journey to the entrance.","It has been several days since they left the Zhen Wu Dynasty.","Unexpectedly, just before entering the Universe Sea, they were being targeted.","The first thing that came to mind was the Immortal Divine Temple.","Apart from this organization, Jian Wushuang couldn’t think of anyone else.","Only they would have the audacity to pursue them.","“Don’t panic, they can’t catch up!”","Jian Wushuang’s brow furrowed. He had already kept some tricks up his sleeve and hadn’t used full speed, fearing they would be targeted.","With precaution taken early on, how could he not keep something in reserve?","Splash!","With the candle dragon feathers fully spread, a majestic universe descended from the sky.","“Universe Supertravel!”","All things gathered and descended.","Jian Wushuang’s Origin Source Universe arrived.","100,000 black holes connected into stars, guarding the cosmic spacetime in all directions.","This scene startled Chaoge, who was chasing from behind.","“Universe Dao Arena!”","“Is he the Universe Master of the Eight Tribulations realm?”","And he could even detect them.","That was the most terrifying part.","At this moment, they were still far from Jian Wushuang.","They could only see the outline of Jian Wushuang’s Origin Source Universe.","Before they could get a clear view, the universe disappeared the next moment.","Only ripples were left behind.","Shuttling through the universe was not as simple as it sounded.","Jian Wushuang was traversing with his own universe, each time it was the distance of his own","Origin Source Universe.","His speed was unparalleled.","Much faster than the previous Three Quake Universe.","To put it bluntly, whereas before Jian Wushuang’s Candle Dragon Wings had to fly three times, now one trip was the distance of a universe.","Moreover, his universe was much larger than that of the Universe Masters of the Eight Tribulation realm.","It was like his speed had tripled.","The speed of the spacetime hall that Chaoge was riding in could have caught up with Jian Wushuang originally, and it could even conceal their aura, but unexpectedly, they were","suddenly discovered.","Now, whether to chase or not was a dilemma.","“Their target is the Universe Sea. Notify lord divine spirit!”","Chaoge gritted his teeth. They had planned everything, but before they could even show up, they were shaken off.","They could only inform the three major divine spirits.","Only the three major divine spirits could stop Jian Wushuang from entering the Universe Sea.","Once Jian Wushuang entered the Universe Sea, even if the divine spirits came, they wouldn’t","be able to find him.","The Universe Sea was vast, with countless celestial worlds.","There, it was boundless.","No end in sight.","The space was infinitely vast, and the time of the Universe Sea’s existence was immeasurable.","Because there was no trace of time.","The Immortal Divine Temple.","The temple that had remained motionless for billions of years began to tremble at this","moment.","“Let’s go in person!”","The three divine spirits felt somewhat helpless.","When the source of Life was not cut off, they could manipulate the Immortal Divine Temple","as they pleased.","But not anymore.","Because the power used by the Immortal Divine Temple was the power of Life.","Every activation consumed a great cost.","They used to not care, but now that they were living more carefully, they didn’t dare to waste","anymore.","But now, in order to investigate the matter of the cut-off Life source, facing three mysterious practitioners with questionable backgrounds and peculiar strengths, they had no choice.","The initial investigation by the Immortal Divine Temple only revealed a cultivation level of the Sixth Tribulation realm.","However, now it could host its own Universe Dao Arena, a feat achievable only by a Universe Master of the Eighth Tribulation realm.","Moreover, the scale of this universe was immense, far surpassing the expectations for an","Eighth Tribulation realm existence.","The three divine spirits observing from the Immortal Divine Temple all took note of Danbao. Unable to discern the truth, they attributed these occurrences to Danbao.","“Tsk tsk, since they flee upon facing us, there’s nothing to fear. Let’s intercept them at the","entrance to the Universe Sea!”","“Let’s go!” The three great divine spirits collectively manipulated the Immortal Divine Temple.","In the blink of an eye, they arrived above a certain area of the sea.","Below stretched an endless expanse of azure ocean, while above loomed a colossal black hole filled with countless vortices, seemingly capable of devouring everything—the entrance to the Universe Sea, accidentally ruptured by two superexistences in the past.","The origin of the Immortal Divine Temple traced back to this event.","The emergence of the Universe Sea had further empowered cultivators in the Great Sky Dome","World.","From the Universe Sea, the three divine spirits obtained the Immortal Divine Temple and its","Life force.","With the Life force within the temple, they came to dominate the entire Sky Dome World.","Although there were some special beings exempt from Tribulation, they were different from","those outside.","External special beings could enhance their divine power with divine artifacts, whereas these beings required life force to boost their divine power.","This fact was almost common knowledge, to the extent that even Zhen Wuyang had forgotten","to inform Jian Wushuang about it.","If Jian Wushuang had known, it would have been a profound shock!","When life force could be consumed to transform into boundless divine power, certain matters","began to make sense.","Those who relied on devouring Life force to enhance their divine power could only be","associated with Mie Sheng.","These special beings, however, were birthed from the Wanliu Universe, which made them all","the more terrifying.","Their schemes ran deep.","The Immortal Divine Temple hovered above the sea, awaiting Jian Wushuang’s arrival, while the three divine spirits stood on the temple’s white stone slab."]},{"number":5941,"title":"Chapter 5941: Three Great Divine Spirits","paragraphs":["Chapter 5941: Three Great Divine Spirits","The entire Immortal Divine Temple didn’t boast many palaces.","Instead, the surrounding area was covered with flat white stone slabs.","“They’re here, remarkably fast!” Three divine spirits looked out together.","In the distance, a massive oval-shaped universe continuously flickered, each time shifting the distance of an entire universe.","Jian Wushuang vibrated the Candle Dragon Wings incessantly, relying on spatial shifting, about to reach the entrance of the Universe Sea.","But then, they halted.","Wu Li’s expression turned puzzled as he asked, “Why did we stop?”","“Someone’s there!”","Before Jian Wushuang could speak, Danbao voiced the reason.","This time, Jian Wushuang also sensed it.","Actually, those with sharper eyes could see it.","Within his own universe, he wore the Life Tribulation Armor and had executed the Super Eternal Ancient Transformation.","Now, his divine power had reached a terrifying 6 million.","His eyes almost pierced through everything.","Naturally, he could see a circular temple floating above the sea.","A spherical object, seemingly split into two pieces.","That was the temple he saw.","“Danbao, can you tell how many strong individuals are above?”","“Many!” Danbao’s response was concise.","But Jian Wushuang wasn’t calm anymore.","Many?","Then it’s troublesome.","“How did these guys find us?” Jian Wushuang wondered inwardly, now with no way out, the path blocked.","The only way to enter the Universe Sea was through this route.","Now that it’s blocked, they could only face it.","He refused to believe that these people came to kill him.","“If we can’t avoid it, let’s go and see!”","“The atmosphere on that main hall doesn’t seem hostile; they probably won’t harm us!” Danbao added, “But I can sense that the origin within that temple is related to Life!”","“The Treasure of Life?” Jian Wushuang frowned.","His Tribulation Armor was also related to Life; he just felt a faint resonance earlier, but didn’t pay much attention.","Now, Danbao mentioning the Life Origin Source within that temple confirmed his earlier perception.","Indeed, it was a special Treasure of Life.","The Wanliu Universe was truly extraordinary.","With such treasures, there would likely be a rush from the entire North Spacetime to seize them if they were brought to the outside world.","No wonder people from the outside were eager to get in.","The treasures here couldn’t be underestimated by ordinary standards.","Jian Wushuang felt a pang of envy as he looked around.","Although his Tribulation Armor resonated somewhat with the temple, it was like trash compared to it.","There was simply no comparison.","Nevertheless, for safety’s sake, he still took the Tribulation Armor and returned to his usual state, allowing the Origin Source Universe to slowly dissipate.","Relying solely on the Candle Dragon Wings, he quickly approached the temple.","The fact that the other party could wait for them so calmly meant they were absolutely confident.","There was no chance in directly confronting them.","It was better to face them honestly.","If they were really intent on harming them, there would be time to strike later.","If, by chance, the other party hadn’t intended any harm towards them but were provoked into action, it would only lead to trouble.","Being cautious was enough.","If they really had to act, they could instantly rise to their peak.","Swish!","The figures of the three arrived at the edge of the temple and came to a slow stop.","They were three, and so were the ones across from them.","Boom!","Just as they steadied their forms, thunder rolled across the sky, lightning connecting into","lines, surrounding the area and making the space tremble.","Then a group of people appeared faintly amidst the lightning.","It was Chaoge and the others.","Jian Wushuang’s eyelids twitched, he glanced over, then paid them no further attention.","He could easily tell that these people were in league with those on the temple. “Seniors, may I ask why you intercepted us? What’s the matter?” Jian Wushuang asked directly, without beating around the bush.","He could see that the other party didn’t harbor any intent to kill.","Here’s the translation:","They probably just wanted to figure out their identities.","They might as well come clean.","Given the current situation, even if he had many cards up his sleeve, there was no chance of","turning the tables.","Moreover, Danbao’s Shield of Life had not yet recovered.","They couldn’t afford a direct confrontation!","“Where are you from?” Jian Wushuang asked.","“And where do you want to go!?” the three divine spirits sitting above the temple throne","asked with imposing airs.","“We come from above, heading to the Universe Sea!” Jian Wushuang pointed upwards,","making his intentions clear.","These were the strong ones of the Great Sky Dome World.","He couldn’t tell them he came from the outside world!","If he did, they probably wouldn’t believe him. It’s better to say they came from above.","“Why are you here?” the divine spirit sitting on the left squinted at Jian Wushuang.","“We came unintentionally!”","They didn’t intend to come here!","They just wanted to go to the Higher Heavens.","Or rather, they followed the Great Monk.","Only the other party knew where the Stairway to Godhood was.","“Unintentionally?”","The three divine spirits were momentarily stunned, but they could tell Jian Wushuang was not","lying.","At their level, trying to deceive them was futile.","They could spot the flaws before the words even left one’s mouth.","As Chaoge slowly descended towards the temple, he said, “Your Excellencies, some people","related to this person on behalf of Emperor Zhen Wu have been restrained.”","They were prepared on both sides.","The things Jian Wushuang did in the Zhenwu Dynasty had long been under the surveillance of the Immortal Divine Temple. If they wanted to investigate Jian Wushuang’s background, they naturally made full preparations.","“I’ve said it; we just came unintentionally. It’s useless for you to catch them!” Jian Wushuang","was a bit anxious.","It wasn’t as simple as catching Zhen Wuyang and Emperor Zhen Wu for the Immortal Divine Temple, but rather, he sensed their intentions.","By helping Emperor Zhen Wu recover, he exposed the power of Life.","Originally, he thought that the power of Life was not rare in the Wanliu Universe.","But now it seems different from what he thought.","The power of Life was precious everywhere.","Although it was easy to obtain the power of Life in the Great Sky Dome World, the","consumption was also considerable!","No one knew how many Eighth Tribulation experts were sleeping in the Immortal Divine Temple, and all of them needed the power of Life to sustain them.","The power of Life not only maintained the vitality of the Scattered Tribulation realm but was also a necessity for Special Life Forms to enhance divine power.","Speaking of which, the uses of the power of Life were even more numerous than in the outside","world.","Jian Wushuang feared this the most.","If they set their sights on their power of life, it would mean a fight to the death.","Wu Li couldn’t help but speak up, “Just say what you want to say directly, don’t beat around","the bush!”","He wasn’t afraid.","Because the Great Monk was even more desolate than these people and must be approaching","them.","With help, there was nothing to fear.","“Arrogant!”","Chaoge looked at Wu Li daring to speak disrespectfully to the immortal divine spirits and was","about to take action.","“Do not be rude!”","Just as Chaoge was about to act, he stopped and stood obediently to the side.","The three divine spirits each pondered for a moment and had already made plans in private.","Restrain them!","Since they knew they came from above, they had to ask about things from above.","“Now that the three guests have arrived, please stay!”"]},{"number":5942,"title":"Chapter 5942: Stay","paragraphs":["Chapter 5942: Stay","The withered old man sitting in the middle slowly raised his hand and pointed a finger, instantly freezing the space.","Jian Wushuang widened his eyes, unable to believe it.","Just now, there was no divine power fluctuation in that move, yet it could freeze the space.","Definitely stronger than the Great Monk and Divine Wood King.","He couldn’t even resist.","“It’s over!”","This time, he really messed up big time.","Encountering such a powerful individual, he didn’t even have hope of escaping.","It would have been better to try to escape, at least he could have maneuvered a bit.","But now, there was no way to escape.","Luckily, the other party didn’t have any killing intent, just wanted to keep them. “Don’t resist!”","Jian Wushuang shook his head at Wu Li and Danbao.","At the same time, he was thinking of a strategy.","How to get away.","With the opponent’s strength, even if the Great Monk and Divine Wood King found them, it wouldn’t matter.","They wouldn’t be able to rescue them at all.","Unless Chi Jiuxiao descended, only then could they fight.","But the key was that Chi Jiuxiao and them were not on the same side.","They could only think of another strategy.","“You don’t need to worry!” The withered old man waved his hand and directly sent Jian Wushuang and the others into the Immortal Divine Temple.","“We just want to know some things about the Higher Heavens. If you cooperate well, I guarantee you’ll be fine!”","Jian Wushuang sighed, “Senior, whatever you want to know, just ask, I’ll answer truthfully. But we really have urgent matters to attend to!”","This time, he almost begged.","If they were really detained.","Who knew when they could leave.","Although he had time, it wasn’t meant to be wasted like this!","“Let me introduce myself, my name is Jiang Wuyan, one of the founders of the Immortal Divine Temple. I can also assure you that as long as you cooperate, everything will be fine!”","Jian Wushuang was anxious!","They were anxious too!","The matter of the Source of Life was crucial to their life and death.","Jian Wushuang took a deep breath, his expression becoming more serious, and then asked, “Senior Jiang, what do you want to ask, just say it!”","“Good!” Jiang Wuyan, with his skinny claws, scratched his beard and said all the prepared words.","Mainly asking about the Higher Heavens, whether there had been any changes.","Instead of asking how Jian Wushuang came here, because they could see that Jian Wushuang and his group had secrets, and they wouldn’t really say them.","It’s better to ask about their own interests.","“The Higher Heavens!”","Jian Wushuang pretended to be relaxed but was more panicked than anyone.","How would he know what the Higher Heavens looked like!?","But seeing the other’s appearance, he probably didn’t know much about the Higher Heavens either.","So he simply started fabricating a vast and ancient world of the Higher Heavens.","And then led to that incident.","“The incident!”","Of course, it was the corrosion of the Metal Life Form on the Divine Tree of Wanliu.","This wasn’t much of a secret, even if he said it, it wouldn’t matter.","These powerhouses within the Wanliu Universe couldn’t possibly have any dealings with metallic lifeforms!","The three divine spirits were greatly alarmed upon hearing about the invasion of metallic lifeforms.","They promptly sealed off the spacetime, retreating into the depths of the temple.","“Could these metallic lifeforms have any connection to the pyramid we saw?” “Impossible!” Jiang Wuyao retorted, “That pyramid is merely a treasure, how could it be a lifeform?”","“But the lad said it’s metallic life, not conventional life. It seems more like a Special Life Form. It’s highly probable that it’s related to the pyramid. I’ve long suspected a disruption in the source, possibly linked to that pyramid!”","The dwindling Life source within the Immortal Divine Temple had been a matter of speculation, but lacking evidence, they had dismissed it.","During its prime, the Immortal Divine Temple could freely traverse the Universe Sea.","They had once plundered treasures within it, using the temple to overcome any obstacle.","Their last expedition had been to collide with a pyramid, believing it to be a treasure beyond","their grasp.","Yet, despite their efforts, they couldn’t even scratch it.","They eventually gave up and returned to the Higher Heavens.","Shortly after, the Life source within the temple dried up.","They had initially attributed it to other factors, but now, according to Jian Wushuang’s words,","it seemed there had been some unexpected event during that time.","They had inadvertently triggered some kind of prohibition.","And the pyramid had vanished since then.","At the time, they had thought it was seized by others.","Now, it seemed that within the pyramid might lie metallic lifeforms, awakened by their collision with the Immortal Divine Temple.","If Realm King were to find out they had released these metallic lifeforms, he would surely be","furious.","Actually, when the Wanliu Divine Tree was brought by Weiss, the pyramid was already in the Universe Sea, just sealed.","It was only because the Immortal Divine Temple had broken the seal that the metallic","lifeforms were released!","The three exchanged astonished glances.","They had thought some calamity had befallen the Higher Heavens, only to realize it was due","to their own actions.","For a moment, it was hard to accept.","Whoosh!","The three returned to Jian Wushuang, this time with a more amiable demeanor.","“Young Friends, how much do you know about these metallic lifeforms?”","Jian Wushuang said calmly, “In fact, not much. We don’t even know their exact location, just","planning to venture into the Universe Sea and try our luck.”","Realm King had previously mentioned that the metallic lifeforms were nibbling at the Life","source of the Wanliu Willow.","So, they were probably within the source itself, the interior of the Universe Sea.","The Stairway to Godhood was also there.","To achieve godhood, one couldn’t ignore the metallic lifeforms.","Actually, it would be easier to deal with them once Danbao became the God of Life.","Unfortunately, dealing with the metal lifeforms was not going to be easy.","These metallic beings weren’t ignorant; they hailed from other spacetimes, possibly knowing","more than the three great spirits themselves.","The three divine spirits exchanged glances, the truth now laid bare before them.","Without deluding themselves, they could even venture into the Universe Sea to seek out these","metal lifeforms.","“In that case, we cannot shirk our responsibility. Although we don’t know how these metal","lifeforms came into existence, they pose a threat to the Great Sky Dome World. It’s not just the powerful beings of the Higher Heavens who must act; we will also intervene personally!”","Jiang Wuyan’s words were impassioned.","He was eager to confront the metal lifeforms head-on immediately.","Jian Wushuang hadn’t anticipated the magnitude of the situation. He thought they might not","believe or would require more delicate negotiation.","But to his surprise, they didn’t hesitate to offer their assistance.","Not only did they agree outright, but they also volunteered to actively eradicate the metal","lifeforms.","A glimmer of hope emerged amidst the uncertainty.","“Senior’s noble intentions!”","Jian Wushuang breathed a sigh of relief, feeling a surge of excitement deep within.","“Benefactor, this temple is extraordinary!” Danbao suddenly communicated through mental","transmission.","He sensed a fluctuation emanating from within the temple."]},{"number":5943,"title":"Chapter 5943: Southern Saint King","paragraphs":["Chapter 5943: Southern Saint King","Upon entering the temple, a surge of life force slowly began to emanate, seemingly connected to his own Life essence.","Upon hearing Danbao’s transmission, Jian Wushuang remained composed outwardly but secretly communicated, “What’s the matter?”","“There’s a source of Life within this hall, but it’s been sealed by some kind of prohibition!”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes flickered.","A Life source like that was truly a treasure!","It was comparable to the innate Life force, and even akin to the Origin Source of Life.","He tried to restrain himself as much as possible.","Such treasures were not something they could easily meddle with, at least not at the moment.","“Restrain yourself. Now is not the time for this discussion. We can talk about it when the Great Monk and Divine Wood King arrive. Only then will we have the qualification to discuss this.”","Danbao nodded silently, refraining from saying more.","This treasure indeed held great significance for him.","Jian Wushuang could sense its resonance even through his Tribulation Armor, let alone Danbao, the reigning God of Life.","If it truly held great value for Danbao, then they would have to wait until the Great Monk and the others arrived before they could confidently explore it.","They might be wiped out before they even had a chance to speak if they acted recklessly now.","Since the three great divine spirits had pledged to help them search for the metallic lifeform, they were all in the same boat for now.","It was imperative to handle the situation carefully.","The search for metallic lifeforms couldn’t wait.","The three divine spirits first instructed Zhao Ge to inform the Universe Masters of the Eighth Tribulation realm within the Universe Sea to gather information, and then politely invited Jian Wushuang and the others into the inner hall.","They claimed it was for rest, but it was essentially a form of house arrest.","Although Jian Wushuang was anxious, he had no better alternative.","Sending Danbao to the Universe Sea was actually the easiest way to find metallic lifeforms, considering its source of Life.","Having the Universe Masters of the Immortal Divine Temple search would be too slow.","As the days passed by, the Great Monk, accompanied by Divine Wood King and others, roamed the Higher Heavens for three days before entering the Universe Sea.","Meanwhile, Jian Wushuang had been stuck in the Immortal Divine Temple for three cycles.","People were on the verge of going mad.","One day, in a secluded hall of the Immortal Divine Temple, Jian Wushuang was casually chatting and drinking with Wu Li, but their seclusion didn’t contribute much to their cultivation.","They either studied Life within their own universe or wandered around the temple.","Today, Wu Li emerged from seclusion, and they engaged in idle conversation.","Suddenly, hurried footsteps echoed outside the hall.","Wu Li immediately put down his wine glass and turned to look outside.","“Excuse us, sirs!”","A faint smile crossed the newcomer’s face as he hurriedly entered.","Over the years, Jian Wushuang and Wu Li had gained some understanding of the strong figures within the Immortal Divine Temple, aside from the three divine spirits.","Besides the three divine spirits, there were also ten divine kings.","Chaoge was just one of them.","These ten kings had all once led the Immortal Divine Temple.","Even the weakest among them was a peak figure of the Eighth Tribulation realm.","The person before them was the former ruler of the Immortal Divine Temple.","Chaoge wasn’t weak by any means.","“Southern Saint King!” Jian Wushuang and Wu Li both stood up simultaneously.","He was a Universe Master of the Eighth Tribulation realm.","He had stepped down due to Chaoge’s appearance and had later ventured into the Universe Sea, aiming for further advancement.","Unfortunately, every step in the Eighth Tribulation realm was extremely difficult.","Among the Universe Masters, he was considered one of the top figures in the Eighth Tribulation realm.","However, when it came to divine power, the starting point was millions.","It was definitely the peak combat power of the Eight Tribulations realm.","This was the might of the Universe Master.","Facing such a formidable opponent, Jian Wushuang and Wu Li naturally didn’t dare to be negligent.","The Southern Saint King gestured with his hand, indicating, “No need to be formal, sit down and speak!”","Jian Wushuang and Wu Li followed suit, sitting down, while also anticipating what was to","come.","Perhaps there would be good news again.","During their second epoch in the Immortal Divine Temple, they almost located the position of the metal lifeforms.","They had already captured its aura, but by the time they arrived, the pyramid had vanished.","Later, even the three great divine spirits personally went in search, but they never found it","again.","However, it also gave them hope.","Now, all the Eight Tribulations realm powerhouses sleeping in the Immortal Divine Temple","had been summoned.","They were all thrown into the Universe Sea.","In fact, the three great divine spirits were even more anxious than they were.","Because there were too many things at stake regarding the power of Life.","Over the years, Jian Wushuang had also learned that the three great divine spirits were not of","the Three Tribulations.","They were special existences.","That was also the reason why the other party was so powerful.","In terms of surface strength, they were even stronger than Chi Jiuxiao.","Perhaps the three of them combined could contend evenly with Chi Jiuxiao.","It should be noted that even the Great Monk and Divine Wood King together would fall before","Chi Jiuxiao.","Special Life Forms.","Their growth potential was much higher than cultivators.","It could be seen at the same level.","“This time we’ve come to find you because of manpower issues. Originally, you didn’t need to","go, but recently a new secret realm has appeared in the Universe Sea. As you know, there are still many Universe Masters in the Immortal Divine Temple, they don’t lack the power of life,","but what they lack is opportunity, so...”","Jian Wushuang nodded solemnly, “Understood!”","Although he said this on the surface, his heart was already ecstatic.","He had long wanted to enter the Universe Sea.","Even if he had to follow those people from the Immortal Divine Temple, he would still go in.","Staying in the Immortal Divine Temple all the time was not a long-term plan at all.","In the blink of an eye, three epochs had passed.","There was still no news from the Great Monk and Divine Wood King.","Not only was Jian Wushuang anxious, but Wu Li was even more so.","If they continued to be trapped here, how much longer would they have to wait?","“Southern Saint King, whatever you need us three to do, just say it!”","Although Jian Wushuang was excited in his heart, he still had to restrain himself on the","surface.","Otherwise, the other party would definitely think he had ulterior motives.","Actually, now in the Immortal Divine Temple, they were of great use to Jian Wushuang and the others, and they might not necessarily want to escape.","Danbao had a special method to find the metal life, and by then, they could rely on the power of the Immortal Divine Temple to eradicate the metal lifeform.","With their current situation, even if they escaped, they couldn’t deal with the metal lifeform","when they met the Great Monk and the others.","At first, they were a bit careless.","They thought that even if the Wanyao Universe was powerful and its population had reached its peak, it wouldn’t have more strong individuals than the Ancient Moon Spacetime.","But now it seemed that they had overestimated themselves.","In just a single Sky Dome World, Eighth Tribulation realm powerhouses could survive until","now, and just from what Jian Wushuang had seen, there were at least five Universe Masters of","the Eighth Tribulation realm.","And there were still many Eighth Tribulation realm Special Life Forms that were equally","powerful.","Not to mention the Scattered Tribulations, just considering the number of these","powerhouses, it could rival the Ancient Moon Spacetime.","This was not counting the Higher Heavens.","Otherwise, there would be even more.","Originally, they thought that with the Great Monk and Divine Wood King, they could handle","everything.","But with the threat of metal lifeform now, they also had to face Babidi.","Passive!","They had been passive in many things along the way.","Ultimately, it was because Jian Wushuang’s strength was not enough.","Or rather, the things he encountered exceeded the capacity he should have borne."]},{"number":5944,"title":"Chapter 5944: The Ninth Tribulation Realm Is Not Equal to Eternity","paragraphs":["Chapter 5944: The Ninth Tribulation Realm Is Not Equal to Eternity","However, without these events and opportunities, he wouldn’t have become so powerful. Everything was fair.","Jian Wushuang harbored no complaints.","Under the guidance of the Southern Saint King, they once again paid homage to the three great divine spirits.","This time, they would follow the Southern Saint King to venture deep into the Universe Sea to search for the metallic lifeform.","In the past, the three great divine spirits wouldn’t have done such a thing.","But after learning the reason for the drying up of the source of life, they became anxious.","At first, there was no feeling, but the longer they waited, the more restless their hearts became.","Because of worry!","They worried that in the future, treasures like the source of life would cease to appear!","By then, they would be doomed.","The Immortal Divine Temple relied on the word “immortal”.","Without the power of Life, immortality became a joke.","Even their own survival became uncertain.","That’s why they were anxious.","Although the Universe Masters of the Eighth Tribulation Realm were not in a hurry, they also lamented the tragedies of others like rabbits and foxes.","They knew that sooner or later, they too would meet the same fate.","No one dared to say they would reach the Ninth Tribulation realm.","For some reason, the Ninth Tribulation realm seemed like a shackle, firmly controlling the Universe Masters.","It was always impossible to surpass.","In the Northern Spacetime, there were nine core temporal rivers.","Only three ancient super-strong existences remained.","But these three were referred to as puppets by Weiss.","This just shows!","These three ancient existences were probably not strong because of reaching the Ninth Tribulation realm, but because they became eternal existences for some reason.","True strong beings capable of revealing Ninth Tribulation realm power had never appeared. Perhaps such existences existed in other spacetimes or the Starry Sky.","But not in the Northern Spacetime, at least.","This might have something to do with the Law Rules.","...","The goal of the three great divine spirits was not actually the Ninth Tribulation realm.","It was to break through all laws with sheer strength.","To transcend the confines of time and space.","To forge eternity.","The prerequisite for achieving this was the power of Life.","And the operation of the Immortal Divine Temple.","Relying solely on cultivation was basically futile.","Jian Wushuang and his companions didn’t understand this, so naturally, they didn’t realize","that these three divine spirits simply wanted to preserve their lives.","After a few words with the three great divine spirits.","They continued to exchange superficial pleasantries as usual, without revealing any substantial information.","They were mainly concerned that Jian Wushuang might take advantage of the opportunity to escape.","They said some nice words.","But for Jian Wushuang, these words were meaningless, they went in one ear and out the other.","Finally, he expressed his loyalty and then left with the Southern Saint King.","After leaving the Immortal Divine Temple.","They arrived at the entrance to the Universe Sea.","The reason they didn’t teleport was actually because they couldn’t afford to waste any more","Life force, and blocking the entrance to the Universe Sea was also quite good.","Several teams took turns to explore the Universe Sea in search of metallic lifeforms.","Along the way, they could also find some treasures.","For example, this time they discovered a new mystery realm.","It was a significant find.","The realm drifted from the depths of the Universe Sea, just in time for Chaoge and his team to discover it, naturally leading them to venture inside.","And right now, they were a bit short on manpower.","That’s why Jian Wushuang and his two companions came out to lend a hand.","Of course, it wasn’t just because of that.","Recalling the words of the three major divine spirits.","Especially the look in their eyes regarding the Danbao, it was evident that there was","suspicion.","Because they couldn’t see through Danbao.","They felt Danbao was very special.","So they asked Jian Wushuang to take people to investigate.","Perhaps they could find that metallic life form.","This time, as long as they discovered it, they would transmit the location to the three major","divine spirits, and the Immortal Divine Temple would instantly descend.","Anywhere in the Universe Sea, as long as there was enough Life force, the Immortal Divine Temple could instantly arrive.","With this guarantee, Jian Wushuang and the others felt relieved.","They just needed to be responsible for finding it, and once found, they would notify the three major divine spirits to come, without needing to intervene themselves.","Even Jian Wushuang had thought ahead that when the three major divine spirits were busy dealing with the metallic life form, they could take the opportunity to escape.","That was the best plan.","Unfortunately, every plan was good in theory, but it was difficult to execute when faced with","reality.","Crash!","Southern Saint King stood at the entrance of the Universe Sea, forming seals with his hands,","and casted an unknown secret technique.","The entrance to the Universe Sea was sealed off.","“What’s this...” Jian Wushuang was somewhat surprised, looking at the seemingly ordinary","entrance, which, after the sealing, rippled with waves.","Soon after, he felt a surge of divine power erupting from it.","Southern Saint King said calmly, “What, haven’t you felt the power of the Universe Sea","before?”","“I’m just curious, Your Highness. I didn’t expect the seal of the entrance to be your key. If we had foolishly entered before, we might have been stopped!” Jian Wushuang naturally wouldn’t mention anything about the Universe Sea, lest he expose himself.","Just now, he was really taken aback.","The violent power kept blowing out from the entrance.","“Is the entire Universe Sea like this?” Jian Wushuang was secretly amazed, his eyes flickering","with astonishment.","Wu Li, behind him, widened his eyes, afraid that others wouldn’t notice they had never been","to the Universe Sea.","Jian Wushuang couldn’t help but cough lightly, reminding the other party.","Don’t embarrass themselves.","Making them look like they knew nothing.","Fortunately, Danbao remained calm enough.","And Southern Saint King, although he had been talking with Jian Wushuang, kept his gaze on","Danbao.","After the entrance to the Universe Sea was opened, it didn’t take long for several Eighth Tribulation realm powerhouses to appear inside the entrance.","These Eighth Tribulation realm powerhouses were all Scattered Tribulations.","Every hundred million years, they rotated once.","The other Eighth Tribulation Universe Masters followed Chaoge to the newly appeared mystery realm, while these scattered tribulation powerhouses of the Eighth Tribulation realm, whose vitality was already pitifully scarce, were okay with searching for metallic lifeforms but not fighting.","The Universe Sea was formed by divine power.","Flying above consumed a large amount of divine power, which was no less than battling.","These Scattered Tribulation experts had to come back for recuperation once every hundred million years, or else their vitality consumption would be too great, and they might directly","fall into a deep sleep.","One hundred million years outside was equivalent to one era inside the universe, which was why rotation was necessary.","In order to find metallic lifeforms, the three major divine spirits of the Immortal Divine","Temple summoned a large group of Seventh Tribulation Universe Masters to search the","Universe Sea.","However, the Thought power of these people was much weaker compared to the Eighth Tribulation Universe Masters.","A starving camel is bigger than a horse.","Although the Scattered Tribulations no longer had their Origin Source, their Thought power","still remained.","An Eighth Tribulation Universe Master could handle a group of Seventh Tribulation ones.","But Jian Wushuang was different; his Thought power was no worse than that of an Eighth Tribulation Universe Master.","That was why the three major divine spirits specifically instructed him to go.","And there was Danbao.","Ever since he became a candidate for the God of Life and refined that treasure, his Thought","power had become terrifying.","The power he couldn’t feel, Danbao could.","“Southern Saint King, it’s up to you guys now!”","The returning Eighth Tribulation powerhouses greeted and glanced at Jian Wushuang and the","others before entering the Immortal Divine Temple.","Southern Saint King smiled faintly, “Jian Wushuang, let’s go!”"]},{"number":5945,"title":"Chapter 5945: Entering Universe Sea","paragraphs":["Chapter 5945: Entering Universe Sea","“Sure!” Jian Wushuang nodded.","This time, apart from them four, there were five other Eighth Tribulation experts accompanying them.","Nine people in total.","They would have to split up when they arrived.","However, the three of them would be separated.","This was to prevent Jian Wushuang and the others from escaping together.","Although the Universe Sea was vast, it was condensed by divine power.","It was impossible to detect fluctuations in divine power at all.","Only some special marks could allow them to sense each other’s positions. Swish!","Several figures instantly entered the entrance.","They felt a strong wind blow over their faces, and they had already entered the Universe Sea.","Buzz!","The sea looked no different from the outer oceans, all pale blue.","But the aura was different.","The Universe Sea!","It was an ocean of divine power.","For practitioners like them, it had tremendous suppressing power.","Even flying above it made them feel tired.","No wonder those Eighth Tribulation experts had to come back to rest and recover. Moreover, the threshold for entering the Universe Sea was a million units of divine power. This threshold was extremely high.","It was basically the threshold of the Seventh Tribulation realm.","Without being at the Seventh Tribulation realm, coming here was simply courting death.","It was fine to wander around nearby, but once they delved deeper, they would perish if they didn’t encounter danger.","Jian Wushuang looked at the boundless Universe Sea, deeply shaken in his heart, and said with emotion, “If only we could devour such a vast ocean of divine power.”","“Haha, everyone thinks the same way. With such a vast Universe Sea, even if we could control just one ten-thousandth, we would be invincible!”","Southern Saint King chuckled. He had this idea back then.","It was his first time entering the Universe Sea, and he was accompanied by elders from the clan. At that time, he was the Universe Master at the Sixth Tribulation realm.","He wanted to observe this Universe Sea.","But just at the periphery, he felt infinite pressure.","Let alone devouring it, it was a luxury to be able to stay in the Universe Sea for a long time.","Currently, only Eighth Tribulation Universe Masters could survive normally in the Universe Sea.","Or it could be some Special Life Forms at the Eighth Tribulation realm.","The rest couldn’t stay long.","“Alright, let’s set off. Not far from here, there’s a teleportation array. We’ll use it to go to the inner region first, and then search separately!”","Southern Saint King instructed, and everyone flew towards the teleportation array.","The teleportation arrays here were built by the three great divine beings back then, just to save travel time.","It was considered a shortcut for those at the Seventh Tribulation realm.","With these teleportation arrays, Seventh Tribulation Universe Masters could also venture into the depths of the Universe Sea.","Zhen Wu Emperor, a Scattered Tribulation, had the strength of a Half-Step Eighth Tribulation realm because he wandered in the Universe Sea and obtained a giant tortoise shell, creating the Zhen Wu Secret Art.","Achieving a Half-Step Eighth Tribulation realm.","It could be said that as long as one ventured deep into the Universe Sea and had good luck, they could obtain equal opportunities.","That was why it attracted so many practitioners to come in droves.","The Zhen Wu Emperor had risked his life back then, depleting his vitality and almost causing the Zhen Wu Dynasty to be destroyed.","All for the sake of fighting for a treasure deep in the Universe Sea.","If successful, he might advance another half step.","After all, being Scattered Tribulation, although his strength was at the Half-Step Eighth Tribulation realm, his room for improvement was limited.","Even so, he still had to fight for it.","The Universe Sea was indeed a magical place, captivating people.","To see the essence through the Universe Sea.","In fact, the Wanliu Divine Tree was the same.","In the outside world, practitioners were obsessed with the Wanliu Divine Tree.","Internally, they were obsessed with the depths of the Universe Sea.","Because both had powerful treasures flowing out.","Riding the teleportation array, they soon arrived at the deep sea of the Universe Sea.","Each teleportation span was quite large.","If they flew slowly, it would probably take several epochs.","This time span was something even Seventh Tribulation Universe Masters couldn’t bear.","However, peak Eighth Tribulation experts could handle it.","Because their speed was fast enough.","Jian Wushuang roughly calculated that even in his state of infinite divine power, it would","probably take him an epoch.","If he had really come here back then, just flying alone would have been deadly enough.","He wondered how the Great Monk and Divine Wood King were doing now.","If they truly entered the Higher Heavens, relying on Elder Blu’s causal induction, they should","be able to discover them in the vast expanse of the Great Sky Dome World.","However, pinpointing their exact location could be troublesome.","The temporal dynamics of the Great Sky Dome World differ from those of the Higher Heavens.","Yet, the spacetime within the Universe Sea remains stable.","As long as they all entered the Universe Sea, the flow of time remained consistent.","What Jian Wushuang didn’t know was that both the Great Monk and Divine Wood King had","long entered the Universe Sea.","And they had been drifting within it for countless epochs.","The Universe Sea, a vast expanse where heaven and earth meet.","No matter which entrance one takes, it leads to the other side.","Jian Wushuang and the others could travel through teleportation arrays.","But Divine Wood King and the Great Monk had no such luxury; they had to rely on flight alone.","Fortunately, with Danbao’s help, they had restored their peak strength, and they had also","obtained numerous life fruits.","Otherwise, they would have exhausted themselves.","Jian Wushuang had worried about this, but he had underestimated the abilities of the Great","Monk and Divine Wood King.","At this moment, deep within the Universe Sea, floated a withered vine secret realm.","Externally, it appeared as a desiccated tendril.","But internally, it housed a paradise.","Divine Wood King, the Great Monk, and the others were on this vine.","When they first entered the Universe Sea, they only felt that something was peculiar, and they","were curious about how the Universe Sea had formed.","However, the Great Monk intentionally concealed the truth.","Because he knew best the horrors of the Universe Sea.","If they relied solely on flight to find Jian Wushuang and the others, they would likely exhaust","themselves, even the Great Monk himself.","If word got out, perhaps no one would dare to enter.","Fortunately, deep within the Universe Sea, they encountered a drifting vine.","It was a hidden paradise.","They took the opportunity to enter this realm.","By continuously drifting along this vine, they conserved their divine power.","Otherwise, they might have exhausted themselves before encountering the metallic life","forms.","Coincidentally, the realm they found themselves in was stumbled upon by the likes of Chaoge, who were searching for metallic life forms.","They were currently trying to break open the realm to search for treasures!","Indeed, there were treasures within the paradise, but the Great Monk and Divine Wood King","had already plundered everything clean.","They left nothing behind.","So, Jian Wushuang’s worries were unnecessary; not only did they not exhaust themselves, but","they also made a considerable profit.","Their mouths were filled with delicacies.","Their divine power surged!","Within the withered vine secret realm, devastation abounded!","There were numerous colossal withered trees, devoid of any vitality.","Of course, this wasn’t the work of Divine Wood King and the others; it had always been this","way.","However, beneath these withered trees, they harvested numerous fruit cores.","These were the cores left behind after the fruits evaporated, which provided significant","assistance to their divine power.","As the withered trees withered away, they offered immense help to cultivators; one could say","every part of them was a treasure.","In front of each withered tree, a cultivator sat cross-legged, continuously absorbing the divine power from the withered trees."]},{"number":5946,"title":"Chapter 5946: Grotto-Heaven Secret Realm!","paragraphs":["Chapter 5946: Grotto-Heaven Secret Realm!","On the largest withered tree, two figures sat in meditation.","They were none other than Divine Wood King and the Great Monk.","Only these two had the qualification to monopolize absolute resources.","The rest could only have a share.","Despite being the ones who benefited the most, their expressions now looked somewhat grim.","“What should we do about those natives from the outside?”","“We should just slaughter them!”","“Absolutely not!” The Great Monk shook his head hastily.","Those natives were drawing their attention, and they didn’t have the time to deal with them.","Besides, this was their first encounter with cultivators.","After enduring for so long, they finally laid eyes on living beings. They had to go out and have a conversation no matter what.","But once they went out, how should they identify themselves?","They couldn’t possibly say they came from the Higher Heavens!","The Great Monk was a powerful native of the Wanliu Universe. He knew how difficult it was to enter the Great Sky Dome Great World from the Higher Heavens.","The reason they were able to arrive here smoothly was due to the collapse of the Higher Heavens.","It had turned into a world of ice and snow, devoid of vitality.","The barrier of the Universe Sea had also decreased significantly.","“What do you suggest, then?”","Divine Wood King’s mood felt somewhat contrived.","They had been too suppressed these years, always searching for the Danbao according to Elder Blu’s karmic ties, yet they had received no news whatsoever.","And no matter which way they went, they felt an infinite distance away from the Danbao.","Now their spirits were almost breaking apart.","How could they not be anxious?","“We still need to deliberate. Since we’ve encountered cultivators here, we’re closer to the Great Sky Dome World. The reason we feel the distance to the Young Master is remote is because time and space are isolated. Once we enter the Sky Dome World, we can quickly find the Young Master!”","“Do I still need you to teach me?” Divine Wood King snapped.","They understood the reasoning, but the key was how to enter the Great Sky Dome World.","They couldn’t possibly let those outsiders lead the way!","Saying such a thing would make even a three-year-old mock them.","Faced with unfamiliar powerhouses, who would lead the way?","They could only fight!","Fight until the opponent bowed, then they would be led to the Great Sky Dome World.","That was Divine Wood King’s idea.","But the Great Monk didn’t think so.","Because outside, there were six Universe Masters.","Each of them was at the Eighth Tribulation realm.","Going out, they might not necessarily win.","Although Divine Wood King had once refined that supreme treasure, his divine power surpassed even the Universe Masters, it was at most a one-on-one suppression.","Including himself, they could at most handle two opponents.","But outside, there were six Eighth Tribulation Universe Masters.","Currently, they had only two choices before them.","Fight!","Or avoid fighting!","For now, the stronghold of this paradise realm could still hold out.","“Get out!”","There was only one battle to be fought.","Because he knew those Universe Masters were coming for the treasure.","“Sigh!” The Great Monk sighed, feeling that the team was hard to manage.","But Divine Wood King was confident.","Because this time, he was the biggest gainer.","The withered wood here didn’t help much with his own strength, but it greatly aided his Mo Yun Vine.","The Divine Wood King’s Moyun Vine already had top-tier strength at the Eighth Tribulation realm.","Now, after absorbing the withered wood, it was not weaker than him, even slightly stronger. Being a plant-based life form, the enhancement from the secret technique was significant. He could use the Moyun Vine to ambush and swiftly kill a Universe Master at the Eighth Tribulation realm.","A single battle outside might not result in a loss.","That’s why he advocated for it.","Just as the two were deadlocked, Elder Blu, who was sitting cross-legged in the distance,","suddenly opened his eyes wide.","“I sense the position of the Danbao!”","Blu exclaimed directly, trembling with excitement all over.","He had been waiting for this moment for too long.","The position of the Danbao had been stationary all along, and although their positions were getting closer, the effect was minimal.","But now he felt the Danbao’s position, in the same spacetime as theirs, and very close.","If they flew out, with the Great Monk’s speed, they could find the Danbao in ten years.","Upon hearing Blu’s words, everyone looked over.","Divine Wood King and the Great Monk rushed over directly.","And not just them.","After entering the Universe Sea, Danbao also sensed Blu’s position.","However, they had been moving too fast using the teleportation array and hadn’t had the","chance to inform Jian Wushuang.","Once they stabilized, Danbao immediately sent a message to Jian Wushuang.","“Found them?”","Jian Wushuang’s heart rejoiced upon hearing Danbao’s message.","He knew that the Great Monk and the others must be on their way.","It’s just that they weren’t in the same spacetime, so it felt distant.","Just as they entered the depths of the Universe Sea, they felt the other party’s position.","Jian Wushuang asked through transmission, “Roughly how far?”","“Ten years!”","The same as Blu’s prediction of the elder monk’s speed.","The peak speed of the Great Monk was almost as fast as Jian Wushuang’s Universe Supertravel","Technique.","Upon hearing this distance, Jian Wushuang began to ponder.","Now that he had found the Great Monk and the others’ position.","He was considering whether to leave the team now, taking Danbao and the others to find the","Great Monk.","If they left the Immortal Divine Temple now, the other side would definitely pursue them. Although they wouldn’t catch up, it meant adding another enemy.","But he also wanted to reconcile with the Great Monk and the others, which would give him","some confidence.","There was only one option left.","“Danbao, before we part ways, tell Southern Saint King the location of the Great Monk and the others!” Jian Wushuang’s mind stirred, forming a plan.","Using another’s hand to kill!","Upon hearing this, Danbao frowned, transmitting, “Tell Southern Saint King?”","He was still a bit naive and couldn’t understand Jian Wushuang’s words. “Just say you’ve sensed the presence of metallic lifeform, it’s at that location. I’ll coordinate with you later. Whether Southern Saint King believes it or not, he’ll go check it out. With our combined speed, it’ll take roughly a hundred years. That amount of time is nothing to the","Southern Saint King!”","Jian Wushuang explained the plan straightforwardly, which was actually quite simple.","Better to waste time than to miss the opportunity.","That was the current state of the Immortal Divine Temple.","Faced with the tasks from the three great divine spirits, Southern Saint King dared not be negligent, and they also understood the danger of metallic lifeform.","Moreover, Danbao had always played a mysterious role.","Even before entering the Universe Sea, Southern Saint King had been keeping an eye on","Danbao.","Now it was the same.","Although he wasn’t staring with his eyes, he had a Thought power lingering on Danbao.","Now that Danbao spoke of his discovery, Southern Saint King would definitely take notice.","He wasn’t afraid of the other party not acting.","Danbao took a deep breath, his voice deliberately ominous as he said, “Southern Saint","King...”","“Hmm?”","Southern Saint King turned his head towards Danbao immediately.","He had been planning the area, preparing to send people to search.","Upon hearing Danbao’s words, he was stunned.","“You say you’ve sensed the location of metallic lifeform?” Southern Saint King couldn’t","believe it.","Although he felt Danbao was somewhat mysterious, it was strange that Danbao claimed to","have found the metallic lifeform just after entering the Universe Sea.","He couldn’t help but be suspicious."]},{"number":5947,"title":"Chapter 5947: Urgent Travel","paragraphs":["Chapter 5947: Urgent Travel","Jian Wushuang looked at the other person, disbelieving that they’d just revealed the","coordinates, then added, “Southern Saint King, it’s not even a journey of a hundred years. How about we go and explore?”","Every search took an era of time.","A hundred years, what did it matter?","“Where did you say?”","Southern Saint King didn’t care much about the hundred years, but he was surprised at why Danbao had discovered the location of the metallic life form so quickly.","Now, upon hearing the direction Jian Wushuang mentioned, he was even more astonished, rooted to the spot.","He then took out a token from his sleeve, channeled his Thought energy into it, and a hologram appeared on the token – it was the Universe Master of the Eighth Tribulation realm, Chaoge.","“Guard that cave secret realm and don’t let it escape. I’ll take people over immediately!”","Chaoge’s hologram moved slightly, surprised, “Should we inform the Lord Divine Spirit?” “Not necessary for now!”","Southern Saint King put away the token, then turned to Jian Wushuang, saying, “If the Divine Spirits comes, the cost will be great. We need to confirm again!”","“The location you mentioned is the cave secret realm they discovered!”","Jian Wushuang exclaimed, “What!”","Such a coincidence?","They actually stumbled upon it.","The Great Monk and Divine Wood King were at the secret realm discovered by Chaoge. Wasn’t that a bit too coincidental?","Fortunately, Southern Saint King was cautious. If the divine spirits were to teleport directly... Wouldn’t that be a trap?","The Great Monk and Divine Wood King would probably be dumbfounded.","Luring them in to besiege their own people.","It’s ridiculous just to think about it.","Shooting oneself in the foot!","They had done this kind of thing many times before.","Every time, it was just this coincidental.","It’s really unlucky.","“It seems you’re right to feel that way. Perhaps the metallic life form is really there!” Southern Saint King said with a smile, “I didn’t expect it to go so smoothly this time. Let’s hurry!”","Jian Wushuang and the others could only awkwardly nod.","If Divine Wood King and the Great Monk knew they were leading a group of Eighth Tribulation realm experts to besiege them, who knows what they would think.","Although Wu Li didn’t know what was happening, he also felt something was amiss and secretly transmitted, “Brother Wushuang, have you found the metallic life form?”","||","Jian Wushuang didn’t even want to speak, his face dark as he followed behind Southern Saint King, not saying a word.","For them, flying alone would take a hundred years.","A hundred years was quick for them.","There were no stops along the way. Although there were unique divine beasts in the Universe Sea, they posed no threat to them.","The greatest danger in the Universe Sea was underwater.","Those powerful ancient divine beasts generally lurked underwater and wouldn’t actively emerge.","So the divine beasts they encountered were all weak, easily dealt with.","Along the way, Danbao’s expression was somewhat embarrassed.","Initially, he deceived Southern Saint King, claiming to have sensed the aura of the metallic life form.","Now, it seemed like he really had.","An exceptionally strong Life force.","Corroding plant and tree life.","The vegetation withered instantly after being corroded.","Scenes played out in Danbao’s mind.","“Benefactor, the metallic life form is very likely in that cave secret realm!”","The closer they got, the clearer Danbao felt.","He had to tell Jian Wushuang now.","There was a 90 percent chance!","Jian Wushuang, whose face was already embarrassed, looked even more so upon hearing Danbao’s words.","If the metallic life form really was in that cave secret realm, the divine spirits would surely","come.","How would they explain then?","And how would the Great Monk and Divine Wood King be associated with the metallic life","form?","Without Danbao’s guidance, they wouldn’t have been able to find the metallic life form,","right?","Everything was very suspicious.","If it were a coincidence, then it was too coincidental.","Now there was no other way, they could only wait until the time was right.","Jian Wushuang was torn between wanting to quickly deal with the metal lifeforms and wanting to meet with the Great Monk and Divine Wood King as soon as possible.","But these two matters collided, turning into a mess.","And they coincided to such a high degree, it was as if they were almost indistinguishable.","“Danbao, do you think the divine beings of the Immortal Divine Temple will believe us if we tell them the truth?” Jian Wushuang was considering drastic measures.","It might be better to lay everything out, so everyone would have an understanding.","When they arrived later, the metal lifeforms were indeed in the secret realm.","The Great Monk and Divine Wood King, among others, were also in the secret realm. It was like trying to stuff mud into a pant leg; things were getting messy.","“Benefactor, perhaps there’s no need for this!” Danbao shook his head at him, then continued via mental transmission, “I can feel Elder Blu and the others’ vitality; there’s been no change. Although the aura of the metal lifeforms is also present, there’s no connection between the two. We don’t need to link the two matters!”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes flickered, then he suddenly smiled.","At this moment, he felt that Danbao had grown up, no longer the child he once was.","They decided to handle the two matters separately.","Perhaps it was the most prudent course of action.","If the metal lifeforms were in the shadows, they would enter from the shadows.","If they were in the light, they would advise the Great Monk and Divine Wood King’s group not","to act rashly.","When the divine beings descended and clashed with the metal lifeforms, they would quietly meet with the Great Monk and the others, then take the opportunity to slip away.","Or they could simply watch and wait.","If the Immortal Divine Temple couldn’t handle it, they would step in to help.","Resolving the situation would be the best outcome for everyone.","With the source of life in the Immortal Divine Temple revived, they could also ascend to the","Stairway of Godhood.","“That’s settled!”","The two exchanged a glance, everything understood without needing to be spoken.","A hundred years passed in the blink of an eye.","Suddenly, with the Southern Saint King leading Jian Wushuang and the others, they arrived at","the secret realm where Chaoge was located.","Just before they arrived, deep beneath the sea of the Universe Sea, a huge bubble swelled up,","then burst.","After the burst, there was a rupture in space.","Countless sea waters instantly converged on this newly opened entrance to space.","Hum!","As the seawater rushed in, it was forcefully pushed back by a power outside the entrance.","Splash!","Countless bubbles surged again.","Before the bubbles burst, figures had already entered the depths of the Universe Sea through","the entrance.","The leader, upon entering, almost suffocated, but fortunately, an energy shield covered his","body in time.","“Phew!”","“Lord Babidi, this should be the core of the Wanliu Universe!”","“I don’t need you to tell me, okay?” Lord Babidi said coldly, “If you losers hadn’t led us","astray, I would have been here ages ago!”","These people were indeed Lord Babidi and his group.","Originally leaving from the City in the Sky, they wandered endlessly in the savage world,","unable to leave.","In the end, it was the eruption of Chi Jiuxiao that continuously attacked the space-time,","opening this space-time tunnel and entering the Universe Sea. “Jian Wushuang, this time, let’s see where you’ll run off to?”"]},{"number":5948,"title":"Chapter 5948: Meeting","paragraphs":["Chapter 5948: Meeting","Babidi, who had just teleported there, sensed the aura of Jian Wushuang and Divine Wood King, among others, and a smirk curled up his lips as he chuckled coldly.","Behind him, Chi Jiuxiao was toying with the sea beasts in the depths of the ocean.","The sea beasts at the level of ordinary Eight Tribulation realm, with divine power of up to 5 million, were like toys in Chi Jiuxiao’s hands. With casual control, he crushed the divine bodies of the sea beasts.","“Stop playing around, it’s time to get serious!” Babidi raised his hand and took out the cosmic ship, hovering it above the seabed.","Although Chi Jiuxiao was somewhat reluctant to stop playing, he didn’t dare to disobey Babidi’s command and obediently boarded the ship.","The other powerful beings also followed suit.","But the number of people was somewhat reduced.","Now, only a few remained. In the endless wilderness, they had encountered several terrifying wild beasts, each possessing millions of divine power. It was inevitable that a few would die. The cosmic ship instantly activated, breaking through the surface of the Universe Sea and, after a moment’s pause, began to accelerate in the direction they intended to go. The pressure of the Universe Sea seemed unable to interfere with this ship.","Surprisingly, it could travel at high speed without consuming divine power.","Ordinary flying treasures usually required powerful individuals to inject divine power to manipulate them.","But this boat did not require such manipulation.","Such was the difference between treasures from different time and space!","The vehicle flew towards Jian Wushuang and his group’s direction.","Their only target was the Danbao.","...","Outside the secret realm of the cave.","Jian Wushuang and the others were gathered together, discussing how to enter.","They had been here for tens of thousands of years and still couldn’t break open this secret realm.","Now, hearing that there might be metal lifeforms hidden inside the secret realm made them even more reluctant to forcefully open it.","They were anxious outside.","But inside, chaos erupted.","Divine Wood King and the others, who had been preparing to rush out, found that Jian Wushuang was also getting closer.","So, they refrained from acting.","Isn’t it surprising to see Jian Wushuang mixing with those indigenous powerhouses outside?","Fortunately, through Elder Blu’s transmission, Danbao explained what had happened along the way, which stabilized them.","The most important thing now was to cooperate with the external powerhouses to find the metal lifeforms.","It was precisely because of the metal lifeforms that they were in such a panic.","“I never thought that damn metal lifeforms would be in this secret realm!” Divine Wood King cursed angrily. “Why do we always encounter such things!”","He was also frustrated. After finally finding Jian Wushuang and the others, they couldn’t leave.","The Great Monk was much calmer.","After some thought, he spoke, “We don’t need to panic, everyone. Didn’t Jian Wushuang say it? The metal lifeforms is hidden, so let’s deal with it in secret. Let’s collaborate with those indigenous powerhouses and let them take the lead. We can just sit back and watch the show!” “You make it sound easy!” Lord Hengmu sneered. “Are you thinking too lightly of those people? They are six Universe Masters at the Eight Tribulation realm, not a bunch of fools!” His words had just come out when a loud rumble came from outside!","Everyone looked towards the entrance of the secret realm.","A black aura was dispersing.","“They really dare to attack!”","Everyone was startled.","They had just said they weren’t that foolish, and yet, those Universe Masters from outside didn’t think much and directly attacked!","Even Jian Wushuang outside was stunned. He had only mentioned the approximate location of the metal lifeforms, but these Eight Tribulation Universe Masters couldn’t resist taking action.","Great Monk wanted to stop them, but he couldn’t. All he could do was console, “Since you all can track the target, it’s simple. Even if you scare the snake and let it escape, you can find it again. Why not just break open this secret realm first? By then, let the divine beings come down personally.”","“...We can only do that!” Jian Wushuang sighed. He was insignificant here, what could he stop?","Six of these Eight Tribulation Universe Masters, led by Chaoge, besieged the secret realm. They were preparing to forcefully open the secret realm.","Inside the secret realm, the Great Monk and Divine Wood King asked Danbao through Elder","Blu what was happening.","With such intensity of attack, it was likely that the secret realm would be broken open.","What to do then?","Chaoge and the others initially came to study the secret realm.","After all, for treasures!","They couldn’t act rashly; if they forcibly broke open the secret realm, the treasures inside might be damaged, so they dared not make a move.","Now that they knew the metal lifeforms was inside, they gave up on the treasures inside the secret realm and focused solely on capturing the metal lifeforms, without any reservations in","their actions.","“Everyone, don’t panic, this pocket dimension can still withstand...” Elder Blu inquired about the situation from Danbao, receiving a reassurance, he could only comfort everyone for the","time being.","But before he could finish his sentence, the pocket dimension began to crack.","It could collapse at any moment.","What would they do once they got out?","They shouldn’t make things worse for themselves.","Failing to find the metallic life form, they attracted attacks from those Universe Masters.","It was precisely at this moment that a powerful aura began to rise from the depths of the sea.","That aura was most familiar to Jian Wushuang.","The overwhelming Death Qi and the towering figure were already imprinted in their minds.","Boom!","A massive cosmic ship burst out from the sea floor.","In an instant, it appeared before everyone. Compared to this cosmic ship, the pocket dimension seemed extremely tiny.","When Chaoge and the others saw the appearance of the cosmic ship, they were stunned and","stopped in their tracks.","This relieved the people inside the pocket dimension.","“It stopped?”","Divine Wood King’s telepathy spread outward, sensing the familiar aura, his face changed drastically, reminding, “Don’t relax, it’s Babidi and his group!”","But this was also their opportunity.","Babidi and his group carried the power of death, while the Immortal Divine Temple was","searching for the consumption of life force.","Seeing Chi Jiuxiao, there would inevitably be a great battle.","Then, it would be their chance.","For a moment, the people inside the pocket dimension held their breath.","Chi Jiuxiao, with his overwhelming strength, against six Universe Masters at the Eight Tribulations realm, as well as several top experts at the Eight Tribulations realm.","That was definitely a battle worth watching.","Without the divine power of countless super strong individuals, they would not be enough to","participate in this battle.","Outside the pocket dimension.","Jian Wushuang saw the cosmic ship, his face darkened.","He didn’t expect Babidi to catch up with them so quickly.","This was going to get lively.","One wrong move and they could perish.","“Hehe... You guys sure run fast!”","Splash!","The hatch opened, and Babidi stepped out first.","Chi Jiuxiao and Dylan also walked out of the cabin behind him.","The likes of Hun Tian followed suit, feeling the powerful auras from the outside, not only did","their brows furrow, but there was also fear in their eyes.","But Babidi didn’t care, and Chi Jiuxiao completely ignored those people.","Even Universe Masters at the Eight Tribulations realm, despite having limitless divine power, were only at the peak of the Eight Tribulations realm in terms of combat power."]},{"number":5949,"title":"Chapter 5949: Never","paragraphs":["Chapter 5949: Never","Chi Jiuxiao was at the Half-Step Nine Tribulation realm.","After the sky city’s transformation, Chi Jiuxiao’s divine power had become unfathomable, reaching a level where he could rival the Nine Tribulation realm.","It was far beyond what several Universe Masters could handle.","“Who are you people?” Chaoge frowned, his gaze fixed on Chi Jiuxiao, unable to gauge the depth of his power but sensing a shroud of death surrounding him.","This realization prompted Chaoge to immediately relay a message to the three great divine spirits of the Immortal Divine Temple.","Ignoring Chaoge, Babidi calmly stated, “Jian Wushuang, I’ll give you one last chance. Hand over the Danbao and become my servant, and I might spare your life!”","“Never!” Jian Wushuang was resolute, his heart as unyielding as iron.","He’d rather die than become a servant. With his second soul, he could start anew if needed.","Treasure could be forsaken, but freedom and future were non-negotiable.","Becoming a servant meant eternal bondage.","Despite fearing Chi Jiuxiao’s strength, they had ample manpower.","They had at least six Universe Masters and figures like the Southern Saint King.","Gathering ten peak Eight Tribulation realm experts was not an issue.","They could withstand Chi Jiuxiao.","“There’s nothing more to discuss then!” Babidi sneered coldly and waved his hand menacingly.","Suddenly, Chi Jiuxiao’s figure expanded, towering like a majestic mountain in the Universe Sea, emanating a crimson aura.","His divine power momentarily surged, breaking through 15 million.","This startled both Chaoge and the Southern Saint King.","They realized that this mysterious newcomer was connected to Jian Wushuang and the others. Before they could inquire further, Danbao stepped forward and exclaimed, “Babidi, you’ve destroyed my Source of Life, and now you seek to destroy the very essence of Wanliu’s life?” This statement not only puzzled Babidi but also shocked the native powerhouses present. Source of Life? Essence of Life!","To Babidi, Danbao’s words didn’t seem entirely wrong.","Chi Jiuxiao was the one who destroyed Danbao’s Shield of Life, a direct connection to him. But the Source of Life within Wanliu and the Stairway to Godhood were his ultimate goals. No one could hinder him.","Therefore, he didn’t find Danbao’s words particularly significant.","He thought Danbao was simply unwilling to accept his fate and was venting before death.","However, to Jian Wushuang and the others, it wasn’t so simple.","Danbao’s words weren’t directed at Babidi but at Chaoge and the others.","After hearing this covert revelation, Chaoge and the Southern Saint King began to feel uneasy.","They glanced at Danbao and chose to relay a message to Jian Wushuang.","“At this juncture, if you remain silent, we’ll wash our hands of this!”","Southern Saint King felt they were being played by Jian Wushuang and the others, his expression a mix of anger and cunning, though deep down, he still intended to deceive Jian Wushuang.","Upon hearing this, Jian Wushuang inwardly sneered, though his expression instantly changed to one of shock.","He hurriedly sent a message, pretending to be frightened, “Respected Seniors, it’s not that I wanted to conceal this, but the matter is too significant, involving the fate of the Higher Heavens and the entire Great Sky Dome World. As you’ve heard, their plan is to destroy the entire essence of Wanliu, the source of this spacetime. If that happens, we’ll all be doomed!”","“Humph! You, a Universe Master at the Sixth Tribulation realm... You expect us to risk our lives based on just your words?” Chaoge’s expression shifted, clearly dissatisfied with Jian Wushuang’s statement and wanting to know more.","Although his demeanor showed such defiance, deep down, he was profoundly shocked.","It concerned the origin of the entire spacetime.","In fact, they had long suspected.","This place might be within the universe of some super powerhouse.","They just couldn’t break through.","Now, after hearing Jian Wushuang’s words, they were starting to understand.","“If you don’t believe, you can go feel Danbao’s Origin Source for yourself, and see if his body really contains what you call the Source of Life!”","Jian Wushuang paused, reminding Danbao to reveal his Source of Life.","Then he continued, “He is Life, and Life is Danbao. If he dies, the Source of Life will","disappear. Don’t believe it? You can try!”","Chaoge, along with Southern Saint King and the other Universe Masters at the Eighth Tribulation realm, all turned to look at Danbao.","By now, Danbao had already taken out the Life sphere he had refined, with faint cracks on its surface due to Chi Jiuxiao’ attack.","Seeing that sphere, Chaoge’s gaze focused, and thunder seemed to echo in his heart.","He directly transmitted this scene to the three great divine spirits within the Immortal Divine Temple.","Upon seeing the sphere, the three divine spirits in the Immortal Divine Temple also had their expressions drastically changed.","“This...”","The three of them only paused for a second after seeing the sphere before their figures","flashed, directly entering the core of the Immortal Divine Temple.","There was a huge altar there.","On the altar, there was a groove.","That groove was where the power of Life was born.","Now it was desolate.","Above the altar, there was also a huge platform.","Once, the three great divine spirits had spared no effort to enshrine their divine images on it,","but they couldn’t succeed.","They didn’t pay much attention to this.","Instead, they had a burning gaze towards the sphere in Danbao’s hand.","“We must obtain it!”","“But...!”","Jiang Wuyan flicked his robe, shouting angrily, “There’s no ‘but.’ No matter what connection","he has with the Origin Source in the depths of the Universe Sea, we must snatch that sphere. Even if this place collapses, even if what Jian Wushuang said about the Wanliu World Willows","is true, so what?”","If they were really just surviving within the universe of some powerhouse, then there would","be no further hope.","Only by breaking out could they stand tall.","If the Wanliu World were destroyed, so be it. They could leave with the treasures!","By then, what relation would this place have to them?","For the sake of becoming stronger, let alone their hometown worlds, even beloved ones could","be abandoned.","At their level.","Some things were no longer satisfying.","Only greater unknowns could excite them.","“Let’s go all out!”","The three of them spoke in unison, as if they were one person.","At this moment, the Immortal Divine Temple also began to stir.","Ready to teleport at any time.","Jian Wushuang and the others in the depths of the Universe Sea were unaware of the thoughts","of the three great divine spirits.","At this moment, Jian Wushuang had portrayed Danbao as the savior of the Wanliu World.","It wasn’t fabricated by him, but true.","However, to prevent Chaoge and the others from suspecting, he still concealed his identity","from the outside world.","“You guys step back, leave this to us!”","Chaoge had already received the divine message from the three great divine spirits to protect","Danbao.","As for Chi Jiuxiao?","They had ways to hold him back.","As long as the three great divine spirits came, they could fight.","The terrifying divine power of the three great divine spirits, everyone remembered."]},{"number":5950,"title":"Chapter 5950: The Battle of Universe Sea (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 5950: The Battle of Universe Sea (1)","“Get ready!”","Babidi’s eyes darted, catching Jian Wushuang and the others communicating through voice transmission.","Though he was confident in Chi Jiuxiao’s strength, he still feared unexpected incidents.","After all, he had encountered such accidents many times before.","He failed to capture them in the Wanliu Divine Realm and almost seized the Danbao in the City of the Sky, only to have them escape again.","This time, he didn’t want his plans to be ruined again.","For the sake of controlling the path to resurrection.","He had waited too long for this.","At the end of the path of resurrection, there was something he desired.","That thing even made Mie Sheng tremble with fear.","Once obtained, he could return to the Starry Sky.","Look down upon everything, and reclaim what he had lost.","Boom!","Chi Jiuxiao surged forward on endless seawater.","The power emanating from his divine power could crush even the top experts of the Eight Tribulation realm.","Now, only the peak experts of the Eight Tribulation realm could barely contend with Chi Jiuxiao.","And it would take a group of them.","The six Universe Masters of the Immortal Divine Temple acted first.","The armor on Chaoge’s body emitted endless light, illuminating the sea area, and his divine power surged to 12 million.","At the same time, the Dao Arena descended.","It crashed into the Universe Sea.","With the blessing of divine power, it had reached 14 million.","He was the strongest among the Universe Masters of the Eight Tribulation present!","“Shang Luo Spear!”","With a wave of Chaoge’s hand, a sharply black spear appeared in his hand, surrounded by countless thunderbolts and gathering endless Universe Origin Source.","The spear swung, sweeping through the endless seawater.","Straight towards Chi Jiuxiao.","Hum!","Feeling the endless power contained above the spear, Chi Jiuxiao not only did not panic but was somewhat excited.","He directly clasped his hands and stood in front of Chaoge, allowing the latter to manipulate as he pleased.","Not only did his divine power not weaken, it surged to 16 million.","Chaoge’s arms were somewhat numb from the shock, he tried everything he could, but couldn’t even injure the other party.","“Attack together!”","Now, he was somewhat at a loss, calling everyone to attack together, and also secretly communicating with the three great divine spirits.","He originally thought the three great divine spirits would use the Immortal Divine Temple to teleport over.","But at this moment, the three great divine spirits, hearing about Chi Jiuxiao’s formidable strength, wanted to conserve enough Life force, so they didn’t directly teleport to this place using the Immortal Divine Temple.","Instead, they teleported to the teleportation array.","Relying on the teleportation array’s transmission, they could save a lot of Life force.","But just because of this saving, several Eight Tribulation realm experts fell in an instant on the battlefield here.","The Scattered Tribulation experts brought by Southern Saint King directly became cannon fodder.","The top forces of the Eight Tribulation realm had not even come into contact with Chi Jiuxiao before being crushed by his aura.","They didn’t have the Life force to restore their divine bodies, so they fell on the spot.","Southern Saint King felt palpitations and stayed behind to protect Jian Wushuang and the others, not daring to approach.","At this moment, they finally witnessed Chi Jiuxiao’s terror.","“Ha!”","Chi Jiuxiao stretched out his hands and shouted angrily.","He truly began to act.","Despite his towering figure, he was extremely agile.","Shuttling through spacetime.","Ignoring those Dao Arenas.","He could even break through the spacetime of the Universe Sea.","Those Dao Arenas of the Universe Masters of the Eight Tribulation could easily be torn apart","by him.","Although they could sustain themselves with the Origin Source Universe, it had been torn apart, causing significant losses to them.","Their foundational reserves were nearly depleted.","“If the divine spirits don’t come soon, we’re finished!” someone’s face revealed despair.","Because Chi Jiuxiao’s divine power was still soaring.","Hissing...","The tearing of spacetime caused a universe to collapse instantly.","An Eighth Tribulation Universe Master became a Scattered Tribulation, losing their own","Origin Source Universe.","This scene left Jian Wushuang and the others speechless.","Chaoge didn’t have time to look, only feeling a chill down his spine, and as he turned, he saw","the terrifying face of Chi Jiuxiao.","He hastily retreated in fear.","Babidi reminded from the side, “Stop playing around, hurry and kill them!”","Although Chi Jiuxiao had been effortlessly crushing everything in his path, Babidi still felt","uneasy.","He felt like something was watching them!","But he couldn’t pinpoint where.","And the owner of those eyes seemed familiar.","It was something he had encountered in the Starry Sky.","Something that shouldn’t be present here.","So he couldn’t help but worry.","That presence was indeed surrounding them.","Only Babidi felt a palpitation, not from the presence, but from a premonition.","Neither Jian Wushuang nor Danbao noticed, but at this moment in the secret realm, some","subtle changes were occurring.","The withered grass and dilapidated trees were now covered in countless silver threads.","These threads were silver throughout.","They couldn’t be captured by the naked eye.","But they were incredibly fast.","Soon, they covered all the withered wood.","“Hmm?”","Divine Wood King was the first to notice something was amiss.","He had been using Thought power to observe the battle in the outside world, and seeing Chi","Jiuxiao’s dominance, he felt nervous.","According to his and Jian Wushuang’s plan, it was almost time to make a move.","But Chi Jiuxiao’s strength made them hesitate.","They feared that if they went out, they would be completely wiped out.","They wanted to wait a bit longer.","However, while waiting, they noticed changes in the dead wood in front of them.","There was no aura above them originally, but now, there was a special vitality.","The silver lines became more and more apparent.","Just as Divine Wood King lowered his head to look, a howl came from behind him.","“Ah!!”","This startled everyone, and they quickly turned to look.","Even Divine Wood King, who had been observing the withered wood, turned to look.","They saw a Seventh Tribulation strongman, now covered in silver threads that filled his eyeballs, causing him to scream in agony.","This person was a close friend of Lian Xing. Naturally, Lian Xing wouldn’t just stand by.","He rushed forward to help, but was stopped by Lord Hengmu.","“Let Zuo Yehui handle it!”","Lord Hengmu’s expression was stern.","Lian Xing paused for a moment, then stopped.","Zuo Yehui was a war beast, similar to a puppet, whose body had been modified.","If there was real danger, it wouldn’t backlash.","Whoosh!","After receiving the command, Zuo Yehui stepped forward and directly approached the","Seventh Tribulation strongman.","Its claws were about to touch him, but before they could, the silver threads extended along","Zuo Yehui’s claws.","“Not good!”","Lord Hengmu’s expression changed drastically as he raised his hand to attack.","This startled everyone.","They felt Lord Hengmu was overreacting a bit.","Attacking at this moment might injure their own people.","But before they could persuade him, they saw the Seventh Tribulation strongman, who had","been initially entangled by the silver threads, actually turning into silver."]},{"number":5951,"title":"Chapter 5951: The Battle of Universe Sea (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 5951: The Battle of Universe Sea (2)","The constitution of Life was instantly altered.","The whole person transformed into a silver puppet, unexpectedly breaking through Zuo Yehui’s chest with a single punch.","It’s worth noting that Zuo Yehui is one of the top war beasts in the Eight Tribulation realm. To break through Zuo Yehui’s divine body with just one punch was terrifying beyond belief.","Even peak experts in the Eight Tribulation realm would find it difficult to accomplish. Buzz!","At this moment, Lord Hengmu made his move, albeit a bit late, hastily shouting, “Stop standing there dumbfounded, quickly kill him, or we’ll all be done for!”","“Don’t get close to those withered trees!” Divine Wood King at this moment remembered the silver lines he had just seen on the withered trees and was the first to soar into the air.","The Great Monk, who had originally been sitting on a wooden stump, stood up upon hearing the warning, turned around, and smashed the stump he had been sitting on into powder with a raised hand.","Within the powder, however, countless silver threads emerged, rushing toward the Great Monk.","For a moment, everyone was in chaos.","With the first one controlled, several other Seventh Tribulation realm experts were subsequently controlled by the silver threads, launching indiscriminate attacks on those before them.","The cave secret realm was completely thrown into chaos.","And beneath the cave secret realm, they were unaware that there was still a silver pyramid hidden.","The pyramid continued to choose, and the silver threads emerged from it.","This time, there was no need for external experts to attack; the cave secret realm began to crumble on its own.","Divine Wood King and the others also took the opportunity to flee.","Compelled, facing the unknown fear, they would rather confront Chi Jiuxiao.","Outside the cave secret realm.","Jian Wushuang and the others, who had been suppressed by Chi Jiuxiao’s divine power, only now realized that the cave secret realm had silently shattered.","And countless silver threads were spreading out from the cave secret realm.","“What’s this?”","Wu Li looked at the threads, somewhat puzzled.","Danbao, however, immediately sensed something amiss, fear appearing in his eyes like never before, and turned to Jian Wushuang, shouting loudly, “Quick, run!”","Before Jian Wushuang could react, several voices shouted in unison.","“Master, run!”","“Jian Wushuang, take Danbao and go!”","“Hurry...”","Countless shouts left Jian Wushuang with no time to think.","He grabbed Danbao and immediately unleashed the Three Quake Universe, even forgetting about Wu Li beside him.","And Southern Saint King.","He had no idea what was happening.","In an instant, however, the cave secret realm shattered, a group of unfamiliar experts rushed out, and then they saw Jian Wushuang running away behind them.","Only Wu Li remained dumbfounded.","But with a blink of an eye, even Wu Li disappeared from sight.","Looking up, being carried by a bald old monk, he had already fled far away.","The silver threads, however, rushed toward the nearest Tribulation realm expert.","Although Southern Saint King didn’t know what these threads were, he didn’t dare to take it lightly and quickly retreated.","Chaoge and the others were still battling Chi Jiuxiao. Seeing Jian Wushuang fleeing with Danbao and then glancing back at the shattered cave secret realm, they were somewhat at a loss.","These people were still kept in the dark.","But Babidi recognized those silver threads.","Or rather, he recognized the silver pyramid within the shattered cave secret realm.","“Damn it!” Babidi clenched his small claws, staring angrily at the silver pyramid, and","shouted, “Chi Jiuxiao, come back!”","Jian Wushuang had already fled with Danbao; he didn’t want to confront that silver pyramid.","Although he had confidence, it was still quite tricky.","He wanted Danbao, not trouble with someone else.","Upon hearing Babidi’s words, Chi Jiuxiao was about to break away. In fact, breaking away was as simple as turning back. Chaoge and the other Universe Masters were completely on the defensive, just struggling to hold their ground.","If they could withstand it, that would be considered lucky.","Everything happened too quickly, in just a few breaths.","If it had been any slower, they might have perished.","Boom!","The sound of the cave secret realm shattering finally came.","The speed of sound was vastly different from the speed of light.","They had just seen the cave secret realm shatter, took a breath, and only then did they hear this deafening explosion.","Chi Jiuxiao didn’t take a step forward when he felt a piercing pain in his back.","It was the same sensation as when he faced Jian Wushuang’s reincarnation sword last time.","“Damn!”","Chi Jiuxiao erupted in complete fury.","Ignoring everything, he unleashed numerous rainbow-colored beams from his hands,","blasting towards the shattered secret realm behind him.","Amidst the blaze, one could see dozens of silver puppets standing amidst the broken realm,","along with a silver pyramid.","Above the pyramid, there was a triangular crystal from which an attack had just burst out,","stinging Chi Jiuxiao.","Buzz!","Facing Chi Jiuxiao’s frenzied assault, the pyramid emitted continuous buzzing noises.","Several halos flickered around it.","Babidi saw Chi Jiuxiao going berserk and shouted loudly, “Don’t attack it!”","But the warning came too late.","All of Chi Jiuxiao’s attacks were absorbed by the pyramid.","Now, beneath the pyramid, a pitch-black opening appeared. After a buzzing sound, countless metallic insects surged out of the opening.","Each of those metallic insects possessed divine power in the millions.","There were tens of thousands of metallic insects in total.","If they were to escape, they could destroy the entire Ancient Moon Spacetime.","Even the entire Northern Spacetime could face annihilation.","Chaoge and the others had just breathed a sigh of relief and were about to transmit their","message to the three great divine spirits.","Mainly because they weren’t sure what had happened-suddenly, the secret realm shattered, and a group of unfamiliar powerhouses emerged, seeming to know Jian Wushuang, and then","they ran away.","The key was they couldn’t stop them.","Now, seeing those metallic insects, they felt utterly hopeless.","“Divine spirits, come quickly!” Chaoge’s throat was almost torn apart.","Metallic insects filled the sky.","They obscured the sun. The divine power on the insects overshadowed the Universe Sea.","Babidi furrowed his brow. After calling Chi Jiuxiao back, he led everyone directly into the","cosmic ship.","Hun Tian and the others didn’t know what had happened, but seeing Babidi’s expression, they","didn’t dare to ask.","Looking at the ugly scene through the cosmic ship’s window, Babidi’s expression softened, and he said coldly, “There’s no need to be afraid. As long as we don’t attack that silver pyramid, there’s no threat. The divine power of these metallic insects is only temporary. I’m afraid if they’re attacked a few times at will, their divine power will dry up!” “Could it be that the divine power of these metallic insects comes from Chi Jiuxiao’s attacks?” The realization dawned on the crowd at this moment.","Babidi nodded and said, “Correct, it comes from Chi Jiuxiao’s attacks!”","“This...!” Hun Tian gasped in shock, then continued, “To think that such heaven-defying","means exist in this world!”","Absorbing Chi Jiuxiao’s attacks and then converting them into their own divine power to","create those metallic insects.","And there were tens of thousands of them.","Chi Jiuxiao’s attack just now lasted only a moment."]},{"number":5952,"title":"Chapter 5952: The Battle of Universe Sea (3)","paragraphs":["Chapter 5952: The Battle of Universe Sea (3)","Even though in an instant, it might unleash a million attacks, it’s impossible to absorb and convert them all completely!","It’s akin to devouring, but the conversion rate is only 20 percent!","“It’s not a life form from your timeline, so it can’t be speculated with common sense. There are things you don’t know. This silver pyramid should come from another timeline. I’ve encountered similar life forms in the Starry Sky before, seems to be from the Southern Spacetime!” Babidi recalled slightly and gave an answer.","There wasn’t much worry about this.","Although attacking the pyramid would only make it stronger, there were ways to crack it. One way is to break through with sheer force.","As long as the divine power is strong enough, everything can be destroyed naturally.","Perhaps only a Ninth Tribulation realm expert could do this.","Currently, Chi Jiuxiao is not strong enough to break it.","But there are other ways.","Sealing!","Suppression!","Or entering the interior of the pyramid to destroy the metal lifeform controlling it. These are all methods.","As for those metal crawlers, although each possesses millions of divine powers, they are extremely fragile because they lack divine bodies, only having divine power.","Although their attack power is high, they have no defense whatsoever.","Not to mention Chi Jiuxiao, even those Universe Masters from the outside world can kill a large group of them in one go.","But with tens of thousands of them, it’s not worth it to trade lives.","Even if it’s one for a hundred.","At this time, Chaoge and the others also noticed that although the attacks of the metal crawlers were powerful, they had no defense at all.","The Shang Luo Spear was swung in a wide arc, sweeping away a large swath of them, but being surrounded by those metal crawlers still posed a risk of falling.","But they could barely manage.","And at this moment, ripples suddenly appeared in the surrounding spacetime, and a majestic palace loomed faintly.","The Immortal Divine Temple is about to descend!","“Let’s go!”","After seeing the shadow of the temple, Babidi manipulated the cosmic ship and chased after Jian Wushuang and the others.","The speed of the cosmic ship was not slow. In just a blink of an eye, it rushed out of this battlefield, causing waves of thousands of feet to rise in the sea below.","The Immortal Divine Temple descends.","The three major divine spirits were ready to take action, but they didn’t see the mysterious strong person mentioned by Chaoge and the others, nor Jian Wushuang and the others.","They could only reluctantly deal with those metal insects.","But crucially, they didn’t know that they couldn’t attack the pyramid!","...","In the depths of the universe sea.","An elliptical light spot kept flickering and shrinking.","Every blink would change its position.","But the distance in between was extremely far.","If an Eighth Tribulation realm expert simply flew, it would take an hour.","Even a Universe Master would need a quarter of an hour.","But the light spot only needed a breath.","This is the Three Quake Universe travel technique.","It’s the peak secret method newly improved by Jian Wushuang.","These three epochs.","Not only have they revamped the secret method of Universe Supertravel.","Even his Super Eternal Ancient Transformation has improved a lot.","But it’s still far from the full-powered Super Eternal Ancient Transformation.","The current enhancement is only 70 times.","The complete Super Eternal Ancient Transformation will reach a hundredfold.","That’s the strongest transformation.","“Danbao, do you think that pyramid just now is a metal lifeform?” Jian Wushuang asked while traversing the universe.","Danbao, who was extremely sensitive to such matters, complied with the inheritance information from the source of life and knew the origin of the pyramid and its function inside.","He told Jian Wushuang about it.","After listening, Jian Wushuang, like Hun Tian and the others, had a somewhat dazed look.","Such heaven-defying means.","In his view, it’s impossible.","But in the distant Southern Spacetime, it’s commonplace.","“Benefactor, don’t worry too much. I can see that the Metal Origin Source inside that pyramid is very fragile. If we can enter the interior of the pyramid, it’s easy to defeat them. As for those metal crawler insects, without divine bodies but only some weak Life force contained in the thin metal, as well as absorbing Chi Jiuxiao’s divine power, even if we don’t attack them, they won’t pose a threat even if they act a few times!” Danbao explained calmly.","Jian Wushuang nodded, taking a breath before speaking, “There must be something else that made you so anxious to make me escape just now.”","The transformation of Danbao had indeed been significant, indicating the possibility of even more terrifying events unfolding.","At that moment, before Danbao could explain, they both felt a violent force sweeping in from","behind.","Even from such a distance, it managed to affect the two of them.","The Great Monk and others further back were almost engulfed by the storm.","Babidi’s control over the cosmic ship nearly faltered, barely managing to hold steady.","This wave of turbulence spread throughout the depths of the universe sea.","At the outer edges of the cosmos, the waters began to recede.","This was the divine power being consumed by the Universe Sea.","Danbao glanced down at the descending sea of divine power, speaking solemnly, “This is the core of the Wanliu Universe. Metal lifeforms are not tolerated here. Once the universe sea detects them, it automatically protects the Origin Source, using the divine power of the sea to eliminate the threat.”","“This is a fortunate turn of events. Does this mean we don’t need to worry about that metal lifeform anymore?” Jian Wushuang’s expression brightened.","But he had misunderstood.","He thought Danbao was concerned they might be caught in the vortex of self-purification","within the universe sea.","Upon hearing Jian Wushuang’s words, Danbao shook his head with a wry smile, “It’s not that","simple!”","“That silver pyramid can absorb divine power attacks, naturally, it can absorb the divine","power sea!”","As soon as these words were spoken, Jian Wushuang suddenly understood.","His figure trembled, muttering to himself, “No wonder... no wonder that pyramid would hide","in a cave secret realm instead of drifting in the Universe Sea. Last time, when we found it, it was just outside a cave secret realm, and this time, it entered the cave secret realm, absorbing life and divine power within, concealing itself from being cleared by the Law Rules above the","Universe Sea!”","However, there was one thing he didn’t quite understand, but he had a guess.","“Danbao, if you step onto the Stairway of Godhood, will it interfere with the Law Rules of the","Universe Sea?”","Danbao understood what he meant, nodding, “Yes, once I step onto the stairway, I’m afraid the Law Rules of the Universe Sea will collapse. By then, that silver pyramid can devour the divine power sea without restraint. Perhaps before I become a god, endless metal serpents will be born on the other side, destroying everything. The stairway will also shatter. This is what Realm King is worried about, so he wants us to kill that metal lifeform first.”","This time, Jian Wushuang fully understood.","No wonder Realm King was so worried.","It wasn’t just about the divine power sea.","The paradises that drifted from the depths of the Origin Source were the same.","They were all part of the Wanliu Origin Source.","If the strong from the Immortal Divine Temple or the Higher Heavens took them away, they’d","be gone.","They were their own people.","They were also part of the Wanliu Origin Source.","The three divine spirits foolishly thought that by taking treasures, they could ignore the fate","of their homeland.","Once the Wanliu Divine Tree collapsed, all life nurtured by it would perish.","The downfall of the Higher Heavens represented everything."]},{"number":5953,"title":"Chapter 5953: The Immortal Divine Temple Descends","paragraphs":["Chapter 5953: The Immortal Divine Temple Descends","The silver-gilded pyramid, possibly originating from the Higher Heavens, had devoured a portion of its essence, causing all the strong beings from there to vanish completely.","Jian Wushuang shook off the drag from the vortex behind him and came to a halt.","Facing the metallic lifeforms was inevitable.","Escaping wasn’t an option!","The rules of the Universe Sea weren’t sufficient to clear that pyramid.","At most, they could clear out those metallic crawlers.","Initially, when Jian Wushuang sensed those crawlers, he felt like the sky was falling and thought the entire Northern Spacetime was doomed.","But upon understanding everything, suddenly, it didn’t seem so daunting anymore.","Compared to Chi Jiuxiao, at least they could still flee.","“Let’s wait for the Great Monk and the others!”","Once everyone was together, they could discuss a plan.","Currently, all sides were in motion.","The biggest threat was actually Chi Jiuxiao.","Then came the metallic lifeforms.","Lastly, there was the Immortal Divine Temple.","For now, the Immortal Divine Temple was beneficial to them.","They could cooperate with the other side.","This way, it would be a united front.","With the Immortal Divine Temple on their side, they could deal with the metallic lifeforms or Babidi and his ilk together.","Babidi wouldn’t collaborate with the metallic lifeforms.","Both Babidi and the metallic lifeforms were lone wolves.","If they hadn’t offended Babidi too severely before, there might have been a chance to team up with him against the metallic lifeforms.","Unity was Jian Wushuang’s specialty.","After stopping for a short while, the vortex began to slow down.","They didn’t foolishly wait around; instead, they turned around to find Elder Blu and the others.","Just a few breaths later, they saw the gathering of people.","This time, many had fallen.","It could also be said that many had been controlled by the silver-gilded pyramid.","Now, there were only about a dozen people left.","Each one still bore injuries.","Just as they gathered, Danbao was about to help them recover.","This time, Jian Wushuang took the initiative to stop him and personally helped everyone restore their divine power and vitality.","He wasn’t as reliant on the power of Life as Danbao; without it, Danbao would truly become useless.","Over the years, he had recovered quite a bit, but he still hadn’t restored the Source of Life. “Alas!”","Lord Hengmu squatted on the side, sighing.","Although everyone’s breath had stabilized, they still felt somewhat hopeless in the face of the current situation.","It was only when Jian Wushuang personally explained the origin and background of the silver-gilded pyramid that the atmosphere eased a bit.","It wasn’t that their resilience was lacking.","The scene just now would have even made the current Grand Pope of the Ancient Moon Temple too frightened to move.","Suddenly, tens of thousands of divine power metal monsters appeared.","Who wouldn’t be afraid?","“Brother Wushuang, did you come back suddenly because you have a plan?” Divine Wood King spoke up, and many people looked over.","All eyes turned to Jian Wushuang.","“A plan!” Jian Wushuang took a deep breath. He hadn’t actually thought of a plan yet, but with so many people looking at him, he became even more nervous and couldn’t think of one. So, he turned to look at Danbao.","Seeing Danbao’s blank expression, he regretted it. Just as he was about to come up with a lie to stabilize everyone, something suddenly came to his mind.","A grand hall!","The Immortal Divine Temple.","The absolute treasure of the Great Sky Dome World.","“The Immortal Divine Temple!” Jian Wushuang blurted out, then looked at Danbao and said, “Danbao, didn’t you say there’s something resonating with your Source of Life inside the Immortal Divine Temple?”","“Yes!” Danbao didn’t understand what he meant, just nodded dumbly.","Buzz!","He had also sensed resonance from the Immortal Divine Temple.","It was similar to the resonance with the Skysight Heavenly Chessboard.","Perhaps the Immortal Divine Temple was much stronger than the Skysight Heavenly Chessboard, but he had felt the resonance, which indicated that the Immortal Divine Temple","was a Temporal Treasure.","Danbao also felt the resonance from above, related to the power of Life.","A Temporal Treasure.","A Life Treasure.","Danbao could feel the resonance, most likely because of the life treasure he had refined.","They all could feel it.","Jian Wushuang refused to believe that the three divine spirits couldn’t feel it.","If it weren’t for this resonance, why would they imprison them?","Plus, Danbao had actively brought out that treasure before.","The Immortal Divine Temple, after descending, didn’t find Jian Wushuang and the others’","whereabouts.","Instead, it first rescued Chaoge and the others.","Before clashing with the metallic crawlers, the Law Rules of the Universe Sea descended,","stirring up a storm.","Everyone took refuge in the Immortal Divine Temple.","The silver-gilded pyramid also took those Tribulation realm powerhouses transformed into","metallic puppets into the pyramid.","These metallic puppets weren’t transformed from divine power like the metallic crawler insects, but had true divine bodies and a constant stream of divine power.","After the transition from the Seventh Tribulation realm to the Eighth Tribulation realm, they possessed the peak power of the Eighth Tribulation realm.","Each divine power reached a level of 15 million, similar to the peak state of Great Monk and","Divine Wood King.","However, the metallic lifeforms inside the silver pyramid, controlling the metallic puppets,","were limited to only ten.","The rest were killed.","This was good news for Jian Wushuang and his companions.","After consolidating their forces, they still had hope.","Of course, they relied on the Immortal Divine Temple.","At this moment, the Immortal Divine Temple was deep within the vortex.","The three great divine spirits inside the hall remained calm.","The external divine power storms couldn’t interfere with the interior of the temple at all.","Being called the Immortal Divine Temple and being a treasure of spacetime, how could it not withstand such attacks?","“Give me three breaths of time, and I can lock onto Jian Wushuang’s aura. He’s with Danbao, and we can teleport over!” Jiang Wuya manipulated the Immortal Divine Temple, his brow furrowed as he searched for Jian Wushuang’s specific location amidst the chaotic divine power","storm.","Teleportation by the temple consumed a vast amount of energy.","This time, they teleported here not for the metallic lifeforms but for Danbao.","Unfortunately, like Babidi and his group, they also came up empty-handed. But at least they could teleport to lock onto Jian Wushuang and the others.","Babidi and his group were truly in a sorry state.","Despite having the strongest force, Chi Jiuxiao, they repeatedly failed.","This made Babidi extremely frustrated as he tried to break free from the storm and locate Jian","Wushuang and the others.","With Chi Jiuxiao’s powerful Thought power, he directly covered half of the universe.","This time, Jian Wushuang and the others truly had no way to escape.","They were besieged by two powerful opponents.","Yet, Jian Wushuang remained calm.","He knew the Immortal Divine Temple could teleport.","At this moment, he deliberately exposed his aura to lure the Immortal Divine Temple over.","And this time, he didn’t seek cooperation.","It wasn’t because he was confident in himself, but because he trusted Danbao. “Danbao, this time it’s up to you!” Jian Wushuang glanced at Danbao. He truly had no other","solution this time. He couldn’t always rely on gambling; if it went wrong, they would all","perish.","Danbao was a candidate for the God of Life, and there were some things that Danbao had to accomplish on his own."]},{"number":5954,"title":"Chapter 5954: I See the End of the Road","paragraphs":["Chapter 5954: I See the End of the Road","Relying on others wasn’t an option.","Jian Wushuang once relied on his teacher, but their departure taught him greater resilience.","He endured his time in the Great Si Region.","Especially before entering the Great Si Region, witnessing Ding Baiyi’s peerless","swordsmanship fueled his aspirations even more.","Some people are just passersby.","Yet they leave behind boundless aspirations and an upward perseverance.","Wanting to become stronger.","Requires one’s own efforts.","Danbao was actually quite fortunate.","From an unknown youngster to soaring heights.","Becoming a god!","Wasn’t this a leap?","To Jian Wushuang, it was the greatest leap.","And the greatest opportunity.","From one small world to another, he gradually glimpsed the truth of the universe.","The universe, spacetime, the Starry Sky.","Everything became clear, the path lay ahead.","To become powerful, one must keep moving forward.","Just like this time entering the Wanliu Divine Tree.","Originally, he had reasons not to enter.","Was it just because of Weiss’s words?","Or because of the “Extreme Freedom Intent Technique!”","Neither!","It was his own desire for adventure.","That was what mattered most.","Jian Wushuang scanned the crowd and said in a low voice, “Everyone, elevate your aura to the highest!”","Buzz!","Though uncertain, everyone complied.","Divine Wood King and the Great Monk, two pinnacle Eighth Tribulation realm powerhouses, erupted without reservation.","Divine power directly broke through 15 million.","Behind Divine Wood King, a huge vine, the Moyun Vine, surged into the sky.","Similarly erupting with the aura of the pinnacle Eighth Tribulation realm.","Currently, Divine Wood King exhibited the strongest combat power.","With the Moyun Vine at the pinnacle Eighth Tribulation realm.","Divine Wood King’s strength could overpower other Eighth Tribulation realm powerhouses, reaching the limit of the Eighth Tribulation realm.","If they progressed further, they would have half a step into the realm of the Ninth Tribulation.","They were the strongest among the powerful figures present, both in terms of foundation and potential.","After all, he was peak experts of the ancient Eight Tribulation realm, who had once refined Life Treasures.","And he also possessed the Moyun Vine.","As for the Great Monk, although his initial strength was formidable, his subsequent improvements were not significant.","Far from being comparable to Divine Wood King.","Now, he was already firmly suppressed by Divine Wood King.","However, he showed no signs of discontent, instead appearing quite indifferent.","The aura of everyone erupted.","The seawater below instantly boiled, divine power filled the surrounding space, and ripples of space oscillated around.","“Why haven’t they arrived yet?” Jian Wushuang frowned. Although he didn’t know much about the Immortal Divine Temple, he remembered that Chaoge and others had been very confident in the Immortal Divine Temple’s teleportation abilities.","It should have arrived by now, after two breaths.","Jian Wushuang believed that the teleportation should have been instantaneous.","And it was pretty close to what he thought.","The teleportation of the Immortal Divine Temple was indeed fast, but it required a vast amount of Life force to support it.","In the current Immortal Divine Temple, the Source of Life had already dried up, making it tricky to activate the fastest teleportation.","The most important thing was to capture the aura during teleportation.","Inside the temple.","Jiang Wuya poured all his Thought power into the Immortal Divine Temple, desperately trying to capture the divine aura of Jian Wushuang and the others.","They knew that Jian Wushuang could conceal his aura, so they were somewhat worried.","Fortunately, there were still some people whose aura couldn’t be hidden.","But when he used his mental power to search, he discovered a huge aura erupting above the universe sea, like a sun.","“Found it!” Jiang Wuya’s eyes flashed with excitement.","The two divine spirits beside him immediately mobilized the remaining Life force in the Immortal Divine Temple. Following Jiang Wuya’s locked position, they began to perform the","Immortal Teleportation.","Buzz!","The surrounding space collapsed actively.","This was even more intense than the storm that wiped out foreign entities in the sea of divine","power.","Space collapsed, time flowed backward.","The massive Immortal Divine Temple vanished in an instant without a trace.","Only the silver pyramid in the storm remained.","As for those metal insects, they had long been cleared away by the storm.","Outside the storm, Babidi’s manipulation of the cosmic ship also escaped the engulfing","storm.","Just after escaping, they sensed a powerful divine power fluctuation in the distance.","It was definitely not the innate divine power of the Universe Sea.","This point could still be analyzed by Babidi based on the information from Chi Jiuxiao.","Without hesitation, he manipulated the cosmic ship to burst at full speed towards the position of Jian Wushuang and the others.","Meanwhile, the Immortal Divine Temple had already subtly arrived.","The loud buzzing shook Jian Wushuang and the others continuously backward.","“They’re here!”","Jian Wushuang took a deep breath, looking at the almost tangible Immortal Divine Temple","that had instantly arrived before them.","The immense pressure and ancient buzzing made them all feel apprehensive.","This kind of power far surpassed his chessboard.","It could even be said that compared to this Immortal Divine Temple, the Skysight Heavenly Chessboard was like a baby meeting a martial arts master.","Everyone was stunned on the spot.","Originally, the strong ones who faced the Immortal Divine Temple, like Divine Wood King,","were still somewhat confident.","Because during the cave secret realm, he had seen Chaoge and others being abused by Chi","Jiuxiao.","They were all wary of Chi Jiuxiao and the later appearance of the silver pyramid.","But their attitude towards the Immortal Divine Temple had been rather ordinary.","Now, when they truly faced the Immortal Divine Temple, an indescribable fear arose in their","hearts.","It was as if they were facing a true god.","Words failed them.","“Jian Wushuang!”","A slender voice came from inside the temple. In a blink of an eye, three major deities emerged from the temple, accompanied by Chaoge and Southern Saint King.","Jiang Wuya took the lead, stepping directly in front of everyone. With a slight movement of","his mouth, he spoke in a cold tone, “So many guests have come, don’t you explain?”","After speaking, his eyes flashed like flowing light, looking at Jian Wushuang. “Great divine spirits, these...” Before he could finish, he felt a burning sensation erupting","from his heart.","His divine body was being consumed.","The methods of the three major divine spirits far exceeded his imagination.","It was not like Chi Jiuxiao’s simple crushing with divine power, but a special method that","tortured him.","Seeing Jian Wushuang’s painful expression, Danbao was about to step forward but was stopped by the Great Monk.","The pain of a cultivator was nothing compared to the tearing of the divine body.","Jian Wushuang gritted his teeth and shook his head at Danbao.","Now was not the time to act recklessly.","They still relied on Danbao to turn the tables later.","Otherwise, they would have no chance.","The strength of the three major divine spirits touched upon the realm of the Ninth","Tribulation, and with the Immortal Divine Temple, they could easily crush them.","Danbao closed his eyes slightly and endured it.","For him to become a god, how many people had perished?","At that moment, he didn’t know if his divine being had fulfilled its duty.","Wherever he went, there would be fighting, there would be death!","Was this really the true meaning of life?","In the instant Danbao closed his eyes, the level of Life underwent a qualitative change.","The green aura on his body erupted instantly.","Even the Immortal Divine Temple trembled along with it."]},{"number":5955,"title":"Chapter 5955: My Heart Is Dead for the Polunga Clan","paragraphs":["Chapter 5955: My Heart Is Dead for the Polunga Clan","Jiang Wuya glanced at Danbao, feeling surprised deep down, then nodded towards the rear.","It was time to take action!","But for safety’s sake, it was best to let Danbao willingly hand over the treasure.","Torturing Jian Wushuang alone wasn’t enough; Jiang Wuya noticed another person among the crowd who was related to Danbao.","Raising his finger, Jiang Wuya unleashed a burst of light.","Wherever the light reached, it shattered the void, aiming straight at Elder Blu’s face.","Unable to bear it any longer, Danbao stepped forward, shouting loudly, “What do you want? Just say it, it has nothing to do with them!”","Originally, the plan was to have him cooperate and enter the Immortal Divine Temple, but it seemed they had overestimated the patience of the three major divine spirits.","Now they were immediately pressuring Danbao to produce the Life Treasure.","Blu was aware of this, so facing the light, he roared angrily, transforming into the shadow of a dragon god, struggling to resist, while shouting to Danbao, “Don’t give up, remember what the Great Elder said!”","“For the survival of the Borun Clan, also known as the Polunga Clan!”","A familiar voice sounded, and Danbao turned to look at Blu. Behind Blu, he saw the figure of the Great Elder.","Encouraging him!","“After the destruction of the Polunga Clan and the fall of the Great Elder, my heart was already dead, and life has given me everything!” Danbao murmured, lowering his head.","The three major divine spirits, however, misunderstood and thought Danbao couldn’t hold on any longer. They then cast a forbidden spell at the Elder Blu and Divine Wood King, suppressing everyone in this spacetime.","Jiang Wuya behaved as if nothing had happened, calmly saying, “Danbao, the treasure inside you originally belonged to the Immortal Divine Temple. I hope you reconsider and don’t do anything useless!”","Implicitly, he didn’t want Danbao to resist and wanted him to hand over the treasure.","They had already shown excessive greed upon seeing the green light leaking from Danbao’s body.","But it was all sugar-coated words.","“Heh!” Danbao chuckled coldly, suddenly lifting his head, continuing, “You all don’t understand the true meaning of life. This treasure means nothing to you!”","As soon as he finished speaking, he turned his hand into claws and plunged it into his own chest.","Green blood flowed from his chest, traces of blood appearing at the corners of his mouth. His voice was hoarse, “If you want it, take it!”","With determination, Danbao dug out the green sphere from his chest.","This was not a phantom of the Life Treasure but the real Life Treasure.","The moment he took out the treasure, the green light on the staff in his hand dimmed.","Behind him, countless people fell into silence.","“No need for this!”","Jian Wushuang gritted his teeth, shaking his head.","For him, or for them, the treasure meant everything.","People could die, but treasures could never be handed over willingly.","It was no different from death.","Divine Wood King and Lord Hengmu were also surprised at Danbao.","Perhaps this was the gap.","Danbao, however, didn’t care.","He directly threw the treasure out, tossing it to Jiang Wuya.","As if treating the coveted Life Treasure, which countless people envied, as a clump of soil.","The three divine spirits saw the treasure flying towards them, their eyes instantly becoming fiery.","Jiang Wuya reached out and caught the treasure, finding nothing unusual, he was overjoyed.","He didn’t expect Danbao to be so straightforward.","It would have been better if he had been like this earlier.","“Now, can you let us go?” Danbao covered his chest, his voice weak.","The three divine spirits, excited after obtaining the treasure, no longer bothered to look at the crowd, casually waving their hands to lift the spatial restrictions around them.","The Immortal Divine Temple stabilized.","Just now, they had used the Domain around the Immortal Divine Temple to suppress","everyone.","Otherwise, it would have been somewhat difficult for the three divine spirits to deal with them without using force.","They were not like Babidi, they wouldn’t procrastinate.","They directly suppressed and demanded the treasure.","Effortlessly.","Poor Babidi was still trailing behind!","With a splash, the prohibition was lifted.","Everyone breathed a sigh of relief.","But deep down, there was a sense of unwillingness.","Even though Danbao had saved their lives this time by using his treasure, they felt no","gratitude.","This was the reality of the strong!","If Danbao didn’t become a god, they couldn’t embark on the path to resurrection.","Everything was over.","There was no hope in sight.","If only, from the beginning...","If there hadn’t been a path to resurrection from the start, if this had just been a simple","gathering, how much better it would have been!","If that were the case, even facing the withering of life and approaching the end would have","been better than now.","The most painful thing is like this.","The person who gave you hope, destroyed it with their own hands.","Especially Lord Hengmu and Divine Wood King.","That treasure, it was something they both pooled together.","Consider them the first investors in Danbao.","They even heavily invested.","But now Danbao has simply handed over the treasure to someone else.","How could they be resigned to this?","“You...” Divine Wood King pointed at Danbao, not knowing how to express himself, finally","just sighing.","But Lord Hengmu wasn’t as easy to talk to.","He grabbed Danbao by the collar, loudly questioning, “Have you gone mad? That was the opportunity to ascend to godhood, why did you just give it away?!”","Seeing Lord Hengmu take action, Elder Blu rushed forward.","Both he and Danbao are part of the Polunga Tribe.","The last wish of the Elder was for him to protect Danbao and leave the Infinite World, to","survive in the outside world.","So when Danbao gave away the treasure, he didn’t react.","Becoming a god or not becoming one, it doesn’t matter.","Being alive offers greater hope. Seeing Blu rushing to confront Lord Hengmu, Danbao shook his head.","Jian Wushuang, standing aside, didn’t show much change, just casually glancing at the Great","Monk.","This Great Monk, known as Danbao’s Dao Guardian, was standing there dumbly at the","moment, silent.","Like a beast about to go mad, emitting a tremendous aura.","The rest were still complaining about Danbao giving away the treasure.","Only Jian Wushuang noticed the Great Monk’s anomaly.","But now, facing the Immortal Divine Temple, they were already in a bind.","They couldn’t question it at this time.","Now that the Life Treasure was gone.","Godhood was hopeless.","Everyone was deflated.","Standing there at a loss.","Lian Xing seemed the most relaxed, as if he saw through everything, looking up at the sky","above the Universe Sea, saying casually, “It was just a dream, haha...”","“A dream?”","Was it really just a dream?","Jian Wushuang asked himself inwardly.","If it was a dream, then he had suffered a great loss.","Originally, he didn’t have much attachment to the internal affairs of Wanliu.","And Weiss only asked him to enter Wanliu to find treasures, not to help Danbao become the","God of Life.","As for the treasures promised by Realm King, he wasn’t very interested.","Anyway, he had made enough profit this time.","Becoming the Universe Master, no matter what, he would have the power of Life when he","went out, and he would be able to protect himself.","Completing the last wish of the Polunga tribe’s Elder was also not a problem.","Wu Li was the same."]},{"number":5956,"title":"Chapter 5956: Disband?","paragraphs":["Chapter 5956: Disband?","He was also the Universe Master of the Sixth Tribulation realm, and before coming here, he couldn’t have imagined becoming the Universe Master of the Sixth Tribulation realm.","The only two Universe Masters were surprisingly the most relaxed.","Parting ways!","They were now facing a breakup.","Feeling the aura of Babidi behind them, there was no surprise!","If they came, so be it!","It didn’t matter to them anyway.","Some people even thought about joining Babidi now.","Once human desires were unleashed, they were hard to conceal.","Danbao lost hope.","But there was still hope in Babidi.","Most importantly, Babidi still had Chi Jiuxiao.","They could fight against the Immortal Divine Temple.","Joining Babidi was also a way out.","They just worried that Babidi wouldn’t accept them.","With Chi Jiuxiao’s top-notch combat power, there was no need to recruit them, the Seventh Tribulation cultivators.","Pitiful!","Seeing the loss of color in those people, Jian Wushuang also felt pity for them.","But it didn’t concern him.","“Danbao, let’s prepare to leave here!” He walked towards Danbao and Blu. Lord Hengmu had already let go of Danbao and stood alone on the side, looking desolate.","No destination!","After comforting Danbao, Blu looked up at Jian Wushuang and asked, “Where are we going?”","“Leaving here!” Jian Wushuang said decisively.","He had just asked about the treasures that Weiss needed, but Weiss hadn’t answered.","It was better to leave the Universe Sea first and then figure things out.","If not, he could just go to Zhen Wuyang for refuge.","Cultivating in the Wanliu Universe for a while wouldn’t be a bad thing.","They could also search for the treasures Weiss needed.","Danbao kept his head down, but didn’t answer, his brows furrowed.","His consciousness wasn’t here.","Jian Wushuang’s eyes flickered, also noticing something unusual.","He wanted to say something but didn’t, instead, a strand of his consciousness flew towards the Immortal Divine Temple.","After the three divine spirits obtained the Life Treasure, they directly entered the central altar of the temple.","By now, they had placed the Life Treasures into the groove above the altar.","The round treasures of life fit perfectly into the groove without any gaps.","The moment they entered the groove, an infinitely powerful force of Life erupted above the altar.","This power shook the entire Immortal Divine Temple.","Jian Wushuang’s consciousness was just approaching the Immortal Divine Temple when it was shattered by the shock.","“Danbao...” He seemed to understand something, looking shocked at Danbao.","The Life Treasure.","After being refined by Danbao, it had long merged into one.","Realm King’s command had already been recognized.","How could it be snatched away like this!","It was always because they were too cautious, or rather, because they had protected Danbao too well.","“Can you still control that treasure?” Jian Wushuang didn’t dare to ask directly, instead, he transmitted his voice to Danbao.","If it were true, Danbao wouldn’t just lose the Life Treasure, he might even gain control of the Immortal Divine Temple for free.","Boom!","A muffled roar erupted inside the Immortal Divine Temple.","This time, without waiting for Danbao’s answer, Jian Wushuang confirmed his guess.","Hearing the commotion, everyone looked towards the temple.","Just like Jian Wushuang, they understood Danbao’s intentions.","Even a fool could see it now.","Because above the Immortal Divine Temple, a green light and shadow appeared.","The light and shadow had a human face, exactly like Danbao’s.","With a staff of life in hand, it was surrounded by green light.","It even enveloped the temple.","With a wave of his hand, he suppressed the temple.","Or rather, he controlled the temple himself.","The three divine spirits were completely dumbfounded.","They had originally thought that obtaining the Life Treasure would elevate the Immortal","Divine Temple to a higher level.","But they hadn’t expected to be making wedding clothes for others.","For a moment, the faces of the three divine spirits were like pig livers.","They were fuming.","“You dare to trick me?”","“How dare you...”","Squeak...","The three divine spirits were about to erupt in anger, but found they couldn’t even speak","properly, their voices squeaking like mice.","Danbao’s Dao Image was now seated above the altar.","It was called an altar, but now it looked more like a temple.","It was dedicated to the God of Life.","“Here, it never belonged to you!”","Danbao’s voice was cold and stern, his gaze piercing.","Countless bubbles surged, relocating the three great divine spirits, the ten divine generals,","and hundreds of slumbering Eighth Tribulation realm envoys onto the white slabs of the","Immortal Divine Temple.","Appearing before Jian Wushuang and the others.","At this moment, Danbao’s true form began to shatter.","His essence transformed into the god within the temple!","This immense metamorphosis.","Within the Immortal Divine Temple, Danbao was a true god, invincible.","The three great divine spirits were like toys, easily suppressed.","Jian Wushuang watched in astonishment. This ability to speak and create rules made him","exceedingly wary.","The three great divine spirits, once considered supremely powerful, were mere toys in","Danbao’s hands.","Their lives manipulated.","All disregarded!","“Whew!”","The Grand Monk’s eyes sparkled at this moment, more excited than anyone else. He raised his","arm and exclaimed loudly, “Let’s go, into the temple!”","He was the first to enter the temple, kneeling down and proclaiming, “Congratulations, Young Master, one step further and you will obtain the true god’s form!”","Witnessing this scene, many sighed inwardly, simultaneously regretting their slow reactions.","Even Lord Hengmu, who had just been complaining about Danbao, swiftly followed into the","temple and prostrated himself.","The divine manifestation!","Incredibly majestic.","Outside the temple, they felt only amazement.","But upon entering the temple and beholding Danbao’s god form, they found it unbelievable.","With endless power.","This was what they envisioned as divine.","Gods!","They should be like this.","Jian Wushuang and Elder Blu also entered the temple nonchalantly, experiencing tremendous","awe upon entering.","However, they did not kneel.","There was a difference in status!","If he knelt, wouldn’t it be a joke?","Inside the temple, Jian Wushuang simply stood aside casually, waiting for Danbao to deal","with the strong of the Immortal Divine Temple.","In his view, Danbao was the God of Life and should not make things difficult for these people.","Most likely, he would let them go.","But next, Danbao’s expression changed drastically, roaring angrily, “Occupying the temple, seizing my treasures, you... are not worthy of life!”","As soon as his words fell, those slumbering Eighth Tribulation powerhouses, who had little","vitality left, began to dissipate under Danbao’s command.","The ten divine generals were the same.","Even the Universe Master began to perish.","Life faded away!","However, Jian Wushuang noticed something strange: the divine bodies of these Universe","Masters did not shatter, and even their Universe Dao Arenas remained intact.","They just lost their vitality.","Lost their lives. The three great divine spirits remained at the end, unable to speak, their eyes filled with","despair.","Frantically shaking their heads, but unable to stop.","Until life vanished.","In an instant, hundreds of Eighth Tribulation realm beings were slain.","This shook everyone.","Especially Lord Hengmu, who knelt on the ground trembling uncontrollably."]},{"number":5957,"title":"Chapter 5957: Immortal!","paragraphs":["Chapter 5957: Immortal!","Occasionally glancing at Jian Wushuang and Elder Blu, he wanted them to intercede.","He feared retribution from Danbao.","Thinking of grabbing Danbao by the collar just now, Lord Hengmu wished he could slap himself twice.","He couldn’t fathom how he had the audacity to question Danbao just now.","Now, regret overwhelmed him.","However, Jian Wushuang paid no attention to Lord Hengmu’s gaze.","Because he didn’t think Danbao would trouble Lord Hengmu over such matters.","Moreover, from the conversation between Realm King and Weiss earlier, he knew that the role of gods was to create rules, not merely to kill.","Otherwise, what would they need Realm King for? With him around, any threat could be dealt with.","Did they still need to struggle here?","After tidying up the many powerhouses of the Immortal Divine Temple, Danbao’s Dao Image condensed and gathered above the altar.","Becoming a divine appearance.","The original body shattered, transforming into the appearance of a god.","He emerged from it again.","But what emerged was an incarnation.","Ethereal and elusive, like a phantom.","Yet no one dared to underestimate Danbao now.","He was even more formidable than before.","Danbao’s ethereal form held the scepter of Life, guiding all living beings.","The power of Life also erupted in the Immortal Divine Temple.","For a moment, everyone felt the immense vitality from within.","Those who had perished in tribulations were now just a step away from resurrection, lacking only an Origin Source.","That is, the moment Danbao truly became a god, they could embark on the path of true resurrection.","The eruption of Life force not only benefited everyone present but also triggered the revival of those fallen temple powerhouses.","Originally stripped of vitality by Danbao, they now reignited.","The revived temple powerhouses underwent earth-shaking changes.","Like metallic life forms.","Except in different colors.","After revival, they were clad in green battle armor.","On their chests was a symbol.","“God!”","Their eyes turned green.","Vitality filled their bodies, instantly restoring them to their peak.","Their combat power also reached its peak.","“We pay homage to our Lord!”","The revived temple powerhouses knelt one after another!","Their vitality and consciousness had changed.","Danbao stood before them, his expression majestic!","“Arise!”","Rustle!","The original three divine spirits, along with the ten divine generals, and even the 99 Eighth Tribulation realm powerhouses, all stood up.","The symbols on their chests also underwent some changes.","Commander, General, Soldier!","This kind of symbol made Jian Wushuang’s expression flicker.","Immediately, he thought of the symbols on the pieces of the Skysight Heavenly Chessboard.","...","Considering Danbao’s current identity, a buzzing sound resonated in his mind.","The Skysight Heavenly Chessboard!","It was far more intricate than he had initially thought.","This treasure!","It had connections to the divine!","Simultaneously, he recalled Teacher Xuan Yi’s identity.","The one who could give him such a treasure, Teacher Xuan Yi, might also be a god!","The Immortal Divine Temple.","The word “immortal” represented eternal life.","So, what did this Skywatch Chessboard represent?","However he looked at it, the Skywatch Chessboard didn’t seem suitable for him.","Moreover, the strength of the pieces within the chessboard couldn’t compare to that of the Immortal Divine Temple.","The origin of the pieces in the Skywatch Chessboard with the ‘Commander’ title, although also at the Eighth Tribulation realm, were much weaker.","The ‘Commander’, “General’, and ‘Soldier’ manipulated by Danbao’s Immortal Divine","Temple were all at the peak of the Eighth Tribulation realm.","With complete vitality restored, those revived pieces possessed the top combat power of the","Eighth Tribulation realm.","The temple messengers with the ‘General’ title even had the pinnacle combat power of the","Eighth Tribulation realm.","The three major divine spirits had the limit of Eighth Tribulation realm strength.","However, they lacked the ‘God’ title!","In his Skysight Heavenly Chessboard, there were pieces with the ‘God’ title.","But the profundity of the Skysight Heavenly Chessboard couldn’t match that of the Immortal","Divine Temple.","This left him somewhat puzzled.","Clearly, he had glimpsed something, but he couldn’t figure it out.","“Teacher Xuan Yi!” Jian Wushuang took a deep breath, thinking to himself, “What exactly are","you planning?... Maseter, what role does this chessboard play?”","Even after reaching the level of Universe Master, he could only use the pieces above, unable to","truly mobilize the internal origin Source.","The Immortal Divine Temple represented Life.","Based on this deduction, then the chessboard represented the Heavenly Dao.","But he didn’t cultivate the Heavenly Dao.","The Heavenly Dao was unique.","In fact, it was a kind of All Things.","It’s just that his All Things transformed into Life.","It had only a slight relationship with the Heavenly Dao.","The Heavenly Dao contained more, such as Heavenly Mechanisms, Zen, Destiny, etc....","All of which were different from his Sword Dao.","Everything in the world, he had always pursued the supremacy of the Sword Dao.","Even if he mastered everything, it was to assist the Sword Dao.","The function of this chessboard for him was to comprehend Tribulations and to assimilate","and comprehend.","Now, he had also grasped a method suggested to him, which was to create Life.","Using the internal Origin Source Pieces to deduce his own Dao.","In the future, he would have to ask Danbao about the operation of the Immortal Divine","Temple.","Perhaps he could emulate it.","Learn something. Right now, holding the Skysight Heavenly Chessboard, he was wasting it as a fire stick.","Looking at Danbao’s amnesty of the world, he also yearned for it!","Now, the strongmen of the temple had all been brought under Danbao’s seat.","For a moment, talent abounded.","Instead, people like them seemed burdensome.","Jian Wushuang also intentionally or unintentionally looked towards the Great Monk.","Finding that the other party didn’t have the sense of crisis, but was rather pleased after","Danbao achieved this position.","A Dao Guardian?","Indeed, it was like this.","The stronger the young master, the happier they were.","However, Jian Wushuang saw a hint of greed in the other party’s eyes.","The Immortal Divine Temple originally belonged to Danbao.","It also came with so-called divine envoys.","Disciples!","The role of Dao Guardian seemed redundant.","Moreover, when Realm King didn’t mention much about Dao Guardians.","He became wary of the Great Monk and started to guard against him.","Higher Heavens!","That was where his inner demons originated.","The Great Monk was definitely not as simple as he appeared on the surface.","He must be on guard.","Having suffered too much, Jian Wushuang didn’t want to derail again.","Moreover, the development of the overall situation had always been disproportionate to his","strength, making him feel powerless.","In the Infinite Great World, it was okay, he was a key force in several battles.","Whether it was in the Roman River or in the Dragon God Continent.","He had shown his strength.","But after entering the Wanliu Divine Realm, his role became smaller and smaller.","He was said to be adventuring.","He was more like a passerby.","A witness!","Danbao looked down at everyone, holding the scepter, and walked slowly.","Standing at the edge of the temple, backed by everyone, his voice indifferent, “Get up, everyone. We still have to deal with the metallic lifeforms and Babidi. My true body and my avatar cannot leave the temple. We will need your help then!”"]},{"number":5958,"title":"Chapter 5958: “Momentum”","paragraphs":["Chapter 5958: “Momentum”","Transforming into the embodiment of the God of Life, Danbao’s demeanor grew increasingly indifferent, developing a new understanding towards life.","It was a departure from his previous character. As they watched Danbao’s figure recede, they sensed a profound loneliness emanating from him.","It was a loneliness born from tempering, a loneliness that came after reaching the peak.","Even Blu felt a sense of unfamiliarity when he looked at Danbao.","Wu Li felt the same way.","He used to often pat Danbao’s head, but now just seeing his back made him nervous, let alone reaching out to pat him.","This was transformation.","Jian Wushuang had long grown accustomed to such occurrences.","After all, he had all traversed through various stages.","Just like Jian Wushuang now, looking back at those former companions.","Like Zhen Wuyang.","The former Emperor!","In the past, encountering him would evoke a sense of oppression and self-respect.","Now, Jian Wushuang could casually call out his name without any sense of oppression.","Because both had reached the same level.","Jian Wushuang was even stronger.","Even if he addressed Zhen Wuyang with respect, the latter would feel somewhat unworthy.","Jian Wushuang’s normal state was peak power at the Seventh Tribulation realm.","In his peak state, he could reach the pinnacle of the Eighth Tribulation realm.","A Universe Master at the Fifth Tribulation realm would be almost petrified upon seeing him, let alone being addressed.","Perhaps some would see this as disrespectful, but it was actually the greatest form of respect. It was the “momentum” that increased with strength.","He had long grown accustomed to it.","As for facing the Realm King or Whis, Jian Wushuang felt no palpitations; it was because of fearless ignorance.","Unable to even detect their breath, he remained indifferent.","They could converse casually.","Strong beings like Weiss, or “gods”, who truly exuded pressure, would probably leave him speechless.","After all, they were beings who could even alter the highest Law Rules.","This surpassed Jian Wushuang’s imagination.","It was a power beyond the Tribulation realm.","According to Realm King, the appearance of the God of Life would give birth to true Ninth Tribulation realm beings and produce superpowerful individuals who could transcend the Tribulation realm.","This indicated that the Ninth Tribulation realm was a bottleneck, a position where one could stand shoulder to shoulder with gods.","Hence, it was so difficult to reach.","Of the Nine Great Spacetimes, only three eternal beings existed.","These three beings were all related to the Realm King.","It was highly probable that they were stuck at the Ninth Tribulation realm.","Or perhaps the Law Rules of the Northern Spacetime were insufficient to support them. Hence, they remained so mysterious, rarely ever making a move and keeping a low profile. The top-tier strong individuals were still those Universe Masters of the Eighth Tribulation realm.","Once the God of Life appeared and broke this Law Rule, perhaps there would be many eternal beings in the future Northern Spacetime.","Now they were dealing with matters of the future.","At this moment, Jian Wushuang regained some sense of presence.","From being weak to now, it had been a gradual progression.","They followed the paths of those who came before in cultivation.","Until now, they found themselves in the miraculous position of contributing to the creation of cultivation paths.","Watching Danbao’s figure recede, he couldn’t help but feel admiration from the depths of his heart.","Now, facing Babidi or the metallic life form, they had absolute confidence.","The Immortal Divine Temple stood tall above the Universe Sea.","This was their most relaxed moment, even more so than when they were hiding under","Danbao’s Shield of Life in the past.","Because with those envoys of Life, they didn’t need to worry at all.","Chi Jiuxiao had arrived, but they had the capability to hold him off.","Jian Wushuang took a step forward and, following Danbao’s lead, stood at the edge of the","temple, gazing at the approaching aura.","A vast aura swept across the Universe Sea.","It was Babidi’s cosmic ship.","A colossal entity, flickering with shadows, approached from a distance.","In the blink of an eye, it flickered countless times.","The aura clearly arrived before them, yet the ship itself hadn’t been seen. It took a moment","longer for it to truly arrive.","The speed was such that the power of matter had yet to catch up, but the aura had already","arrived.","The cosmic ship hummed as it descended.","Babidi couldn’t wait to leap down with Chi Jiuxiao.","At the moment of their arrival, a triangular phantom appeared in the distant sky, breaking through space and descending as well.","It was the metallic life form.","“They’re all here?” Jian Wushuang’s brow furrowed. If they were besieging one side, they still had the strength, but fighting the metallic life form and Chi Jiuxiao alone would be somewhat","difficult.","Danbao, upon seeing this, smirked slightly, somewhat pleased with the situation.","It was simpler for everyone to come together rather than seeking them out individually.","This time, he would eradicate these scum in one fell swoop.","The rubbish contained within life.","“Hmph, trash from the Southern Spacetime!” Babidi also detected the aura of the metallic","life form and spat disdainfully, showing no respect.","The silver pyramid hovered in the void, observing the situation like a spectator.","The metallic life form was also a form of life.","Moreover, it was a superpower from the Southern Spacetime.","It wouldn’t be foolish. It understood the intentions of these people from the enslaved","metallic puppets.","It knew that Danbao and the others aimed to destroy it, but it also understood that Babidi and","the others aimed to kill Danbao.","The gathering of the three parties wasn’t a closed loop.","The metallic life form aimed to transform the entire Wanliu Divine Tree, seize the ocean of","divine power here, and nurture countless metallic warriors.","So it wasn’t in a hurry.","Babidi was the one in a rush.","Danbao also had absolute confidence.","Only Babidi was anxious.","The silver pyramid, the Immortal Divine Temple, and the cosmic ship.","The three flying treasures floated in the air.","In terms of hierarchy, the Immortal Divine Temple and the silver pyramid of the metallic life","form were slightly stronger.","But in terms of individual combat power, Chi Jiuxiao was the strongest.","The metallic life form couldn’t leave the pyramid, and its contained divine power could only","be used for attacks through the pyramid.","It was not enough to threaten Chi Jiuxiao; in fact, facing Chi Jiuxiao alone was extremely","dangerous.","Its metallic puppets were also insufficient.","At most, they possessed peak Eighth Tribulation realm strength, not enough for Chi Jiuxiao to","slaughter alone.","But all of this was Chi Jiuxiao himself.","Babidi had no combat power at all.","At best, he could match an average Third Tribulation Universe Master, although his methods were somewhat special, his combat power was like air among the others.","Once there was an opportunity to eliminate Babidi first, it would mean the end of the threat.","Chi Jiuxiao was just a top-tier fighter.","Intelligence was equal to zero!","The metallic life form quickly planned to catch Babidi off guard.","It was much simpler than confronting Chi Jiuxiao head-on.","Babidi’s side was unaware that they had been targeted. He","stood with his hands on his hips, sneering at the people on the Immortal Divine Temple.","“This time, there won’t be any more accidents!”","Then he turned his head and said to someone behind him, “Hun Tian, it’s up to you!”","“Yes!”","Hun Tian held several small flags and directly scattered them into the surrounding spacetime.","The flags fell into the Universe Sea.","In just a moment, the waves of the Universe Sea began to solidify, turning into ice."]},{"number":5959,"title":"Chapter 5959: Breaking the Cauldron and Going All Out","paragraphs":["Chapter 5959: Breaking the Cauldron and Going All Out","Space was also condensed.","Time was cut off.","The communication with the heavens was severed!","The grand formation descended.","This time, there was truly no way to escape.","Babidi blocked off all paths, including his own.","There couldn’t be any more accidents.","The metallic lifeforms in the silver pyramid were also stunned to see Babidi’s determination.","“Is he really going all out?”","He came from the Southern Spacetime.","To others, he was the greatest threat in Wanliu.","A terrifying existence.","But in the Southern Spacetime, he was like a stray dog, driven out by others.","Sneaking into Wanliu Divine Tree, it was to become stronger, then to cleanse the shame with blood.","Return to the Southern Spacetime.","Now seeing Babidi so determined, there was suddenly a stirring.","It seemed they were all extremely arrogant, extremely wanton.","But!","They were all fighting.","They all had their own untold secrets.","Babidi was the same.","Though he came from the Starry Sky, his background was extremely bleak.","He was Mie Sheng’s pet.","Enslaved by others.","Especially by Mie Sheng.","That kind of torment had long driven him insane.","If he couldn’t become a god, he would become a demon.","He must stand at the pinnacle and wash away past shame.","“Kill!”","Endless rage filled Babidi’s eyes. With a point of his finger, the Chi Jiuxiao transformed into thousands of feet, stepping forward.","Danbao retreated to the core of the temple, raising his hand to shake the entire Immortal Divine Temple, shouting angrily, “Destroy!”","All the messengers on the Immortal Divine Temple moved into action.","More than a hundred of them.","Divine Wood King and the Great Monk also acted at this moment.","Together, they besieged Chi Jiuxiao.","As for Jian Wushuang and the others, they could only watch helplessly.","The battle began in an instant.","Scarlet Jiuxiao fought alone against a hundred Eighth Tribulation realm experts.","Among them were the four strongest.","Jiang Wuya’s trio, and Divine Wood King.","The massive Moyun Vine descended, surrounding Chi Jiuxiao.","The clouds moved in all directions.","The battle pierced through the spacetime of the Universe Sea, creating countless black holes.","Each one was an entrance.","Everyone held their breath; this battle was incredibly intense.","It surpassed the scale of Ancient Moon Spacetime from ancient times to the present.","A battle of a hundred Eighth Tribulation experts.","Forget about Ancient Moon Spacetime, such a scene was rarely seen in the entire Northern Spacetime.","Only when some unique secrets appeared would it gather hundreds of Eighth Tribulation experts.","But these experts were also from all over.","Not from one spacetime river.","Unlike the situation they were in now.","A hundred top Eighth Tribulation experts.","Among them were extreme Eighth Tribulation experts.","Chi Jiuxiao’s divine power was comparable to the power of a Ninth Tribulation.","It directly erupted to 20 million.","With just a casual strike, he could heavily injure the peak Eighth Tribulation experts.","The 99 top Eight Tribulation realm experts of the Immortal Divine Temple, combined with the grand formation, transformed into gods and demons, their strength reaching the level of a Half-Step Ninth Tribulation realm.","The three major divine spirits unleashed their pinnacle secrets.","“Three Qi Become One!”","Led by Jiang Wuya.","They also transformed into Half-Step Ninth Tribulation realm.","The ten great divine generals, led by Chaoge, began to merge as well.","Their merging technique involved a strange treasure.","Jian Wushuang and others had never seen anything like it before.","Commander, General, Soldier.","The Commander was “Jiang Taixu”, after the fusion of the Three Qi.","The General was “Luoyang” after Chaoge’s fusion.","The Soldier was “Nantian” after Southern Saint King took the lead in merging.","The three divine bodies each erupted with the aura of Half-Step Ninth Tribulation realm.","From adversity, they turned the tide.","For the first time, they began to suppress Chi Jiuxiao.","Elder Blu and Divine Wood King were momentarily confused, unable to keep up with the pace","and had to assist from the sidelines.","The people of the Immortal Divine Temple were envious and excited, saying, “This time we’ve won for sure. No wonder Danbao is so calm, turns out they had a plan long ago.” “It’s not that simple!” Jian Wushuang’s lips curled upwards. He was equally sensitive to the power of Life and discovered a faint green light around the Immortal Divine Temple.","That was the Domain of the Immortal Divine Temple.","Within this Domain, as long as Chi Jiuxiao couldn’t kill Jiang Taixu and the others in one fell swoop, they wouldn’t perish; they would be restored immediately by Danbao after being","injured.","It was practically invincibility.","The combat power of the Half-Step Ninth Tribulation realm.","These three ultimate messengers of life were almost unbeatable.","They could even wear Chi Jiuxiao down to death.","Unless it was a true Ninth Tribulation realm powerhouse, they could break through.","But now, the strongest individual was Chi Jiuxiao, only comparable to the Ninth Tribulation","realm.","They were really going to win this time.","“Everything is about to end!” Jian Wushuang couldn’t hide his joy.","The others felt the same way.","After fighting for so long, they finally saw hope.","Danbao kept growing, getting stronger.","Defeating Chi Jiuxiao, leaving only one, Babidi, was like dealing with air.","There was no threat.","Finally, it was the metallic lifeforms.","With the Immortal Divine Temple, they could suppress the opponent.","Everything was moving in a positive direction.","At this moment, Babidi was somewhat panicked.","Chi Jiuxiao’s current potential had been maximized.","There was no hope of further advancement.","If they couldn’t win now.","He really","no cards left to play.","“How did it come to this!” Babidi frowned, disbelief in his eyes.","His panic did not escape the notice of Hun Tian behind him.","Even Babidi was panicking.","Now it was truly a matter of life and death.","Inside the silver pyramid.","The internal structure was extremely complex, countless tiny particles were operating in an","orderly manner. Looking around, countless metal particles were manipulating the entire","pyramid.","At the core of the pyramid.","There was a semi-figure, entirely black, smooth on the surface, with arms, chest, and a head.","It just didn’t have clear facial features like a normal person.","This black figure only had a scorching eye on its face. Below the figure, endless divine power seawater gathered. Countless metal particles were using divine power seawater to create this black puppet.","And the consciousness of the metallic lifefrom existed in the eyes of the black puppet.","Hehe...","In the scorching eye sockets, a tiny puppet walked out.","“Such a powerful life, controlled by a waste, what a pity!” The tiny puppet was the metallic","lifeform from the South Spacetime.","There was also a light brain in his head, which was his true consciousness. Even the tiny","puppet was a manifestation created by him.","His strength was actually quite weak.","Somewhat similar to Babidi.","But he could create extremely powerful puppets.","Life, divine power.","With these two things, he was invincible.","He nurtured countless metal warriors.","And powerful metal puppets.","This was his specialty.","The black metal puppet at the moment was his masterpiece.","It was only halfway completed now.","And it was just a shell.","Unless the entire divine power sea was used as the divine body, and the Source of Life from","Wanliu was used as the Origin Source, it would reach its peak.","At that time, he would have the true power of the Ninth Tribulation realm.","And he would personally control it, regaining the greatest capital of the South Spacetime.","But now, he couldn’t see any hope.","Chi Jiuxiao was bound to fall sooner or later.","Then it would be his turn."]},{"number":5960,"title":"Chapter 5960: Plan to Win First Place!","paragraphs":["Chapter 5960: Plan to Win First Place!","His fighting force was inferior to that of Chi Jiuxiao under his command.","Although capable of self-preservation, there was still a risk of being suppressed.","Once suppressed.","Danbao would be able to comfortably ascend the Stairway to Godhood.","By then, he would become the God of Life in the Northern Spacetime, monopolizing the entire Wanliu Divine Tree.","A kick could send him flying, casually thrown into some temporal rifts.","He would truly become a dog of a bereaved family.","“No, I cannot lose!” There was a tone of determination in his voice, then he turned and entered the blazing eye socket.","A command had been issued.","The plan originally prepared to deal with Babidi was now redirected towards the Immortal Divine Temple.","He felt that the Immortal Divine Temple was similar to Babidi.","Both were strong externally but weak internally.","Taking advantage of the current peak strength, all engaged in combating Chi Jiuxiao.","He could completely arrange his subordinates to sneak attack the Immortal Divine Temple.","However, the Immortal Divine Temple was different from the cosmic ship.","The defense of the cosmic ship was very fragile.","The defense of the Immortal Divine Temple was relatively strong.","It required more fighting force.","Merely enslaving the top ten puppets was far from enough.","He still needed endless metal warriors.","Metal warriors even more perfect than those metal crawlers.","Powerful divine power.","But that was only one aspect.","The divine power of metal crawlers was very strong, but they had no defense at all.","Even if they bred more, they couldn’t enter the Immortal Divine Temple.","So he needed to breed stronger life forms, otherwise, going there would be in vain.","“Metal armored warrior?”","“Yes, it’s you!”","The metal light brain kept flashing, and soon a perfect metal armored warrior was created. The divine power was fixed at 15 million.","Defense capabilities rivaled the top treasures of the Seventh Tribulation realm.","Even top experts of the Eighth Tribulation realm would need several moves to break through.","The total divine power contained within was enough to battle a peak expert of the Eighth Tribulation realm for several breaths.","Extremely perfect.","Just within his defense capabilities.","Not a single bit of divine power was wasted.","After the first metal armored warrior was bred.","The second one was automatically generated.","Then came production in multiples.","Soon three thousand were born.","“Almost there!” The metal light brain transmitted a thought, summoning the control of the top ten metal puppets and instructing, “Attack the Immortal Divine Temple, only success is allowed, if necessary, self-destruct!”","Snap!","The miniature light brain felt it was not perfect enough, so it took out several divine power crystals from the blazing eye sockets.","“These are the divine power ignition crystals, when you self-destruct, all ten of you must activate them, try to detonate near that Danbao!”","The top ten metal puppets nodded together.","No words were wasted.","Orders were given and they immediately set off.","In one breath.","This was puppets.","Calculating perfection at all times.","Unlike cultivators, who had various variables.","The silver pyramid was still a considerable distance from the Immortal Divine Temple, to ensure the perfect coefficient of the plan.","The metal lifeform first used the pyramid to quickly approach the Immortal Divine Temple, then a dark hole appeared beneath the pyramid.","Instantly, the top ten metal puppets, accompanied by three thousand metal armored warriors, appeared around the Immortal Divine Temple.","“Charge!”","Hum!","All metal warriors erupted, rushing towards the Immortal Divine Temple recklessly.","Jian Wushuang just reacted and quickly retreated.","Not out of fear, but out of concern that when Danbao acted later, he might accidentally injure","himself.","The sneak attack by the metal life was long anticipated by them.","Danbao was invincible in the Immortal Divine Temple.","So they weren’t worried at all.","Some even just stared blankly like that.","The golden-armored warriors, as they approached the Immortal Divine Temple, found themselves suspended in mid-air by Danbao’s Danbao’s divine scepter.","Their vitality was instantly drained away, just like it happened to the three major divine","spirits before.","Although their vitality vanished, their divine power remained intact.","With a gentle tap of the scepter in Danbao’s hand, these golden-armored warriors regained","their Life force once again.","However, this time, they gained the a different power, different from the metallic intellect","they were injected with.","Their consciousness also shifted completely, now wholly obedient to Danbao.","It could be said that within the span of a breath, these metallic lives were subverted, a strategy akin to using one’s strength against themselves.","The controlled golden-armored warriors, along with the silver puppets, swiftly turned around and charged towards Chi Jiuxiao, rather than directly attacking the pyramid.","Danbao understood the pyramid’s uniqueness; its defensive capabilities were beyond what they could easily overcome.","Attacking it would only be a futile effort.","So, it was better to besiege Chi Jiuxiao first.","Chi Jiuxiao, who was already finding it somewhat challenging to deal with the life envoys at the Half-Step Ninth Tribulation realm, was now surrounded by thousands of golden- armored warriors, causing his divine body to sustain some damage.","His divine power also kept diminishing.","“Now is the time, strike with all your might!” Jiang Taixu’s three energies merged into one, and a faint force of nothingness enveloped his body, enhancing his divine power to its peak. He raised his hand, shaking the heavens, and shouted, “Now is the time!”","Countless feathered sword blades transformed into a sea of swords, overwhelming Chi","Jiuxiao.","This force was enough to annihilate those at the Half-Step Ninth Tribulation realm, making it","extremely difficult even for Chi Jiuxiao to withstand.","Forced to resist head-on, he could only see his divine power dwindling.","He had no replenishment of life force; he had to bear the injuries on his own.","Watching from the rear, Babidi felt anxious but powerless.","“How could things come to such a pass? Chi Jiuxiao is invincible!” Babidi clenched his fists,","his eyes filled with frustration.","If he couldn’t succeed, then they would perish together.","His resolve was evident.","However, he failed to notice the killer intent directed not at the Immortal Divine Temple but","at himself.","That killing intent leaked from the eyes.","It was from Hun Tian of the Yongheng Clan.","Though enslaved, he still retained a sense of Yongheng consciousness, struggling in his mind.","He was waiting for this opportunity.","Chi Jiuxiao was currently unable to spare any attention, constantly drained.","If he were to strike at Babidi now, hardly anyone could stop him.","Dylan was just at the pinnacle of the Seventh Tribulation realm, while he possessed the","strength of the Eighth Tribulation realm.","He could easily kill him.","What he waited for now was to break free from Babidi’s control, ambush and kill him, then","defect to the Immortal Divine Temple.","This was his trump card.","If Babidi won, there would be no need for it.","But now that Babidi’s ship was sinking, he didn’t want to go down with him.","Joining the Immortal Divine Temple would also require some sincerity!","Like killing Babidi!","As long as Babidi died, Chi Jiuxiao would be up for grabs.","Just a madman.","No longer a threat to the Immortal Divine Temple.","Though not a significant achievement, it was still better than nothing.","“The Yongheng Clan shall never be enslaved!”","A flame of determination blazed in Hun Tian’s eyes, like an ancient demon breaking free from","its cage.","In that moment of liberation, he swiftly gathered energy in his hands, condensing a rainbow-","colored beam.","The light burst forth."]},{"number":5961,"title":"Chapter 5961: The Careless Babidi!","paragraphs":["Chapter 5961: The Careless Babidi!","Babidi, even though his mind was on Chi Jiuxiao, eventually reacted. But by the time he did, it was too late.","Just as he turned to look at the light behind him, he felt the presence of death looming.","His protective shield had just opened when his chest was pierced by Hun Tian.","A claw extended from his chest.","It was all too fast, and those nearby didn’t have time to react.","Dylan, about to make a move, was swiftly struck down by Hun Tian and fell into the Universe Sea.","As for Babidi’s other servants, they stood frozen, unable to move.","Because Babidi’s consciousness was fading, and the mark of enslavement was disappearing from them.","They all regained clarity and realized Babidi was done for, seeing no point in futile resistance. Initially coerced, they later chose to comply in hopes of resurrection.","But with Chi Jiuxiao’s defeat, Babidi’s value plummeted.","Had it not been for Hun Tian killing Babidi, they might have died alongside him.","“How dare you?” Babidi’s final breath was spent turning his head to glare at Hun Tian, his eyes filled with boundless resentment.","Regret!","Negligence!","Remorse!","In an instant, his mind was flooded with images.","Reality became blurred.","These were memories before death.","Recollections of the most significant events of his life.","And also the most tragic.","An old man with a round hat, holding an iron chain with Babidi tethered to it.","A pet!","That was his most pitiful memory.","Hun Tian drew his claw, then clenched his fist, pounding Babidi’s head, abruptly ending the reminiscence.","Yet, in a distant realm, within an ordinary secret realm, an old man fishing felt a momentary sinking in his heart as Babidi fell.","His gaze glazed over for a moment.","But it was just a momentary lapse, returning to normal without any further expression.","Babidi’s fall only stirred a slight emotion in Mie Sheng.","Ironically, the most pitiful memory was the last lingering thought in the world!","Babidi, the once formidable figure, fell.","The killer, Hun Tian!","Jian Wushuang and others standing at the edge of the temple witnessed this scene.","For a moment, they were all bewildered.","They had just managed to suppress Chi Jiuxiao, and Babidi had already fallen.","Their expressions were strange.","They didn’t know if they were happy or sad.","Elder Blu’s face froze for a moment, then he exclaimed excitedly, “Young master, Babidi has fallen. There’s no need to pursue Chi Jiuxiao anymore.”","With Babidi’s restraint gone,","Chi Jiuxiao no longer needed to be besieged; he fell into silence.","He remained unmoved by the siege of the three major Life envoys.","Danbao directly summoned the three envvoys back.","The fused three messengers couldn’t be separated anymore.","In other words, with Danbao’s involvement, there were now three Half-Step Ninth Tribulation realm powers.","At that moment, he became the biggest winner present.","The Great Monk and Divine Wood King returned leisurely as well.","It was about to come to an end.","The last metallic lifeform couldn’t escape now, even if it wanted to.","Standing dumbfounded in the void, at a loss.","Internally, the metallic mind constantly calculated its chances of winning and how to defeat Danbao.","After a moment, it reached a conclusion.","“The probability of failure is ninety-nine point nine nine nine nine nine nine nine nine nine nine nine nine...”","It’s over!","“The probability of falling is thirty percent!”","Once Danbao became the God of Life, the probability of falling would be 100 percent.","Now the only way out was for it to ascend on the spot and reach the Ninth Tribulation realm.","That was simply impossible.","Even if it could reach the Ninth Tribulation realm, why bother coming to the Northern","Spacetime?","Why bother worrying about this Wanliu Willow Divine Tree?","“You deserve to die!”","The metallic mind’s gaze turned towards the outside of the pyramid.","Above the pyramid, the crystal burst into a dazzling light, shooting straight towards Hun","Tian.","If not for this little bastard, it wouldn’t have failed so quickly.","The dazzling light pierced through space, capable of slaying even the peak of the Eighth Tribulation realm.","Hun Tian didn’t even have time to react before being blasted into oblivion.","He didn’t even have time to react before his soul scattered.","He probably didn’t even know how he fell.","Along with the servants of Babidi, all perished.","Only the massive cosmic ship remained hovering above the Universe Sea.","The fall of Hun Tian lifted the spatial blockade.","That was one of the reasons for killing Hun Tian.","Space was unlocked.","The metallic mind still had hope of escaping.","The crystal rotated, and the surrounding space trembled as it tried to escape.","In the recent attack, Danbao didn’t intervene, thinking that Hun Tian’s people weren’t worth","it.","But now, he couldn’t let the other party escape.","The Immortal Divine Temple shifted directly above the pyramid.","“Seal!” Danbao pressed down with his palm, and the might of the Immortal Divine Temple erupted, locking the pyramid within its Domain, suppressing it in the void.","The silver pyramid stopped rotating and was suppressed in the void.","Danbao didn’t stop there; he then used the Staff of Life to forcibly break open the pyramid.","He spared no effort.","The power of Life poured into the pyramid.","This excited the metallic lifeform; faced with the continuous influx of Life force, it kept","absorbing.","In the ocean of divine power, it had stolen quite a bit over the years.","What it lacked was the power of Life.","With this influx of Life force, the black puppet it was refining began to improve continuously.","Once successfully refined, it would be a puppet no less powerful than the Ninth Tribulation","realm.","There would be some hope then.","At least it could withstand Danbao of the Immortal Divine Temple.","The frenzy of Life force made the metallic mind somewhat overwhelmed.","Countless metallic particles were busy.","Above the Immortal Divine Temple, Danbao continued to infuse Life force.","Jian Wushuang was a bit puzzled; the power of Life didn’t have much power on its own,","mainly serving as a supplement.","It was like having a meal!","Was he trying to force the pyramid to collapse?","The metallic lifeforms inside weren’t idiots.","Once they were full, they could just spit it out.","Anyway, with plenty of ocean of divine power, spitting it out would result in countless","metallic insects.","That would also be troublesome!","Although he didn’t understand, it wasn’t appropriate to ask.","After all, they were all under Danbao’s protection now.","As a Sixth Tribulation Universe Master, he couldn’t bring himself to ask such a thing.","Just watch quietly.","Just when he was feeling self-deprecating, Danbao turned to him and said, “Benefactor,","there’s something I need your help with later!”","“No problem!” Hearing that he was needed to help, Jian Wushuang suddenly became spirited,","without any hesitation, he agreed.","But he didn’t expect that what Danbao would say next would leave him stunned. Danbao exerted force with both hands to support the life force and then said, “This pyramid","looks strong on the outside, but to destroy what’s inside, a special kind of power is needed, a","power that only you possess!”","“Starry Sky!” Jian Wushuang quickly understood."]},{"number":5962,"title":"Chapter 5962: Entering the Trap Alone!","paragraphs":["Chapter 5962: Entering the Trap Alone!","He wasn’t surprised by this.","What surprised him was the prospect of entering the pyramid.","After all, it was the metallic pyramid capable of birthing countless Eighth Tribulation experts!","Entering it alone seemed like a death wish.","Even though Danbao vouched for it, he still felt a twinge of apprehension.","“Jian Wushuang, you must enter. The treasure I need is inside this pyramid!” Weiss, within him, spoke up in this timeline just as Jian Wushuang hesitated.","It seemed like he always stumbled upon trouble.","Just when things were finally wrapping up.","Now, he was being thrown into another unknown.","But once spoken, he couldn’t refuse!","Plus, there was Weiss’s request.","He could only grit his teeth and proceed.","Seeing his hesitation, Wu Li walked over, comforting him by wrapping his arm around his shoulder, “Brother Wushuang, are you afraid? Don’t worry, I’ll be outside to support you. Whatever you need, just say it. With our combined strength, we’ve even subdued Chi Jiuxiao. There’s nothing to fear!”","“You...” Jian Wushuang narrowed his eyes, startling Wu Li into stepping back.","Now wasn’t the time for such remarks.","He really wanted to give Wu Li a punch to boost his courage.","Whew...","Taking a deep breath, Jian Wushuang closed his eyes for a moment, then opened them,","nodding towards Danbao, indicating he was ready, prepared to open the silver pyramid at any moment.","No risk, no reward!","Weiss always made him feel pressured with his tasks.","He wondered what the interior of this pyramid held.","The fact that Weiss’s required treasure was inside was surprising.","Of course, Weiss was just too lazy to do it himself.","If he retrieved it, Weiss wouldn’t have any involvement.","Sending him was merely an excuse to teach him the Extreme Freedom Intent Technique.","Otherwise, there would be no reason for such unearned favor.","Jian Wushuang wasn’t naive; some things didn’t need to be said to be understood.","The Nine Tribulations Tower, at best, was a treasure of the Ninth Tribulation level. It wasn’t a Temporal Treasure.","In fact, even the Immortal Divine Temple seemed like a Temporal Treasure to him.","It was a Life Treasure and an opportunity for ascension.","The Skysight Heavenly Chessboard, on the other hand, was a treasure of the Heavenly Dao.","Compared to these, the Nine Tribulations Tower was much weaker.","Even compared to this silver pyramid, it was weaker.","Yet, Weiss resided within it.","Weiss gave value to the Nine Tribulations Tower.","His appearance had always puzzled him.","Initially in the Nine Tribulations Tower, then directly moving into his Origin Source.","It felt like playing.","Calling it a test was no different from gratuitous help.","He never understood Weiss’s intentions.","If he were chosen as the God of Life, there wouldn’t be any ambiguity.","Or perhaps, in front of Weiss, even the God of Life and even Realm King were insignificant.","The higher the status, the more absurd.","It made him uneasy.","When heaven bestows a great responsibility upon someone!","Maybe he was overthinking.","But he couldn’t be unprepared.","As he waited for Danbao to open the gap in the silver pyramid, his Origin Source avatar entered Weiss’s estate and found Weiss.","He actively inquired, “Lord Weiss, this metallic lifeform, it seems ordinary. How could it hold what you desire?”","Weiss, lounging in a chair, playing with a hairless purple-skinned cat, looked languid. Seeing his puzzled expression, Weiss answered, “Since you’re about to go in, I’ll tell you. Inside the core of this pyramid lies an Origin Source, left by me in the Wanliu Willow Divine Tree. Originally, you were its master, but alas... you were too incompetent, so I had to give it to this cat.”","“Ah!” Jian Wushuang exclaimed in disbelief, tilting his head. He had no reason not to believe Weiss; after all, he could even alter the highest Law Rules, so what couldn’t he do?","“You left an Origin Source for me?” For a moment, he thought of many things.","Weiss’s schemes.","And the reason for Wanliu Willow’s appearance here.","Weiss nodded lazily, spreading his hands, “Some things might just be luck. Before I met Beerus, I did favor you. But later, I found out the reason I favored you was because you were the first life in your Origin Source Universe. So, your luck was bad.”","“But how’s that my fault?” Jian Wushuang was puzzled. He worked harder than anyone.","Seeing his disbelief, Weiss chuckled, covering his mouth, “You care too much about your Origin Source universe and not enough about yourself. That’s why you’re incompetent... Young man, let me give you some advice: be more carefree in life, whether you’re cultivating your Origin Source or divine power, have the boldness to break through all barriers.”","From the level of Dao Lord to Emperor.","Jian Wushuang indeed placed excessive importance on his origin source.","In terms of combat power, divine power always held the upper hand.","Yet he always sought to pursue both to greater heights.","He pursued balance.","He even wanted his Origin Source to suppress divine power.","But in the end?","The Super Eternal Ancient Transformation and the Starry Sky Chronicles.","Both were indispensable peak secret techniques.","Sometimes one shouldn’t focus too much on a particular power.","What he needed to do was elevate his own combat prowess and realm, not one over the other","between Origin Source and divine power.","If a flower could aid him, he’d cultivate that flower.","If it were a cloud, he’d contemplate that cloud.","Cultivation, sometimes, was just that simple.","Finding the right direction, letting go of worries, and entrusting everything to his own efforts","and luck.","“I understand now!” Jian Wushuang nodded, devoid of any lingering resistance in his heart.","Beerus was the first life nurtured in his Origin Source Universe, after all, he was its creator","god.","In the future, if the other party achieved something, he could boast about it too.","It wasn’t a big deal, he just needed to work hard in the future.","Why envy a cat?","Especially when it’s still hairless.","Having found his answer, Jian Wushuang’s Origin Source avatar automatically returned to the","universe, and his consciousness returned to his true self.","Meanwhile, at Danbao’s side, the Life force was still being infused, endless Life force surged","into the silver pyramid, which now had a tinge of green.","Its original color had been altered.","Metal, life, divine power.","Metal was silver.","Life was green.","The two were vying for dominance.","Now the metal brain inside the pyramid also detected Danbao’s plot, but halting the","pyramid’s operation proved beyond its capabilities.","Jian Wushuang outside also discerned Danbao’s plan and couldn’t help but applaud.","Danbao had truly grown now.","The Life force and metal lifeform continued their struggle for supremacy.","They both sought control of the pyramid.","A hint of anxiety flashed across Danbao’s face; it was backlash.","Crack!","The unbreakable pyramid suddenly emitted a crisp sound, followed by a fissure. Danbao, upon seeing this fissure, was greatly delighted. “Quick, now’s the time.”"]},{"number":5963,"title":"Chapter 5963: Be More Dignified!","paragraphs":["Chapter 5963: Be More Dignified!","Swish!","Jian Wushuang, who had already prepared himself, flashed into the crack.","The Wanjie Sword on his back erupted with the power of the Starry Sky at that moment.","Transformed into a deep blue stream, it entered the interior of the pyramid.","The metallic light brain was startled to see the blue-clad Jian Wushuang and hurriedly rushed into the eyes of the black puppet.","Trying to forcefully activate the puppet.","But the Life force contained within the puppet now belonged to Danbao.","No matter how he tried to manipulate it, it was futile.","As Jian Wushuang delved deeper into the pyramid, a hint of a wicked smile appeared on his face. Raising his hand and drawing his sword, he began to wreak havoc.","Countless metallic particles attempted to attack him, only to be shattered by the power of the Starry Sky.","Without the metallic puppet, it was impossible to mobilize the black puppet.","The metallic light brain was utterly helpless.","All it could do was plead, “Jian Wushuang, please stop. As a Universe Master, you don’t need to be so desperate. You don’t need resurrection, I can offer you many treasures, I can help you reach the Ninth Tribulation Realm.”","But Jian Wushuang paid no attention to the pleas.","His Sword Qi surged as he indulged in wanton slaughter.","The more desperate the opponent became, the safer he felt.","It was evident that the metallic Light Brain had no more tricks up its sleeve.","All it could do was beg for mercy.","“Curses, curses, how could I fall like this!” The worst scenario the metallic light brain had considered was Danbao becoming a god of life, leading to its downfall.","Dying at the hands of a god of life, it could close its eyes peacefully.","But being killed by a Universe Master of the Sixth Tribulation realm was nothing but disgrace. Crack!","Some special transition passages connecting to the pyramid were also destroyed by Jian Wushuang’s sword.","The metallic light brain lost all hope completely, and the black puppet stopped operating at that moment.","When it was operational, it was beyond its control, and now it was even more so.","For the metallic light brain, it had lost its hiding place now.","Jian Wushuang held the Wanjie Sword in a reverse grip, taking a step forward directly in front of the black puppet. Staring at the eyes dimmed by the fading red light, he said coldly, “Come out, I can make it easier for you.”","If it weren’t for the urgency of the situation, he really wanted to ask what the Southern Spacetime was like.","Because he knew from Realm King that other spacetimes were different from the Northern Spacetime.","He came from the Original Universe to the Ancient Moon Spacetime without any barriers.","Because the Northern Spacetime was populated by cultivators.","But the Southern Spacetime was different.","Where they trained was not just different from their methods but even their very lives were different.","So, he was somewhat curious.","But Jian Wushuang was close to tears, dragging his mechanical feet out from the eyes of the black puppet.","“Jian Wushuang, I’ll remember you. You will definitely not have a good end!”","...","“Can’t lose like a good sport?”","Jian Wushuang never expected that the opponent, upon emerging, would utter such words.","However eminent a figure he might be, even Realm King found him troublesome.","Yet, upon their first meeting, he began cursing.","If it were the other way around, he would bravely face death.","He would never be so cowardly.","It was simply shameful.","His curiosity about the Southern Spacetime vanished instantly.","He only wished to deal with the opponent and leave.","The metal light brain went completely insane, falling into frenzy. “You will die for sure, I","swear!”","“Tsk tsk, I’ll be waiting!” Jian Wushuang chuckled at the opponent’s words.","He had heard such words no less than 100 times.","And then?","No one could succeed in killing him.","But this time, it was different.","Before the metallic brain could make a move, it chose to detonate the Fire God Divine Power","Crystal within its body.","The immense explosion turned the pyramid into ashes.","Such an explosion could kill a pinnacle Eighth Tribulation realm expert.","If Jian Wushuang hadn’t been prepared, he might have truly perished.","Within the dust, a green light enveloped Jian Wushuang, leaving him unscathed.","That was the Shield of Life of Danbao.","It covered his entire body completely.","“So, this is your last resort?” Jian Wushuang chuckled self-deprecatingly. “That’s too weak.”","Just as he relaxed, he noticed that the black puppet had disappeared.","He searched around but found no trace of it.","The resilience of that black puppet couldn’t have been reduced to mere debris.","Jian Wushuang felt uneasy and searched carefully, discovering two sets of soft armor.","And some identity tokens.","“Shi Seven, Shi Eight!”","They were two Seventh Tribulation experts from the Shi Kingdom.","They had entered the Wanliu Universe together with him.","But their strength was much weaker, with only a little over 1 million divine power.","He hadn’t paid much attention to them while following Lian Xing.","Later, when Divine Wood King came out of the secret realm, he didn’t see them anymore.","He thought they had perished.","Seeing their soft armor and identity tokens, it was highly probable that they had been controlled by the metallic light brain.","The metallic light brain could enslave up to ten metal puppets.","Among those puppets, there were no Shi Seven or Shi Eight, these two Shi Kingdom experts.","Jian Wushuang was sure that because those metal puppets hadn’t changed appearance after being enraged, only their skin color turned silver.","That meant Shi Seven and Shi Eight, these two Shi Kingdom experts, had been imprisoned","inside the pyramid by the metallic light brain.","Now their destruction should be normal.","But how come that black puppet was gone?","His doubt, outside, turned into astonishment!","After being destroyed, the pyramid lost its power.","It became an ordinary metal treasure.","It could be opened at will.","When he went out, he found a black hole outside.","And the people above the Immortal Divine Temple, when they saw him, all showed strange","expressions.","Back in the Immortal Divine Temple, under Wu Li and others’ explanation, he understood.","Something had run out from the pyramid.","Two streaks of light!","Two figures.","Shi Seven, Shi Eight.","Before the metallic light brain detonated, it issued its final command.","The Origin Source and divine power within the black puppet were all transferred into these","two people.","Just like the threat to Jian Wushuang.","Once these two went out, their goal was to kill Jian Wushuang.","The black puppet had the strength of Tribulation realm.","Shi Seven and Shi Eight, whom the metallic light brain had high hopes for, had strengths","comparable to Ninth Tribulation realm.","So, this time it wasn’t just a verbal threat, it was a real threat.","After going out, they were very likely to be pursued by these two.","Wu Li and others didn’t know much about it.","But Jian Wushuang associated it with what the metallic light brain said before detonating and","had a guess.","But now he was in the Wanliu Universe.","And Danbao was about to go to Stairway to Godhood.","He didn’t care about these things.","Instead, he was more concerned about the Origin Source that Weiss wanted.","A purple Origin Source piece.","After handing it to Weiss, Jian Wushuang also successfully obtained the first half of the","Extreme Freedom Intent Technique.","After examining it for a long time, he found it somewhat incomprehensible, so he carefully","put it away and planned to cultivate it slowly after going out.","The urgent matter now was to go to the Stairway of Godhood.","So, he didn’t say much to Weiss and left.","Above the Immortal Divine Temple. 3,000 golden armor guards stood in all directions.","10 great silver armor puppets lined up on the side."]},{"number":5964,"title":"Chapter 5964: Light of God","paragraphs":["Chapter 5964: Light of God","Three Life Envoys stood behind Danbao.","Their power already dominated the Ancient Moon Spacetime.","Divine Wood King and the others were excited; the good days had finally arrived. They had endured hardships before, but now they moved freely.","“Great Monk, all that’s left now is the Stairway to Godhood. Hurry up and lead us!” Lord Hengmu was relaxed, eagerly awaiting to become a Life Envoy.","The Great Monk blinked, twitched his nose, and walked towards Danbao respectfully. “Young Master, the Stairway to Godhood lies within the Origin Source at the core of the Universe Sea. Shall we proceed now...?”","“No more threats, no need to wait. Let’s depart now!” Danbao raised his head, his scepter in motion.","The Immortal Divine Temple shattered the space directly and began to shift.","As for the broken silver pyramid, it had already been taken by Jian Wushuang.","It was a good treasure; naturally, it wouldn’t be abandoned.","And Babidi’s cosmic ship had been swiftly taken by Divine Wood King.","But the greatest spoils belonged to Chi Jiuxiao.","Finally subdued by the Immortal Divine Temple.","No more aftermath.","Perhaps when Danbao became a true god, it might revive again.","That was the fear of everyone.","The Immortal Divine Temple kept shifting under the guidance of the Great Monk.","They soon arrived at the true core of the Universe Sea.","The Origin Source of the Wanliu Divine Tree.","The place where the Origin Source of Life was ignited.","The Stairway to Godhood lay within.","They could even see it with their naked eyes.","The power above was nearing godhood.","Just by observing, they would benefit immensely.","The Immortal Divine Temple halted at the edge.","Jian Wushuang’s eyes burned with longing, but they weren’t qualified to step onto this Stairway to Godhood.","Otherwise, he could have reached a higher level of Life force.","With the Origin Source within the Skysight Heavenly Chessboard, he could create the most powerful life.","The final step.","Danbao soared into the air.","Even the avatar that couldn’t leave the Immortal Divine Temple could move now.","He slowly stepped out of the temple and entered the Stairway to Godhood.","The entire Wanliu Divine Tree trembled.","Ancient Wood Continent.","Above the Wanliu Divine Realm.","Countless powerhouses had gathered.","An era had passed since Divine Wood King led his people into the Wanliu Divine Tree. Superpowers from the outside not only included the Nine Heavens and Ten Lands but also some Eight Tribulation Universe Masters from the Nine Major Spacetimes.","The Universe Master of the Ancient Moon Sect had also sat here for countless ages.","They were all waiting for Divine Wood King and the others to emerge.","After a silence of an era.","Wanliu Divine Realm suddenly shook, emitting a divine light.","The super strong stationed here all stepped out of their caves, looking towards the Wanliu","Divine Tree.","“Are they coming out?”","“Divine Light!”","“A new era!”","Everyone held their breath.","They were all waiting for something.","In the Northern Spacetime, the three ancient existences were also observing the situation","here.","A new era would arrive at the moment when Danbao became the God of Life.","It was an era for all cultivators.","And it was also the era when the Tribulation Realm truly surpassed itself.","The era of resurrection!","These people didn’t know that many had sacrificed their lives to pave the way for this era.","At the top of the Nine Major Spacetimes.","On the Realm King Planet.","Seeing the commotion in the Wanliu Divine Tree, Realm King also felt a tremor.","He couldn’t help but sigh.","His Northern Spacetime was also about to embark on the path of resurrection.","Stronger cultivators would emerge in the future.","“Finally, the time has come!” Realm King let out a sigh of relief. Being the ruler of a","spacetime wasn’t easy.","Limited power, significant responsibility.","Lack of ability, even less strength.","That was Realm King.","Speaking of the God of Life, he was also under his command, but creating a God of Life in the","Northern Spacetime wasn’t as simple as pulling someone off the street.","It required careful planning, every step calculated.","Realm King Planet wasn’t just inhabited by Realm King alone.","There was also an acquaintance of Jian Wushuang.","Wu Zuo!","He saw a slight change in Realm King’s expression and quietly approached, asking, “Old man,","what’s happening down there?”","Jian Wushuang and the others were in the Wanliu Divine Tree for several epochs.","It had been an entire era in the outside world.","The initial ten individuals had all made significant achievements.","Among them was also the assistance of Realm King.","Like Wu Zuo.","He had even been taken as a direct disciple by Realm King.","And had been sent to the Realm God Continent.","Now he was the Universe Master at the Seventh Tribulation realm.","Originally, according to Wu Zuo’s character, he would have returned to the Qishen Temple","long ago, but he had been kept under pressure by Realm King.","Now Wu Zuo understood.","Realm King’s plans were not trivial.","The matters of the Qishen Temple were not so simple either.","The threat of Mie Sheng was far from it.","When Fan Tianfeng and others returned to the Qishen Temple, they all perished.","That Flame God, the top powers at the Eighth Tribulation realm.","Although his Dao Avatar went over, it perished along with the main body.","Because of this matter, there had been quite a stir in the Ancient Moon Spacetime back then.","Especially in the Ancient Wood Continent.","Divine Wood King went to Wanliu Divine Tree.","Flame God perished.","Only the patriarch of the Shi Kingdom remained.","And that patriarch was also unlucky.","He happened to encounter the beginning of a new era.","Powerful individuals from all sides converged on the Ancient Wood Continent.","The Shi Kingdom also lost its former brilliance.","Not long ago, it also passed away peacefully.","In the current Ancient Wood Continent.","Only Queen Yun Zhi of the Daughter Kingdom and the rebuilt Empress of the Yue Kingdom","were upholding appearances.","As for that titled strongman of the Ancient Moon Sect, he had been transferred long ago.","Now in the Ancient Wood Continent, the Pope of the Ancient Moon Sect personally presided.","Not to mention the Seventh Tribulation realm, even the Eighth Tribulation realm was quite","common.","All were waiting for the appearance of Divine Wood King and others.","This was also the news deliberately released by Realm King. Through the three Eternal Beings, all Tribulation realm experts were informed.","The opening of a new era was within the Wanliu Divine Tree.","The appearance of Divine Wood King would be the day of the era’s beginning.","And that era was called the “Era of Revival”.","Not only all tribulation realms, even Realm King himself was extremely excited.","Upon hearing Wu Zuo’s inquiry.","His eyes narrowed slightly, and he answered obliquely, “Aren’t you eager to return to the","Qishen Temple... Don’t worry, you’ll be able to go back soon!”","“Is that true?” Wu Zuo couldn’t believe his ears, thinking he must have misheard, “Back to","the Qishen Temple!”","Of the initial ten individuals.","Only he and Fan Tianfeng had a different feeling towards the Qishen Temple.","Because he was a disciple of the Qishen.","Though he was a registered personal disciple.","But he was also the only personal disciple still alive.","Now, practicing the Great Dao, he had no reason not to return.","He wanted to revive the past glory of the Qishen Temple.","Lead the lineage of the Qishen Temple to establish a vast territory in the Northern Spacetime.","To perpetuate the “Way” of the Qishen for eternity.","“It’s true, but you’ll have to wait for your companions!” Realm King affirmed.","Upon hearing the word companions, Wu Zuo’s eyes flashed, and he turned to look at Realm","King, “Jian Wushuang!”","In these years.","He had visited all Nine Major Spacetimes."]},{"number":5965,"title":"Chapter 5965: Withering","paragraphs":["Chapter 5965: Withering","They knew that initially, all ten of them had arrived in the Ancient Moon Spacetime.","They had been wandering in the Nine Heavens and Ten Lands of the Ancient Moon Spacetime.","They also found a few people who had come with him.","However, those people meant nothing to him, nor were they very familiar.","Neither Jian Wushuang nor Hu Qing, whom he was familiar with, could be found.","He couldn’t even find Zhen Wuyang.","He only found Dongsheng, Wanyan, Gu Qianluo, and Guangying.","Tongtian Buddha was unwilling to see him, still immersed in completing his ultimate tribulation.","He didn’t want to disturb his state of mind.","He also offered some help to these people.","Even the weakest among them were Universe Masters at the Sixth Tribulation realm.","After all, with the help of Realm King, although they encountered many Tribulations, they also gained a lot.","Looking at it this way, except for Fan Tianfengwho was relatively unlucky among the original ten, they all did well.","It could only be said that she was too impatient.","Falling too early.","The rest of them all did quite well.","Compared to Jian Wushuang, they were all not inferior.","Jian Wushuang, who was still struggling in the Wanliu Divine Tree, would be surprised if he knew about the other nine people from the beginning. Except for Fan Tianfeng, who he initially envied for falling, the rest of them were doing just as well as him, or even better.","Their Dao Hearts had all been shattered.","He had simply faced too many Tribulations.","Crack!","Wu Zuo clenched his fist, “Jian Wushuang, we meet again, you must be surprised!”","When they left the Qishen Temple initially, Jian Wushuang was the strongest.","Then it was Fan Tianfeng.","He, Wu Zuo, ranked in the middle.","But now it’s different.","In terms of knowledge and cultivation realm, he was at the forefront.","Apart from not seeing Jian Wushuang and Hu Qing, that is.","He had also asked Realm King about Hu Qing’s whereabouts!","Unfortunately, Realm King didn’t tell him and didn’t let him search either.","When the time comes, they will inevitably meet.","It’s just not the right time yet.","Ancient Moon Spacetime.","Inside the Ancient Moon ruins in the Nine Heavens and Ten Lands.","They also felt the changes coming from within the Wanliu Divine Tree.","In the core of the ruins, under the shadow of the crescent moon spring, a man and a woman sat cross-legged.","When they felt the divine aura from within the Wanliu Divine Tree.","The clear and ethereal woman sitting across from him slowly opened her closed eyes, with a hint of tears in her eyes.","“Is this fate?” She felt somewhat unwilling.","The God of Life appeared.","Her plans had also failed.","With the God of Life, the life in the Northern Spacetime would have the mark of life.","Those lives that had once fallen would truly be gone.","She could no longer rescue that young figure from the river of time.","For that figure.","She had paid who knows how much.","A blooming flower from the other shore had once astonished the Northern Spacetime.","But in the end, it ended up like this.","Looking at her reflection in the spring water.","Tears slid down her cheeks.","She was the Celestial Maiden who opened the Ancient Moon Spacetime!","The Celestial Maiden who attempted to create the second Starry Sky.","But ultimately fell.","Leaving behind only a trace of Origin Source in this place.","Desiring to live a second life.","But with the opening of the Wanliu Divine Tree, she lost her last hope.","The man opposite the Celestial Maiden was none other than Hu Qing.","“Dao of Heaven returns to unity!”","Now Hu Qing, unlike before, was not like a Buddha!","He resembled more a pure cultivator.","Seeing the weary face of the Celestial Maiden, he sighed inwardly, unsure how to console her.","These years, he had been aiding her in recovering her true nature.","Now Wanliu’s plan lay shattered.","Everything had turned to smoke.","It was time to leave this place.","“Master!” The Celestial Maiden rose and bowed deeply to Hu Qing, then rose again, her appearance now that of Jiang Shang. “If one day, you can control the Heavenly Dao, when you","see him, please deliver this item to him for me.”","She cupped spring water in her hands, a flower of the other shore blooming.","One flower withered, one flower blossomed!","Hu Qing was moved, wanting to reach out and accept it, yet hesitated.","Taking this flower meant the disappearance of the Celestial Maiden, leaving only Jiang Shang","behind.","Jiang Shang, who had lost memories of her past life.","But her determination was resolute.","There was no turning back.","He could only reach out and take the vibrant flower.","He watched as the figure of the Celestial Maiden disappeared into the fabric of time.","Wanliu Divine Realm had yet to open.","But at this moment, the Ancient Moon Ruins began to decay.","It was true annihilation.","A complete ruin, instantly turned to dust.","The Crescent Spring, the vast mountain ranges, countless secret realms, all turned into","fleeting clouds.","These things were meant to disappear.","It was only because of the Celestial Maiden’s obsession that they had persisted.","At the moment the heavenly maiden disappeared, they were all buried with her.","Hu Qing looked at the other flower in his hand, then glanced into the distance.","Amidst endless dust, only he and this flower remained untainted.","“I will accomplish it!” Hu Qing put away the other shore flower, and his body emitted a burst","of light.","One step, one world.","One breath, the life of All Things.","In an instant, he transcended from Emperor to Universe Master.","His realm had long reached this level over the years.","It was only suppressed because of the Celestial Maiden.","Helping her recover her Dao Heart was also his cultivation.","The Celestial Maiden had failed.","He had not.","The path!","It had always been there.","As he grasped the moment of controlling the universe, the Tribulation of the seven-colored","sky descended together.","Crossing seven Tribulations at once.","One more Tribulation than Jian Wushuang.","Like Wu Zuo, he also entered the realm of Seventh Tribulation.","The disappearance of the Ancient Moon Ruins did not cause much commotion.","The cultivators on the ground found it strange, but news of the Eighth Tribulation realm was","widespread.","They had long known that the Ancient Moon Ruins were just a fleeting phenomenon.","Not worth entering at all.","The treasures that drifted out of the Ancient Moon Ruins had also dissipated one by one.","Wanliu Divine Tree, Immortal Divine Temple.","Jian Wushuang discovered that his Nine Tribulations Tower had dissipated.","Without knowing the reason, he thought it was because of Weiss.","Taking advantage of Danbao’s ascension to the godly realm, he split a strand of Origin Source","and entered his own universe to find Weiss.","Entering the vast mansion, he easily found a coast where Weiss often rested.","“Weiss, how did the Nine Tribulations Tower suddenly disappear?”","It was a rare treasure, and its sudden disappearance still pained him a little.","Weiss, upon hearing this, replied indifferently, “Tsk tsk, if the Nine Tribulations Tower","doesn’t disappear, then you will disappear!”","“What do you mean?” Jian Wushuang was a bit puzzled, took a seat, his eyes filled with doubt","as he looked at Weiss, hoping he could explain.","Now he feared nothing.","Danbao was about to ascend to godhood.","In the future, in the Northern Spacetime, he could just relax.","Who dared to make him disappear?","Weiss seemed to see through his thoughts, his lips curled up in a smile, “Jian Wushuang, you","have quite a few enemies, I’m afraid you’ve forgotten about that Celestial Maiden.”","“Celestial Maiden?” Jian Wushuang’s mind buzzed, instantly understanding.","The Nine Tribulations Tower was left behind from the Ancient Moon Ruins.","The Ancient Moon Ruins were where that Celestial Maiden fell.","The disappearance of the Nine Tribulations Tower was related to the Ancient Moon Ruins.","With this realization, he understood.","His gaze shifted, surprised, “Could it be that the Celestial Maiden has regained her strength","and seeks revenge on me!”"]},{"number":5966,"title":"Chapter 5966: You’re Thinking Too Much!","paragraphs":["Chapter 5966: You’re Thinking Too Much!","The Celestial Maiden and Jiang Shang were practically the same person.","He harbored a blood feud with Jiang Shang.","She wouldn’t spare him, not in the least.","After all, she was a formidable figure at the Ninth Tribulation realm!","Moreover, among the Nine Great Spacetimes, she was the only one who had truly reached the Ninth Tribulation realm, even reaching its pinnacle, attempting to create a second Starry Sky.","If she were to regain her strength and seek revenge, he would be doomed.","Forget about Danbao, even Realm King wouldn’t be able to protect him.","“Never mind!”","Weiss saw the terror on his face and chuckled, “I won’t tease you anymore. That Celestial Maiden just dispersed her final Origin Source moments ago and has completely vanished!”","Upon hearing this news, Jian Wushuang’s sorrow turned to joy in an instant. “So, Jiang Shang is gone as well?”","“She’s still around, and whatever happens within the Law Rules is not my concern. If she seeks revenge on you, I won’t interfere!” Weiss sat up, casually tossing Beerus aside, then continued, “The Celestial Maiden from Ancient Moon Spacetime has always been a violator of the highest rules of cultivation. It’s better that she dissipated, so I don’t have to deal with her again!”","The Celestial Maiden’s attempt to create a second Starry Sky was blasphemy against the highest Law Rules.","It warranted death.","Allowing her to retain a strand of her Origin Source was Weiss’ pity towards her.","Otherwise, she might cause trouble again.","Although aware of her schemes, Weiss knew they were doomed to fail.","Because he had long seen through the future.","That’s why he found Jian Wushuang.","Firstly, he still had a mission from the Starry Sky era to find a true disciple.","Originally, Jian Wushuang was the chosen one.","But due to certain events and people, he changed his mind.","He decided to choose the first life in Jian Wushuang’s universe.","Jian Wushuang also caught the key point and exclaimed, “So, it was you who killed the Celestial Maiden back then?”","“Exactly!” Weiss turned his head slowly, a hint of murderous intent leaking out.","That aura was enough to suffocate all cultivators of today.","Just the dispersal of that aura made Jian Wushuang breathless.","“The Celestial Maiden’s actions back then were too much. Therefore, she had to die. It was my duty!”","Jian Wushuang stepped back half a step. “Then, what about me...”","He thought of the Starry Sky in his Origin Source Universe.","“You’re overthinking it!” Weiss dispelled his concerns, explaining, “The Starry Sky in your origin universe was cultivated by you, not replicated. So, it’s fine. Instead, you should focus on cultivating diligently, and don’t let down... my expectations of you.”","The Starry Sky cultivated by oneself emerged from the Origin Source.","Even Weiss had never seen it before.","As for the power of the Starry Sky, it wasn’t particularly noteworthy.","He placed more hope on Jian Wushuang’s Origin Source Universe and his Starry Sky Chronicles.","Being able to cultivate a Starry Sky from the Origin Source Universe was crucial.","The most important factor was the Starry Sky Chronicles.","Although the eruption of the Eternal Ancient Transformation was impressive, there were still many cultivators who could create similar techniques.","But as for the Starry Sky from the Origin Source Universe, Jian Wushuang was one of the two known individuals.","At least that’s what Weiss had observed.","Whether there were others hiding such abilities was unknown.","The reason they were the only two was that the Starry Sky they were in had long been created.","Naturally, there would be someone capable of creating a Starry Sky.","During Jian Wushuang’s stay with Weiss, he remained for a long time.","Surprisingly, Weiss spoke a lot.","Jian Wushuang listened attentively.","Most of it was about cultivating the Origin Source.","It also gave him many ideas for the upcoming fusion of the Chess Origin Source.","That would be his simulation for future Tribulations.","Naturally, he wouldn’t dare to slack off.","It was like having another chance.","Danbao continued to grow on the Stairway to Godhood.","Jian Wushuang also cultivated within the Immortal Divine Temple.","Understanding the Stairway to Godhood only required a single clone.","Still perfecting the Super Eternal Ancient Transformation with his clone and even preparing for the seventh Tribulation, Jian Wushuang’s main body appeared on the Skysight Heavenly Chessboard.","Before the pieces of the three major god titles, he could already sense their mysteries.","Reincarnation had been created.","Time and space were not far off.","The cycle of time and space was his ultimate goal.","In terms of time, he hadn’t progressed far, but his spatial cultivation was already complete.","“Still quite a ways off!”","Jian Wushuang shook his head, denying his previous thoughts.","He sank into contemplation once again, constantly calculating.","He only had two chances. One was to simulate with chess pieces, and the second would require","his life.","Time and space reincarnation seemed somewhat distant, but he was already the Universe Master of the Sixth Tribulation realm.","Once the path of resurrection was opened up, he would advance towards the Ninth Tribulation","realm.","When he reached approximately the Ninth Tribulation realm, he could perfect his time cultivation, even achieving it at the Eighth Tribulation realm.","It’s just that achieving time and space at the Eighth Tribulation realm still fell short.","In the beginning, the Celestial Maiden attempted to perfect time and space for exploring the","complex Starry Sky but ultimately failed.","Time contains both time and space, while the Starry Sky holds much more.","It was too ambitious, too risky.","Having learned from past mistakes, Jian Wushuang was unwilling to take risks and preferred a","steady approach.","Reincarnation, a non-essential realm, could be condensed by him, which was normal.","However, for time and space, he needed time.","Currently, he could only separate the Origin Source chess pieces needed for space and then","cultivate them.","As time passed, he comprehended the Stairway to Godhood, allowing his Life force to soar.","Although he couldn’t become a God of Life, he possessed innate Life force that could","continuously improve.","He didn’t need to pursue the utmost.","Being sufficient was enough.","On the peak technique side, the Super Eternal Ancient Transformation had reached the top","level, albeit lacking a bit for perfection, which he wasn’t in a hurry for.","After all, there were no threats outside, and there were hardly any battles anymore.","As for the contingency left by the metallic light brain, he didn’t pay too much attention to it.","The world was vast.","It wasn’t possible to find him immediately!","As long as he remained prepared, there was nothing to fear.","He had numerous trump cards now.","Although he didn’t make many moves during the trip to the Wanliu Divine Tree, his strength","was not to be underestimated.","In the past, he directly confronted Chi Jiuxiao in a fit of anger, the peak Universe Master of the","Sixth Tribulation realm.","His basic divine power was 1.5 million.","With the Tribulation Armor, he could burst to 2 million.","By employing the Super Eternal Ancient Transformation, his divine power could reach 5","million. Plus, the blessing of the Universe Dao Arena, his divine power was at least 6 million or more.","He was already at the peak level of the Eighth Tribulation realm.","And that’s not even counting his Starry Sky Chronicles, which was his strongest combat","power.","The Reincarnation Sword alone could threaten the peak of the Eighth Tribulation realm.","What was there to fear from just two metal puppets?","Jian Wushuang didn’t care, continuing his cultivation.","The other clone was observing the Stairway to Godhood where Danbao was located,","witnessing the birth of a god.","This was the true god.","Bathed in Life force, Danbao ascended boldly with a scepter in hand, overcoming all","obstacles.","The so-called Tribulations were perhaps the battles before arriving at this Stairway to","Godhood."]},{"number":5967,"title":"Chapter 5967: Realm King’s Coronation","paragraphs":["Chapter 5967: Realm King’s Coronation","After stepping onto the Stairway to Godhood, Danbao became the God of Life.","There were no surprises.","He had been climbing steadily to the peak.","It took only a few years to perfect the power of Life.","At that moment, the divine halo descended upon him.","In the Wanliu Divine Realm, another disturbance erupted. Above the divine realm.","A projection appeared, wearing a face of contentment.","The person who arrived was Realm King.","Under his command, the God of Life finally appeared.","The cultivators under his direct jurisdiction would once again grow.","Having life meant having hope.","“Congratulations, Lord Realm King!” At the moment of Realm King’s appearance, the three Ancient Beings hidden in the void also emerged.","Realm King, seeing these three, was extremely courteous. “The presence of the God of Life benefits you as well. With its appearance, reaching the Ninth Tribulation realm will be within your grasp!”","“We owe it all to Lord Realm King!”","The appearance of the God of Life benefited these three the most.","They had long touched upon the Ninth Tribulation realm but had always suppressed their own realm.","They dared not undergo Tribulation.","Because the level of Life in the Northern Spacetime was lower, once they successfully underwent Tribulation and reached the Ninth Tribulation realm, they wouldn’t live past a day.","They might not even last a moment.","The lesson from the previous Heavenly Maiden served as a warning.","They had no choice but to first elevate their divine bodies to the Ninth Tribulation realm, while the Origin Source Universe constantly suppressed them.","Waiting for the appearance of the God of Life.","This was also because Realm King couldn’t bear to see the cultivators under his direct jurisdiction, who were so talented, continuously throwing themselves into danger, secretly teaching his secrets to these three.","Of course, this wasn’t a big mistake.","Even if Weiss had found out, he would have turned a blind eye.","No questions asked.","They received guidance.","Speaking of these three Ancient Beings, they were still disciples of Realm King.","They had also actively sought to become disciples, but were rejected by Realm King.","After all, he was a Realm King, the highest god in the Northern Spacetime.","If they could become disciples of Realm King, wouldn’t that be prestigious?","Unfortunately, they weren’t that fortunate.","“How lively!” Suddenly, another person appeared behind Realm King.","Wearing a yellow Daoist robe with a tall crown.","With an angular face, yellow skin, and thick eyebrows.","It was Wu Zuo, who had come with Realm King.","The three Ancient Beings were just sighing, but when they saw Wu Zuo appear, they were startled, and their brows furrowed as if they were about to get angry.","Being so disrespectful in front of Realm King.","What kind of behavior was this?","Before the three could get angry, Realm King reached out and lightly pressed, saying calmly, “Let me introduce, this is my disciple, Wu Zuo!”","“Ah!” The three Ancient Beings couldn’t believe their ears, astonished. “When did you take such a high disciple?”","“It was just a while ago. You guys get acquainted here. I need to enter the Wanliu Divine Tree for a bit!” Realm King waved his hand and stepped into the Wanliu Divine Tree.","Only Wu Zuo and three Ancient Beings remained.","“Do you have a name, Dao Friend?”","The three top experts who had an easy time across the Nine Great Spacetimes not only showed envy towards Wu Zuo but also hinted at flattery.","After all, he was the disciple of Realm King.","They had to cozy up a bit.","...","Inside the Divine Tree.","It was livelier than the outside world.","Everyone stood on the edge of the Immortal Divine Temple, gazing at the Danbao.","They were also talking privately.","“In this lifetime, it’s worth it!” A Seventh Tribulation realm expert couldn’t help but sigh.","Many surviving Seven Tribulations Realm experts stood tall and proud.","Along the way, they had seen many super strong individuals.","They were almost numb.","It was only at this moment, when they saw Danbao becoming the God of Life, that they showed expressions of shock.","Lord Hengmu, standing on the side, didn’t forget to curry favor, pretending to be mysterious. “Actually, I knew early on that Danbao could become the God of Life. I even doubted my own eyes at first, but I never doubted Danbao’s abilities!”","This remark drew laughter from the crowd.","Elder Blu looked at Danbao, his eyes filled with nothing but relief.","“Great Elder, you can rest in peace now that you’ve seen what I’ve seen!”","Danbao bathed in the essence of Life.","Jian Wushuang only glanced at it a few times before putting his mind away.","Although Danbao had become the God of Life, there was still a stone in his heart,","continuously scrutinizing the Great Monk.","The one known as the Dao Guardian of Danbao.","The other party always had secrets.","At the moment Danbao became a god, the greed in the monk’s eyes had reached its peak.","Greedy for the God of Life?","Jian Wushuang immediately thought of a terrifying existence.","“Mie Sheng!”","It wasn’t that he was sensitive, but Mie Sheng was omnipresent.","He could even shuttle through spacetime to scheme against him.","If Mie Sheng became the God of Life, the first thing he would think of is whether he had been","schemed by Mie Sheng.","There was no way around it; the other party had caused him significant psychological trauma.","Without eliminating Mie Sheng, he couldn’t sleep soundly.","It was only now, as he became the Universe Master.","That he had some confidence.","With so many powerhouses present, his confidence was even greater.","So, he dared to face the Great Monk directly.","He wanted to see if the other party was Mie Sheng.","Danbao was crowned as a god.","The shadow of Realm King descended once again.","At the end of the Stairway to Godhood.","As Realm King descended, he held a thick book in his hand.","“Danbao!”","The halo above Realm King’s head shone as he looked at Danbao kindly, saying, “From this","moment on, you are the God of Life in the Northern Spacetime, in charge of all life, including","every blade of grass and tree!”","The book in his hand automatically flipped through pages.","It stopped on a certain page, where Danbao’s name appeared.","“God of Life: Danbao!”","Above him, there was also a divine position.","The God of Death, nameless.","Life and Death.","Just like which came first, the chicken or the egg.","Everyone was asking, which comes first.","Now the answer appeared. Death comes first, then new life.","If there was only Life without Death.","Then this place would be hell.","Only the undead in hell are Immortal.","Because they are punished for eternity.","A world without death is even more terrifying than a world with Life.","So Death must come first, then Life.","Danbao was successfully crowned.","The nine rivers of time in the Northern Spacetime trembled together.","Dozens of tributaries in the middle also connected to the end of the river of time.","Danbao transformed, wearing a green robe, even his skin was green.","The whole person’s temperament underwent a tremendous change once again.","From ignorance, to determination.","And now to wisdom.","There was a color in his eyes.","“Great Lord, I pay my respects to Realm King!” Danbao bowed slightly to Realm King.","Realm King smiled happily, “No need for formalities. From now on, we are our own people.","Here is your divine ring. Bid farewell to your little friends. There are more important things waiting for you!”","“Got it!” Danbao also understood.","The position of god was no joke!","The moment Danbao put on the ring, the Stairway to Godhood began to decay.","The Origin Source of Wanliu also washed away the erosion of metallic life."]},{"number":5968,"title":"Chapter 5968: Descent of Terror","paragraphs":["Chapter 5968: Descent of Terror","Returning to the peak of his power, Danbao swiftly arrived at the Immortal Divine Temple.","As he looked at the gathered crowd, his eyes sparkled, a smile playing on his lips.","Those closer to him gathered around, offering their congratulations.","They recounted the challenges of his journey through the Wanliu.","They also inquired about the changes Danbao had experienced since becoming a deity.","Jian Wushuang, ever curious, asked, “Danbao, how is your strength now... Do you possess the power of the Ninth Tribulation?”","He had always been curious about the strength of gods.","Vice had astonished him with his abilities.","Realm King, however, seemed somewhat modest, likening himself to rubbish.","Yet, as he observed Danbao’s aura, it was undeniably extraordinary.","There was a powerful pressure emanating from him.","Surely, he must possess the strength of the Ninth Tribulation!","However, Danbao shook his head unexpectedly, “You’re flattering me. I am merely the God of Life, overseeing the realm of Life reaching perfection. As for strength, I’m afraid I’m still not as formidable as all of you!”","“Why regress?”","Divine Wood King asked in surprise.","When Danbao took control of the Immortal Divine Temple, his personal strength was already comparable to that of an Eighth Tribulation.","How could he now be inferior to them?","There was even Wu Li, who was at the Sixth Tribulation here!","Danbao then explained slowly and calmly, “The concept of strength is something spoken of by cultivators, and it has nothing to do with gods. Whether it’s me or Realm King, we actually have no inherent strength, only responsibilities!”","This explanation finally made everyone understand.","It dispelled their previous speculations.","Only Jian Wushuang remained unconvinced, thinking that perhaps Realm King wasn’t enough.","Weiss’ strength was indeed formidable.","He had even killed the Celestial Maiden.","Who was at the level of Ninth Tribulation!","And they were duplicates of the Starry Sky’s Ninth Tribulation.","Calling him the strongest in the Northern Spacetime wasn’t an exaggeration.","If Weiss wanted someone erased, they would be.","There was still a gap between gods.","Such as between Realm King and Danbao.","One was the overseer of the Northern Spacetime.","The other was the God of Life in the Northern Spacetime.","The difference was apparent.","After discussing their curiosity, Divine Wood King and Lord Hengmu began to subtly mention their own contributions.","Like their confrontation with Chi Jiuxiao.","Protecting Danbao.","Countless battles of life and death.","They even emphasized that particular treasure several times.","Even a fool could see what they were getting at.","They wanted Danbao to fulfill his promise.","And there was Realm King.","He had to fulfill the benefits he had promised initially.","There were quite a few benefits back then!","Can’t gain knowledge without gaining weight!","Danbao, being so clever, naturally understood. He immediately sent a message to Realm King.","Whoosh!","Realm King’s projection appeared personally, slapping his head.","“Look at my memory, I almost forgot about this matter!”","Seeing Realm King come over directly, Divine Wood King and Lord Hengmu hurriedly waved their hands, “This is a trivial matter, there’s no rush...”","“Are you not in a hurry?” Realm King squinted his eyes, staring at the crowd.","The onlookers were momentarily stunned, not bothering with niceties, each wearing a serious expression.","They waited for Realm King to fulfill his promise.","“Alright, what’s yours is ultimately yours!” he said, taking out countless treasures and distributing them one by one to the crowd.","Most of them were treasures needed for crossing to the Seventh Tribulation realm.","They were treasures essential for crossing Tribulations that were hard to find in the outside","world.","Each item brought about a sense of shock when presented.","The most valuable ones were those needed for crossing the Eight Tribulations realm.","Lord Hengmu and Divine Wood King’s eyes gleamed with excitement.","After receiving the treasures, their expressions visibly changed.","After realizing that strength didn’t necessarily correlate with divine status, they no longer harbored grand illusions about the position of gods.","They preferred pursuing power.","Jian Wushuang had never been interested in such things, but he didn’t mind acquiring more","treasures.","He accepted the treasures presented by Realm King, which not only included items needed for crossing his Seventh Tribulation but also some divine power Origin Source.","Mixed within were quite a few.","These treasures were nothing significant for Realm King, but for them, they were like","treasures from the heavens.","After Realm King finished distributing his share, Danbao also stepped forward, rubbing his ring and said, “I have kept the positions promised to you earlier. I can strip three major life envoys of the Immortal Divine Temple and give them to you.”","“Umm...” Divine Wood King and Lord Hengmu hesitated.","Great Monk had been on the sidelines, indifferent to those treasures.","When Danbao mentioned bestowing the envoy positions, their brows furrowed, and their","interest piqued.","Because with Realm King present, Jian Wushuang had let down his guard.","Divine Wood King cleared his throat and spoke first, “Lord Danbao, what benefits does this","Life Envoy position offer?”","In their view, these Life Envoys weren’t much different from puppets.","Those who were used to freedom didn’t seem to have any constraints.","Initially, they pursued these envoy positions because they valued the status and the increase","in power.","Now, after some time together, they felt that not becoming an envoy wouldn’t make much","difference.","It seemed better to aim for the Ninth Tribulation realm.","So they hesitated, wanting to see the offer first.","“Being a life envoy can be very helpful with a Life source. You don’t need to feel pressured.","After becoming a Life Envoy, there are no constraints!” Danbao felt grateful to those who had","helped him, so he relaxed his stance.","After all, as a God of Life, he would definitely research the secrets of life in the future.","He wouldn’t need to engage in battles.","Most of the time, he would be in seclusion.","So he had no requirements for his subordinates.","Upon hearing this, Divine Wood King and Lord Hengmu readily agreed.","With the Life Source, they would be almost on par with Jian Wushuang.","They could continuously restore their vitality.","During battles, they would almost be invincible.","This was a huge advantage.","The two didn’t hesitate at all.","Under everyone’s gaze, Danbao crowned them as Life Envoys.","Becoming envoys, they also received a set of Ninth Tribulation-level Life Armor for free.","It could enhance their divine power.","It was similar to Jian Wushuang’s Tribulation Armor, but its power was much weaker.","His Tribulation Armor could increase his divine power by 50,000 when his basic divine power","was 1.5 million.","That was about one-third.","The Life Armor that Divine Wood King and Lord Hengmu obtained could only increase their","divine power by about one-fifth.","For example, with a basic divine power of 10 million, wearing the Life Armor could increase it","to 12 million.","Despite this, they were still quite satisfied.","The journey to the Wanliu Divine Tree was indeed worthwhile.","They made a killing!","Everyone was very happy.","They had won everything.","It was only in their joy that they overlooked one person.","The originally ostentatious Great Monk.","After the coronation, Danbao remembered Great Monk and turned to find him.","Seeing Great Monk, just as he was about to speak, Realm King intervened. “Dao Guardian!” Realm King exclaimed in surprise. “The Dao Guardian I appointed?”","He had thought that Great Monk voluntarily became Danbao’s Dao Guardian! Now, hearing that he was the Guardian appointed by Realm King himself, he felt astonished."]},{"number":5969,"title":"Chapter 5969: I’ve Long Known That You’re Not Human!","paragraphs":["Chapter 5969: I’ve Long Known That You’re Not Human!","His plan didn’t account for this twist!","Everyone wore a baffled expression.","Jian Wushuang was the first to react. He charged straight towards Elder Blu, his aura exploding, and with a pointed finger, he shouted, “Great Monk, I’ve seen through your deception, show yourself!”","The Sword Intent in his fingertip carried the essence of reincarnation.","Even though Great Monk was at the peak of the Eighth Tribulation realm, he didn’t dare to be careless.","He quickly retreated, his expression filled with astonishment, “Jian Wushuang, what are you doing?”","The others didn’t understand why Jian Wushuang suddenly made a move.","“Mie Sheng, you may deceive others, but not me!” Jian Wushuang drew his sword directly!","That faint yet potent aura of Death.","He was most aware of it.","But he didn’t understand why Realm King hadn’t detected it.","As a Realm King with numerous divine subordinates, he should be most familiar with Life and Death!","But even Realm King at this moment wore a shocked expression.","Great Monk confronted Jian Wushuang.","The others leaned towards believing Jian Wushuang.","Because Great Monk hailed from the Wanliu Universe.","He was a sudden appearance.","Although Jian Wushuang had also arrived in the Ancient Moon Spacetime by chance, at least in terms of seniority, he was Wu Li’s grandnephew.","But now Wu Li was somewhat confused.","One side was his mysterious old man, while the other was an imposter grandnephew.","“Realm King, if you doubt, you can try. He harbors the power of Death within him, and he’s likely from the future, not a contemporary powerhouse!” Jian Wushuang explained while facing off against Mie Sheng.","Upon hearing the name Mie Sheng, Realm King’s expression visibly changed, as if he had remembered something.","“Mie Sheng!” He instantly recalled the flat boat in the Starry Sky from before, surprised, “The God of Death in the Starry Sky, so you haven’t left!”","The Great Monk knew he couldn’t hold it any longer, his identity had been exposed by Realm King, making his words more convincing than Jian Wushuang’s.","He sneered, no longer pretending, “So, you’ve found me out. I’m really curious, why can a Universe Master at the Eighth Tribulation recognize me!”","As his words fell, Great Monk tore apart his facade.","A pointed circular horn emerged, followed by a wisp of black smoke rising.","The familiar appearance of Mie Sheng appeared, utterly disregarding Realm King, glaring at Jian Wushuang, “Mortal, answer me!”","“Don’t you recognize me?” Jian Wushuang exclaimed in surprise, then realized that this Mie Sheng was probably not from the same timeline as the Mie Sheng of the Original Universe.","“Should I know you?” Mie Sheng found it somewhat amusing.","Being questioned by a Universe Master at the Eighth Tribulation.","He was the God of Death in the Starry Sky.","His status was much higher than a Realm King from an affiliated spacetime.","The Starry Sky.","That was where the gods gathered.","It was also the gathering place for peak powerhouses.","And the ultimate destination of the world.","All converged in the Starry Sky.","As the God of Death in the Starry Sky.","Mie Sheng was naturally arrogant.","He didn’t regard Realm King highly at all.","Moreover, Realm King of the Northern Spacetime had long since perished.","His combat power was like air.","No one could stop him.","When the God of Life was born.","It was also when he forged the cycle.","As a god in the Starry Sky, he had existed for endless years.","Not only did he create countless secrets of Death.","But he had also elevated his own strength to an unimaginable level.","It’s just that the Northern Spacetime couldn’t accommodate him.","Even so, the moment his aura leaked out, his divine power surged instantly.","Reaching the pinnacle of the Nine Great Spacetimes.","Even the Immortal Divine Temple trembled.","The power of this aura surpassed everyone.","Jian Wushuang was also extremely astonished.","Mie Sheng’s divine power had reached astronomical figures.","It made them despair directly.","Jian Wushuang was almost collapsing.","He had underestimated Mie Sheng.","The vast divine power surpassed their understanding.","It was definitely at the level of the Ninth Tribulation realm, or even beyond.","There was no way to resist.","Buzz!","Mie Sheng raised his hand slightly, tearing apart the Wanliu Divine Tree.","Revealing a piece of firmament.","The scene in the firmament is exactly the Wanliu Divine Realm.","Countless strong ones outside also noticed Mie Sheng.","They didn’t know what had happened yet.","Seeing the destruction of the Wanliu Divine Tree, Realm King couldn’t sit still anymore.","“Regardless of what you seek, this is the Northern Spacetime. Even if you come from the Starry Sky, you must understand that there are supreme rules to abide by. Aren’t you afraid of death and annihilation?”","“Haha!” Mie Sheng laughed heartily, shaking the Immortal Divine Temple to pieces with a","wave of his hand. “Are you threatening me?”","The shattered Immortal Divine Temple began to continuously gather and restore itself.","Danbao stared at Mie Sheng, despair evident in his eyes. “Are you here for me?”","He had now become the God of Life and could sense the Deathly power emanating from Mie","Sheng.","There was a terrifying demonic power intent on devouring him.","“No, I am here for Life. Not only you, but the Gods of Life from the other three major spacetimes will also be devoured by me, forging a great cycle. You should feel proud to merge","with me!” Mie Sheng’s words remained as arrogant as ever.","Just like the original Mie Sheng of the Original Universe.","Jian Wushuang swallowed hard, silently seeking help.","The current Mie Sheng came from the future, or perhaps from the past.","Anyway, he was different from the Mie Sheng of the Original Universe.","Originally, Weiss had said that if Mie Sheng truly managed to traverse spacetime, he would","personally intervene and eliminate him.","Apart from Weiss, Jian Wushuang couldn’t think of anyone else who could help them.","Mie Sheng’s terrifying divine power was too strong.","No one could stop him.","In his anxiety, a voice sounded in his mind, “Don’t worry, listen to his plan!”","Weiss’s transmission slightly eased Jian Wushuang’s expression.","Only then did he realize that Realm King had been signaling to him long ago, indicating","clearly that he should seek Weiss’ help.","However, the Realm King didn’t know that Weiss had already promised Jian Wushuang to intervene against those who traversed time.","Only Jian Wushuang knew about Mie Sheng’s time-traveling.","Not even Realm King knew.","If he hadn’t told Weiss, Weiss wouldn’t have known that the God of Death from the Starry Sky","had actually traversed time, attempting to devour the gods of the four Major Spacetimes.","Weiss in the Origin Source Starry Sky also stood up at this moment.","The first thing he did was to contact the strong ones in the Starry Sky.","In the distant and mysterious Starry Sky, there were countless divine beings.","Mie Sheng was among them.","He was unaware of the external events.","Mie Sheng, who attempted to devour life was traversing different time periods into the","future.","The true self had always been in the Starry Sky.","Or it could be said that it was in the past now.","The real Mie Sheng was in the future.","“This is quite troublesome!” Weiss rubbed his temples.","He was almost dizzy with the complexity of the situation.","But since he encountered it, he had to eliminate it.","Time travel was not allowed.","Once discovered, even the true self would be eliminated.","This was an iron rule.","Mie Sheng also didn’t expect himself to be so unlucky.","Traveling to the past, wanting to devour the gods of the past, yet encountering Weiss."]},{"number":5970,"title":"Chapter 5970: Erasing Everything!","paragraphs":["Chapter 5970: Erasing Everything!","Mie Sheng, blinded by his arrogance, fixed his gaze on Danbao, a smirk playing at the corner of his lips. “Kid, you should consider yourself lucky!”","With those words, he reached out his claw towards Danbao, intent on snuffing out his life in one fell swoop.","“Time to act!” Jian Wushuang urged, feeling that Mie Sheng regarded them like ants, finding his lengthy words unnecessary.","It was akin to when he participated in the blood sacrifice of mortals; there was no need to divulge his intentions.","Speaking was just a waste of time.","Ping!","A crisp sound echoed through the space-time.","Time and space instantly solidified.","But people did not.","Everyone could still move.","Mie Sheng too.","Only space and time froze.","Then, they all saw a figure appear above the sky.","Holding a scepter, with white hair tied in a bun, it was Weiss.","Everyone was familiar with him.","They had seen Weiss long ago.","They just didn’t know his identity.","They hadn’t expected him to appear again at this moment.","He was the lifesaver for Jian Wushuang and Realm King.","“You’re finished!” Realm King immediately stepped forward, pointing at Mie Sheng and scolding, “A mere small god dares not kneel before Lord Star Spirit.”","This display of power dynamics left Jian Wushuang somewhat speechless.","Even though he was a Realm King.","He didn’t even bother with a shred of dignity.","No wonder he had fallen early, now reduced to an avatar, but still managing the Northern Spacetime.","It was as if he had never died.","“Star Spirit!” Mie Sheng hadn’t yet noticed Weiss, but Realm King’s words startled him.","Then, he turned his head to look at the sky, completely stunned.","Regardless of the deity, there was a hierarchy.","For example, in the Northernern Spacetime, the highest god was the Realm King.","Then came the God of Reincarnation.","Life and Death.","But they had not yet appeared.","Mie Sheng was the God of Death in the starry sky, above him was the God of Reincarnation.","However, the previous God of Reincarnation had fallen.","So he dared to plot for the position of the God of Reincarnation.","Not only was he plotting, but the God of Life in the Starry Sky was also plotting.","But they didn’t have as much courage as he did.","Daring to attract the attention of the Four Great Spacetimes.","Attempting to devour the Gods of Life in the Four Great Spacetimes, merging their own death, thus becoming the God of Reincarnation.","Taking it a step further!","While the God of Reincarnation was undoubtedly powerful, there existed even more powerful beings.","Such as the Cycle of Time.","Above the Cycle of Time.","There was even more...","As for Star Spirit.","That was a noble existence above the gods.","It was the Star Spirit by the side of the creator of the Starry Sky.","With just one glance, the pupils of Mie Sheng nearly burst. “Weiss... Lord Weiss, how can you be here?”","“Haha!” Weiss chuckled, covering his mouth. “Of course, to erase you!”","Mie Sheng kept retreating, his face showing genuine despair, even more so than the power of his own Death.","He never expected to encounter Star Spirit.","It was an existence much stronger than a god.","Forget about resisting, he didn’t even have the courage to stand before them.","“My Lord!” Mie Sheng knelt down directly, his whole being defeated, devoid of any vigor.","He knelt on the ground, devoutly pleading, “Lord Weiss, please kill me!”","The scene left everyone stunned.","They had thought Mie Sheng would at least struggle.","But like a dead dog, he knelt on the ground begging Weiss to kill him.","Among those present, or the outsiders who were puzzled, only one person understood the reason behind it.","Jian Wushuang, although aware of Weiss’s strength, never expected Mie Sheng to willingly seek death. He sent a message to Weiss, cautioning him to be careful.","If Realm King knew about this, he would probably laugh his teeth off.","Jian Wushuang was deeply afraid of Mie Sheng from the bottom of his heart, thinking that the other party was showing weakness on purpose, with some hidden cards.","After hearing the message, Weiss turned to Jian Wushuang and said, “Then, shall I leave this opportunity to you?”","“N-No... no need!” Jian Wushuang shook his head frantically.","“Then don’t regret it!”","After Weiss finished speaking, with a wave of his scepter, he directly obliterated the space and","time where Mie Sheng was located.","At the moment Mie Sheng disappeared, the God of Death in the Starry Sky began to shatter.","And the Mie Shengs in the different times and spaces of the three major spacetimes also","shattered.","Only the Mie Sheng in the Original Universe remained.","Realm King was the first to notice and couldn’t help but sigh at Jian Wushuang. “Jian","Wushuang, you just missed the best opportunity!”","“What opportunity?” Jian Wushuang was still immersed in the moment Weiss acted, somewhat incomprehensible to Realm King’s words.","Next, Realm King explained the structure of the original body.","Jian Wushuang suddenly realized.","Just now, if Weiss had let him take action, he could have killed Mie Sheng.","And it would have also severed the causal connection, killing the Mie Sheng in the Original","Universe.","He wouldn’t have needed to bring people all the way to Qishen Temple.","“I see!” Jian Wushuang was not disappointed. In his consciousness, he had already regarded","Mie Sheng as an opponent.","It was good to leave the Mie Sheng in the Original Universe.","Consider it an opportunity for him.","To personally kill the last clone of his opponent.","“Realm King, how strong is the Mie Sheng in the Original Universe? Is it as powerful as the","Mie Sheng just now?” Jian Wushuang still had some worries.","If it was as powerful as just now.","Then he couldn’t go back immediately.","He still had to continue cultivating.","Upon hearing his words, Realm King smiled, “No, if any Mie Sheng were that powerful, you","would have fallen long ago. That Mie Sheng is just one of many clones, with only average","strength!”","“Average?” Jian Wushuang didn’t dare to be careless, asking further, “How average is it?”","Weiss drifted over from a distance, and Realm King hastily stopped, saying, “Some things should not be revealed!”","Jian Wushuang frowned and looked at Weiss. It seemed intentional between the two.","So he didn’t pursue it further. As long as it wasn’t as powerful as just now, advancing to the","Seventh Tribulation was almost enough.","Even now, it was not impossible to go back with people.","Some things didn’t need to wait until everything was perfect.","He still needed to put some pressure on himself.","Otherwise, crushing opponents would be less fun.","It was precisely because of this that each of his opponents would continuously grow beneath","This nose, even surpassing him.","If he were a bit more ruthless, there wouldn’t be so many things now.","Mie Sheng was left with the last clone.","The Celestial Maiden also had one clone left.","Inside the Temple of World Annihilation in the Original Universe.","Mie Sheng seemed to sense a strong unease.","Then that unease disappeared.","He looked through the Qishen Temple with his eyes, but found no reason.","In the current Original Spacetime.","The power of Qishen Temple had already shrunk into a small group.","Millions of epochs had passed.","In the current original spacetime.","It had already undergone a complete transformation.","The Seventh Tribulation realm was everywhere.","Those acquaintances of Jian Wushuang had all become Universe Masters one by one.","Compared to the Ancient Moon Spacetime, the Original Spacetime was still somewhat","immature.","There were very few Scattered Tribulations.","Mostly, there were Universe Masters."]},{"number":5971,"title":"Chapter 5971: Numb Zhen Ling","paragraphs":["Chapter 5971: Numb Zhen Ling","Most Universe Masters were powerful figures from the Temple of World Annihilation.","Qishen Temple only controlled one-tenth of the Original Spacetime territory, with its strong individuals comprising only two-tenths.","If it weren’t for Zhen Ling’s control over several spacetime treasures, including the Universe Treasures of Ninth Tribulation, the Temple of World Annihilation would have breached it long ago.","Mie Sheng kept a close watch on Qishen Temple.","Within Qishen Temple, Zhen Ling, however, gazed into the distant River of Time.","“Jian Wushuang, you all need to hurry!” Zhen Ling prayed inwardly, for he was barely holding","on.","A storm was still gathering.","Next time, Qishen Temple’s old ship might just sink.","Standing at the peak of Grave God Mountain, Zhen Ling’s eyes betrayed his worry.","Suddenly, footsteps approached from behind. After a brief pause, a voice rang out, “Lord Zhen Ling, Wan Xing have fallen!”","Bad news arrived.","Zhen Ling closed his eyes slightly.","After Jian Wushuang and the others, who were once the most outstanding, left.","Wan Xing became the most promising group of Inheritors within Qishen Temple.","Zhen Ling’s foresight was accurate. Later, when Wan Xing reached the Tribulation realm, it only took a hundred millennia for them to become Universe Masters of the Fifth Tribulation.","Later, they even reached the pinnacle of the Fifth Tribulation.","Becoming a formidable force within Qishen Temple.","Now, however, they have fallen.","Standing on Grave God Mountain, he lost count of how many pieces of bad news he heard.","“I understand!” Zhen Ling paused. He didn’t have time to grieve now; he could only bury those fallen inheritors on Grave God Mountain. If they succeeded one day, he would pay his respects then.","If they failed.","Then let them rest forever!","...","Ancient Moon Spacetime.","Above the Wanliu Divine Realm.","The Immortal Divine Temple had already left the universe within the Divine Wood.","And the Wanliu Divine Tree had also been taken by Weiss.","Leaving behind a land nourished by life.","Divine Wood King immediately declared this place as the ancestral land of the Ancient Wood Sect.","Preparing to revive the Ancient Wood Sect.","The former strong figures of the Ancient Wood Sect, the defectors betrayed, the dead perished.","Now there were hardly any left.","Divine Wood King felt that the foundation was still there.","At least within the sect’s treasury, there were countless mundane treasures that could continue to be cultivated.","He still didn’t know that those treasures had long been taken away by the chief disciple he had appointed.","That chief disciple also perished within the Wanliu Universe, destroyed along with Babidi.","Speaking of Babidi.","Jian Wushuang also thought of Chi Jiuxiao.","Already suppressed by Danbao within the Immortal Divine Temple.","Once consciousness was restored, he would be a powerful giant of the Ninth Tribulation.","The Giant God Clan, known as the premier race in the Starry Sky, even had true gods within their ranks.","Their heritage was extremely profound.","It was unclear what would happen after he regained consciousness.","But that was all for later.","Many of the strong who entered the Immortal Divine Temple had now bid farewell to Danbao and left the temple one by one.","Returning to Ancient Moon Spacetime like heroes.","Welcomed by envious eyes from outsiders.","When Danbao created the peak resurrection method, they would be the first beneficiaries.","Moreover, before he left, they were bestowed with countless forces of Life.","Even if Danbao needed billions of epochs, they could endure.","Many people left successively.","But Jian Wushuang and Wu Li were not in a hurry.","Because Weiss was leaving too.","“Lord Weiss, are you leaving just like that?” Jian Wushuang couldn’t accept it. Having a powerful figure residing within him gave him confidence, so suddenly leaving was hard to","accept.","Weiss smiled faintly, holding the mischievous cat, “There will be opportunities to meet again in the future. I have completed the three things I came here to do, there’s no need to linger. We should meet again when you arrive at the Starry Sky or Realm God Continent.” “The Realm God Continent?” He was curious; he had only heard the name, but he knew about the Starry Sky. He just didn’t know what the Realm God Continent was for!","Initially, Realm King also promised them that he would send them to cultivate in the Realm","God Continent.","But there was no need for that now.","They were all going back with treasures to wait for resurrection!","After his resurrection, Jian Wushuang resumed his cultivation journey, putting aside thoughts","of further adventures for the time being.","But for Jian Wushuang, it was never too early to plan ahead.","He was curious about the Realm God Continent and its nature.","“The Realm God Continent does not belong to your Northern Spacetime; it connects the four Major Spacetimes and was created by a powerful being. If you have the chance, you must go there. Perhaps you will meet me!” Weiss responded casually.","Jian Wushuang nodded, “I will.”","Though he had only obtained the first half of the Extreme Freedom Intent Technique, he","couldn’t practice it yet.","But when the time came, he would seek out the second half.","He would have to actively search for Weiss then.","After bidding their final farewells, Realm King and Jian Wushuang saw Weiss off together.","With a wave of the scepter, a tunnel of colorful light appeared.","Weiss glanced back with a smile and disappeared before their eyes.","Then the space returned to its calm state.","“Star Spirit!” Jian Wushuang muttered to himself, then turned to Realm King, asking, “Are","Star Spirits also gods in the Starry Sky?”","The Realm King nodded in silence, “Yes, and they are the most powerful gods. Among the stars, there are twelve Star Spirits, their status is very high. If you can establish a connection with Lord Weiss, you should work hard in the future. I have high hopes for you!”","The Twelve Star Spirits.","They were the top twelve strong beings in the Starry Sky.","From the era of opening the Starry Sky to the present day.","No one could rival them.","They were practically invincible.","It reminded Jian Wushuang of Teacher Xuan Yi.","Being able to give him treasures like the Skysight Heavenly Chessboard, he probably wasn’t","weak at all.","At least on par with Realm King.","Or even higher. However, when he asked Weiss about Teacher Xuan Yi, the latter didn’t know anything.","Perhaps Teacher Xuan Yi didn’t reveal his true identity to him!","On the other side, Weiss passed through the colorful tunnel. Directly entering the Starry Sky beyond the reach of ordinary people.","In the vast dome of the Starry Sky, there was a temple. After entering the Starry Sky, Weiss instantly moved to this place.","He casually threw Beerus into his own great hall and then went to the depths of the temple.","Upon entering the temple, he no longer moved instantly but strolled into a side hall of the temple.","There was someone inside, who looked very similar to Weiss, holding a scepter in his hand as","well.","Facing this person, Weiss respectfully bowed, “Great High Priest, I wish to see His Majesty","the God King!”","“Wait a moment!” The person in the hall who resembled Weiss was called the Great High","Priest, the steward of the temple. Despite being a steward, his power ranked in the top three.","He turned and opened the door of the side hall, but after entering for a moment, he returned.","He gestured for Weiss to enter the room.","As Weiss passed by the Great High Priest, he slightly bowed in gratitude.","Then he entered the hall.","“Your Majesty the God King, regarding the matters of the Northern Spacetime...” Weiss","recounted everything he had seen, and concluded, “I followed your instructions and chose Beerus. Jian Wushuang is still in the Northern Spacetime!”","“Good.” A figure behind the desk in the hall, with their back to Weiss, just lightly acknowledged, “There’s nothing urgent. You may leave for now!”"]},{"number":5972,"title":"Chapter 5972: God King","paragraphs":["Chapter 5972: God King","He was the God King.","The creator of the Starry Sky.","The strongest throughout eternity.","The God of Creation!","The initiator of the Supreme Rules, the ancestor of all practitioners.","In terms of status and power, he was unparalleled.","That’s what a true heavyweight looks like!","Just hearing the other party’s voice, Weiss felt an immense pressure.","Even though they hadn’t met face-to-face, he bowed respectfully, retreated from the main hall, and only then could he breathe freely again.","After leaving the main hall, there was no one else in sight.","Because it was deducible that Weiss was the only one to visit the God King.","Once Weiss left, there was no need for anyone to stay here.","“Beerus isn’t a bad choice either!” Weiss chuckled to himself, a smile appearing on his face as The calmly left the main hall.","...","Ancient Moon Spacetime.","As Weiss departed, Realm King also prepared to leave with Danbao.","Danbao invited him to go to Realm God Continent together.","But he had more important matters to attend to, so he politely declined.","Turning to the remaining people.","Only Elder Blu and Wu Li remained.","Elder Blu, needless to say, was directly promoted to a demigod powerhouse, still holding the position of War God.","Reaching the strength of a Half-Step Ninth Tribulation realm in one step.","Realm King personally infused his own Realm King’s power into him.","Helping Elder Blu stabilize his realm.","Then it was Wu Li’s turn.","Jian Wushuang smirked and looked at Wu Li, saying, “Brother Wu Li, now that your old man has fallen, what are your plans?”","“Don’t!” Wu Li hurriedly waved his hand when he heard Jian Wushuang’s words, “I don’t have any relationship with that bald monk, don’t joke with me like that, I can’t take it!”","“Haha!” He walked up to Wu Li and patted his shoulder, his tone slightly serious, “Then you should go with Danbao, there’s nothing worth reminiscing about in Ancient Moon Spacetime, we’ll have a chance to drink together in the future!”","Wu Li also understood that Jian Wushuang had secrets, so when he jokingly suggested Wu Li follow Danbao, he was actually helping him.","Entering Ancient Moon Spacetime was because Wu Li entered the Wanliu Divine Tree.","But now the Wanliu Divine Tree was gone.","But because of the other party, he had grown a lot.","It wasn’t a big deal to say a few words.","Danbao also understood Jian Wushuang’s intention. For Wu Li, he was also a benefactor, so he immediately invited Wu Li to accompany him to the Realm God Continent.","“Now that God of Life has spoken, if I decline again, it would be disrespectful, alright, I’ll go to the Realm God Continent to take a look, and I’ll also be Danbao’s guard or something.” But as soon as he finished speaking, those golden-armored warriors, as well as the three original messengers of life, all stepped forward.","Wu Li hurriedly waved his hand and said, “Just kidding, just kidding!”","He wasn’t prepared to compete with these guys for a job.","After everything was arranged, it was time to say goodbye.","Before leaving, the Realm King also gave Jian Wushuang a surprise.","This surprise genuinely caught Jian Wushuang off guard.","“Wu Zuo!”","This time Jian Wushuang was truly delighted.","He met an old friend in a foreign land!","And this old friend was plump and oily.","From afar, he could feel the aura of a Seventh Tribulation realm.","“Brother Wushuang!” Wu Zuo saw Jian Wushuang flying up from below and also took the initiative to greet him.","The Immortal Divine Temple had already torn through the void and left Ancient Moon Spacetime.","Super strong individuals from all directions also gradually left Ancient Moon Spacetime.","Waiting for the God of Life to create the method of resurrection.","But before leaving, some people found Jian Wushuang.","They wanted to purchase some Life power from him.","Wu Zuo thought these people were threatening Jian Wushuang and was about to curse at them, almost resorting to violence.","Some of those Scattered Tribulations weren’t even strong figures in Ancient Moon Spacetime.","Jian Wushuang didn’t actually need to help these people.","But he also needed to prepare for future tribulations.","So he ended up selling a lot of Life power.","Harvesting a large number of primordial stones.","A total of over a hundred million.","Enough for him to pass the Eighth Tribulation.","This made those strong individuals who didn’t come extremely jealous.","Life power was supposed to be unsellable.","Not even a trace of it at countless auctions.","But Jian Wushuang had a sea of life.","How could it not shock and amaze people.","Although he had treasures.","No one dared to covet.","Not only because of Wu Zuo’s relationship, but also because of Jian Wushuang’s strength.","A Universe Master at the Sixth Tribulation realm with such a huge amount of Life power.","His strength was extraordinary.","After everything was settled.","Jian Wushuang declined the invitation from Divine Wood King.","He wanted to recruit him as the second in command of the Ancient Wood Faction.","But Jian Wushuang wasn’t interested.","In the end, he gave it to Lord Hengmu.","The two of them got along well.","Jian Wushuang and Wu Zuo didn’t stay long, as this wasn’t the place for conversation.","Knowing that he was selling Life power, countless people would come one after another.","He’d be exhausted.","After collecting enough treasures, he pulled Wu Zuo away from the Wanliu Divine Realm.","Preparing to visit the Daughter Kingdom.","The two of them were riding in that silver-gold pyramid.","Within the pyramid captured by Jian Wushuang.","It had long been remodeled by him.","Now it was used as a flying treasure.","However, some things inside could still be used, but they needed to find a puppet master to","make some modifications.","Originally, they approached Lian Xing, but his skills were limited.","In the Ancient Moon Spacetime, he could still be considered.","But looking at the entire Northern Spacetime, there was still some gap.","To restore this metal treasure to its original state, at least a metal brain was needed.","Such a thing could either be found in the Southern Spacetime or on the Realm God Continent.","It was extremely troublesome.","Now Jian Wushuang didn’t have that much time. Once they left the Ancient Moon Spacetime, finding an Eightth Tribulation realm Divine Craftsman to repair it casually would be enough.","For example, being able to nurture metal life!","He had infinite Life power!","And he also had infinite power of All Things.","The power of All Things could be transformed into divine power.","By then, relying on the silver-gold pyramid, he would be able to nurture countless armies.","Among the treasures he obtained this time, only this pyramid was remarkable. Although the treasures given by Realm King were precious, they could still be bought.","But this pyramid couldn’t be bought with money.","Even in the Southern Spacetime, it was still the top metal treasure.","For treasures at the Ninth Tribulation level, at least an Eighth Tribulation Universe Master","was needed for casting and repairing.","Whoosh!","Inside the pyramid.","Wu Zuo was casually exploring, curious. “Brother Wushuang, this treasure of yours is quite impressive, powerful, and the space is not bad. Sitting here is quite prestigious!” Now Wu Zuo, like a scion of a prestigious family, enjoyed showing off.","With a wine glass in one hand and the other hand behind his back, he exuded an air of","authority.","“Just made some casual modifications. Actually, the Origin Source and structure inside are damaged. It’s because I was too ruthless when I took action!” Jian Wushuang also took the opportunity to boast a little about himself.","What he said was true. It was indeed because he had acted too ruthlessly.","Otherwise, it could have been preserved more intact.","Wu Zuo swayed the wine glass and, upon hearing that this treasure still had some damage,","immediately said, “Then we must hurry to repair it. Let me introduce you to someone, an ancient existence in our Northern Spacetime, who has been studying casting for countless ages. He will surely be able to help you fix it!”"]},{"number":5973,"title":"Chapter 5973: Turning to Ashes","paragraphs":["Chapter 5973: Turning to Ashes","Upon hearing that it was an ancient existence, Jian Wushuang perked up immediately.","In truth, Jian Wushuang had only recently met Wu Zuo.","But helping to repair a treasure was no issue at all.","After some small talk, the two sat down and began recounting their experiences over the years.","Wu Zuo was quite familiar with Jian Wushuang’s affairs, despite only spanning three epochs, they were quite eventful, yet quickly recounted.","However, Wu Zuo had spent millions of epochs cultivating alongside Realm King, encountering far more events.","For instance, Jian Wushuang had encountered Fan Tianfeng and Zhen Wuyang.","Wu Zuo, on the other hand, had encountered nearly everyone.","Except for Hu Qing.","He knew where everyone else was located.","“Hu Qing should be in the Ancient Moon Ruins!” Jian Wushuang provided the answer, recalling Hu Qing’s warning not to go there.","Now, however, it seemed necessary.","Upon hearing about the Ancient Moon Ruins, Wu Zuo’s expression darkened, exclaiming, “How could it be in the Ancient Moon Ruins? It has become a death trap, turned to ashes not long ago!”","“What!” Jian Wushuang exclaimed in surprise, “Turned to ashes? When did this happen?”","It was at the moment Danbao ascended to godhood that the Ancient Moon Ruins turned to ashes.","This was news to Jian Wushuang.","He felt a twinge of worry for Hu Qing.","Seeing Jian Wushuang’s troubled expression, Wu Zuo quickly changed the subject, mentioning Fan Tianfeng’s demise.","She had fallen, along with that Flame God.","Hearing this news, Jian Wushuang wasn’t surprised, but the demise of the Flame God’s main body intrigued him.","But as Realm King had said, the power of the Origin Source in the Original Universe was weak, yet it possessed the strength of peak Eighth Tribulation realm and above.","Killing the Flame God was quite normal.","Even from such a distance, it could be done in a single strike.","The strength of the Flame God made it difficult even for the top of the Eighth Tribulation realm.","Having a divine power of around 5 million was already quite remarkable.","“I advised her back then, but she was too stubborn!” Jian Wushuang sighed, taking a sip of","wine.","Pouring himself a drink, Wu Zuo spoke up, “Actually, if it weren’t for that old man Realm King holding me back, I might have returned long ago!”","When the topic shifted to the Qishen Temple, their expressions changed.","Jian Wushuang was fine, just feeling that three epochs had passed.","But Wu Zuo had endured a million epochs.","From an Emperor to stepping into the Seventh Tribulation, his longing for the Qishen Temple had grown stronger.","This made him even more loyal to the Qishen Temple.","Knowing that Zhen Wuyang couldn’t bear to leave his wife and children, choosing to stay in the universe of the Wanliu Divine Treeforever, Wu Zuo cursed Zhen Wuyang.","“Well, he’s just a Fifth Tribulation cultivator with limited abilities. Perhaps he saw the gap between us back then and chose to stay, knowing that returning would not benefit him!” Wu Zuo reasoned.","Zhen Wuyang was once his benefactor; it wouldn’t hurt to speak a good word for him. “Hmph, let’s not talk about him anymore!” Wu Zuo smacked his lips and wiped his mouth, then turned to Jian Wushuang.","“Brother Wushuang, now that you’ve reached the Universe Master at the Sixth Tribulation, how’s your divine power?”","They had arrived in the Ancient Moon Spacetime.","Both had embarked on the cultivation of divine power.","In fact, most in the Northern Spacetime were cultivating divine power.","Very few were cultivating the Origin Source.","So, when they discussed their combat strength, it naturally revolved around divine power.","“My basic divine power isn’t much at the moment, only 1.5 million!” Jian Wushuang confidently reported his basic divine power.","With a base divine power of 1.5 million, that was the standard for the Seventh Tribulation Realm.","But when the well-traveled Wu Zuo heard this, he felt somewhat disappointed. “That’s indeed not much!”","Seeing the slight disdain from the other party, Jian Wushuang immediately felt a surge of","temper.","“Wanna try?” he challenged, tilting his head to indicate a nearby martial arena.","It was one he had personally constructed, incredibly sturdy.","“Let’s give it a shot!” Wu Zuo’s hands were itching for a challenge.","Although Jian Wushuang mentioned his base divine power was only 1.5 million, he didn’t mention his explosive potential!","The reason Wu Zuo felt disappointed was that the impact Jian Wushuang had given him back then was too powerful.","Even as an Emperor, Jian Wushuang’s divine power could surge to over 100,000.","For a Universe Master in the Sixth Tribulation, the baseline should be at least 2 million!","Before, when Wu Zuo could contend with Jian Wushuang, Jian Wushuang was just a Dao Lord and couldn’t bully a junior.","Later, as they both reached higher levels, Wu Zuo found himself completely outmatched.","Now, he had finally caught up to Jian Wushuang’s pace, even surpassing him.","Reaching the level of a Seventh Tribulation Universe Master.","Moreover, he had cultivated to the pinnacle of Realm King’s secret technique, enabling him to integrate his own Dao Arena into his body.","Like Jian Wushuang, before reaching the Eighth Tribulation, he could bring his own Origin","Source Universe with him.","In simple terms, it meant placing the Origin Source Universe within his divine body.","Although Wu Zuo was only a Seventh Tribulation Universe Master, he could rival top Eighth Tribulation experts with his Dao Arena.","Ordinary Seventh Tribulation Universe Masters could match typical Eighth Tribulation","experts with their Dao Arenas.","As a direct disciple of Realm King, Wu Zuo’s strength naturally surpassed that of ordinary Seventh Tribulation Universe Masters.","“Please!” Jian Wushuang waved his hand, and both of them flickered into the martial arena.","The space shifted.","“What kind of battlefield do you want?” Jian Wushuang asked.","Wu Zuo hesitated for a moment and said, “A desert!”","Whoosh!","The martial arena instantly transformed into an endless desert.","“Is this okay?” Wu Zuo was astonished.","Jian Wushuang, just to show off, replied casually, “Of course!”","The two faced each other from a distance.","Their divine powers remained unmoved.","Neither of them rushed to unleash it.","Swish!","Wu Zuo made the first move.","In an instant, he appeared in front of Jian Wushuang, striking out with a palm.","The entire desert trembled.","Sand and gravel swept up, covering the sky, like doomsday.","Jian Wushuang didn’t evade; the clash of divine powers was what they were here for.","Otherwise, where would be the fun?","But after taking this palm, he regretted it somewhat.","“Base divine power, up to 2.5 million. Brother Wu Zuo, not bad!” Jian Wushuang exclaimed in","surprise, inwardly noting, “No wonder he’s so arrogant; his base divine power is over 2","million!”","Upon hearing this, Wu Zuo, while attacking, modestly replied, “It’s nothing special, just a","million more than yours!”","“Is that so?” Jian Wushuang chuckled lightly, and a dark battle armor appeared on him.","His divine power instantly increased by 500,000.","This was the Tribulation Armor!","With the crazily operating Tribulation Armor, he gained an additional 500,000 base divine","power.","He instantly rose to another level and actively punched towards Wu Zuo’s chest.","Caught off guard, Wu Zuo adopted a defensive stance, unleashing countless light waves","toward Jian Wushuang’s face.","Each light wave could slay ordinary Seventh Tribulation Scattered Tribulation experts.","Jian Wushuang had to retreat.","But as he distanced himself, Wu Zuo was relentless, continuously bombarding Jian Wushuang","with light waves from both hands.","Explosions resounded, shaking the entire desert.","With a low roar, Wu Zuo unleashed millions of attacks every moment, continuing for a full","stick of incense before finally stopping."]},{"number":5974,"title":"Chapter 5974: Sparring","paragraphs":["Chapter 5974: Sparring","In the midst of such intense attacks, his breathing remained unchanged. “How about that?”","Jian Wushuang’s figure was obscured in the swirling dust.","“Marvelous!”","Jian Wushuang lowered his hands from before him.","Having withstood so many attacks head-on, it was indeed exhilarating.","He quickly found himself accustomed to the sensation of battle.","In the years spent within Wanliu, he rarely had the chance to unleash his full power.","He was even more eager than Wu Zuo.","“The real fun is yet to come!” Wu Zuo exclaimed, “Watch this!”","“Realm King’s Power!”","Hum!","Wu Zuo’s aura instantly turned golden, and his divine power began to increase significantly. It surged from two and a half million to three million in just a few breaths.","“Not bad at all!” Jian Wushuang praised!","Realm King’s power could amplify divine power by 500,000, which was indeed impressive.","No wonder it was a secret technique treasured by the Realm Kings.","Wu Zuo chuckled, revealing his trump card.","He told Jian Wushuang that he could wield 5 times the power of Realm God, meaning in his peak state, his divine power could reach 5 million.","That was already the threshold of the top tier in the Eighth Tribulation.","And that didn’t even take into account the Origin Source Dao Arena!","Even with just a forty percent increase, the divine power in the Origin Source Dao Arena would reach 6 million.","Jian Wushuang was truly impressed by Wu Zuo’s strength. However, he was no pushover himself.","“Beast God’s Power!”","Hum!","“Fivefold!”","With a low roar, Jian Wushuang’s divine power surged from 2 million to 3 million, an increase of a full 1 million.","Now their divine powers were evenly matched, and they clashed once more, relentlessly attacking each other with divine power, the battle heating up and becoming increasingly intense.","After exhausting their divine power, they engaged in physical combat once again, supporting themselves with their hands and burning with divine power.","“Huff... huff...”","They both panted heavily.","Bang!","Jian Wushuang lifted his leg and kicked Wu Zuo away.","“Haha, seems like I have the upper hand in strength!” Wu Zuo, despite being kicked away, wore a smug smile.","Jian Wushuang wiped the sweat from his forehead, disdainfully saying, “Don’t joke around, I haven’t used my full strength yet!”","They prepared to clash once again, facing each other.","“How about my full strength?”","After catching his breath, Wu Zuo directly mobilized his Origin to restore his lost divine power, reaching his peak state.","Jian Wushuang nodded, feeling it was about time to use his full strength as well.","With a thought, his vitality directly restored his injuries.","The previous fight was just a warm-up, and neither of them had revealed their full strength","yet.","Hum!","Wu Zuo burst into action, his 5-fold Realm God’s power erupting instantly.","His divine power surged from 3 million to 5 million, shaking the desert around him.","Golden arcs of electricity surrounded his body.","Seeing Wu Zuo reach his peak strength, Jian Wushuang didn’t hold back either. With a low roar, his aura began to change.","“Blue?” Wu Zuo exclaimed.","Boom!","A powerful aura soared into the sky.","The Beast God’s power completely receded, replaced by Jian Wushuang enveloped in blue arcs","of electricity.","“This move is called Super Eternal Ancient Transformation!” Jian Wushuang pointed to","himself proudly, introducing his own peak technique.","He had personally created it and was naturally proud of it.","With the Super Eternal Ancient Transformation, his divine power also increased to 5 million.","It looked almost identical to Wu Zuo.","But he was only a Universe Master at the Sixth Tribulation level.","Seeing Jian Wushuang as powerful as himself, Wu Zuo couldn’t help but smile.","The Sixth Tribulation level was as powerful as his Seventh Tribulation level.","This was Jian Wushuang!","Boom!","Both of them attacked at the same time.","At the moment of their attack, a vortex rose from the ground.","In the elliptical vortex was their Origin Source Dao Arena.","Wuzuo’s Dao Arena amplified his divine power by a full 30 percent.","Divine power reached 6.5 million.","Jian Wushuang also showed a surprised expression, not expecting Wu Zuo’s Origin Source Dao","Arena to be so powerful.","When his Origin Source Dao Arena reached its limit, it could amplify a universe by 4-fold.","A universe, with the power of 100,000 black holes.","This was much stronger than Wu Zuo.","If a second universe formed, it could amplify by 50 percent.","But in their sparring, Wuzuo didn’t need to amplify that much.","He only amplified by about 30 percent.","Reaching 6.5 million.","At the peak state of the two, they could shatter space with a casual strike.","Breaking everything.","They had both reached the pinnacle of the Eighth Tribulation level.","Each collision made their divine bodies tremble.","“Wushuang, my friend, you haven’t disappointed me. You can match me!”","Wu Zuo moved his wrist, which had gone numb from the shock.","It had been a long time since he had experienced such a peak duel.","For a moment, he felt somewhat uncomfortable.","He had indeed enjoyed too many comfortable days.","His bones had become soft.","This wouldn’t do!","Jian Wushuang hovered in the air, without such a feeling.","“You better be careful. I might crush you again by accident!”","“Haha, impossible!”","Wu Zuo charged again, fists and feet clashing!","He didn’t use any treasures; his divine body was the strongest treasure.","Even the Universe Treasures at the Seventh Tribulation level, he could shatter.","Clang!","Jian Wushuang drew out the Wanjie Sword, instantly freezing the surrounding space to its","nadir, making the sound grow cold. “Oh really!”","As soon as the divine sword appeared, Wuzuo regretted a bit.","“I forgot about this!” He forgot that Jian Wushuang was a swordsman.","And an ultimate swordsman at that.","This made a difference.","Perhaps Jian Wushuang was giving him face, otherwise, he could win against Wu Zuo with just","his divine power alone.","Wuzuo could also tell that Jian Wushuang’s divine power was deliberately kept at the same","level as his.","Definitely giving him face.","Thinking of this, he stopped hiding.","“Since you’ve brought out your eating utensils, I won’t hold back either!”","Wu Zuo took a step back, clenched his fists, and said in a deep voice, “Let me show you the","strongest skill I’ve learned!”","Jian Wushuang held the Wanjie Sword, calmly saying, “One move determines victory or","defeat!”","“Sure!”","The two took their stances.","Jian Wushuang was pondering which sword move to use.","The Sword of Life was somewhat weak.","The Sword of Death was the same.","Using the Sword of Reincarnation might make Wu Zuo lose too embarrassingly.","Balancing it out, he decided to use that move.","Hum!","In an instant, another sword appeared in his hand.","One black, one white! “Dual Sword Slash!” Jian Wushuang lowered his head and plunged down, with Life and Death","in tandem! Wuzuo gathered divine power in his fists and roared, “Realm King’s Fist!”","Fist shadows covered the entire sky, a punch that brought forth myriad thunders!","Above the sky, tens of thousands of fist shadows appeared, all falling together.","Like tens of thousands of beasts charging, heading towards Jian Wushuang.","The myriad beasts collided with the black and white swords.","And were instantly destroyed.","Countless fist shadows were shattered by the Sword Qi.","But these were not enough to worry about.","In their clash, victory or defeat would only be determined at the moment of collision."]},{"number":5975,"title":"Chapter 5975: It’s You Who Won","paragraphs":["Chapter 5975: It’s You Who Won","Buzz!","The twin swords clashed, slicing through the fabric of reality itself.","Black and white divided the heavens and the earth, while the shadows of fists sank into the abyss.","With a single maneuver, the outcome was decided, and they parted ways.","Turning their backs to each other, they simultaneously suppressed their auras, returning to their usual state.","“I lost!”","“No, it’s you who won, you won this martial arena!” Jian Wushuang couldn’t help but chuckle. “Originally, I built this cave heaven for future cultivation under normal conditions, but it could also withstand battles against top experts at the Eighth Tribulation. I didn’t expect that blow just now to split the cave heaven in half and shatter your fist!”","Wu Zuo heard the laughter and remarked, “So I guess I did benefit, but don’t worry, when we reach the Tian Cang Eternal Realm, I’ll arrange something even better for you.”","Though he spoke confidently, his hands trembled behind his back.","That last sword strike nearly crippled his hands.","If Jian Wushuang hadn’t pulled back and slashed the Sword Qi into the cave heaven, he would have been severely injured at the very least.","Jian Wushuang’s strength remained as terrifying as ever, despite Wu Zuo having cultivated alongside Realm King for so long, he still couldn’t match Jian Wushuang.","But it was acceptable; at least now he could keep pace with Jian Wushuang.","In the past, he couldn’t even spar properly.","So, he wasn’t too disheartened.","Their sparring lasted only an hour, and during that time, they had already arrived within the borders of the Daughter Kingdom.","The pyramid floated above the Daughter Kingdom.","It attracted many onlookers, but no one could penetrate its defenses or even sense its aura.","This alarmed Queen Yun Zhi.","In recent years, the Ancient Wood Continent had been turbulent, with powerful figures from all sides passing through.","So, caution was necessary; otherwise, an accident could lead to the destruction of the Daughter Kingdom.","Even the Ancient Moon Sect couldn’t protect them.","Seeing the pyramid surprised Yun Zhi greatly.","She had never seen such a treasure before.","Just as she was curious, Jian Wushuang and Wu Zuo emerged from the pyramid.","“Queen Yun Zhi, it’s been a while!” Jian Wushuang looked at Yun Zhi, whose aura was exceptionally gentle, feeling a twinge of guilt.","He had promised to protect Jincheng, but Jincheng still fell.","Yunzhi looked up in the direction of the voice, finding Jian Wushuang, but she wasn’t overly shocked.","Empress Fengchen had already informed her of the affairs of the Infinite Great World.","Jian Wushuang entering the Wanliu Divine Tree was no secret either.","“It has been some years indeed,” Queen Yun Zhi replied with indifference.","Clearly, she held some resentment towards Jian Wushuang for failing to protect Jincheng.","She didn’t even extend an invitation for him to come in and rest.","She just stood there in the air.","Jian Wushuang felt a bit embarrassed.","Wu Zuo, unaware of the situation, felt the other party was being disrespectful and was about to show off, but Jian Wushuang stopped him.","“I’m sorry about Jincheng,” Jian Wushuang said with a slight bow, presenting two gourds. “These items are gifts from Jincheng to you and the Empress.”","These two gourds contained many treasures.","The one for Queen Yun Zhi also contained relics of Jincheng.","Since the Empress was fond of Jincheng, he decided to give it to Yun Zhi!","As for the Empress, giving her treasures was already generous enough.","Jincheng’s demise was all because of the Empress.","If she hadn’t abandoned them back then, Jincheng wouldn’t have fallen.","Upon hearing about Jincheng’s relics, Queen Yun Zhi accepted the two gourds, her expression softening a bit.","Just as she was about to invite Jian Wushuang in to rest, Jian Wushuang took the initiative to bid farewell.","The Ancient Wood Continent held little sentiment for him as he prepared to depart, fulfilling his debts of gratitude.","There was one more favor owed, to Lian Xing.","Though they had traversed the Wanliu Divine Tree together and exchanged words, the matter of repaying this favor would likely have to wait.","Now, he was accompanying Wu Zuo to the Tian Cang Eternal Realm to find two of his good friends, Dongsheng and Wanyan.","Once they were all gathered, they would soon depart.","“Let’s go,” Jian Wushuang said calmly, leading Wu Zuo back into the pyramid.","Whoosh!","The triangular pyramid shimmered and disappeared from the Ancient Wood Continent, reappearing in the void of the Ancient Moon Spacetime.","“Who was that just now?”","Wu Zuo’s curiosity piqued, prompting him to inquire incessantly.","Jian Wushuang chuckled self-deprecatingly. “Someone who has shown me kindness.”","He didn’t elaborate further, steering the conversation toward Dongsheng and Wanyan","instead.","Originally, they were supposed to first seek out the Tongtian Buddha. However, complications arose with Dongsheng and Wanyan, necessitating their immediate journey to the Tian Cang Eternal Realm to address matters and repair the pyramid along the way.","At their current pace, the unrepaired sections of the pyramid would soon catch up with their universe-crossing travels, and they could enjoy their journey without worrying about","navigation.","For several days, they indulged in food and drink within the pyramid’s confines, until they departed the Ancient Moon Spacetime and entered the desolate wasteland, the largest","territory in the Northern Spacetime.","There, without the presence of the River of Time, it was barren and desolate, devoid of life save for some cold stones drifting aimlessly in the void.","The Ancient Moon Spacetime was relatively close to the Tian Cang Eternal Realm, requiring","only a few months of travel.","However, the journey through the desolation was the most tedious.","Ordinary Tribulation realm experts would need epochs to traverse this area solely by flight, but they, with their speed, outpaced even those of the Eighth Tribulation.","In the entire Northern Spacetime, perhaps fewer than ten individuals could match the speed","of their pyramid.","Even the notorious bandits who preyed on travelers in the wasteland dared not draw their attention, knowing they possessed a formidable flying treasure.","After months of monotonous flight, they finally arrived at the Tian Cang Eternal Realm.","The Ancient Moon Spacetime was opened by the Celestial Maiden, the first Universe Master of the Ninth Tribulation, who transformed her own Origin Universe into one of the streams of","the River of Time.","However, the Tian Cang Eternal Realm had a different Origin Source.","It evolved from the oldest tributary, bolstered and stabilized by an ancient existence,","becoming a vast and enduring realm that would never perish.","The realm harbored many powerful beings, steadily growing stronger unlike the practitioners","of the Ancient Moon Spacetime, who weakened as they became more entwined with the","Celestial Maiden.","With the disappearance of the Celestial Maiden, the foundation of the Ancient Moon Spacetime once again waned, saved only by the emergence of the God of Life.","This stark contrast highlighted the disparity between the two realms.","Tian Cang!","Named after an ancient existence, boasted a complex web of powers within its Tian Cang","Eternal Realm, lacking the unity seen in the Ancient Moon Spacetime.","At least, on the surface, the Ancient Moon Divine Sect appeared to unify the Ancient Moon Spacetime, with the eight-star sects reigning over the Nine Heavens and Ten Lands.","However, the Tian Cang Eternal Realm did not follow suit.","The ancient powerhouse, “Tian Cang”, possessed the strength to unite and suppress all forces","within the Tian Cang Eternal Realm."]},{"number":5976,"title":"Chapter 5976: Dongsheng and Wanyan","paragraphs":["Chapter 5976: Dongsheng and Wanyan","He refrained from doing so.","Because true power-seekers pursue strength.","That’s the paradigm!","The Ancient Moon Divine Sect emphasizes its position only to stabilize its status.","Treating the Ancient Moon Divine Sect as gods.","The ossification of the powerful.","But it’s not conducive to the growth of a time and space river.","In the Tian Cang Eternal Realm, from top to bottom.","All engage in battles and killings; the strong in the timeline are like mushrooms after the rain, with tens of thousands of epochs possibly seeing a turnover.","In these battles, even Eighth Tribulation realm experts might fall.","The fall of Seventh Tribulation realm experts is even more common.","Of the six major forces in the Tian Cang Eternal Realm.","Except for the “Tian Cang Palace”, almost all have risen in recent eras.","Except for the Tian Cang Palace, there is no force that has been able to endure.","Jian Wushuang and Wu Zuo came to the Tian Cang Eternal Realm this time.","For two main reasons.","One is to repair the pyramid left behind by the metallic light brain.","The other is to find Dongsheng and Wanyan.","Crash!","The pyramid had already entered the Tian Cang Eternal Realm without anyone noticing, advancing amidst the endless stars.","The Tian Cang Eternal Realm chooses the universe as its framework.","Continents are scarce.","Instead, there are many planets.","Most of the inhabitants on most planets are mortals.","The real experts are battling in some secret realms.","Looking at different scenes, Jian Wushuang felt quite curious.","“The Tian Cang Eternal Realm is really extraordinary!” Looking through the space to observe the timeline, it’s much more stable than the Ancient Moon Spacetime.","At least it can withstand battles of the Eighth Tribulation realm.","It won’t collapse even after a battle that destroys the timeline.","Wu Zuo, who has seen much, smiled faintly and said, “Actually, it’s nothing. When you enter the Realm King Continent in the future, you will understand. All of this is the material world. Compared to the real world of Law Rules, the Tian Cang Eternal Realm is very fragile!”","“I’ll have to experience it later!” Jian Wushuang nodded, then asked for specific information about Dongsheng and Wanyan.","Wu Zuo recounted, “Dongsheng and Wanyan, these two brothers, actually did quite well. Initially, the old Realm King sent them into a purgatory to stimulate their potential, and they soon became Universe Masters. In your Original Spacetime, there wasn’t much inheritance; most of it was cultivated through talent. After the foundation was built by the Qishen Temple, combined with the opportunities from my old man, their progress was particularly fast. However, in recent years, there has been some stagnation, and they have encountered some troubles!”","“Troubles?” Jian Wushuang was aware of this. Trouble for Dongsheng and Wanyan might be a minor issue for him. He asked directly, “You speak with such urgency; are they being chased by enemies?”","“Almost. After they entered the Tian Cang Eternal Realm, they joined the Blood Demon Temple as Universe Masters. Later, due to a mission, they offended the Blood Demon Temple and have been chased for tens of thousands of epochs. Recently, the Blood Demon Temple even dispatched a Seventh Tribulation realm expert to hunt them down!”","Jian Wushuang was surprised to hear this and exclaimed, “Such a bold move, sending a Seventh Tribulation expert to chase down two Universe Masters at the Sixth Tribulation?”","The Blood Demon Temple, he had heard of it.","It was a newly risen superpower.","Not one of the six peak powers in the Tian Cang Eternal Realm.","But the Lord of the Blood Demon Temple was also a top figure, an emerging Universe Master at the Eighth Tribulation, with formidable strength.","His background was quite mysterious, seeming to have an indiscernible connection with the Tian Cang Palace.","“Well then, let’s first find out their location!”","Jian Wushuang’s thoughts stirred as he unleashed a burst of telekinetic force imbued with causality, with the pyramid as the core.","He began to trace the figures of Dongsheng and Wanyan.","In the Tian Cang Eternal Realm.","In the Qianshui Star Field!","This star field belonged to the periphery of the Tian Cang Eternal Realm, close to the desolate","land.","It was a must-pass place for many foreign cultivators heading to the Tian Cang Eternal Realm.","Because of its large flow of people, this place was a mix of all sorts.","Often, there were some Seventh Tribulation powerhouses, and Universe Masters at the Sixth Tribulation were also common.","Most importantly, this place belonged to no one’s jurisdiction.","There wasn’t much profit to be had here, and the population was mixed.","No one could establish authority here, and all factions were quite repelled by it; not even strong individuals stationed here.","Because of this, this place had become a sanctuary in the Tian Cang Eternal Realm.","Some wanted criminals of major powers all sought refuge here.","Dongsheng and Wanyan also chose to hide in the Qianshui Star Field for this reason.","And they were on Qianshui Planet itself.","Qianshui Planet was created by a powerful individual, comparable in size to a universe.","There were many strong individuals within, coming from all over.","It was the core of the Qianshui Star Field.","Outside Qianshui City.","The scene of millions of cultivators coming and going together was spectacular.","Among them, three inconspicuous figures moved slowly in the crowd.","Two men and one woman!","The three quietly entered Qianshui City along with the crowd.","After entering the city, the three did not linger. They followed the sparsely populated crowd,","winding their way through alleys.","Though it was called an alley, there were many modest dwellings along this path.","Some of these caves were for rent.","The three casually arrived at a low door, took out some universe crystals, and entered one of","the caves.","Although the cave was a bit dilapidated, the space inside was not small, covering dozens of","miles, with gardens and courtyards.","After entering the cave, the three did not relax.","Instead, they first checked the large array of the cave, then set up another large array","themselves before finally letting out a sigh of relief.","“We finally made it!” The sturdy figure among the three took off his hat, revealing a face full","of scars, and sighed.","“Three days!”","“Just three days, and the senior who contacted me will come to pick us up. By then, we’ll be","able to leave the Tian Cang Eternal Realm!” said the man with a scarred face, his tone grave. “But don’t be careless. Although the senior who contacted us doesn’t know our details, you’re aware of the Blood Demon Temple’s intelligence system. Even though this is Qianshui City, there are still plenty of informants!”","“Enough of that,” said the woman among the three, very curious about the Ancient Moon Spacetime. “Wanyan, what are your plans when we arrive at Ancient Moon Spacetime?” “Hmm, you’ll find out then. I’ve said it before, we carry a great secret!” Wanyan chuckled.","After hearing this, the scarred man also smiled.","They were all waiting for the moment they returned to Ancient Moon Spacetime.","These three people, except for the woman, were Dongsheng and Wanyan familiar to Jian","Wushuang.","But Dongsheng, who used to have a heroic face, now had scars on his face.","And Wanyan had lost an arm.","This was both disguise and real injuries.","The two of them, along with this woman, had been fleeing all the way, encountering many","strong individuals sent by the Blood Demon Temple to intercept them along the way.","It could be said that they had risked their lives to reach this Qianshui City. “Brother Dongsheng, with our current strength, what are the odds of us returning to Qishen Temple?” Wanyan didn’t mince words, even in front of the woman."]},{"number":5977,"title":"Chapter 5977: Descending to Qianshui City","paragraphs":["Chapter 5977: Descending to Qianshui City","Upon hearing this, Dongsheng clenched his fist and felt the surge of his divine power, confidently declaring, “Invincible!”","“Haha...”","They all had great confidence in their own strength, even feeling almost like saviors.","Little did they know, a fierce battle awaited them very soon.","As Dongsheng and Wanyan, accompanied by the mysterious woman, stepped into Qianshui City, a formidable Seventh Tribulation realm expert and dozens of Sixth Tribulation Universe Masters descended upon the city right behind them.","“How’s the news about Zhe San?” the lead Seventh Tribulation realm expert asked coldly.","A Sixth Tribulation Universe Master behind him quickly reported with a cupped fist, “The trio from Tianzi No.2 are hiding in Shuilong Alley, scheduled to meet Zhe San in three days!”","“Good! We’ll wait another three days and strike as soon as they leave Qianshui City!”","The Seventh Tribulation realm expert under the black robe had a bloodthirsty gleam in his eyes.","In this pursuit of Dongsheng and Wanyan, he was the strongest force.","As a celestial-tier assassin of the Blood Demon Temple, when he was a Universe Master, he had slain peers of his own level.","Even though he had now become a Scattered Tribulation, he still maintained the peak strength of the Seventh Tribulation.","His divine power reached a staggering 2 million.","By the standards of the Blood Demon Temple, Scattered Tribulations could retire, but the emergence of the God of Life forced him back into action, to earn Life force to sustain himself, awaiting the secret method of resurrection.","And he wasn’t alone.","Apart from Scattered Tribulation experts who were fortunate enough to obtain Life force from Danbao or Jian Wushuang, Scattered Tribulation experts from other times and spaces were desperately scavenging for Life force.","There was no other choice.","The path to resurrection might take who knows how long to create.","For now, all those Scattered Tribulations could do was to maintain their vitality.","Universe Masters also had their own pressures.","Without assurance, they wouldn’t undergo Tribulation, suppressing their own realms until they had no choice but to face it.","Before Tribulation, they would also prepare Life force in advance for unexpected needs.","Life force was already precious, and now its price had soared.","Those Scattered Tribulations who had bought a large amount of Life force from Jian Wushuang initially found that selling just a fraction of it could recoup their initial expenditure in treasures.","They gained 90 percent of Life force for nothing.","Yet, even so, no one dared to do it.","Now, Life force had reached its peak.","But it was also transient.","Once the path to resurrection was created, Life force would plummet.","Though it wouldn’t become worthless, it wouldn’t command the current astronomical prices, where even Eighth Tribulation experts would hesitate.","Moreover, it was hard to come by even if one had the money.","But even so, there were few who dared to attract Jian Wushuang’s attention.","Of course, there were also some Eighth Tribulation experts on the brink of death, already driven to madness.","They wanted to find Jian Wushuang.","Yet, these Eighth Tribulation experts had nearly depleted divine power, making them no match for Jian Wushuang even if they found him.","But there was no better alternative.","They were the most desperate.","Such was life.","Danbao was also striving to create the path to resurrection, but it would take a long time.","This was an unavoidable fact.","For Realm King, having the God of Life was sufficient.","Creating the power of Resurrection was only a matter of time.","Now, the deaths of some were inconsequential.","Throughout history, countless peerless geniuses of the Eighth Tribulation had perished, their number unknown.","Outside the Qianshui Star Field.","A silver-gold pyramid spun into the silent void.","“They’re quite the runners, managing to get this far!” Wu Zuo couldn’t help but marvel.","Two Universe Masters at the Sixth Tribulation, being chased, yet able to escape from the core of the Tian Cang Eternal Realm to Qianshui Planet, and at such a swift pace.","It was indeed miraculous.","After all, unlike Jian Wushuang, they didn’t have a golden pyramid left behind by the metallic brain.","Relying solely on flight, it would probably take several epochs.","And being pursued, it would take even longer.","“In a quarter of an hour, when they reach Qianshui Planet, we’ll be able to see them!”","Jian Wushuang’s Thought power moved, and the pyramid pierced through space into the","Qianshui Star Field.","If it weren’t for wanting to be discreet, he could have instantly arrived in front of Dongsheng","and Wanyan.","Qianshui Star Field, to the south of the Tian Cang Eternal Realm.","When they entered the Tian Cang Eternal Realm, they just forced their way in, paying no","attention to the path.","So, when they reached the eastern edge of the Tian Cang Eternal Realm, they found Dongsheng and Wanyan through causality, and it only took them three days to cross over half","of the Tian Cang Eternal Realm.","This speed, probably only that ancient existence in the Tian Cang Eternal Realm could","achieve.","“Hmm?” Wu Zuo’s eyebrows twitched at this moment, revealing a smirk. “Looks like they’ve run into trouble; it’s going to be hard for them to hold out for a quarter of an hour!”","Jian Wushuang also used Thought power to explore Qianshui Planet.","Only then did he realize that Dongsheng and Wanyan were currently being besieged by a","group of strong opponents.","The battle was exceptionally fierce.","He and Wu Zuo, on the other hand, used the pyramid’s projection to recline in chairs,","watching Dongsheng and Wanyan being besieged.","Occasionally, they commented on the two’s strength.","If Dongsheng and Wanyan saw this, they would surely be infuriated.","“Not bad, the basic divine power of both of them is around 1 million, and their bursts of power can rival typical Seventh Tribulation Realm experts. It seems that Realm King has given them quite the opportunity!” Jian Wushuang was quite satisfied with this.","Getting stronger together was much better than being strong alone.","Wu Zuo took a sip of tea, calmly saying, “If it weren’t for that woman beside them, they","should’ve been able to escape!”","In the projection, Dongsheng and Wanyan fought separately.","Dongsheng resisted a black-robed Seventh Tribulation expert.","Wanyan blocked more than a dozen opponents of the same level. Unfortunately, both of them were cautious and couldn’t go all out, already sustaining","significant injuries.","After watching for a while, Jian Wushuang felt that the projection was too dull.","With a thought, he instantly activated the pyramid’s power to its peak, and in an instant, as if teleporting, arrived above Qianshui Planet.","“Don’t just lie around, let’s go help!” Jian Wushuang slapped Wu Zuo, signaling to go down","and lend a hand.","Wu Zuo stretched his wrist, sighing, “It’s a pity we’re too weak; otherwise, we could’ve had a","good fight!”","Indeed, against that celestial-rank assassin from the Blood Demon Temple... The assassin’s","strength was somewhat lacking.","Only 2 million.","Under normal circumstances, Wu Zuo could easily beat them.","There would be no difficulty at all.","The two stood on the platform of the pyramid, slowly descending from it.","At this moment.","They hadn’t felt the temporal storm brought about by the pyramid’s teleportation while inside it, but after coming out, they keenly felt the violent temporal power.","It had destroyed most of Qianshui City.","This was why Jian Wushuang had chosen to come quietly. Unfortunately, Dongsheng and Wanyan couldn’t hold on any longer.","If they didn’t arrive soon, the two would lose their lives.","Jian Wushuang couldn’t care less about the consequences; he could only unleash the peak","power of the pyramid and teleport to this place."]},{"number":5978,"title":"Chapter 5978: Seventh Tribulation Realm?","paragraphs":["Chapter 5978: Seventh Tribulation Realm?","The pyramid floating above Qianshui Planet exuded boundless power, sweeping across the entire planet in a majestic manner. Except for half-ruined Qianshui City, the rest of the areas were thoroughly cleansed.","Jian Wushuang, after his journey through Wanliu, had developed restraint in his combat, not posing a threat to weaker cultivators.","Within Qianshui City, several auras rose, including two at the Eighth Tribulation realm, though they were Scattered Tribulations, not the Universe Masters of that level.","Becoming an Eighth Tribulation Universe Master typically meant no need to fear enemies.","They could freely join any faction.","Scattered Tribulation experts were different, of limited value.","These two Eighth Tribulation experts were the overlords of Qianshui Planet.","Now, with Jian Wushuang’s pyramid destroying half a planet in an instant.","Even they couldn’t sit still.","However, they weren’t planning to strike but to flee.","To operate such a powerful treasure, one had to be at least an Eighth Tribulation Universe Master, and likely one of the top-tier ones.","Otherwise, they wouldn’t be able to mobilize such a potent treasure, much like how Jian Wushuang couldn’t truly activate the Skysight Heavenly Chessboard.","“Hmm?”","The two Eighth Tribulation Realm experts stared at the two figures below the pyramid, their eyes narrowing in surprise.","“Seventh Tribulation?”","What they saw was Wu Zuo’s cultivation level.","Jian Wushuang’s aura was completely concealed, undetectable even by an Eighth Tribulation expert, visible only to the naked eye.","Seeing Wu Zuo at the Seventh Tribulation level and Jian Wushuang seemingly devoid of aura like a puppet, they relaxed.","At the same time, the Blood Demon Temple assassins attacking Dongsheng and Wanyan halted.","Countless powerful individuals on Qianshui Planet turned their attention to Jian Wushuang and Wu Zuo, who were walking leisurely under the pyramid’s roar, emitting a palpable pressure.","“My Heavens, what kind of treasure is this?”","Someone in the crowd stared incredulously at the pyramid, feeling its endless might, capable of easily suppressing Seventh Tribulation experts.","Most of the powerful beings on Qianshui Planet were only at the Fourth Tribulation.","Seventh Tribulation experts were rare.","The destruction of Qianshui City had brought out only dozens of them.","“Whatever treasure it is, it’s not something we can meddle with. The Qianshui Twin Saints are here; there’ll be a show soon!”","A Sixth Tribulation expert in the crowd retreated continuously until stopping in the void.","Many chose to leave Qianshui Planet, fearing involvement.","But there were more who stayed to watch the spectacle, mostly fugitives from the Tian Cang Eternal Realm, bearing warrants, all desperados.","A scene like this might not be witnessed again in their lifetimes, so they naturally refused to leave.","The Qianshui Twin Saints arrived together, blocking Jian Wushuang and Wu Zuo’s path. Their tone was icy.","“Dao Friend, by destroying Qianshui Planet without cause, are you looking down on us?” “Just some trash, no need to take it so seriously,” Wu Zuo replied casually, scratching his ear.","One of the Twin Saints, Saint Li Tian, had the most fiery temper.","When he heard someone calling Qianshui Planet rubbish, he immediately wanted to act.","But he was stopped by Saint Feng Tian beside him.","However, his expression turned grim, and his voice became sinister.","They had been cultivating quietly for so long, and they hadn’t made a move for a long time.","They didn’t expect to encounter someone so disrespectful.","“The Dao Friend speaks rightly. Indeed, what was destroyed is rubbish, but it also depends on whose rubbish it is!”","Feng Tian’s tone was icy, and divine power surged continuously in his body.","It had already reached around 5 million.","Upon hearing this, Wu Zuo immediately made an embarrassed expression and waved his hand, saying, “I’m sorry, it’s my fault. I forgot to send you two away together when I was cleaning up the trash!”","“You...”","Saint Li Tian couldn’t hold back anymore and attacked directly.","“Too much!”","Before the opponent could make a move, Wu Zuo had already acted.","The power of Realm King erupted directly.","Divine power soared to 6 million.","One person suppressed the Twin Saints of Qianshui.","The divine power roamed, destroying much of the remaining half of Qianshui City.","This scene scared the onlookers, who quickly retreated.","But there were still some unlucky ones who didn’t escape in time and were swept into the","temporal cracks by the vortex of divine power.","Their bodies were directly turned into powder.","Standing in place, Jian Wushuang covered his mouth and coughed dryly, muttering to","himself, “To act like this, it’s really impolite!”","Perhaps because Wu Zuo lost to him and held some grudge, he was now venting his anger on","the Twin Saints of Qianshui!","Wu Zuo was fighting fiercely with the Twin Saints of Qianshui.","Jian Wushuang was not idle either. With a flash, he appeared in the void of Qianshui Planet.","“Dongsheng, Wanyan brothers, do you still recognize me?”","Seeing Jian Wushuang before them, who did not even have any aura, Dongsheng and Wanyan dared not recognize him.","It was only after hearing Jian Wushuang’s words that their eyes turned red.","“It’s really you, Brother Wushuang!” Dongsheng was somewhat excited and rushed over, his","eyes full of the traces of time.","They hadn’t seen each other for millions of epochs.","Although they were among the first batch of Fifth Tier Dao Lords in the Original Universe,","they hadn’t experienced much.","Coming to the Ancient Moon Spacetime, it was really like starting a second life.","It was because Zhen Wuyang couldn’t withstand the baptism of time that he eventually lost","his true heart.","Dongsheng and Wanyan, fortunately, were together, warning each other and their hometown.","That’s how they survived until now.","“I’m late!”","Jian Wushuang patted their shoulders.","His eyes were sincere too.","Even if they had forgotten their past promises, he wouldn’t blame them.","After all, after experiencing hundreds of epochs, their mentality had long changed.","The three recognized each other.","For a moment, memories were brought back to the days when they explored the Blood Demon","Temple.","At that time, Dongsheng was the first to enter the Blood Demon Temple.","Later, it was Jian Wushuang and Wanyan.","The three of them walked the path together.","Everything happened too quickly.","“Huh?” A killer from the Blood Demon Temple at the Seventh Tribulation felt a sinking","feeling in his heart when he saw Jian Wushuang suddenly appear.","Immediately, he relayed the news back to the interior of the Blood Demon Temple.","He wasn’t stupid.","He saw Jian Wushuang walking out of the pyramid alone.","Wu Zuo single-handedly beat two Eighth Tribulation powerhouses.","So Jian Wushuang wouldn’t be weak either.","Naturally, he didn’t dare to act again.","He even wanted to leave without a word.","“Humph!”","At the moment he wanted to leave, he was stunned by Jian Wushuang’s Thought power.","With a cold snort, Jian Wushuang directly immobilized the Seventh Tribulation powerhouse","in the void.","This brought quite a surprise to Dongsheng and Wanyan.","Jian Wushuang said sternly, “Do you want me to help you kill him?”","Although he now restrained his killing intent.","He rarely used his sword.","But he wouldn’t hesitate.","Since he had chased Dongsheng and Wanyan, he wouldn’t let the other party escape so easily.","He casually condensed two clusters of Life force and infused them into Dongsheng and Wanyan’s bodies, saying calmly, “Don’t feel pressured. Look at the Northern Spacetime. Now, there’s no one who can threaten us.”"]},{"number":5979,"title":"Chapter 5979: Poor Man","paragraphs":["Chapter 5979: Poor Man","This statement sounded extremely arrogant.","But it depended on who said it.","Jian Wushuang was qualified to say so.","Looking across the Northern Spacetime, he truly feared no one.","Who would dare threaten him?","“He’s also a man with a bitter fate, just a killer from the Blood Demon Temple, let him go!” Dongsheng spoke, his eyes filled with vicissitudes.","The two of them were also killers from the Blood Demon Temple.","But they were also coerced.","Controlled by the Blood Demon Temple.","Later, because of a mission to kill a mysterious woman.","When the two of them were about to act, the blood drops in their bodies were relieved by that woman, and they left the Blood Demon Temple.","That woman was the one they were protecting.","The plain-clothed woman standing beside them, though ordinary-looking, had a pair of colorful eyes containing a subtle and mysterious aura.","Jian Wushuang already knew about Dongsheng and Wanyan’s situation.","After glancing at the mysterious woman, a slight movement stirred in his heart, as if he had seen through the secrets within their bodies.","But he didn’t speak it out.","Instead, he turned his head to the Blood Demon Temple killer frozen in the void and said coldly, “There are no blood drops in your body. Although my brother is reluctant to kill you, you can’t escape punishment.”","A dazzling light burst from Jian Wushuang’s eyes, directly shattering the divine body of the old man, but not fatally.","But losing a large amount of vitality, as a Scattered Tribulation realm, was tantamount to losing half of his life.","And it was irreversible.","Even so, the Seventh Tribulation realm killer from the Blood Demon Temple trembled and respectfully said, “Thank you for not killing me, Senior!”","“Get lost!” Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows lightly, not bothering to look at the other party.","He didn’t have any good feelings towards these killers.","If they were forced, that would be another story.","Since they were followers, they deserved punishment.","Blood Demon Temple!","Blood drops.","That was a very powerful means of enslavement, unexpectedly broken by that mysterious woman. No wonder the Blood Demon Temple sent a Seventh Tribulation realm expert to chase Dongsheng and Wanyan.","Initially, Dongsheng and Wanyan had concealed their true strength in every action, which allowed them to escape to Qianshui Planet.","If the Blood Demon Temple knew their true strength, they would have sent even stronger killers long ago.","The killers from the Blood Demon Temple are divided into four stages or tiers.","Human, Earth, Celestial, Divine.","Human stage killers mainly handle tasks below the Tribulation realm.","The Earth stage includes the first six Tribulations.","Dongsheng and his companions were once top Earth stage killers.","The Celestial stage is the Seventh Tribulation realm.","Divine stage is the Eighth Tribulation realm.","However, those kinds of killers generally do not belong to the Blood Demon Temple.","Most of them are cooperative relationships.","When a Divine stage killer is needed, the target of the mission may also be an Eighth Tribulation expert.","Each appearance of such a mission would cause quite a stir in the Tian Cang Eternal Realm.","Of course, Eighth Tribulation experts who can be targeted by killers are not that strong.","At most, they are at the level of the Twin Saints of Qianshui.","Their divine power is barely over 5 million.","Just reaching the threshold of the top Eighth Tribulation experts.","Mobilizing two true top-notch experts of the Eighth Tribulation realm could achieve it.","The premise was that the opponent’s background wasn’t strong enough.","When Jian Wushuang first heard about it, he found it somewhat unbelievable.","But upon considering the current vitality of life, he understood.","Wouldn’t top-notch experts of the Eighth Tribulation realm be tempted if a large amount of Life power were offered as a reward?","The Blood Demon Temple only made a small profit from it.","Top-notch assassins all operated through the platform of the Blood Demon Temple.","Some people earned treasures by adventuring, while others used their own methods.","The Lord of the Blood Demon Temple was one such person.","“Let’s go, we’ll talk more inside!”","This place was crowded with people, not a suitable place for conversation.","He didn’t want outsiders to know about the affairs of the original universe.","Otherwise, it would only cause more trouble.","His affairs had to be dealt with by himself.","Moreover, he had the ability to handle them.","If he didn’t want to take action, he could just offer Life power and dozens of experts of the","Eighth Tribulation realm would be willing to act.","But there was no need for that.","Losing the original spirit of the strong was unnecessary.","After leading Dongsheng and Wanyan into the pyramid, he turned to Wu Zuo, who was still fighting, and said, “It’s time to go!”","“Forget it, it’s not fun to fight with these two trash!” Wu Zuo said, then retracted his aura, but suddenly burst into speed, turning into a stream of light appearing below the pyramid.","He was taken into the pyramid along with Jian Wushuang.","The back and forth battle lasted only a quarter of an hour.","At the beginning, it seemed fierce.","Suddenly it stopped, catching many people off guard.","Qianshui’s Twin Saints breathed a sigh of relief.","Being beaten up by a Universe Master of the Seventh Tribulation was not a pleasant","experience.","Not only did they suffer some injuries, but they also lost face.","Being beaten up by a Universe Master of the Seventh Tribulation realm.","And the key point was that they lost despite the two of them fighting one.","The reputation accumulated over countless years was all gone.","Many powerful beings outside the void were discussing the mysterious experts inside the","pyramid.","Dongsheng and Wanyan were somewhat famous in the Tian Cang Eternal Realm and were","recognized by many.","Everyone speculated about the relationship between the two experts in the pyramid.","The battle in the Qianshui Star Field soon spread throughout the Tian Cang Eternal Realm.","Jian Wushuang, however, was completely uninterested.","Inside the pyramid, he could see everything outside.","He gently raised his hand, manipulated the pyramid, and directly crashed it into Qianshui","Planet.","The endlessly powerful pyramid directly shattered Qianshui Planet.","Wu Zuo transmitted his voice through the pyramid, “Haha, I said, next time I will definitely","clean up all the trash!”","Saying that, he burst out divine power and shook the fragments of Qianshui Planet into","powder.","The pyramid only stayed for a moment on the ruins of Qianshui Planet, then flashed with light","and disappeared completely in front of everyone.","Leaving only the dumbfounded Qianshui Twin Saints.","The two of them were almost furious.","“Damn it!” Saint Feng Tian clenched his fists.","Saint Feng Tian already had a fiery temper, and he roared, shattering the surrounding space.","“Just wait for me. When I step into the power of resurrection, I will definitely avenge today’s","grudge!”","They didn’t know yet that in the future path of resurrection, they would indeed encounter Jian Wushuang and others.","But at that time, they still couldn’t avenge themselves.","Buzz!","The pyramid sped forward. Heading towards the core of the Tian Cang Eternal Realm, the “Tian Cang Palace”.","The second thing to do this time was to repair the pyramid.","And after arriving at the Tian Cang Palace, there was also someone not very familiar waiting","for them.","“Emperor Guangying!”","Now he should be called the Lord Guangying.","Dongsheng and Wanyan were captured by the Blood Demon Temple when they arrived at the","Tian Cang Eternal Realm, unaware that Lord Guangying was also in this spacetime.","He wasn’t very familiar with the Inheritors who had once been in the same group as Jian","Wushuang.","He only knew that the other party had a very high spirit."]},{"number":5980,"title":"Chapter 5980: The Joy of Reunion","paragraphs":["Chapter 5980: The Joy of Reunion","Speaking of which, he and Lord Guangying were the first generation inheritors of Qishen Temple.","They were in good spirits!","They just weren’t very familiar with each other, but they could bring him along when they repaired the pyramid.","Inside the pyramid.","The four of them sat on the ground, surrounded by empty wine flasks.","A mysterious woman poured wine for the four of them quietly on the side, without saying much.","Jian Wushuang and the other three, under the influence of alcohol, talked a lot.","They divulged everything about themselves.","Compared to the opportunities Jian Wushuang had with Wu Zuo, Dongsheng, and Wanyan, there was quite a difference.","And it was much harder.","Jian Wushuang’s only grievance was marrying Jincheng and becoming a son-in-law.","Later, he was calculated by the Empress and faced everything alone.","Fortunately, subsequent developments resolved everything.","There were also highlights.","Let’s not talk about Wu Zuo.","Initially, it seemed that Fan Tianfeng had the best luck, but in the end, it turned out that Wu Zuo had the best luck.","Becoming a disciple of Realm King, they strode across the entire Northern Spacetime.","Opportunities kept coming, and treasures were abundant.","Dongsheng and Wanyan’s opportunities, however, required the greatest effort.","Even oppression.","In the purgatory of Realm King, the two of them suffered all the way.","Fortunately, their strength increased rapidly, and bottlenecks were broken one by one.","They soon became Universe Masters.","They were then moved to the Tian Cang Eternal Realm, and after being targeted by the Blood Demon Temple, they became killers for the Blood Demon Temple.","They spent millions of epochs in the Blood Demon Temple.","They were almost numb.","If it weren’t for a certain mysterious woman they encountered, the two of them would have almost collapsed.","Although they could complete every mission, they had to get injured to hide their true strength.","Almost every time they returned from a mission, they were quite injured.","The mental torture was significant.","Fortunately, after encountering that mysterious woman, she removed the blood drops from their bodies, giving them freedom.","After hearing the detailed experiences, Jian Wushuang apologized proactively with a cup raised, “It’s my fault for being late!”","After saying that, he drank the strong liquor in one gulp, without wrapping it with divine power, letting the fiery liquor flow down his throat into his body.","After feeling a burning numbness all over, he gradually eased.","The liquor was brought by Wu Zuo, all from Realm King’s collection, with great strength.","It also greatly helped their divine bodies.","Each sip could increase hundreds of divine power.","It’s worth noting that Jian Wushuang’s divine body was 1.5 million.","With each sip increasing by a few hundred, drinking a pot could increase by tens of thousands.","Outside, that was a rare divine treasure, with considerable value.","“Wushuang, please don’t say that!” Wanyan quickly interrupted, now completely free, with joy on his face. He looked up at the woman pouring wine, his eyes shining, “If you had come earlier, maybe I wouldn’t have met Miss Ye.”","Just seeing them, Jian Wushuang knew that Wanyan had a hidden affection for this woman.","Now that he voluntarily mentioned it, Jian Wushuang wasn’t surprised. Since they broached the topic, he immediately perked up.","This mysterious woman, her surname was Ye!","That didn’t surprise him even more.","Because he was connected to her by a thread of karma.","She was also a practitioner from the Ancient Moon Spacetime.","And she was from the Ye Family in the Black Heaven.","Since the incident where he killed the young master of the Ye Family, he had a karmic connection with them.","However, he could sever such karma at any time.","But there was no need.","Although this Ye girl was from the Ye Family, there was no animosity in their karmic","connection.","Apparently, she also didn’t align with the Ye Family.","Otherwise, their karmic thread would be red.","Fortunately, there was no hatred in their karma.","Otherwise, he would have suspected that he was somehow cursed, casually killing someone","would attract a bunch of enemies.","Jiang Shang and Broly were the best proof of that.","But since it wasn’t a blood feud, there was no need to bring up the matter.","Pretending not to know, he asked, “Brother Wanyan, you’ve been talking without introducing","her first!”","“You see how forgetful I am!”","Wanyan slapped his forehead, reached out to take Ye’s hand, stood up solemnly, and","introduced, “Her name is Ye Lingxiao, just like us... all from Ancient Moon Spacetime, and","she’s also my benefactor and Dao Companion!”","He hadn’t revealed this relationship before, but now that he truly had nothing to worry about,","he took the opportunity to speak out.","Dongsheng was the first to smile, feeling very happy for Wanyan.","Before the Qishen Temple appeared, both of them were Tier 5 Emperors of the Original","Universe, and there was some discord between them.","Later, because of the Qishen Temple, two discordant people came together, all because of the","Demon Sound Temple.","They both worshipped Divine General Moyin.","Entered the Ancient Moon Spacetime together.","And were arranged together by Realm King.","Became brothers of life and death.","Seeing them rejuvenated, finding a Dao Companion, he naturally felt very happy for him.","Jian Wushuang and Wu Zuo also gave their blessings.","The group, riding on the pyramid, chatted all the way.","However, Jian Wushuang didn’t mention Ye Lingxiao’s secret.","Because that matter was quite complicated.","And there was no rush.","There was no need for him to worry since Wanyan hadn’t mentioned it to him. If there was a","need in the future, he could help again.","Why chase after someone’s privacy to inquire?","It would be embarrassing instead.","After the past was discussed, they talked about the future.","The Return Battle.","And from that moment on, they officially stepped into the next stage.","After going to the Tian Cang Palace, they also had to prepare some treasures.","Just in case.","It would take a long time to return from the Ancient Moon Spacetime to the Original Universe.","They could use that time for cultivation.","And prepare some treasures to deal with Mie Sheng.","Wu Zuo was more experienced in this.","And he was also quite wealthy.","He was given full authority to handle it.","On Jian Wushuang’s side, he needed to repair the pyramid.","This treasure would become a key treasure for him for a long time to come.","Escape, protect, suppress!","Each was an invaluable treasure.","Most importantly, it could nurture life.","In conjunction with his Origin Source Universe, it was perfect.","Now the life in his Origin Source Universe had reached the level of All Things.","But they were all Special Life Forms.","They couldn’t reproduce.","Unfortunately, he wasn’t the God of Life, so he didn’t research much on this aspect.","Otherwise, he would also establish a clan.","In this endless Starry Sky, branching out.","They chatted along the way, and time passed quickly.","In the blink of an eye, they had reached the boundary of the Tian Cang Palace.","During these days, there were many rumors about the pyramid in the Tian Cang Eternal","Realm.","Especially the incredible story of the Seventh Tribulation cultivator overpowering two Eighth Tribulation experts.","So much so that many people were paying attention to this matter. Because Wu Zuo’s battle with the two Eighth Tribulation experts overshadowed Jian","Wushuang saving three cultivators wanted by the Blood Demon Temple.","Outsiders were unaware.","But the Blood Demon Temple had known for a long time."]},{"number":5981,"title":"Chapter 5981: Blood Demon Temple Master","paragraphs":["Chapter 5981: Blood Demon Temple Master","And the news had already reached the Blood Demon Temple Master.","At the heart of the Tian Cang Eternal Realm.","There was a blood-red star field.","Within the star field was a Blood Demon Planet.","This was the core of the Blood Demon Temple.","The Blood Demon Hall also stood here.","On the planet, atop a towering mountain peak.","The notorious Blood Demon Temple was situated here.","Around the grand hall, a crimson aura enveloped.","Similar to the blood sacrifice of the Yongheng Clan.","But the aura of blood here was even more intense.","Inside the hall, a constant leakage of crimson aura occurred, if an ordinary powerhouse were to touch it, they would suffer severe injuries, even death.","However, the guards here wore blood-red armor, completely immune to the crimson aura.","Inside the hall.","Everything was crimson.","Without any adornments.","Only at the center, there was a blood spring.","Within the crimson water, there stood a broad figure.","Upon closer inspection, one could see the thick figure, adorned with blood-colored shadows.","The figure bathed in the blood spring.","Beside the spring, stood an old man in red robes, silent.","“How’s the matter being investigated?” a voice came from the spring.","The old man standing beside quickly bowed, “Master, it’s been investigated. The pyramid comes from the Ancient Moon Spacetime.”","Snap!","Blood splattered!","The broad figure stood up, instantly donning a black robe.","Upon hearing the report, it clearly disturbed his mood.","“I underestimated her back then!” The figure turned slowly, revealing an extremely heroic face, angular features, thick eyebrows, and a full forehead.","He was a rare handsome man.","This person was the master of the Blood Demon Temple.","The old man in red robes hesitated, then continued, “Master, Ye Lingxiao also comes from the Ancient Moon Spacetime. There might be some connection between these two matters.” “Do I need you to remind me?” The master of the Blood Demon Temple snorted coldly. “What needs to be done now is to find that pyramid and get rid of her, understood?”","The old man in red robes hesitated for a moment but spoke the truth, “Master, within that pyramid, there are two individuals of unknown strength, it might be difficult!”","“Then find it first, I’ll deal with it personally!”","“Yes!” The old man in red robes dared not say more and hurriedly left the blood-red hall. After a while, he returned.","The intelligence network of the Blood Demon Temple was incredibly fast.","Just as he went down, he received the location of the pyramid.","The master of the Blood Demon Temple was also very surprised, he hadn’t expected it to be this fast.","“Tian Cang Palace!”","Upon hearing the location, the master of the Blood Demon Temple sneered.","And immediately set off.","The Blood Demon Temple ascended into the air.","This grand hall had ruled this place for countless ages and had rarely left.","Every time the Blood Demon Temple left the blood-red star field, it would lead to slaughter.","Even in Tian Cang Palace, the master of the Blood Demon Temple still chose to act.","If it were any other of the top five peak powers, he might have hesitated.","But in Tian Cang Palace, there was no need for that.","Boom!","The rising Blood Demon Temple’s power was instantly unleashed, and in an instant, it left the blood-red star field and headed towards Tian Cang Palace.","For Ye Lingxiao, the master of the Blood Demon Temple was determined.","Last time was a mistake, not acting personally.","And it brought so much trouble.","The reason for not personally acting was actually due to concerns.","If the master of the Blood Demon Temple personally made a move to capture a woman without any background at the Fifth Tribulation, it would surely attract the attention of","many.","However, now it was unnecessary.","Because, acting within the Tian Cang Palace, there were people assigned to clean up this","mess.","This was also why the Blood Demon Temple had such a bad reputation but no one dared to","touch them.","Within the Tian Cang City, the pyramid had slowed its pace.","After all, this was the territory of some ancient existence, not a place where one could","recklessly trespass.","This time they had come with a request.","Giving face was necessary.","Wu Zuo, however, felt that Jian Wushuang was being overly cautious.","Now, as long as they wielded the power of Life, they were in control.","Jian Wushuang, on the other hand, advocated for his own viewpoint.","In dealing with the strong, one must still have the heart of a respected individual.","One couldn’t be overly deferential.","Perhaps it was because Realm King owed great favors to the three Eternal Beings.","As a disciple of Realm King, Wu Zuo dared to act like this.","But Jian Wushuang was different.","Besides having the power of Life, he was just an ordinary person with peak strength at the","Eighth Tribulation level.","He couldn’t become a playboy like Wu Zuo.","The pyramid leisurely headed towards the Tian Cang Palace, attracting quite a few onlookers","along the way.","Within the Tian Cang City, it was not only practitioners from the Tian Cang Palace.","There were also geniuses from all over, as well as formidable practitioners living here.","Seeing the pyramid appear in this place, they were all curious.","They speculated whether the pyramid was the treasure of a super genius from the Tian Cang","Palace.","After all, for a seven-tribulation realm to cross ranks and challenge someone at the eight- tribulation level, it could only be achieved by the most top-tier geniuses.","It was an unprecedented and unmatched move.","Jian Wushuang and the others hadn’t expected that their battle would attract so much","attention.","After all, Jian Wushuang, at the Sixth Tribulation realm, could contend with Chi Jiuxiao!","Why didn’t that battle cause such a stir back then?","“Wu Zuo, how does it feel to become famous after one battle?” Dongsheng held up his wine glass, looking at the many strong figures gathered outside because of the pyramid. “Look,","there are quite a few female cultivators too!”","This remark made Wanyan burst into laughter.","Jian Wushuang, however, sat cross-legged to the side, ignoring their banter.","He was cultivating his own Origin Source Starry Sky.","And further perfecting his Super Eternal Ancient Transformation.","It was somewhat difficult to cultivate the Super Ancient Transformation to perfection;","currently, he had reached a bottleneck.","Breaking through wasn’t so easy.","Once he reached perfection,","Using the Super Eternal Ancient Transformation, he could almost double his divine power.","Right now, it was 2 million.","With the perfected Super Eternal Ancient Transformation, it could be amplified to 6 million.","Plus the augmentation from the Origin Source Universe.","He could easily elevate his strength to the peak level of the Eighth Tribulation realm.","And this didn’t even account for the Starry Sky Chronicles.","Being able to contend with the peak of the Eighth Tribulation realm was far from enough.","To deal with Mie Sheng, he must be fully prepared.","Otherwise, he would be in danger of losing his life.","Weiss wasn’t by his side now.","He had no trump cards.","And his second avatar was also in the Qishen Temple.","If he died, then he would truly be dead.","With pressure comes infinite motivation.","Even if it was just a bit of time, he had to seize it to cultivate.","However, this peace was shattered just as he had begun to cultivate.","Out of respect for the Tian Cang Palace, he hadn’t spread his Thought power too widely.","So when a threatening force arrived in front of him, he only then realized it.","A bloody figure descended.","With a black robe fluttering, the handsome and imposing Blood Demon Temple Master","stepped forward, blocking the pyramid’s path.","If Jian Wushuang’s Thought power hadn’t controlled the pyramid, it would have been","impossible to stop it.","Yet the Blood Demon Temple Master forcibly halted the pyramid.","This was also because the pyramid hadn’t activated its peak power."]},{"number":5982,"title":"Chapter 5982: Do You Know Who I Am?","paragraphs":["Chapter 5982: Do You Know Who I Am?","Otherwise, they wouldn’t have been stopped.","But those details didn’t matter.","The Blood Demon Temple Master suddenly descended.","Instantly, the surrounding powerhouses held their breath.","The greatest demon in the Tian Cang Eternal Realm.","The terrifying Blood Demon Temple Master, who made countless people shudder,","unexpectedly appeared here to intercept the pyramid.","One side consisted of veteran powerhouses, while the other had gained fame due to the battle on Qianshui Planet.","These two sides clashed.","In an instant, the entire Tian Cang Eternal Realm erupted into chaos.","“I remember now, someone mentioned it before. In the pyramid, there was also a young man carrying a sword. He saved two traitors who were being pursued by the Blood Demon Temple. It seems they were Dongsheng and Wanyan, who have gained some fame recently,” a knowledgeable figure in the crowd quickly pointed out the reason for the conflict.","Upon hearing this reason, many people still didn’t buy it, arguing, “Just because of two Universe Masters at the Sixth Tribulation realm, how could it possibly provoke the Lord of the Blood Demon Temple to take action personally?”","This logic was clearly unconvincing.","Not to mention the onlookers.","Even the parties involved, Wanyan and Dongsheng, felt incredulous.","Seeing the appearance of the Blood Demon Temple Master, their faces turned pale instantly.","But Wu Zuo seemed indifferent, then turned and said, “You may not know my true identity, but don’t be afraid, I’ll handle him!”","Jian Wushuang also cooperated by opening the pyramid.","The Blood Demon Temple Master was a Universe Master at the Eighth Tribulation realm.","With divine power exceeding tens of millions, he was definitely a peak powerhouse. Facing this great demon, victory could only be achieved through prestige.","Wu Zuo gestured to the crowd and then shouted loudly at the Lord of the Blood Demon Temple, “Do you know who I am?”","After speaking, he leaped out of the pyramid and actively charged towards the Blood Demon Temple Master.","Not only Dongsheng and Wanyan were astonished by this scene.","Even the onlookers frowned!","They all thought Wu Zuo was crazy.","A Universe Master at the Seventh Tribulation realm actively seeking trouble from a Universe Master at the Eighth Tribulation realm?","It was acceptable to defeat two Universe Masters at the Eighth Tribulation realm.","But challenging an Eighth Tribulation Universe Master?","That was too arrogant.","The Blood Demon Temple Master was also taken aback.","He didn’t recognize Wu Zuo.","He hadn’t even bothered with the matter of the Wanliu Divine Tree.","Because he wasn’t interested.","He was a Universe Master and lacked no Life force.","Nor did he lack treasures.","Naturally, he didn’t recognize Wu Zuo’s identity.","In fact, only three Eternal Beings knew his identity.","Others were unaware of who he was.","And he just charged straight ahead.","The Blood Demon Temple Master naturally didn’t hold back.","With his hand as sharp as a blade, he directly slapped Wu Zuo fiercely, sending him flying far away.","Several towering mountains collapsed before he finally stopped.","“Has he always been this brave?” Blood Demon Temple Masteer thought there might be some tricks, but apparently not.","With divine power of over 6 million, Wu Zuo seemed like he could be easily defeated in his normal state.","Fortunately, Wu Zuo had plenty of treasures, astonishing defense.","Otherwise, this blow would have cost him half his life.","After getting up from the pile of rocks, Wu Zuo roared in anger.","After becoming the direct disciple of Realm King, he had never suffered such a setback.","Realm King also protected him very well.","Although there was training, they were evenly matched opponents.","Encountering a true Universe Master at the Eighth Tribulation, who was so ruthless in his","actions, woke him up.","After wiping off the blood from his face, Wu Zuo was awakened by this blow.","Thinking about it, this was the Tian Cang City. He immediately transmitted his voice to one of","the ancient existences, “Tian Cang!”","If you can’t win, move the pieces.","Although arrogant, he wouldn’t casually reveal the title of Realm King.","Messaging took time, and arriving even more so.","Right now, someone needed to confront them.","In truth, he could just hide within the pyramid.","Jian Wushuang didn’t believe the other party could break through the pyramid.","Unfortunately, the pyramid couldn’t absorb attacks now. Otherwise, the stronger the attack,","the more it could absorb.","“Wu Zuo, come back!” With a wave of his hand, a metal plate beneath the pyramid actively","retrieved Wu Zuo.","Hiding wasn’t his style.","If it were Chi Jiuxiao outside, he could endure.","But a Universe Master at the Eighth Tribulation wouldn’t make him avoid a fight.","The other party rushed here to intercept.","That was unexpected.","But he understood the Blood Demon Temple Master’s intentions.","There was a secret within Ye Lingxiao’s body.","The blood-colored aura of the Blood Demon Temple Master was very similar.","This guy came for this.","But daring to intercept them in the Tian Cang City.","That was somewhat arrogant.","Showing no respect for any Eternal Beings.","Was it a bet on which Eternal Being wasn’t in the Tian Cang City?","Stretching his shoulders, Jian Wushuang didn’t dwell on it further, instructing Wu Zuo, “I’ll","go out to meet him. Don’t come out!”","“Wushuang!” Wanyan’s expression was somewhat anxious.","In their conversations over the past few days, they had learned that Jian Wushuang was","merely a Universe Master at the Sixth Tribulation.","Going out now was too dangerous.","Even though Jian Wushuang’s strength was incredible and he could fight beyond his level, this","was pushing it too far!","Ye Lingxiao, standing aside, blinked. Just before Jian Wushuang left, she spoke up voluntarily,","“Wait...”","Jian Wushuang paused for a moment, but it was just a hesitation, leaving behind a resolute","statement as he departed.","“Wait for me!”","Just that simple sentence eased everyone’s minds.","As Jian Wushuang left the pyramid, a hint of a smile appeared on his face.","The fact that Ye Lingxiao could call him back at the last moment was enough.","If he had kept hiding it, one could suspect his character.","In this crucial moment, willingly speaking up proved character.","It was also to test the other’s bottom line.","Now it seemed Wanyan’s judgment was correct.","He could handle what came next.","Even if he couldn’t win, he could retreat into the pyramid.","He could leave at any time or continue towards the Tian Cang Palace.","The initiative was with Jian Wushuang!","So there was no need to panic.","Seeing a man with a sword suddenly appear, the Blood Demon Temple Master knew this was","the Ancient Moon Spacetime expert who saved Ye Lingxiao.","“Surrender her, and I can spare your life!”","Jian Wushuang snorted, “Are you qualified to ask me?!”","With these words, the Blood Demon Temple Master didn’t obstruct the pyramid anymore.","He faced Jian Wushuang from a distance and burst into laughter. Talking about qualifications with him, this was the first time someone had said that to him.","The onlookers also turned their attention to Jian Wushuang at this moment.","But they couldn’t sense Jian Wushuang’s aura.","The Blood Demon Temple Master was the same.","But intuition told him that Jian Wushuang’s divine power wasn’t very strong.","This feeling couldn’t be blocked.","Unless it was a Star Spirit.","Like Weiss, becoming a transparent person.","Yet terrifying in battle.","At that level, Jian Wushuang couldn’t even imagine it.","The Blood Demon Temple Master and the onlookers hadn’t seen the so-called Star Spirit.","So they thought Jian Wushuang must be using some kind of incredible treasure to conceal his","aura."]},{"number":5983,"title":"Chapter 5983: Ordinary","paragraphs":["Chapter 5983: Ordinary","Everyone waited for Jian Wushuang’s outburst. Even the Blood Demon Temple Master.","Even Wu Zuo was knocked down with a single move.","But Jian Wushuang dared to come out for a battle.","Many still had considerable confidence in him.","The Blood Demon Temple Master was also curious about Jian Wushuang’s strength.","Through the Blood Demon Temple’s intelligence network, he hadn’t been able to uncover Jian Wushuang’s background.","He knew a few well-known Eighth Tribulation realm experts in the Ancient Moon Spacetime. Like Divine Wood King, who had once again established the Divine Wood Sect.","Although he was a Scattered Tribulation, he had followed the newly ascended God of Life.","And the recently revealed divine power effortlessly surpassed 15 million.","He was the top expert in the entire Northern Spacetime.","Then there was the Lord of the Ancient Moon Sect.","The Universe Master of the Eighth Tribulation realm, and the ruler of the Ancient Moon Spacetime.","His strength was unfathomable.","Apart from these individuals, there were few formidable figures in the Ancient Moon Spacetime that made him wary.","For Jian Wushuang, this unknown expert, he was only curious.","But he also set a limit in his heart.","At least, he must be at the level of the Eighth Tribulation realm.","Wu Zuo was the Universe Master of the Seventh Tribulation realm, with combat power reaching the pinnacle of the Eighth Tribulation realm.","Yet he was defeated.","And still dared to engage with him.","So Jian Wushuang’s strength must be at least at the pinnacle of the Eighth Tribulation realm.","Or even surpass it.","Under everyone’s curious gaze, Jian Wushuang’s aura disappeared quietly.","His divine power and Origin Source were fully revealed.","With a divine power of 1.5 million, he was at the realm of the Sixth Tribulation. Unintentionally revealed.","If someone saw Jian Wushuang in this state on a normal day, they might be surprised! Surprised that a Sixth Tribulation realm could possess a divine power of 1.5 million.","The Origin Source even reached the level of the Eighth Tribulation realm.","Now, people were still surprised!","Just surprised that Jian Wushuang was too weak.","Weak without self-awareness.","A Sixth Tribulation realm, even with a divine power of 1.5 million, and an Origin Source comparable to the Universe Master of the Eighth Tribulation realm.","But it also depended on who he was facing.","That was the Blood Demon Temple Master!","The onlookers in the distance couldn’t help but sweat for Jian Wushuang.","“A Sixth Tribulation realm, is he insane?” Many couldn’t help but exclaim!","Originally, they thought Wu Zuo was crazy enough.","A Universe Master of the Seventh Tribulation realm taking the initiative against a Universe Master of the Eighth Tribulation realm.","Now, after seeing Jian Wushuang’s true strength.","They understood.","It was like a junior challenging a senior.","People coming out of the pyramid seemed to be getting weaker and weaker.","Making this peak showdown seem somewhat ridiculous.","Seeing Jian Wushuang in this state, the Blood Demon Temple Master was momentarily stunned, then couldn’t help but laugh, “Are you planning to defeat me with just your eyes?”","While he said this, he was speculating about Jian Wushuang’s trump card!","A Universe Master of the Sixth Tribulation realm dared to fight him.","Was it because of his background?","Or was he really foolish?","He wasn’t afraid of backgrounds!","And fools, he was even less afraid of.","In the Tian Cang Eternal Realm.","He had never worried about being suppressed by others’ backgrounds.","Jian Wushuang floated in the air, paying no attention to those gazes, “Indeed, I’ve weakened","a bit!”","Even he couldn’t help but shake his head.","The few people in the pyramid also worried about Jian Wushuang.","“Wushuang has gone mad, hasn’t he? How dare he?” Dongsheng couldn’t believe his eyes seeing Jian Wushuang so calm and composed.","At this moment, Wu Zuo also grew a bit concerned. Though he knew Jian Wushuang was slightly stronger than himself, there were limits to his strength!","Nevertheless, he tried to reassure everyone, saying, “Don’t worry, I’ve already sent a message to Tian Cang. He’ll be here soon, and this Blood Demon Temple Master won’t be able to frolic","for much longer.”","The three individuals, who were somewhat blurry to Realm King and the ancient existence,","could only nod.","Outside.","A crimson storm began to sweep through.","“Enough with the nonsense. If that’s all you’ve got, then prepare to meet your end!” The","Blood Demon Temple Master raised his hand, gathering a crimson storm and charging","towards Jian Wushuang.","At the core of the crimson storm lay over 8 million units of divine power.","Enough to kill even the top-tier experts of the Eighth Tribulation.","With the storm unleashed, everyone believed Jian Wushuang was doomed without a doubt.","Even Wu Zuo and others inside the pyramid held their breath.","In that instant, they began to recall whether Jian Wushuang had truly gone insane.","They worried that Jian Wushuang might have played himself to death.","If he were to fall like that, it would be too unfair.","Most of the onlookers, ordinary experts though they were, couldn’t grasp the full power contained within the crimson storm, but they understood that this strike would bring down","even the ordinary Eighth Tribulation realm experts.","“He’s done for!”","“So reckless. He could have stayed hidden in that pyramid and might have been able to hold on for a while. But no, he had to provoke the Blood Demon Temple Master. He’s done for this","time!”","It wasn’t a matter of not having faith in Jian Wushuang anymore; it was about believing that he couldn’t even withstand a single move and was about to perish.","Even Wu Zuo would probably fall.","The Blood Demon Temple Master, however, didn’t think so much. With a casual strike, he was","already determined to kill Jian Wushuang.","And feeling a bit aggrieved that he was intimidated by the Universe Master of the Sixth Tribulation realm before him, he unleashed an even more ruthless attack.","As countless eyes watched, a miracle unfolded.","Jian Wushuang took a deep breath, clenched his fists, let out a low growl, and underwent a","tremendous transformation in his aura.","A blue aura burst out from within him, crackling with electricity, forming a huge sphere.","His divine power surged from 1.5 million to over five million in an instant.","At the same time, an elliptical universe descended.","His divine power surged once again.","Reaching seven million.","Facing the crimson storm, he slowly raised his hand.","Clang!","The Wanjie Sword emerged.","With just one sword strike, he cleaved the crimson storm in two.","Easily dispelling the Blood Demon Temple Master’s casual attack.","This scene stunned everyone.","Even the Blood Demon Temple Master found it hard to believe.","For countless years, he had not only never seen such a thing but hadn’t even heard of such an","existence.","A Universe Master of the Sixth Tribulation realm who could effortlessly achieve the power comparable to the top tier of the Eighth Tribulation realm with just one sword.","If word got out, even the Universe Masters of the Eighth Tribulation realm might feel like","banging their heads against a wall.","“Who are you!” The Blood Demon Temple Master furrowed his brow, thinking of the","Northern Spacetime and that mysterious place.","The Realm God Continent.","All three ancient existences had been there.","And many legendary Eight Tribulations experts had also practiced there.","But entering the Realm God Continent required the Realm God Order.","This kind of thing couldn’t be obtained just because one wished for it.","Even for ancient existences, they only had one. They couldn’t bring others into the Realm God Continent.","So that place appeared extremely mysterious among the Eighth Tribulation realm.","Not only did only Eight Tribulations experts enter, but there were also rumors that not long","ago, a Universe Master of the Seventh Tribulation had left the Realm God Continent and entered the Northern Spacetime.","But this didn’t match up with Jian Wushuang at all!","Although Jian Wushuang was heaven-defying, his realm was still that of a Universe Master of","the Sixth Tribulation realm.","Not only that.","He also possessed the Universe Dao Arena.","He didn’t make a move until now, but when he did, he amazed everyone.","Just the fact that a Universe Master of the Sixth Tribulation realm could summon the Universe","Dao Arena shocked everyone.","Universe Dao Arena."]},{"number":5984,"title":"Chapter 5984: Sword Slash Storm","paragraphs":["Chapter 5984: Sword Slash Storm","That required transferring the Origin Source Universe into the divine body.","Only those at the Eighth Tribulation could achieve it.","The principle was actually quite simple.","It involved the divine body merging with the Origin Source Universe to reach a highly compatible state.","Universes Masters below the Eighth Tribulation couldn’t accomplish it.","Because of this, many couldn’t accept that a Universe Master at the Sixth Tribulation could achieve it.","Around Jian Wushuang and the Blood Demon Temple Lord, numerous powerful beings had gathered.","Many were from the Tian Cang Palace, with some even at the Eighth Tribulation.","However, none from the Tian Cang Palace moved to intervene.","After Wu Zuo relayed the message, it was apparent that reinforcements from Tian Cang were on their way.","But it would take some time.","Moreover, Wu Zuo didn’t make it clear in his message that they were already in the Tian Cang City.","It was all because of Divine Wood King.","Establishing a sect, pulling three Eternal Beings to bolster his own prestige.","Otherwise, Tian Cang would have returned to the Tian Cang Eternal Realm long ago.","As he rushed back, he also transmitted a message to the Blood Demon Temple Lord.","“Don’t touch them!” Just those three simple words made the Blood Demon Temple master hesitate to act.","Even if Tian Cang hadn’t warned him, he wouldn’t dare to act anymore.","Jian Wushuang’s revealed strength was nothing extraordinary.","But on a Universe Master at the Sixth Tribulation, it was remarkable.","To be so powerful at the Sixth Tribulation, his background must be immense.","So the Blood Demon Temple Master immediately inquired about Jian Wushuang’s identity.","Jian Wushuang remained calm, “Just an insignificant nobody, not worth mentioning!”","With that, he retrieved the Wanjie Sword.","That one sword had stunned everyone present.","The Blood Demon Temple Master refrained from acting as well.","He no longer had any reason to be uptight.","“An insignificant nobody?” The Blood Demon Temple Maseter gritted his teeth.","He really wanted to act.","But he didn’t dare to disobey Tian Cang’s orders.","Ye Lingxiao!","A greedy glint appeared in the Blood Demon Temple Master’s eyes.","Greed overcame fear.","While he wouldn’t act against Jian Wushuang, there was no prohibition against attacking others.","He knew Ye Lingxiao’s background well.","There were no reservations.","As long as he bypassed Jian Wushuang, it would be fine.","If necessary, he could suppress Jian Wushuang first.","But Ye Lingxiao must be captured.","“Since you’re unwilling to speak, then I won’t ask anymore, but Ye Lingxiao must be mine!”","After saying this, the Blood Demon Temple Master flashed past Jian Wushuang at lightning speed towards the pyramid.","Jian Wushuang remained unmoved.","He even watched the Blood Demon Temple Master attacking the pyramid as if watching a fool.","Inside the pyramid, Wu Zuo and the others saw the Blood Demon Temple Master continuously attacking the pyramid, but they didn’t feel any divine power, not even a tremor.","The sound of the attacks was also blocked.","Inside remained as calm as ever.","While Wu Zuo and the others were confident in the pyramid’s defenses, they didn’t expect it to be so astonishingly resilient.","Those bystanders, some puzzled, couldn’t understand why the Blood Demon Temple Master bypassed Jian Wushuang and kept attacking the pyramid.","Among them were some insightful experts who calmly remarked, “Although the Blood Demon Temple Master fears no one in the Tian Cang Eternal Realm, there are still concerns. It’s wise not to take action against the mysterious swordsman. Attacking the pyramid now must be to seize someone!”","Many nodded in agreement with this analysis.","It sounded reasonable.","Jian Wushuang remained relaxed, standing at a distance, watching as the Blood Demon Temple Master attacked the pyramid.","The crimson storm continued to rage.","The divine power surged, quickly surpassing tens of millions.","The peak strength of the Blood Demon Temple Master was around 12 million.","He was already at the pinnacle of the Eighth Tribulation.","Yet he couldn’t shake the pyramid in the slightest.","This further crushed the Blood Demon Temple Master’s spirit.","First, there was a swordsman erupting with Eighth Tribulation power from the Sixth","Tribulation.","Then there was this silver pyramid.","No matter how he attacked, he couldn’t budge it.","Conventional attacks failing, he mobilized the Blood Demon Temple.","Trying to suppress the pyramid.","The Blood Demon Temple was a supreme treasure at the pinnacle of the Eighth Tribulation","realm.","Suppressing ordinary treasures was effortless.","Even treasures of the same level could be suppressed and trapped.","As long as he could suppress it, he could open this pyramid.","Seeing this, Jian Wushuang couldn’t help but remind, “Blood Demon Temple Master, don’t","waste your energy. This pyramid is a treasure of the Ninth Tribulation. Your pile of scrap","metal won’t be able to suppress it!”","“The Ninth Tribulation!” The Blood Demon Temple Master was completely shattered.","No wonder no matter how he attacked, there was no response!","A treasure of the Ninth Tribulation.","If he could blast it open, that would be strange.","Moreover, the silver pyramid was crafted by the Southern Spacetime’s metallic brain.","In the Southern Spacetime, metallic lifeforms were predominant.","They had the most research into crafting treasures.","Among Ninth Tribulation treasures, this silver pyramid was the top.","It was much more powerful than Ninth Tribulation treasures in the Northern Spacetime.","For the Blood Demon Temple Master to be able to break it, he would at least need to be a peak","Ninth Tribulation expert.","But in the Northern Spacetime, where would one find Ninth Tribulation experts?","Ninth Tribulation treasures were rare, let alone experts.","This wasn’t like the Moro Spacetime back then.","The Moro Spacetime had spacetime treasures because of Mie Sheng’s influence.","The Higher Heavens of the Wanliu Universe had quite a few Ninth Tribulation treasures.","Even spacetime treasures.","Like the Skysight Heavenly Chessboard.","In fact, upon careful consideration, Jian Wushuang could deduce that Teacher Xuan Yi came","from the Starry Sky.","Because the Skysight Heavenly Chessboard originally existed in the Starry Sky.","It was transmitted to the Moro Spacetime through Mie Sheng, initially obtained by the First","True King, and eventually ended up in his hands.","Despite the nine major spacetimes upstream being much more powerful than the Moro","Spacetime.","They didn’t have true spacetime treasures.","They only had universal treasures at the Ninth Tribulation level.","That was because of the Realm God Continent.","Transmitted from the Realm God Continent.","So in terms of treasures, the Moro Spacetime was still formidable.","But this also brought unprecedented calamities.","Mie Sheng was a big problem.","“Ah, why bother!” Jian Wushuang shook his head. “Blood Demon Temple Master, I vouch for this person. Even if","Senior Tian Cang comes, you won’t be able to touch her!”","Upon hearing the words “Tian Cang”, the Blood Demon Temple Master’s expression changed.","He turned to look at Jian Wushuang, his gaze filled with dread and jealousy.","Following that was the descent of a massive blood-colored Dao Arena.","That was the Blood Demon Temple Master’s Origin Source Dao Arena.","It was the Origin Source Universe.","With the Dao Arena’s descent, the Blood Demon Temple Master’s divine power erupted once","again.","From around 12 million, it surged to about 14 million.","The divine power shook the entire Tian Cang City.","If this place weren’t the core of the Eternal Realm, the spacetime might have been shattered.","“It’s over, the Blood Demon Temple Master is about to go mad!”","Among the onlookers, a Universe Lord from the Tian Cang Palace, a peak expert of the Seventh","Tribulation, couldn’t help but retreat.","Even the aftermath of attacks by Eighth Tribulation peak experts was unbearable for them.","For a moment, everyone backed away once again."]},{"number":5985,"title":"Chapter 5985: Blood-Colored Power","paragraphs":["Chapter 5985: Blood-Colored Power","Jian Wushuang couldn’t help but step back.","“This Blood Demon Temple Master has good potential. Why bother pursuing the blood-red power!” he couldn’t help but sigh.","Perhaps only he and the Blood Demon Temple Master knew the secret of Ye Lingxiao.","Because initially, this blood-colored power had helped him quite a bit.","The casual impression was very profound.","The Blood Demon Temple Master’s goals were similar to his.","Both wanted to use the power of blood color to forcibly enhance their basic divine power.","The Blood Demon Temple Master’s current basic divine power could reach tens of millions. To the point where ordinary divine power techniques had no effect on him.","He needed divine power techniques of the Ninth Tribulation realm.","But in the Northern Spacetime, there was no Ninth Tribulation realm.","So he set his sights on the Realm God Continent.","That avenue didn’t work out.","Finally, he set his sights on the power of blood.","To forcibly enhance his own basic divine power.","Without divine power techniques, he wanted to raise his divine power to the limit of the Eight Tribulations Realm.","This was also a kind of cultivation method.","Jian Wushuang possessed the Super Eternal Ancient Transformation, which could achieve the greatest amplification.","He was never hungry after being full.","He didn’t understand the Eight Tribulations Realm experts who didn’t have peak divine power techniques.","This was also normal.","After all, they were not gods.","They could only watch as the Blood Demon Temple Master attacked the pyramid like a madman.","Divine power continuously poured out.","The Blood Demon Temple Master attacked for a full 15 minutes before stopping, exhausted.","He was somewhat despondent.","“... Could it be that I really can’t surpass my father?” the Blood Demon Temple Master staggered back.","Inside the pyramid.","Upon seeing this scene, Wu Zuo breathed a sigh of relief. “Looks like it’s time to give up!”","Although they couldn’t feel the power of the attack, they were afraid the opponent could break in.","“What’s this?” Dongsheng noticed a blood-colored crystal above the pyramid, flashing continuously.","Upon hearing Dongsheng’s words, Wu Zuo also looked over.","The red triangular crystal kept flashing.","And the light grew brighter.","“Could it be that it can’t hold on anymore?” Wu Zuo slowly rose up, approached, and carefully studied it.","Worried that the pyramid couldn’t bear it, he reached out to touch it.","Just as he touched it, the pyramid began to tremble.","The silver pyramid, which had been attacked by the Blood Demon Temple Master with impunity, suddenly shook at this moment.","Not only Wu Zuo and the others were shocked.","Even Jian Wushuang outside, widened his eyes.","Feeling a sinking feeling in his heart, he quickly transmitted his voice to Wu Zuo to inquire about the situation inside the pyramid.","“A red crystal?” Jian Wushuang heard Wu Zuo’s words and was puzzled.","He knew very little about the pyramid.","When it was intact, he had only seen it a few times from the outside.","Later, when he entered to kill the metallic light brain, he...","He didn’t have time to investigate.","Suddenly, there was a change, and he couldn’t figure out what was happening.","All he could do was to comfort Wu Zuo and the others, telling them not to touch anything","randomly.","The Blood Demon Temple Master saw the pyramid shaking but showed a surprised expression, thinking that his attack had worked.","He immediately erupted with divine power again and continued to attack the pyramid.","But he didn’t notice that the top of the pyramid had turned red by now.","A mighty red beam of light was converging there.","That power had once severely injured Chi Jiuxiao.","Mind you, Chi Jiuxiao had reached the Ninth Tribulation realm level.","Anyone hit by that blow would feel pain, let alone someone at the peak of the Eighth Tribulation realm.","However, the Blood Demon Temple Master paid no attention to this and kept attacking recklessly.","It wasn’t his fault; it was because the red beam of light had no divine power aura at all.","It was colorless and odorless.","While the Blood Demon Temple Master continued to attack the pyramid relentlessly, suddenly, the red beam of light erupted.","Like a flowing light, it directly surged towards the Blood Demon Temple Master’s chest.","If this blow landed, the Blood Demon Temple Master would undoubtedly perish.","Upon seeing the red beam of light, Jian Wushuang’s first reaction was to flee.","He had experienced the power of that light beam before.","Even from a distance, one could feel its scorching sensation.","After the eruption, the red beam of light exposed its divine power.","The terrifying divine power had already surpassed 20 million.","The Blood Demon Temple Master was completely stunned.","He had never seen such immense divine power before.","He stood there motionless.","Jian Wushuang only cared about fleeing for himself.","He didn’t care at all whether the Blood Demon Temple Master died.","It would be futile even if he died.","He had already said that the pyramid was a treasure of the Ninth Tribulation realm,","unbreakable.","The other party didn’t believe it, but what could he do?","The powerful beings watching the battle felt the sound of space-time shattering.","Then, the sky was covered by the red light.","What happened afterward was unknown.","Jian Wushuang also fled in panic.","Although his telekinesis was observing, it was shattered by the red beam of light.","Only Wu Zuo and the others inside the pyramid could see clearly.","Just as the red beam of light was about to kill the Blood Demon Temple Master, a majestic","figure appeared.","The shattered space-time instantly restored.","Space-time forged eternity.","The majestic figure pushed the Blood Demon Temple Master away.","He stood alone in front of the red beam of light.","Because there was no time, he could only resist it head-on.","The majestic figure struggled to block with both hands.","He felt his divine body being crushed.","His hands had disappeared.","And his divine body had been severely damaged.","But he managed to barely block the red beam of light.","Inside the pyramid, Wu Zuo and the others were stunned by the scene before them.","They hadn’t expected the power of the red beam of light to be so strong. Although Dongsheng and the others didn’t know who was blocking the attack for the Blood Demon Temple Master, they understood that if that blow had hit him, he would surely have","perished.","The one who voluntarily helped the Blood Demon Temple Master must be even more","powerful than him.","Wu Zuo was familiar with the person in front of him.","Because not long ago, he had been introduced to him by Realm King.","He was the true master of the Tian Cang Eternal Realm.","“Elder Tian Cang!”","The majestic figure turned out to be an old man in his seventies.","Seeing this, Wu Zuo also realized.","No wonder after he communicated with Elder Tian Cang, the Blood Demon Temple Master","didn’t attack Jian Wushuang.","It turned out they had some sort of deal.","Helping the Blood Demon Temple Master withstand this blow at the cost of severe injuries.","Even a fool could see that their relationship was extraordinary.","And judging by their appearances, they were likely father and son.","As the power dissipated, the sky returned to calm.","Elder Tian Cang’s hands also recovered, but he didn’t pay attention to the Blood Demon","Temple Master behind him.","Instead, he nodded towards the inside of the pyramid and shouted, “Brother Wu Zuo?”","His tone was extremely playful, as if he was teasing a child.","Wu Zuo, at this moment, also stuck his head out, not looking at Elder Tian Cang but first","casting a glance at the Blood Demon Temple Master.","Obviously, he was suspicious of whether it was safe at the moment.","Seeing this, Elder Tian Cang hurriedly apologized, “I’m late. I made my son act rudely in front","of Senior.”","“Cough cough!”","Seeing this, Wu Zuo directly walked out of the pyramid, his steps steady, his demeanor","arrogant.","He glanced at Elder Tian Cang with an unsightly expression and said, “You’re not a son, you’re a dragon son. You’ve become an Eighth Tribulation realm at such a young age, outstanding among your peers!”"]},{"number":5986,"title":"Chapter 5986: Uncle Master?","paragraphs":["Chapter 5986: Uncle Master?","Elder Tian Cang knew that Wu Zuo was being sarcastic.","He was still resenting the rudeness of the Blood Demon Temple Master just now, especially that chop which nearly split Wu Zuo’s face in half.","“Why are you still standing there? Why don’t you hurry up and apologize to your senior brother!” Elder Tian Cang turned around angrily and shouted, seeing that the Blood Demon Temple Master was still somewhat defiant.","He raised his hand and slapped the other’s head.","The sound was crisp.","Uncle Master!","These two words reminded the Blood Demon Temple Master.","In the entire Northern Spacetime, there were not many people who could make his father show such respect, except for those gods.","And the legendary Realm King.","Ordinary gods were okay; they didn’t have much power and were not as influential as Elder Tian Cang.","But Realm King was different.","Elder Tian Cang had always been called the Realm King’s named disciple.","Now calling Wu Zuo Uncle Master...","He suddenly woke up.","He looked at Wu Zuo with a look of disbelief!","“What, do I have flowers on my face?”","Wu Zuo made a fierce face at the Blood Demon Temple Master.","Elder Tian Cang turned to the Blood Demon Temple Master and gave him a stern look.","Only at this moment did the Blood Demon Temple Master accept reality.","He obediently stood behind Elder Tian Cang, bowing respectfully to apologize to Wu Zuo.","This scene stunned everyone.","Elder Tian Cang appeared.","Those onlookers recognized the majestic figure.","And seeing this Eternal Being of the Tian Cang Eternal Realm being extremely polite to Wu","Zuo and scolding the Blood Demon Temple Master, they were even more surprised!","The Blood Demon Temple Master, as the person involved, was even more astonished!","He never thought that Wu Zuo would be related to Realm King.","If it were Jian Wushuang, he wouldn’t have been so out of line.","Jian Wushuang, who was standing in the distance, slowly flew over.","“Tian Cang Senior, I’ve caused you trouble this time!” Jian Wushuang didn’t put on airs, but greeted this legendary figure of the Northern Spacetime in a plain tone.","Elder Tian Cang knew Jian Wushuang, the peerless genius with the power of Life, the key figure in the Wanliu.","In the Northern Spacetime, Jian Wushuang’s reputation was extremely loud.","After all, he possessed the power of Life.","That was like a moving treasure trove.","But no one dared to attract Jian Wushuang’s attention.","Elder Tian Cang was the same, smiling and saying, “I didn’t expect Brother Wushuang to be here too, it really adds luster to my Tian Cang Domain. If those Scattered Tribulations knew, they would probably trample my threshold.”","As he said this, he had already blocked the surrounding spacetime.","The onlookers outside didn’t know what they were talking about.","But the Blood Demon Temple Master listened carefully.","After recognizing the person in front of him as Jian Wushuang, he was greatly moved.","Nowadays, among the few strong figures in the Northern Spacetime, he had offended almost all of them.","Fortunately, he wasn’t a Scattered Tribulation.","Otherwise, he would regret it.","The reason why Jian Wushuang could be so influential in the Northern Spacetime was his control over the power of Life, his pinnacle strength of the Eighth Tribulation realm.","Ordinary Scattered Tribulations were not enough to look at him.","Furthermore, he could use the power of Life to exchange for anything.","If Jian Wushuang wished, he could buy half of the Northern Spacetime with his power of Life.","In the Northern Spacetime, at least 70 percent of practitioners were Scattered Tribulations, with only 30 percent being Universe Masters.","This was also the reason for the continuous growth of the Northern Spacetime recently.","Previously, having a 20 percent share would have been considered good.","Although Jian Wushuang knew his weight, he was not as arrogant as Wu Zuo.","Instead, he was very low-key.","Facing Elder Tian Cang, he also showed respect.","Even though the other party praised him, he modestly replied, “Senior Tian Cang, you overpraise me. I am just a Universe Master of the Sixth Tribulation, a mere gleam compared to the sun and moon!”","Elder Tian Cang chuckled at Jian Wushuang’s words, thinking that Jian Wushuang was much easier to talk to than Wu Zuo.","The three Eternal Beings were indeed worthy of respect.","Just from the explosion inside the pyramid earlier, which could injure the former Chi Jiuxiao,","Elder Tian Cang’s divine power only decreased slightly under resistance.","That is to say, the opponent’s divine power was probably at the level comparable to the Ninth","Tribulation realm, not much different from Chi Jiuxiao at the time.","Ancient existences were not necessarily of the Ninth Tribulation realm.","This Elder Tian Cang had already known from Realm King.","Speaking of which, the first powerhouse of the Ninth Tribulation realm in the Northern","Spacetime was created by Babidi.","Possessing the powerful strength of the Ninth Tribulation realm.","Incredibly strong.","During the Wanliu, he was almost beaten up by Chi Jiuxiao.","In the end, he only managed to turn the tables with the help of the Danbao.","And it wasn’t even a direct defeat.","It could be imagined how terrifying Chi Jiuxiao’s strength was.","Even in the entire Northern Spacetime, countless strong figures had to join forces to contend","against him.","Fortunately, he had now been suppressed by the Immortal Divine Temple of Danbao.","Otherwise, it would have been a big trouble.","Elder Tian Cang had introduced them enough and also realized that Jian Wushuang and the others had come to his Tian Cang Domain probably for some business, so he took the","initiative and said, “Since you’ve come to my territory, why don’t we continue our","conversation in my cave?”","“Excellent!” Jian Wushuang felt a surge of delight within him.","He thought it was good to maintain Wu Zuo’s face!","Originally, he had thought it might be troublesome to rashly seek help from an Eternal Being.","But it turned out to be so smooth.","Elder Tian Cang smiled faintly, “Please!”","After saying that, he took the lead and headed towards the core of Tian Cang Domain, the Tian","Cang Palace.","Jian Wushuang gathered the pyramid, enveloped Wu Zuo and the others with his Thought power, and followed Elder Tian Cang directly.","After they left, those onlookers, unable to see the fight, naturally dispersed.","However, after this battle.","The reputation of the pyramid became even more miraculous. The Lord of the Blood Demon Temple also followed beside Elder Tian Cang.","It’s more like being carried along by Elder Tian Cang than following him.","“Such speed?” Elder Tian Cang turned his head and smiled at Jian Wushuang and the others,","but he was somewhat shocked in his heart.","Originally, he thought Jian Wushuang would use the pyramid to follow him.","Relying on the speed of the treasure, he could keep up with him.","But unexpectedly, without the treasure, they could still match his speed.","Jian Wushuang, on the other hand, had no reservations.","The Northern Spacetime was no longer a threat to him.","And he had already exposed his speed in the Wanliu Spacetime, so many people had seen it!","There was no point in trying to hide.","The most important reason was that he felt it would be impolite to fly with the treasure while","the owner of this place led them in flight.","The group moved at an extremely fast speed.","In just the time it takes for an incense stick to burn, they arrived at Tian Cang Palace.","The entire Tian Cang Palace exuded an ancient aura.","Passed down through generations, it had experienced countless eras.","But Tian Cang Palace remained eternal.","Inside the core of Tian Cang Palace, the “Jade Tree Hall”, preparations were underway for a","grand banquet.","“Hurry up, the Patriarch’s guests will be here soon, move faster!” A middle-aged man in","luxurious clothing was directing the servants’ arrangements in a somewhat impatient","manner.","His identity was not simple either, he was one of the descendants of Elder Tian Cang, possessing extremely strong bloodline power."]},{"number":5987,"title":"Chapter 5987: Honored Guest","paragraphs":["Chapter 5987: Honored Guest","Now, as the Universe Master of the Seventh Tribulation realm, he was also the most powerful figure of his generation within the Tian Cang Palace.","Presently, he was giving orders to his subordinates to receive guests for the Patriarch.","It was evident that Patriarch Tian Cang had elevated the protocol for Jian Wushuang and the others’ arrival to the highest level.","Before long, hearty laughter echoed from a distance.","Sensing the Patriarch’s presence, he quickly dismissed his attendants, a smile adorning his face as he walked out.","“Grandson, Yue Wuji pays respects to the Patriarch and to all the Seniors!”","However, when he raised his head to look at the distinguished guests behind the Patriarch, he froze.","At the forefront was a Universe Master of the Seventh Tribulation realm, emitting an aura similar to his own.","Behind him were three Universe Masters of the Sixth Tribulation realm and a common","woman.","For a moment, he was bewildered, unable to discern who the honored guests were!","At this moment, behind the Patriarch, he sensed a powerful figure whose bloodline power bore a striking resemblance to his own.","The Lord of the Blood Demon Temple!","A Universe Master of the Eighth Tribulation realm.","The restrained aura made Yue Wuji realize the identity of the other party.","After recognizing him, his expression eased slightly.","If it weren’t for the Patriarch’s presence, he might have directly shown displeasure.","This subtle change didn’t escape Jian Wushuang’s notice, but he paid it no mind.","They were both aware of the relationship between the Blood Demon Temple Master and Elder Tian Cang.","The reason for the lack of rumors in the outside world was probably a scandal they preferred to keep quiet.","Patriarch Tian Cang introduced cheerfully, “Senior Brother Wu Zuo, Junior Jian Wushuang, this is Yue Wuji, my junior disciple, considered one of the most outstanding individuals of our generation.”","“Not bad at all. Your peak divine power is probably around 2.5 million!” Wu Zuo nodded approvingly, offering his evaluation.","Hearing the Patriarch addressing the Seventh Tribulation Universe Master so respectfully and even calling him “Senior Brother” left Yue Wuji deeply shaken.","Moreover, the Patriarch openly stated his true strength.","A distinguished guest was indeed distinguished; their perspective and strength were extraordinary.","“Alright, let’s take our seats!” Patriarch Tian Cang gestured for everyone to enter the Jade Tree Hall.","Wu Zuo was the first to walk in without ceremony.","Jian Wushuang and the others followed suit.","The moment they entered the Jade Tree Hall, they felt a wave of relaxation wash over them. Their souls felt completely empty, and their mental faculties became highly active.","This was largely due to the presence of the Origin Source within the hall.","“Senior Tian Cang, if I’m not mistaken, within this jade tree, there should be a strand of tree soul, and it’s at the Eighth Tribulation realm level!”","Jian Wushuang approached the jade tree, carefully examining it before remarking on its uniqueness.","Patriarch Tian Cang didn’t respond directly but instead signaled to Yue Wuji with his eyes. Yue Wuji immediately understood.","He stepped forward and explained the origin of the jade tree to Jian Wushuang and the others, taking the opportunity to flatter Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang felt somewhat embarrassed by this.","Yue Wuji, a Universe Master of the Seventh Tribulation realm, addressing him and his seniors","in such a deferential manner, made him somewhat self-conscious.","Although his strength far surpassed Yue Wuji’s, there was still a considerable difference in their realms.","After all, Yue Wuji was a Universe Master of the Seventh Tribulation realm, while he was only of the Sixth Tribulation realm.","He felt somewhat disrespectful.","Deciding not to dwell on it, he quietly took his seat.","He sat on the left side of Patriarch Tian Cang. He needed to make a request later, so he couldn’t sit too far away and thus couldn’t speak up.","Wu Zuo sat in the seat of honor.","Next to Wu Zuo was Yue Wuji.","Yue Wuji, sitting beside Wu Zuo, poured wine for him and introduced the delicacies on the","table.","All of this was surely prompted by Elder Tian Cang.","The reason was simple.","Jian Wushuang saw through it and took the initiative to chat with Elder Tian Cang.","Knowing that Wu Zuo was not serious in his speech, Elder Tian Cang was also willing to converse with Jian Wushuang.","As for the others, they were more reserved.","Especially the Blood Demon Temple Master, after entering the Jade Tree Hall, he felt uncomfortable all over, and he sat at the end, ignored by everyone.","Even Dongsheng and Wanyan sat in front of him.","Making the dignified Blood Demon Temple Master sit in the corner.","Perhaps only the Tian Cang Palace had such capability.","Yue Wuji and Wu Zuo were chatting and boasting, talking about the recent battle.","Hearing that the Blood Demon Temple Master dared to make a move against Wu Zuo.","Seizing the opportunity, he ruthlessly criticized the Blood Demon Temple Master verbally.","Wu Zuo was very pleased with this.","Obviously, he remembered that slap very deeply.","Despite his superficial frivolity, his heart was like a mirror.","He knew why these people were so respectful.","He was only a Universe Master at the seventh Tribulation realm.","The most important reason Elder Tian Cang treated him so cautiously was his relationship","with the Realm King.","At the same time, he was also the Realm King’s direct disciple and would become a super","powerhouse in the future.","Because of these reasons, he received respect.","The latter wasn’t important, becoming a super powerhouse had nothing to do with them.","The three Eternal Beings all had the ability to reach the Ninth Tribulation realm.","It’s just that the Northern Spacetime couldn’t bear it.","And they had all entered the Realm God Continent and had the most experience.","Knowing that the appearance of the God of Life would elevate the entire Northern Spacetime’s Life force, they would be able to break through then.","After the breakthrough, they would continue to explore the Realm God Continent.","Returning to the Northern Spacetime now was solely because they couldn’t advance in the Realm God Continent.","They had returned to their home spacetime, waiting for the appearance of the God of Life.","They could be said to be the first group of cultivators who benefited from the Realm God","Continent.","They were the most dependent on the Realm God Continent.","After entering the Realm God Continent, they had grown to their limits.","They wanted to send the younger generation to cultivate in the Realm God Continent as well.","Wanting to go to the Realm God Continent required the crucial Realm God Order.","Only Realm King possessed such a thing.","So they flattered the Realm King’s direct disciple, Wu Zuo.","The Blood Demon Temple Master also bowed to Wu Zuo because of this.","Yue Wuji, after learning about Wu Zuo’s identity, became even more attentive.","Everything was for benefits.","Actually, this wasn’t considered a bad thing.","It was just troublesome.","Wu Zuo was only vague in expression about this, but he was disdainful in his heart.","Wanting to obtain the Realm God Order was actually quite easy.","As long as one made significant contributions to the Northern Spacetime, they could obtain it.","For example, when Jian Wushuang and others helped Danbao become the God of Life.","Everyone who came out alive from the Wanliu Universe got a Realm God Order.","It wasn’t so easy to get a Realm God Order out of nowhere.","Realm King wouldn’t give it out casually.","Because the quotas were limited.","The existence of the Northern Spacetime was to nurture stronger cultivators.","Not for personal connections.","Even if Wu Zuo was Realm King’s direct disciple, it wasn’t so easy for him to obtain extra","Realm God Orders.","If it weren’t for Jian Wushuang seeking help from Elder Tian Cang, Wu Zuo himself wouldn’t","bother with these people.","The problem Jian Wushuang was worried about came.","Before he could ask for help, others sought help from him.","If it were other conditions, he could handle it, but the Realm God Order, he really had no way.","He only had one in his hand."]},{"number":5988,"title":"Chapter 5988: Seventy Percent?","paragraphs":["Chapter 5988: Seventy Percent?","Although hesitant, he eventually voiced his request.","Upon hearing about the restoration of the pyramid, Tian Cang’s expression changed, though deep inside he was ecstatic, readily agreeing.","“Tian Cang, you’re amazing!” Jian Wushuang exclaimed, presenting the pyramid, now","reduced to the size of a palm, to Elder Tian Cang.","Even the Blood De mon Temple Master, aware of the pyramid’s power, couldn’t resist looking up.","Just moments ago, he had nearly perished from the attack unleashed by the pyramid. Especially upon learning that the pyramid was damaged, his eyes widened in disbelief.","Tian Cang, who had seen much, was not overly shocked!","Having been to the Realm God Continent, he was a super strong individual.","He had seen many treasures, and he himself possessed treasures of the Ninth Tribulation level.","Although the pyramid was powerful, he recognized it at a glance.","“This pyramid must be a treasure from the Southern Spacetime’s Machine Clan!” Tian Cang carefully observed before continuing, “And it’s made by a special group within the Machine Clan called the Metallic Light Brain, quite unique.”","Jian Wushuang’s expression froze upon hearing about the Machine Clan.","He knew about the metallic light brain.","But the Machine Clan was something he had never heard of before.","Through Tian Cang’s explanation, he understood that the life structures of the Southern Spacetime were vastly different from those of the Northern Spacetime.","It wasn’t as simple as it seemed on the surface.","The Machine Clan, like the Human Clan, was a group nurtured within spacetime.","But their levels of life were different.","The Human Clan had high comprehension.","The Machine Clan had a natural talent for crafting treasures.","Their own combat power might be average.","But with the use of treasures, they could fight against super strong individuals of the Human Clan.","And they were extremely troublesome opponents.","“Elder, is there a way to completely repair this pyramid?”","Jian Wushuang asked the thing he was most worried about.","The stronger the pyramid, the more he needed it to be fully repaired.","Otherwise, he wouldn’t have the confidence to deal with Mie Sheng when he returned.","Upon hearing this, Tian Cang smiled faintly,","“Friend Wushuang, we are all allies. Since you’ve spoken up, I’ll help you with this matter. However, complete repair is difficult. Even with all the Divine Craftsmen in the Northern Spacetime working together, it’s impossible. But I’m confident I can restore about seventy percent!”","70 percent!","That was already Tian Cang’s limit.","Among the three Eternal Beings, Tian Cang was the oldest.","He had spent the longest time reaching the peak.","When the usual paths were blocked, he began to explore various alternative methods.","He knew quite a bit about the Machine Clan’s secrets.","After all, the Machine Clan’s strong individuals, relying solely on treasures, were not powerful.","He had initially wanted to try this path.","Upon reaching the peak, although the Realm King had said that they had to wait for the emergence of the God of Life to break through the Ninth Tribulation, waiting for countless eons was out of the question.","They naturally wouldn’t wait.","They all began to explore other secret methods.","Such as creating stronger secret methods, or studying forging, alchemy, and Origin Source.","As long as it could enhance their combat power or assist in battle, they hunted for it.","Among them, Tian Cang, who was extremely obsessed with forging, chose the peak secret methods of the Machine Clan.","He could already refine some common Eighth Tribulation-level Universe Treasures of the Machine Clan.","Now that Jian Wushuang had taken out a Ninth Tribulation-level treasure of the Machine Clan, he didn’t have much confidence.","To say 70 percent was already an exaggeration.","The harder it was, the greater the favor Jian Wushuang owed.","By then, he could also bring up the matter of the Realm God Order.","Even if he couldn’t produce the Realm God Order, he would still help Jian Wushuang.","It wasn’t just to please Wu Zuo.","More importantly, he saw potential in Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang’s strength was evident to all.","It wasn’t just a simple matter of Life force.","There was also his relationship with the God of Life, as well as his own combat power.","All of these aspects were worth their assistance.","Now it was a timely help, and in the future, it would be a valuable addition.","“Seventy percent!” Jian Wushuang took a deep breath, thinking to himself, “It’ll have to do for now!”","As Elder Tian Cang had described, the current state of the pyramid was essentially just a shell.","Any repair, no matter how small, was progress.","And he was content with that.","“Jian Wushuang, speaking in confidence, you possess the Realm God Order. Once your strength advances further, you can go to the Realm God Continent. There, you’ll find formidable Ninth Tribulation realm experts, including those from the Machine Clan. They could assist in repairing the pyramid, but the cost will be significant!”","Though Jian Wushuang didn’t know much about the Realm God Continent, he understood that it was a gathering place for powerful beings from the four Major Spacetimes and the Starry","Sky.","It was an extraordinary land with Ninth Tribulation realm experts, which was to be expected. For now, this was the only solution. Jian Wushuang raised his wine cup and declared, “Senior, I’ll rely on you this time. If there’s anything you need, just ask. I’ll do my best to assist!” With the repair resolved, the next step was acquiring the necessary treasures for restoration. He couldn’t possibly use the scrap metal from the Northern Spacetime to repair the Machine Clan’s treasures!","Having been to the Realm God Continent, Jian Wushuang knew Tian Cang and Wu Zuo.","Wu Zuo had gone there to have fun, always sticking around Realm King, where he could","obtain treasures from the Machine Clan.","Therefore, Jian Wushuang had to purchase them from them.","Helping with the repair was already a great favor; he couldn’t ask for treasures as well.","He remembered how he had cheated during the forging of the Wanjie Sword.","He couldn’t keep taking advantage of others.","Jian Wushuang had decided that whatever Tian Cang asked for, he would agree, even if it","meant giving up the Realm God Order.","After all, he had no intention of going to the Realm God Continent.","If he needed to go in the future, he could ask Realm King for help.","Of course, if Tian Cang didn’t ask for the Realm God Order, it would be even easier.","Besides the treasures he personally used, he could offer everything else to Tian Cang.","“We’re all allies, there’s no need to be so polite. I have many treasures from the Machine Clan,","all spoils of war, hardly worth mentioning!”","Tian Cang was extremely generous, not mentioning any repayment.","However, the more Tian Cang said this, the more uncomfortable Jian Wushuang felt.","If it were Wu Zuo, he would probably start pretending to be dead silent by now.","Back in the Qishen Temple, Wu Zuo had often swindled treasures from Zhen Ling, relying on","his thick skin.","But Jian Wushuang couldn’t stand such things.","It was harder for him to owe someone than to have others owe him.","Tian Cang had seen through this point, hence his continuous apologies.","If it were Wu Zuo, he wouldn’t have been so apologetic.","After all, having lived for so many years, who hadn’t he seen?","Could he be duped by two youngsters?","“That won’t do!” Jian Wushuang shook his head firmly. “Senior, you repaired my treasures for","free. Whatever treasures are needed for the repair, I must provide!”","Tian Cang also stood up, patting Jian Wushuang’s shoulder.","“There’s no need. I’ve saved up some wealth over the years. We’re all from the Northern Spacetime. In the future, when we go to the Realm God Continent together, we’ll support each other. What are these treasures between us?”"]},{"number":5989,"title":"Chapter 5989: This Won’t Do!","paragraphs":["Chapter 5989: This Won’t Do!","Speaking of this, Yue Wujin also stood up and echoed, “Senior Jian Wushuang, what Patriarch said is right. We cultivators from the Northern Spacetime will unite when we arrive at the Realm God Continent. These treasures are indeed insignificant. Although the juniors haven’t been to the Realm God Continent yet, Patriarch often tells us that when we go there, we must unite.”","Implicitly, he admitted that he hadn’t been to the Realm God Continent, but what Patriarch said was correct.","Whew!","With a deep breath, Jian Wushuang directly took out the token. It was the Realm God Order. He slapped it on the table and said, “Everyone, please stop persuading. There’s nothing valuable on me that you desire. This Realm God Token was bestowed by Realm King. Today, I will give it to Senior Tian Cang!”","As he spoke, he pointed out and placed the Realm God Token directly in front of Elder Tian Cang.","“I can’t accept it!” Elder Tian Cang was ecstatic in his heart but didn’t dare to take it.","He did want to fight for a token like this for the younger generation, but he didn’t plan to take Jian Wushuang’s.","Instead, he wanted Jian Wushuang to ask Wu Zuo to get it from Realm King.","Unexpectedly, Jian Wushuang, without being provoked, directly brought out his own Realm God Token.","It was not surprising for Jian Wushuang to have this token.","The achievements of Wan Liu’s group were significant for the Northern Spacetime, and Jian Wushuang had resolved the crisis with the metallic lifeform.","It was normal to be granted the Realm God Token.","“If Senior respects me, please accept it!” Jian Wushuang’s gaze was serious. “If not, I’ll have to find another way to repay this favor!”","The atmosphere froze suddenly.","Elder Tian Cang felt a bit embarrassed.","But Yue Wujin and the Blood Demon Temple Master were gleaming with excitement.","If Patriarch agreed, then both of them had a chance to obtain this token.","In the current Tian Cang Palace.","Among Elder Tian Cang’s descendants, there were four Eighth Tribulation experts, two of whom were Scattered Tribulations.","There were also two Eighth Tribulation Universe Masters.","However, their strengths were just average.","Yue Wujin’s status could rival that of an Eighth Tribulation Universe Master, and his bloodline power was very strong.","Elder Tian Cang favored him greatly and he had a good chance of obtaining this Realm God Token.","As for the Blood Demon Temple Master, as Elder Tian Cang’s illegitimate son, he was also an Eighth Tribulation Universe Master.","Although the father and son had some conflicts, they were still related by blood.","Compared to Yue Wujin, who knows how many generations apart, the father and son were much stronger.","Moreover, among the Eighth Tribulation, the Blood Demon Temple Master’s strength surpassed the other two Eighth Tribulation Universe Masters in Tian Cang Palace by far.","They were both very excited and eager to help Elder Tian Cang accept it.","But Elder Tian Cang remained unmoved.","The Realm God Continent was not that simple.","Outsiders and natives were completely different.","And it also depended on one’s background and status.","Elder Tian Cang had only average relations with the gods of the Northern Spacetime.","Initially, he was only favored by Realm King.","Naturally, his strength was invincible among the Eighth Tribulation, but he hadn’t reached the level of power in the Ninth Tribulation.","Even if he reached the Ninth Tribulation in the future, he wouldn’t be invincible in the Realm God Continent.","He still needed help!","Jian Wushuang and Wu Zuo were the kind of help he needed.","In addition to helping the younger generation enter the Realm God Continent, Elder Tian","Cang hoped to have an alliance relationship with Jian Wushuang and Wu Zuo.","Not only were they powerful, but their backgrounds were also strong.","That’s why he hesitated.","Even though Jian Wushuang spoke so decisively, there was still no intention to accept.","Seeing things reach this point, Wu Zuo had to step forward to ease the tension.","After a moment of contemplation, he had an idea in mind and generously took the Realm God Token, casually handing it to the elder of Tian Cang.","“Tian Cang, my brother is straightforward, just accept it. It’s just a Realm God Token, right?”","Wu Zuo seemed indifferent. “I’ll have as many as I want. When Brother Wushuang wants to enter the Realm God Continent, I’ll just ask the Realm King for another one!”","After hearing Wu Zuo’s words, the elder of Tian Cang couldn’t help but accept it.","Although aware that Wu Zuo was somewhat boastful, considering Jian Wushuang’s extraordinary talent and Wu Zuo’s relationship, it should be easy for him to ask the Realm King for another Realm God Token in the future.","“Well then... I accept it!”","The elder of Tian Cang forced a smile and accepted the Realm God Token.","The purpose of this exchange was achieved, albeit with flaws, they still obtained a Realm God","Token.","Glancing at Yue Wujin and then at the Blood Demon Temple Master, he remained silent regarding the ownership of the Realm God Token.","He feared that if he decided now, the Realm King might blame him later, which would be troublesome if Jian Wushuang came with him.","So, he dared not make a direct decision.","When Jian Wushuang obtained a new Realm God Token and entered the Realm God Continent in the future, he would then determine the ownership of this Realm God Token and inspire all","the juniors.","Letting them know that everyone has the chance to enter the Realm God Continent.","It was hitting two birds with one stone.","Seeing the elder of Tian Cang accept it, Jian Wushuang also felt relieved.","Finally, he didn’t owe anyone any favors.","A burden lifted from his heart.","At the same time, he transmitted his voice, “Brother Wu Zuo, can you really get me another","Realm God Token?”","“Don’t worry, that old Realm King isn’t as stingy as Zhen Ling. If I ask, he’ll definitely give it","to you!” Wu Zuo confidently replied.","Actually, he wasn’t sure.","But to repair the pyramid.","He had to make some effort.","He couldn’t let Jian Wushuang bleed alone.","After all, after the pyramid was repaired, it was to return to the Qishen Temple to deal with","Mie Sheng.","And using Jian Wushuang’s name to ask for the Realm God Token was much better than saying","The wanted to exchange it for treasures.","Otherwise, the Realm King would scold him as a spendthrift.","He could actually do something like exchanging the Realm God Token for treasures.","Jian Wushuang really had no choice but to take out the Realm God Token.","However, he wasn’t really concerned about the Realm God Token.","He didn’t have much expectation for the Realm God Continent either.","As long as Mie Sheng was alive, there was a mountain in his heart. After eradicating Mie Sheng, he would take a good rest before considering his adventures.","He would definitely go to the Realm God Continent, just not in a hurry.","After expressing his request and resolving the favor issue, the banquet became more casual.","After three days of drinking, they ended the banquet.","Jian Wushuang didn’t ask much about the Realm God Continent, but the discussions about the Ancient Beings became much more stable.","Ancient Beings.","Eternal Beings.","Before, Jian Wushuang thought the other party might be in the Ninth Tribulation, or even","beyond it.","Later, he wondered if the other party might be a god.","Now, he finally understood where the other party was stuck!","Perfect-stage of the Eighth Tribulation realm.","The perfection of the Origin Source and divine power.","But it hadn’t reached the true limit yet.","To become a Ninth Tribulation realm, one’s hometown’s spacetime needed to be able to","sustain one’s life.","Currently, the Northern Spacetime hadn’t achieved that yet.","But it wasn’t far off.","Once Danbao created the secret technique of Resurrection, they would start preparing for the","creation of the pinnacle secret technique of the Ninth Tribulation realm."]},{"number":5990,"title":"Chapter 5990 The Truth","paragraphs":["Chapter 5990 The Truth","Once capable of sustaining life in the Ninth Tribulation Realm, the Northern Spacetime would reach its peak state.","It could continuously give birth to beings of the Ninth Tribulation realm.","The other three Major Spacetimes had already gone through this process.","The Northern Spacetime, however, lagged behind.","It was no wonder that Weiss had berated the Northern Realm King back then.","Now, Elder Tian Cang, like Scattered Tribulation, awaited the creation of the Danbao secret technique.","Their current state wasn’t the Eighth Tribulation realm nor the Ninth.","To be precise, they had sealed their Origin Source, allowing their divine power to increase while their Origin Source remained stagnant.","Advancing further would require transcending the Ninth Tribulation.","Given the current state of the Northern Spacetime, even if the Tribulation were successful, it would result in downfall.","Having cultivated for so long, the three ancient existences were well-prepared for the Tribulation, possessing absolute confidence in their success.","They were just unable to undergo it.","Thus, they had no choice but to seal their Origin Source, halting its cultivation.","Jian Wushuang was extremely curious upon hearing this.","He wondered how they could suppress the Ninth Tribulation for so long.","If one could prolong the time of Tribulation suppression, there wouldn’t be Scattered Tribulation in the Eighth Tribulation realm.","Ultimately, they would all reach the state of ancient existence.","The explanation received later was related to the Realm God Continent.","Not only the Realm God Continent but also with the assistance of the Realm King, they cultivated a peculiar secret technique to reach the state of Eternal Being.","After receiving this explanation, Jian Wushuang fully understood.","At the same time, he lamented the tragedy of the other Eighth Tribulation experts, abandoned mercilessly.","They marched forward to undergo the Tribulation one after another, eventually becoming Scattered Tribulation.","No wonder the three Eternal Beings never disclosed their realms to the outside world.","They only let those Eighth Tribulation powerhouses speculate, ultimately losing their lives.","Now, with the God of Life, Scattered Tribulation and the Eternal Beings all had hope.","This era truly was the best of times.","Jian Wushuang sighed!","As the opener of this spacetime, he also felt a hint of excitement.","He hoped to see a world of different colors.","His strength had already touched the pinnacle of this world.","Without stronger beings, it would be dull.","Although there were Ninth Tribulation realm powerhouses in the Realm God Continent, it was merely swapping one world for another.","There was minimal essential improvement.","Unknowingly, they reached the end.","Jian Wushuang felt hollow in his heart.","Perhaps the existence of Mie Sheng was still a good thing, giving him endless motivation.","The banquet ended, and the crowd dispersed.","Elder Tian Cang prepared to address the restoration issue, while Jian Wushuang and others were taken by Yue Wujin to visit the Tian Cang Palace.","Their purpose wasn’t merely sightseeing.","Inside the Tian Cang Palace, there was someone waiting for them to find.","And they needed to purchase some treasures.","Originally, the task of purchasing treasures was supposed to be entrusted to Wu Zuo.","However, after realizing the difficulty behind repairing the pyramid this time, Jian Wushuang generously took out a life Origin Source of the Eighth Tribulation level and handed it to Yue Wujin, asking for help in purchasing treasures.","The power of Life served as the reward.","Yue Wujin vigorously declined, not because he didn’t want to help with the treasure purchase, but because he didn’t dare to accept the power of Life.","He needed to behave well, especially in front of Jian Wushuang and others.","“Friend Wujin, just accept it. As for this power of Life, I have as much as I need. It’s nothing!” Jian Wushuang rarely boasted but was speaking the truth.","Still, Yue Wujin was quite cautious.","He first sought the opinion of the elder before finally accepting it.","He was actually quite tempted by so much power of Life.","Although he didn’t need it himself, he could use it to exchange for favors!","Originating from Tian Cang Palace, Jian Wushuang was not just a formidable figure.","He was the cream of the crop, the epitome of his generation’s excellence.","What he lacked wasn’t treasures but allies.","He required the support of strong figures within his clan, such as the two Scattered Tribulation experts.","With their backing, he could obtain the Realm God Token.","With the infusion of Life force, Yue Wujin became even more attentive, introducing the peculiar treasures of Tian Cang Palace while instructing its strong members to gather the treasures Jian Wushuang needed.","Upon reviewing the purchase list, he couldn’t help but feel a pang of pain.","The number of required treasures was overwhelming, far beyond what Tian Cang Palace could provide in one go.","They needed to gather from other spacetimes, coinciding with the years required for pyramid restoration.","However, this wasn’t a setback.","The restoration process was accelerated by millions of times, courtesy of Elder Tian Cang.","Repairing a level Ninth Tribulation-level artifact of the Machine Clan wasn’t as simple as it sounded.","Even though it was only restored to about 70 percent of its original power, it still demanded a significant amount of time.","Playing games with an age-old fox like Tian Cang was a testament to Jian Wushuang’s naivety.","Nevertheless, it was merely a display of wit.","Moreover, Elder Tian Cang lacked some materials, requiring exchanges with two other Eternal Beings.","Back at the banquet, if he hadn’t played his cards right, he wouldn’t have acquired the Realm God Token.","Playing games with an age-old fox like Tian Cang was a testament to Jian Wushuang’s naivety.","Nevertheless, it was merely a display of wit.","Presenting the Realm God Token, Jian Wushuang had no qualms.","All he sought was peace of mind.","There was no resentment towards Elder Tian Cang.","Instead, he was deeply grateful.","The ability to restore the pyramid made everything worthwhile.","Having witnessed the pyramid’s power, he became even more convinced of his plan.","There were no doubts.","Restoring 70 percent of its power, as long as the pyramid could still emit those red beams, he was confident of returning to Qishen Temple with absolute certainty.","He refused to believe that Mie Sheng’s power could remain formidable at the lower levels.","According to what Weiss and Realm King had said, Mie Sheng couldn’t unleash its peak strength in the Origin Universe’s spacetime.","Being at the peak of Eighth Tribulation was already commendable.","However, even so, he wasn’t complacent, preparing everything wholeheartedly.","The Martial Hall!","A branch of Tian Cang Palace, it also served as a martial arena for sparring matches.","In order to entertain Jian Wushuang and his peers, Yue Wujin went to great lengths to organize an internal challenge within Tian Cang Palace ahead of schedule.","It was a grand competition held to motivate the members to strive for improvement.","“All Universe Masters?” Jian Wushuang and his companions sat at the top of the viewing platform, surrounded by emptiness as they occupied almost half of the platform.","There were no outsiders to disturb them, but this time, two Eighth Tribulation experts accompanied them.","The Eighth Tribulation Universe Masters of Tian Cang Palace were out adventuring and not present at Tian Cang Palace.","Even if they were, Yue Wujin wouldn’t have allowed them to participate.","Giving such an opportunity to others would mean losing everything for oneself.","Since Tian Cang’s old man had obtained Jian Wushuang’s Realm God Token, Yue Wujin saw everyone as potential competitors.","So, this time’s martial competition was exclusively for disciples below the Seventh Tribulation.","To enhance the spectacle, they naturally wouldn’t invite Scattered Tribulation experts to avoid embarrassment.","Therefore, all participants were Universe Masters, numbering in the thousands.","Jian Wushuang was stunned.","Thousands of Sixth Tribulation Universe Masters.","This was the first time he had seen so many Universe Masters.","Tian Cang Palace truly lived up to its reputation as a force equal to the heavens, possessing formidable reserves."]},{"number":5991,"title":"Chapter 5991: Lord Guangying","paragraphs":["Chapter 5991: Lord Guangying","Among those people, Jian Wushuang immediately spotted a familiar face.","“Lord Guangying!” he turned and reminded Wu Zuo and the others.","They all looked towards Lord Guangying.","As an inheritor from the Qishen Temple, he was now shining brightly within the Tian Cang Palace.","It was the sect’s martial arts competition.","On the ten main platforms, each had a defender.","The longer one defended, the higher their rank.","Initially, everyone had one challenge opportunity.","Lose, and you’re out.","Win, and you gain another challenge opportunity.","Even if you lost later in the round robin, you could still challenge other platforms.","And so on.","Only the final ten would qualify for the next round.","At this moment, Lord Guangying sat atop the first platform.","Surprisingly, no one dared to challenge him.","Clearly, among peers, his strength was dazzling, and everyone feared his power.","Some who knew they were at the bottom took the heroic route.","They chose to challenge Lord Guangying.","But on the platform, Lord Guangying hardly needed to lift a finger to defeat his opponents.","Because his shadow alone could defeat challengers.","To the point where he boredly danced with his shadow.","On one platform, there were two identical shadows standing on each side.","Encountering a challenger, just one shadow could easily defeat them.","Watching from the spectator stands, Yue Wujin saw Jian Wushuang and others showing interest in Lord Guangying on the first platform. Seeing no one challenge, he forcefully ordered some Universe Masters at the Sixth Tribulation realm, who had decent strength, to challenge Lord Guangying.","“Seniors, interested in challenging Lord Guangying?” Yue Wujin cautiously asked.","Jian Wushuang shrugged, playfully saying, “Friend Wujin, I might need to ask you for a favor this time!”","“Oh?” Yue Wujin paused for a moment, thinking Jian Wushuang had eyes on that female cultivator, and replied with a faint smile, “If they catch your eye, it’s their luck, feel free to challenge!”","He acted as if he was open to their challenges.","Wu Zuo felt a bit speechless, waved his hand and said, “When did Lord Guangying enter Tian Cang Palace?”","“He hasn’t been with Tian Cang Palace for long, probably around a million epochs ago, but his progress has been rapid. In just a million epochs, he reached the peak of the Sixth Tribulation realm. His current divine power is estimated to be around 1.2 million!” Yue Wujin explained in detail because Lord Guangying belonged to his faction of strong individuals. He was familiar with his own people.","The 1.2 million divine power figure was just a fabrication.","He just felt it sounded about right.","In reality, Lord Guangying’s strength was far from that.","It should be noted that initially, Lord Guangying was the first among the first batch of Inheritors from the Qishen Temple.","During the same period, he shone even brighter than Jian Wushuang and Hu Qing.","His potential was much greater than Dongsheng and Wanyan.","He was also an Emperor who achieved the Ultimate Dao.","After reaching the Sixth Tribulation realm, with the support of the Realm King, his opportunities were probably not small.","His divine power wouldn’t be weaker than Dongsheng and Wanyan either.","He had at least 1.5 million divine power.","“Friend Wujin, this Lord Guangying, he’s an acquaintance of mine. This time, I might take him along when I leave, please forgive me!” Jian Wushuang didn’t conceal anything, instead, The voiced his request.","Although Yue Wujin was somewhat curious, he didn’t mind. He raised his hands in agreement. Initially, he thought Jian Wushuang had his eye on a female cultivator, never expecting to encounter an acquaintance.","Luck was on his side. Being acquainted with Jian Wushuang and his companions, and moreover being under his command, brought their relationship closer once again.","Glancing briefly at the battle power of Lord Guangying from the observation platform, it seemed satisfactory.","Actually, there was no need to bring the other party back to the Qishen Temple.","They wouldn’t be of much use anyway.","Jian Wushuang just wanted to fulfill his initial promise.","Back then, he promised Zhen Ling to bring back everyone.","He couldn’t go back on his word.","As for the initial vow, it had long been gone.","Once reaching this level, releasing vows was simple.","They weren’t oaths bound by Supreme Rules.","There were no constraints.","If the other party, like Zhen Wuyang, didn’t want to leave.","He wouldn’t force them.","But the karma for the future would be severed.","Jian Wushuang still looked down on those who even abandoned their homeland.","It was just that it was Zhen Wuyang he dealt with initially, he didn’t show it.","Because Zhen Wuyang’s Great Si Region had already been destroyed.","There was no attachment left.","As for the great kindness of Zhen Ling, according to his words, he would repay it in the next","life.","Lord Guangying was different.","His homeland was still there.","And Zhen Ling had shown him great kindness back then.","After all, from a Dao Lord, he had reached the peak perfection and left the Qishen Temple.","It could be said that from shortly after birth, he arrived at the Qishen Temple, cultivated all the way to peak perfection, made an oath in front of the Qishen’s tombstone, and even drank","blood wine.","He couldn’t not go back.","Sitting above and watching the fights below, Jian Wushuang felt a bit itchy to fight.","It just happened that he wanted to talk to Lord Guangying, so he took the initiative to get up and stretch, “Watching them fight is making me itchy. Friend Wujin, I’ll go meet the pride of your Tian Cang Palace!”","“Haha, it’s the good fortune of these little fellows!” Yue Wujin chuckled lightly. Although he hadn’t seen Jian Wushuang take action, he had heard that Jian Wushuang could hold his","ground against the Blood Demon Temple Master.","Even he wasn’t a match for the Blood Demon Temple Master.","Yet Jian Wushuang was only at the Sixth Tribulation realm!","Although his realm was similar to those little fellows below, his divine power was strong to such an extent.","Upon hearing Jian Wushuang’s words, Wu Zuo also wanted to go down and try, but after seeing the Origin Source of Jian Wushuang’s Sixth Tribulation realm, he held back.","No matter how thick-skinned he was, he wouldn’t go to spar with a Sixth Tribulation Universe","Master.","Dongsheng and Wanyan, on the other hand, didn’t have this idea.","The two of them had been oppressed by the Blood Demon Temple for so long, and now they","were finally free.","They enjoyed life, watching others fight on the arena was the most comfortable.","Jian Wushuang and Wu Zuo found it boring without opponents.","The two brothers had fought for millions of epochs.","They had grown tired of battles.","Jian Wushuang’s figure flickered and appeared directly on the first arena below.","The master of the first arena was Lord Guangying!","“Hmm?” Lord Guangying saw the unfamiliar figure in front of him and thought his eyes were","playing tricks on him!","Although there were many Sixth Tribulation Universe Masters in the Tian Cang Palace.","But there were only about a thousand of them, each one he knew, and could even speak of the other’s cultivation secrets.","The unfamiliar figure appearing in front of him now felt familiar, but he couldn’t recognize","who it was.","Jian Wushuang restrained his aura. Even an Eighth Tribulation Universe Master couldn’t see","through him.","Among the same realm, even Sixth Tribulation Universe Masters couldn’t see his appearance.","Even Lord Guangying could only vaguely see the outline of Jian Wushuang’s face, which made","him feel familiar.","There was a layer of black mist on Jian Wushuang’s face.","He deliberately concealed himself.","Since he had come down, he might as well fight a battle first.","Deal with the matter after the fight.","“Who are you?”","“Just an old friend!” Jian Wushuang replied indifferently."]},{"number":5992,"title":"Chapter 5992: Old Friend","paragraphs":["Chapter 5992: Old Friend","Lord Guangying frowned, “Old friend?”","He pondered over it but couldn’t figure out who it might be.","The matter of Qishen Temple was buried deep in his heart, he never really dwelled on it.","After reincarnating into the Ancient Moon Spacetime, he arrived at the Treasure Market within the Nine Heavens.","Becoming a direct disciple of a seven star sect, then ascending to the position of Universe Master, and unexpectedly being transported to the Tian Cang Eternal Realm during an adventure in a secret realm.","However, upon entering the Tian Cang Eternal Realm, he first arrived at a secret realm, obtained an ancient inheritance, and only then entered the Tian Cang Palace.","With a powerful inheritance and the nurturing of the Tian Cang Palace, after cultivating for millions of epochs, he finally broke through to the Sixth Tribulation Universe Master.","Throughout this journey, he had yet to have a confidant.","He always regarded the Ancient Moon Spacetime and the Tian Cang Eternal Realm as his crucible.","He had never felt emotions.","Now, hearing the term “old friend”, stirred something in his heart.","Yet, he dared not dwell on it.","Because he had actively searched for the several people who had come together initially.","But there was no news whatsoever.","To the point where he began to wonder if they had all perished.","Or perhaps, everything that happened back then was just a fleeting dream?","Jian Wushuang discerned the other party’s doubt, realizing that everyone would have such thoughts.","Except for himself.","Not because his Dao Heart was particularly steadfast.","But because time flowed slowly within the Wanliu Divine Tree, while the outside world’s time flowed too swiftly.","As a result, after several epochs for him, millions of epochs had passed outside.","Those people from the past had been specially arranged by Realm King, and as long as he didn’t come out, they wouldn’t meet.","So, at this moment, there was such a great doubt.","Various thoughts raced through his mind!","Stirring up memories of the past.","And those vows made by those naive faces standing before the Qishen Tomb, had become lies.","“Who exactly are you?” Lord Guangying didn’t dare to think further, furrowing his brows and taking a step back, pointing at Jian Wushuang with an incredulous gaze.","Jian Wushuang smiled faintly, raising his hand, “Try and you’ll find out!”","Clang!","He drew his sword directly.","The Wanjie Sword emerged from its scabbard, bathed in a faint blue light.","This action was his signature move.","Just like when he drew the Jueyun Sword back then, confronting the incarnation of Mie Sheng. Lord Guangying had witnessed it.","Now, seeing this action, he started to believe somewhat.","The person before him was indeed an old friend.","This also made Lord Guangying feel somewhat relieved, but he didn’t retreat further.","Instead, several dark shadows appeared around him.","Jian Wushuang grinned as well, and both of them made their moves simultaneously.","Since they were old friends, they decided to test each other’s strength over these years.","Lord Guangying was one of the top talents back then.","At some point, he even surpassed Jian Wushuang and Hu Qing.","Apart from Shang, he was the first inheritor at the Grave God Mountain.","Now, after entering the Ancient Moon Spacetime, although he was also a Sixth Tribulation Universe Master, his overall strength was indeed much stronger than Dongsheng and Wanyan.","Three shadow clones moved instantly.","Each clone’s divine power was controlled at 1.2 million.","Not much different from the main body.","Moreover, these clones were elusive and their speed was extremely eerie.","Jian Wushuang didn’t use the Super Eternal Ancient Transformation, merely relying on basic divine power of only 1.5 million, but dealing with these shadow clones was still a piece of cake.","With a swift movement, several streams of light protruded.","With one sword and three slashes, Jian Wushuang pierced through three shadow clones.","Finally, he dashed towards the true body of Lord Guangying.","“As expected!” Lord Guangying realized, Jian Wushuang hadn’t changed from the formidable swordsman he once knew.","He was still as powerful as ever.","But, he hadn’t wasted his years either.","Jian Wushuang’s Wanjie Sword transformed into thousands of blue lights descending.","His divine power reached the pinnacle of foundation.","With a force of 1.5 million, he directly pierced through Lord Guangying’s true body.","“Hmm?” Jian Wushuang paused, looking at the pierced true body with a raised brow, then quickly turned to look behind.","While Lord Guangying’s true body reformed, a hundred shadow clones appeared around the","arena.","Each shadow’s divine power surged to 1.3 million.","This scene astonished many present.","They had only seen up to ten clones of Lord Guangying before.","And those clones had around 1.2 million divine power each.","This level of divine power was the peak for most Universe Masters at the Sixth Tribulation.","Lord Guangying’s ability had already reached the pinnacle among Sixth Tribulation Universe","Masters.","And that was just the true body.","Nobody at the same level could fathom Lord Guangying’s true combat strength.","“I didn’t expect Lord Guangying to conceal his true power!” Some geniuses on other","platforms murmured, marveling at Lord Guangying’s strength.","At the same time, they were curious about Jian Wushuang’s identity.","They could sense Jian Wushuang’s realm, also a Sixth Tribulation Universe Master.","Yet he could go toe-to-toe with Lord Guangying.","The spectators in the observation platform remained indifferent.","Especially those like Wu Zuo who knew Jian Wushuang’s true strength.","Even if there were a hundred clones with 1.3 million divine power each, Jian Wushuang could","easily annihilate them.","Yue Wujin, standing aside, was astonished by Lord Guangying’s strength, never expecting","such a character under his command.","With such strength, talent, and potential, he would undoubtedly become a Seventh Tribulation Realm Universe Master in the future!","He also understood why Jian Wushuang wanted to take him away.","Glancing over, among Jian Wushuang’s group, there was Wu Zuo, whose strength could rival","the top Eighth Tribulation Realm experts, surpassing them by an unknown degree.","Then there were Dongsheng and Wanyan, whose divine power surpassed 1.5 million each,","casually surpassing the top geniuses of various major powers.","They were invincible existences among Sixth Tribulation Universe Masters.","As for Jian Wushuang, it went without saying.","He could resist divine powers of tens of millions effortlessly.","He was also unique among the Nine Great Spacetimes.","It’s just that the Jian Wushuang on the platform hadn’t shown his full strength.","Facing a hundred shadow clones, although he felt no pressure, he didn’t display","overwhelming suppression either.","Instead, he was testing Lord Guangying.","“Guangying, show some of your true abilities, or this fight will end soon!”","Jian Wushuang wielded the Wanjie Sword and released a burst of Sword Qi from behind,","shattering several light shadows.","Countless sword shadows flew out from his back, instantly breaking through the hundred","shadow clones.","The opponent’s secret technique was quite good, definitely a peak technique.","But a hundred shadow clones were far from Lord Guangying’s limit.","He could at least create a thousand shadows.","And individual shadows would be even more powerful.","Lord Guangying raised his head, his voice deep, “Tsk tsk, then let me show you what I’ve","learned over the years!”","Rumble!","The ground began to collapse as light and shadows fell into it.","The sky began to distort.","“Ten Thousand Shadow Tribulation!”","Buzz!","The surrounding spacetime began to shake.","Countless light and shadows converged in the sky."]},{"number":5993,"title":"Chapter 5993: Water Can Carry a Boat, but It Can Also Capsize It!","paragraphs":["Chapter 5993: Water Can Carry a Boat, but It Can Also Capsize It!","From top to bottom, a pyramid shape inverted.","Light and shadow rose from the ground at this moment, emitting a dark mist all over, the power after the fragmentation of shadows.","Countless shadows above the head, blessing the entire body of light and shadow.","Each of the countless shadows possessed a divine power of 1.5 million.","Each one was comparable to a Seventh Tribulation realm expert.","And at this moment, the true strength of the Lord Guangying burst forth.","Directly increased from 1,5 million to 2 million.","These powers came from shadows.","“Water can carry a boat, it can also overturn it!”","The Lord Guangying could empower shadows with divine power, naturally, shadows could also amplify the divine power of the Lord Guangying’s main body.","The subtlety of this secret technique lies here.","2 million divine powers made the divine body of the Lord Guangying extremely huge.","Looking at this huge divine body, the Sixth Tribulation Universe Masters who were of the same sect as the Lord Guangying couldn’t even utter words in shock.","This wasn’t just a slight difference, but almost a difference of a whole level.","The current Lord Guangying had reached the peak strength of the Seventh Tribulation realm. Dongsheng and Wanyan were no match for him.","Among the Sixth Tribulation realms, perhaps only Jian Wushuang could suppress the Lord Guangying.","The opponent was indeed very powerful.","The basic divine body was actually similar to his.","But amplifying such a large divine body, the secret technique indeed surpassed Dongsheng and Wanyan.","This indirectly explained the function of the secret technique.","The basic divine power relied on treasures to be stacked up.","But the secret technique required one to create it themselves.","Initially, Jian Wushuang’s secret technique could only amplify the Origin Source, unable to amplify divine power.","Later, it took who knows how much cost to create the Super Eternal Ancient Transformation.","Together with the Origin Source, it was amplified to the peak.","This was the power of the secret technique.","Lord Guangying looked down at Jian Wushuang and said indifferently, “How about it, can the current strength meet your eyes?”","This sentence carried a hint of provocation, indeed, Jian Wushuang’s strength was pressing the many Inheritors of Qishen Temple to the point of breathlessness.","When they entered the Ancient Moon Spacetime, they were all gearing up to surpass everyone else.","They regarded Jian Wushuang as their target.","Now, Lord Guangying was confident in defeating Jian Wushuang in front of him.","A basic divine power of 1.5 million.","Not much different from light and shadow.","It all depended on the secret technique.","Lord Guangying didn’t rush to make a move, just waiting for Jian Wushuang.","At this moment, there was excitement in his heart, guessing where Jian Wushuang’s divine power limit lay!","There was no hiding the Origin Source, Jian Wushuang’s Sixth Tribulation strength was right there!","Initially, Jian Wushuang could rival the Universe Masters at the level of Dao Lord.","Although it’s difficult to surpass realms after reaching the Tribulation realm.","But that’s just for ordinary people.","Not for someone like Jian Wushuang, a peerless genius.","“Not bad, your strength surpasses Dongsheng and Wanyan!” Jian Wushuang evaluated indifferently.","After hearing these two familiar names, the Lord Guangying paused for a moment, then understood.","Jian Wushuang didn’t come alone.","He also brought Dongsheng and Wanyan.","And they could suddenly join the trial in Tian Cang Palace.","Both in background and strength, they wouldn’t be too weak.","This only made the Lord Guangying more excited.","“Jian Wushuang, it’s been so many years, yet you still remain so composed!”","Lord Guangying’s figure trembled as his myriad shadows reached their peak.","Countless shadows returned to his original form in the light.","Divine power continued to surge, with no more concealment from him.","His divine power directly broke through the 2 million mark, finally settling at 2.3 million, surpassing the strength of ordinary Seventh Tribulation experts.","If it’s said that for Sixth Tribulation realm experts, reaching 1.5 million divine power was a limit, then for Seventh Tribulation realm, it was 3 million.","Crossing that threshold put them on par with ordinary Eighth Tribulation realm experts.","The fact that Lord Guangying’s divine power could erupt to 2.3 million had exceeded the expectations of many.","Only Jian Wushuang could sense that immense divine power within him, hence his lack of too much surprise.","As for the other geniuses at the arena who were at the Sixth Tribulation realm, their mouths gaped wide once again, shocked by Lord Guangying’s strength.","It was beyond their comprehension.","Even Yue Wujin, on the observation platform, wore an incredulous expression.","He, being a Half-Step Eighth Tribulation realm, had a basic divine power of only 2.8 million.","With his secret techniques, he could match ordinary Eighth Tribulation realm experts,","increasing his divine power to over 3 million.","But he was a Universe Master at the Seventh Tribulation realm!","And his basic divine power was extremely high.","In contrast, Lord Guangying was only a Universe Master at the Sixth Tribulation realm, with","weak basic divine power of only 1.5 million.","Yet, after amplification, it reached a terrifying 2.3 million, an increase of a staggering","800,000.","This demonstrated how powerful Lord Guangying’s secret techniques were.","Although Jian Wushuang knew of Lord Guangying’s strength, he couldn’t help but be stunned","in place.","An increase of 800,000, reaching more than half of his basic divine power. Although his Super Eternal Transformation could double his power, it was because of the power of the Starry Sky and the ability to connect with the Origin Source that it could achieve","such an increase.","But Lord Guangying, just a Universe Master on the path of Ultimate Dao cultivation, was able","to create such astonishing secret techniques.","Truly rare!","Only disciples like Wu Zuo, who had cultivated the Realm King’s supreme techniques, could confidently suppress Lord Guangying.","It all came down to different opportunities.","If Lord Guangying had been a disciple of the Realm King, he might not have been inferior to","Wu Zuo.","With Realm King’s guidance and countless treasures, reaching the Seventh Tribulation realm","wasn’t that impressive.","After all, initially, all ten people could have reached it.","It was just a matter of fate.","“Now, am I worth your intervention?”","Lord Guangying retracted his shadows, but he had already transformed into a shadow","himself.","His divine power seemed ethereal, his face somewhat ferocious, as he stared fixedly at Jian","Wushuang.","His whole body was covered in pitch-black demonic flames, with real substance within the shadow but the divine power seemingly void, allowing him to fully unleash the power within","his divine body, almost infinite.","Jian Wushuang immediately discerned his opponent’s confidence and took a deep breath, intending to fully unleash his own divine power, to feel his limits.","“Super Eternal Ancient Transformation!”","He clenched his fists, and his Tribulation Armor instantly appeared.","His basic divine power directly increased by 500,000.","This startled Lord Guangying, who was also puzzled.","“Just a five hundred thousand increase?” Even as an opponent, he found it hard to believe.","Jian Wushuang had been so dazzling before.","After becoming a Universe Master, how could he be so mediocre?","But when he saw that the additional 500,000 divine power merged seamlessly with the basic","divine power, he realized things weren’t so simple.","On the observation platform, Wu Zuo and others were relaxed. “Haha, Brother Wushuang,","this outbreak will probably dumbfound Lord Guangying!”","Wu Zuo laughed loudly.","“Watch closely, this kind of scene is rare!”","The last sentence was clearly directed at Yue Wujin, who had always doubted the extent of Jian","Wushuang’s divine power.","At this moment, he was fully focused on observing Jian Wushuang’s changes."]},{"number":5994,"title":"Chapter 5994: You Can’t Judge with Your Eyes!","paragraphs":["Chapter 5994: You Can’t Judge with Your Eyes!","The basic divine power increased by 500,000, and he was indeed very surprised.","But he was more eager to see Jian Wushuang’s secret method, to see how much more divine power it could amplify!","To resist the peak powerhouse of the Eighth Tribulation realm, he would need at least 8 million divine power!","On the arena, Jian Wushuang clenched his fists tightly, roaring angrily, his aura soaring into the sky.","The blood vessels on his neck surged, and with the outbreak of the blue aura, his divine power directly soared to its limit.","“5 million!”","With a burst, it didn’t stabilize, stopping only at 5 million.","Actually, this was not his peak. When he fought against Wu Zuo back then, the value was far more than this.","But in front of Lord Guangying, he didn’t need to display his full strength.","Just using the Super Eternal Ancient Transformation was enough.","His Super Eternal Ancient Transformation could now amplify 3 million divine power.","If he also used the Origin Source Dao Arena, it would amplify 40 percent more divine power. He could reach 8 million.","Once he lit up the second universe, he could amplify 50 percent more, which would be 7.5 million.","The more universes he lit up, the more he could amplify.","In the nine great spacetimes, the reason why they all followed the path of divine power in the early stage was because without the support of the Dao Arena, cultivating the Origin Source was not very useful.","Usually, it was only after reaching the Eighth Tribulation realm, or when they reached their limit, that they would cultivate the Origin Source.","Especially for the Universe Masters of the Eighth Tribulation realm, who could carry their Dao Arena with them.","They would pay special attention to the support of their Dao Arena.","Just like Tian Cang, when they reached that level, they usually cultivated their Dao Arena to the extreme, probably lighting up no less than ten universes.","Compared to ordinary universe masters of the Eighth Tribulation realm, they became much stronger.","Without using the Origin Source Dao Arena, Jian Wushuang was closest to the normal state of the Sixth Tribulation realm.","But wherever he stood, he still intimidated the powerhouses in the entire sky.","5 million divine power, he didn’t feel the slightest bit of effort, it was extremely easy.","Lord Guangying stared wide-eyed, full of disbelief.","“5 million!”","That power could easily crush him with just a touch!","The other Sixth Tribulation realm powerhouses on the other platforms were even more dumbfounded.","They all doubted whether Jian Wushuang was pretending to be weak and hiding his realm. Otherwise, how could he be so powerful?","For a moment, many Universe Masters of the Sixth Tribulation realm had already sent messages to Yue Wujin.","But Yue Wujin on the observation platform turned to look at Wu Zuo, his tone extremely unsettled. “Senior Wu Zuo, can his divine power reveal seventy percent?”","5 million divine power was Yue Wujin’s guess.","Just seeing Jian Wushuang’s calm expression, he really wanted to know how powerful Jian Wushuang really was.","How much did he differ from the rumored 10 million divine power!","“It’s about the same. Some powers cannot be seen with the eyes, but need to be tested with life!” Wu Zuo’s words made Yue Wujin sink into contemplation.","Obviously, he was telling him that Jian Wushuang’s strength was not just on the surface, but the terrifying toughness he showed when fighting for his life.","Once again witnessing Jian Wushuang erupting with the power of Eighth Tribulation, Wanyan and the others couldn’t help but exclaim in amazement!","Especially for Ye Lingxiao, within just a few days, from being hunted down to this moment, it was all because of Jian Wushuang and Wu Zuo’s protection. At this moment, she finally understood why Wanyan trusted Jian Wushuang so much.","It was all about confidence.","Lord Guangying on the arena went from astonishment to a sense of relief!","He could be powerful, and so could others.","As long as Jian Wushuang didn’t fall, there was no potential surpassing him.","With a swoosh!","No fighting!","He directly accepted the secret technique.","His figure also returned to its original appearance!","“Speaking of which, I’m a bit embarrassed. I’ve been holding onto the determination to surpass you all these years. I didn’t expect that when we meet again, the gap is still so vast, even greater than during the Emperor’s period!” Lord Guangying chuckled bitterly and shook","his head.","Back then, they were all Emperors.","Jian Wushuang could rival the power of Third Tribulation.","At that time, they were only at the Supreme Peak.","Rivaling the power of First Tribulation.","After millions of epochs passed.","Jian Wushuang had reached the peak power of the Eighth Tribulation, even rivaling the pinnacle of the Eighth Tribulation.","The gap was too big.","Despite their divine power being able to rival the pinnacle of the Seventh Tribulation.","But the gap in between was terrifyingly difficult to bridge, even more so than during the","Emperor’s time.","Jian Wushuang also absorbed the divine power calmly and said, “We’re all the same, everything is for that home. There’s nothing to sigh about, there will be plenty of","opportunities in the future!”","The two looked at each other and then laughed.","With a thought, in the other’s unconsciousness, they had already arrived at the observation","platform.","Lord Guangying’s relationship with the others was quite ordinary.","It was only Wu Zuo who had spent quite some time on Grave God Mountain, so he could be","considered as having watched them grow.","There were some things to talk about.","Five people gathered.","Half of them were already here.","Originally, there were ten people.","In the end, only eight could go back.","Or maybe nine!","They had already gone back, and the fallen Fan Tianfeng had become a thing of the past.","Zhen Wuyang chose the Wanliu Willow Tree and had his own home.","Jian Wushuang treated him as if he had also fallen.","Now, there were only three people left to find.","While the crowd chatted, Wu Zuo also mentioned the whereabouts of Tongtian Buddha and","Gu Qianluo.","The former was in the Ancient Moon Spacetime, and the latter was in the Azure Sea","Spacetime.","Both were still quite far away.","Jian Wushuang wasn’t interested in Gu Qianluo.","Among the original ten people, he looked down upon Gu Qianluo the most.","The other one was Fan Tianfeng, but his opinion changed later on.","So only Gu Qianluo was left.","If Lord Guangying had ambitions back then, unwilling to fall behind.","Then Gu Qianluo had reached the extreme of unwillingness, with a twisted heart.","So he wasn’t interested in this person!","Moreover, the distance to the Azure Sea Spacetime was almost the same as to the Ancient","Moon Spacetime.","And from Wu Zuo’s words, he also understood that Tongtian Buddha hadn’t walked out of his","own path yet, so it might take some time.","Jian Wushuang decided to go alone to the Ancient Moon Spacetime, while Wu Zuo led the remaining strong ones to the Azure Sea Spacetime to find Gu Qianluo!","And repairing the pyramid would take time, so there was no need for Wu Zuo and the others to","wait here with him.","It was better to set off for the Azure Sea Spacetime first.","This group of people, Wu Zuo was on par with the peak power of the Eighth Tribulation, and","Lord Guangying had the peak power of the Seventh Tribulation, so there was absolutely no","danger.","It was just a simple crossing of the river of time and space, something that the Universe Masters could do.","Those with slightly weaker abilities might encounter danger.","But the weakest among them were all Universe Masters of the Fifth Tribulation.","There was almost zero threat.","Plus, with Wu Zuo’s status, no one dared to provoke them.","The only thing Jian Wushuang was worried about was the Universe Master of the Fifth","Tribulation, Ye Lingxiao.","The blood-colored power on her was very special!","He had just been too embarrassed to ask about it.","He was afraid that something might happen to him. When the opportunity arose, he would go and ask the Blood Demon Temple Master about it!","The blood-colored power could amplify divine power, which was truly a coveted treasure. He was just afraid that someone might have their eyes on it.","Moreover, since the other party came from the Ye family, he hadn’t heard of such a person in","the Blood Robe Sect.","When he returned to the Ancient Moon Spacetime, he would also ask Divine Wood King and others for help in finding out."]},{"number":5995,"title":"Chapter 5995: Split Up","paragraphs":["Chapter 5995: Split Up","“Brother Wushuang, we’re leaving now. If you run into trouble, just mention my name. Don’t hesitate, don’t compromise yourself. We’ve got connections, we’re not afraid of anything!”","Wu Zuo deliberately shouted a few times in front of the Blood Demon Temple Master as he departed.","It was a deliberate attempt to disgust the Blood Demon Temple Master.","Of course, there was some truth to it.","Mentioning his name might actually work.","But Jian Wushuang didn’t see the necessity anymore.","With his own strength, even if he couldn’t defeat peak Eighth Tribulation Realm experts, he could escape.","Speed was his advantage!","No one could match him.","The three ancient existences had all received favors from Realm King, so they wouldn’t lay hands on him either.","In the Nine Great Spacetimes, even in the entire Northern Spacetime, he basically had no rivals.","Naturally, he wasn’t worried about this.","After seeing off Wu Zuo, Jian Wushuang glanced at the Blood Demon Temple Master but didn’t rush to inquire about Ye Lingxiao’s situation.","Instead, he turned and entered the cave mansion arranged for him in the Tian Cang Palace, starting a brief seclusion.","The time needed to repair the pyramid was delayed again after collecting the materials in Tian Cang.","Although he was anxious to return to the Qishen Temple, he wasn’t in a hurry when it came to things that required time and effort.","After all, it was related to his safety, so there was no harm in taking his time.","Especially when he thought about the dark red triangular crystal, he couldn’t help but feel excited.","It could severely injure, or even kill, peak Eighth Tribulation experts.","That was a huge trump card.","And it also had the ability to nurture life.","With his endless life and divine power, he could nurture powerful flesh-and-blood lifeforms.","Because he wasn’t a metallic lifeform himself, and his Origin Source was also flesh-and- blood and plant-based.","He couldn’t nurture metallic lifeforms like he did in the past.","Anyway, as long as his strength could reach the Eighth Tribulation, that would be enough.","He had seen the scene of locust-like Eighth Tribulation power before.","This could be considered another trump card!","The more trump cards he had, the greater his chances.","The obsession with Mie Sheng had to be eradicated.","After eradicating it, he would have the opportunity to catch his breath.","To explore the Northern Spacetime.","To go to the end of spacetime, even to the source, to see everything in this world!","It would be monotonous to recall scenes of battles or to constantly be on the path of battle.","Cross-legged on the jade bed in the cave mansion, Jian Wushuang indulged in the future for a while.","Then he began to enter cultivation.","Currently, his cultivation progress had slowed down considerably.","He no longer had the rapid progress he experienced within the Wanliu Divine Tree.","As for crossing Tribulations, he was indeed prepared.","It’s just that the foundation of the Origin Source Universe was too profound.","It could be said that he had raised the threshold for his own Tribulation too much.","If he were an ordinary Sixth Tribulation Universe Master, with his current strength, he could have crossed Tribulations long ago, even the Eighth Tribulation.","But he wasn’t an ordinary Sixth Tribulation expert!","Now, to cross the Seventh Tribulation, he needed to illuminate three entire universes.","The second universe was not yet perfected.","Each universe had to reach the perfect level of the first.","This was indeed a test for him.","Once the three universes were illuminated, his Origin Source Dao Arena would be enhanced by","60 percent.","A single Origin Source Dao Arena was 40 percent.","Two would be 50 percent.","Three would be 60 percent.","The limit of the Dao Arena was to double its enhancement.","That distance was quite far from him.","Tian Cang had once told him that the enhancement of ancient existences had reached a perfect","level, but there were more than ten, even dozens, of universes opened up.","The further enhancements became increasingly difficult.","They didn’t even know where the limit was.","This was something Jian Wushuang had to explore on his own.","Swish!","A clone of the Origin Source stopped on the Tianqing Mountain of the first Origin Source","Universe.","There were not only the castle left behind by Weiss but also many treasures that could be","nurtured.","For example, “Qianluo Flower”, which increases basic divine power, as well as “Water of All Things”, which enhances the Origin Source.","These treasures, if placed in mustard seeds, would be wasted.","It’s better to put them in one’s own Origin Source Universe, where they can continue to","increase in quantity.","He left many avatar clones in his Origin Source Universe to personally manage these treasures.","The avatars left behind at this moment are meant to cultivate his own Origin Source.","Countless black holes are waiting for him to illuminate.","And conveniently, there are those treasures for his use.","Swish!","His main body flashed and entered the Skysight Heavenly Chessboard placed on the cliff of","Tianqing Mountain.","Training the origin cannot stop; the elevation of divine power would occupy his main body,","wasting time.","So, he dispelled the intention to cultivate divine power.","The basic 1.5 million divine power is sufficient for now.","On the way back to Qishen Temple, it’s not too late to increase it further.","Now, he wants to explore things beyond the cycle of time and space.","This is not only related to his Tribulation Armor but also to the Starry Sky Chronicles.","The chess pieces with those impressive titles on the Skysight Heavenly Chessboard have been","studied almost to completion.","Under the guidance of Realm King, the cycle has been initially stabilized.","Now, it’s just the space-time aspect.","“Phew!”","Jian Wushuang took a deep breath and immersed himself in it.","Thus began a long journey of cultivation!","Centuries, millennia, ten thousand years, millions of years.","Time flowed like a beam of light through his fingers, yet he felt nothing.","Such is the wonder of time.","And space!","Invisible, intangible!","Even more miraculous.","The fusion of two illusory things is not so easy.","Sitting for millions of years, when Jian Wushuang opened his eyes again, he summoned the","chess pieces with divine titles with a wave of his hand!","“It’s too mysterious!” He shook his head, still unable to comprehend these chess pieces with","divine or god titles.","And he couldn’t devour them either.","It would be too wasteful.","The chess pieces with impressive titles are currently very useful.","He dared not move them recklessly.","“Was the Ultiamte mentioned by Lrod Realm King a single Ultimate, or the Ultimate of the","Myraid Daos?”","A single Extreme.","It’s his Ultimate Sword Dao.","The Myriad Daos, the Ultimate path... It was his Extreme Dao.","It seems that both have appeared on him.","But he hasn’t experienced the feeling of being invincible in these two aspects.","Space-time cycle!","The movements of the chess pieces were frozen at one point.","“Realm!”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes flickered as he thought of the Realm King.","Why is he called the Realm King?","Isn’t it because he controls the entire Northern Spacetime?","Time and space are both in his hands.","Isn’t that the Realm King?","Perhaps the space-time cycle is just one of his obsessions.","This obsession arose because of Mie Sheng.","Reincarnation is because of Life and Death.","Time and space were the paths he was supposed to take.","The Emperor cultivates space, and the Universe Master cultivates time. Ultimately, they merge the two again to reach the level of space-time.","Perhaps that’s not his path!","Up to now, after groping around.","Jian Wushuang slumped to the ground.","Unable to find direction.","Flattened the original plan.","“Perhaps I should go a completely new way!”","Jian Wushuang felt inspired! Thinking about his uniqueness.","Having all sorts of magical powers, if he still follows the paths of his predecessors but","possesses abilities surpassing theirs, it doesn’t seem right no matter how you look at it."]},{"number":5996,"title":"Chapter 5996: Collapse","paragraphs":["Chapter 5996: Collapse","Above the Tribulation realm, everything remained obscure.","You’d call it divine, wouldn’t you?","But he’d seen several already.","Let’s say, the God of Life!","That sounds grand enough, doesn’t it?","Commanding life in a realm.","But in terms of combat prowess, it was rather ordinary, at least in his eyes.","Perhaps if Danbao created enough life secrets for you to fill, he might become more powerful. But the other party simply didn’t pursue the path of strength...","Jian Wushuang pondered.","“Though Danbao is a god, transcending the Tribulation realm, he is not among cultivators!” He shook his head, then thought of Weiss, “Weiss’s strength is formidable, incredibly so, to the point where I can’t resist it, but that kind of power doesn’t seem to belong to cultivators either.”","Above the Universe Masters!","The Spacetime Master?","This position couldn’t be considered the rank of cultivators.","It was more like a divine position.","To be precise, Realm King is the master of the Northern Spacetime, that is the master of spacetime!","“Forget it, if even deduction fails, I’ll think about it after reaching the ninth tribulation realm!” He disrupted the chessboard with a sweep of his hand, no longer bothering.","But just after he disrupted the chessboard, the spacetime Origin Source in the middle of the board unexpectedly surged upward.","The spacetime and reincarnation chess pieces condensed by the Commander’s emblem directly entered the Spacetime Origin Source.","The chess pieces marked with the three major Divine emblems were now on both sides and in the middle of the main river.","A terrible force of Life suddenly erupted.","“Huh?” Jian Wushuang was startled, sitting up directly.","The Tribulation Armor on his body also flew out, separating from him.","This scene stunned Jian Wushuang.","However, he was unaware that the eye in the Starry Sky was still watching here.","After sighing, it actively manipulated the Skysight Heavenly Chessboard, evolving everything.","The birth of a river of time and space appeared right in front of Jian Wushuang.","He watched it with fascination, feeling no change in time.","The precipitation of billions of years in the outside world did not change him at all, until the river of time and space completely condensed and then collapsed!","Everything followed its natural course, so perfect.","Crack!","After the Spacetime Origin Source shattered, the chessboard also began to collapse, ultimately condensing into a point.","An eye!","A dark green eyeball floated in the original position of the chessboard.","It was only because of that voice that Jian Wushuang’s consciousness returned to his body.","“Phew!”","he gasped heavily, feeling somewhat scared by the scene just now, his body trembling uncontrollably.","This was awe for the river of time and space!","A complete river of time and space.","In the entire Northern Spacetime, there was only one such river.","However, it was divided into core, upper, middle, and lower sections, extremely intricate.","But just now, that river of time and space was complete.","“A great opportunity!”","Jian Wushuang clenched his fist, unable to stop trembling.","Just as observing the collapse of a black hole had brought immense benefits, now witnessing","the birth and destruction of a river of time and space would surely be equally rewarding.","His Origin Source surged rapidly.","The framework of the second universe formed instantly.","Countless treasures were poured in.","And directly gave birth.","Then came the birth of the third universe.","Finally, when the treasures were insufficient, it came to a halt.","He depleted all his Origin Source-type treasures.","But with his cultivation realm elevated, as long as there were treasures, he could swiftly establish the third universe.","This was truly a tremendous opportunity.","Though he couldn’t fathom why the Celestial Chessboard suddenly transformed into this","appearance.","He couldn’t help but tremble.","Eyeball, Tribulation Armor!","They flew towards him together.","The Tribulation Armor was familiar, but the divine power within was immense, he found","himself unable to even put it on.","As for the eyeball, he couldn’t comprehend it.","Just a gentle touch revealed a chessboard within the eyeball.","Clatter!","The Skysight Heavenly Chessboard appeared again.","A wave of fear swept through him as the chessboard transformed into his mightiest","adversary, “Mie Sheng”.","Then it morphed into the eyeball again.","“Heavenly Dao!”","Jian Wushuang took a deep breath.","Although the River of Time was destroyed, the essence of Heavenly Dao remained within it.","It was this eyeball.","It could perceive everything.","“What a pity!”","he sighed, “I don’t cultivate the Heavenly Dao, but my heart is like the Heavenly Dao, yet it’s","of no use!”","His heart followed Heavenly Dao’s principles, where even heaven with feelings would","eventually grow old.","The heavens was indifferent, and so was he.","But this indifference wasn’t about brotherhood or love between spouses.","It was about facing the laws of Heavenly Dao and All Things.","He lacked that compassion.","Like Heavenly Dao!","But he didn’t understand balance.","So it didn’t suit him.","“Perhaps it has found someone suitable!”","Through the eyeball, Jian Wushuang saw a familiar figure.","Clad in white, untouched by dust.","The Heavenly Mechanism!","Or rather, Hu Qing!","This time’s gain was entirely passive.","He couldn’t comprehend those chess pieces and nearly fell into madness.","In the end, for some reason, the chessboard turned into an eyeball, leaving behind the","Tribulation Armor.","And he witnessed a perfect cycle of time from birth to destruction.","The gain was not insignificant.","It was similar to what he had originally envisaged.","It simulated the path ahead.","“My path, I’ll walk it myself!”","Jian Wushuang’s voice was resolute as he grabbed the eyeball and stowed it away.","At that moment, the Tribulation Armor, as if acknowledging its master, returned directly to","his divine body.","The eyeball didn’t belong to him.","But the Tribulation Armor did.","Hum!","The fully enclosed Tribulation Armor directly covered his entire body.","The black battle armor was dazzling.","A dark red aura emanated from above the Tribulation Armor, which was the power of Supreme","Rules.","At this moment, a token appeared in his mind.","The word ‘Tribulation’ was written above it!","With a thought, he familiarized himself with the information in the token.","The Tribulation Armor was now perfected.","But his own strength couldn’t keep up.","The full name of the Tribulation Armor also appeared on this token.","“Ninth Tribulation Battle Armor!”","Named after the Tribulation realm!","Currently, the Tribulation Armor contained the power of Sixth Tribulation realm.","Boosting the basic divine power by 1 million!","The six supreme Tribulations elevated the power of the Tribulation Armor to 1 million.","There were still the seventh, eighth, and even the ninth Tribulations to come.","At the same time, there was a sentence in the token that drove him crazy.","“One force shatters all laws!”","He initially thought it was overestimating his abilities, but now it appeared here.","And he believed it.","This treasure was probably left to him by Teacher Xuan Yi.","How could he not believe it?","This Tribulation Armor gave him a vague path.","Perhaps, after the Ninth Tribulation, he would completely see where his path lay!","Hum!","The Tribulation Armor merged into his skin, and Jian Wushuang’s gaze was firm.","With a flicker, he directly left his own Origin Source Dao Arena.","In that eyeball, he saw Hu Qing.","When he found Hu Qing, he would give this treasure to him.","After all, he couldn’t use it himself.","Giving it to Hu Qing would also enhance their overall combat power.","And he had always been somewhat ignorant about the Heavenly Dao.","By then, he could also witness it through Hu Qing. Leaving the Origin Source Dao Arena, he felt the passage of time. Billions of years passed in the blink of an eye."]},{"number":5997,"title":"Chapter 5997: Blood Origin Source","paragraphs":["Chapter 5997: Blood Origin Source","It was indeed a long time.","The agreed-upon time by Tian Cang had long passed.","After calming his emotions, he couldn’t wait any longer and left the cave. Just as he stepped out, he noticed a familiar figure standing on the hill outside the cave, watching the sunrise.","“Blood Demon Temple Master!” Jian Wushuang was somewhat surprised to see the other party waiting for him.","So much time had passed, yet the other party was still in Tian Cang Palace, indicating a dedication to the Realm God Token far beyond imagination!","Perfect. He also had some matters to discuss with the other party.","Approaching, bathed in the first rays of warm sunlight, the two stood side by side.","“I thought I would have to wait a long time, but I didn’t expect you so soon!”","Blood Demon Temple Master turned his head and spoke first.","There was a hint of a smile on his face, clearly with some intention to please.","However, deep down, he still harbored discontent.","As long as he obtained the Realm God Token, he was confident of surpassing his father, Tian Cang.","In this world, there was no one he would willingly submit to; his ambitions were immense. People with such ambitions tended not to lack in strength.","Jian Wushuang took a deep breath, not rushing to inquire about the pyramid’s matter. “Blood Demon Temple Master, there’s something I’d like to consult you about, may I?”","Blood Demon Temple Master, who had wanted to improve relations with Jian Wushuang, was taken aback for a moment, then pleased, immediately agreed, “Feel free to ask!”","“It’s about the blood aura on Ye Lingxiao, how much do you know about it?”","As soon as Jian Wushuang’s words fell, Blood Demon Temple Master furrowed his brow.","Fortunately, he had guessed what this was about and wasn’t too surprised.","Now that he had the Realm God Token, his pursuit of the blood aura wasn’t as intense, so he explained why he had been chasing Ye Lingxiao.","It was similar to what Jian Wushuang had thought; both sought to forcibly enhance their divine power.","He already knew this. He had also used the power of blood before.","But to utilize the power of blood to forcibly enhance divine power, one needed something to assist.","Like the beetle he had used before.","It could absorb all the backlash into its body.","Merely enhancing divine power on its own wasn’t enough.","So, Blood Demon Temple Master probably had a similar method. However, such things were too private, and he didn’t want to ask.","After giving the other a deep glance, Jian Wushuang still didn’t speak.","“Actually, it’s nothing much. Ye Lingxiao’s origin is the Blood-Colored Origin Source, very similar to my inheritance. If I obtain her, my basic divine power can increase by another twenty percent!” Blood Demon Temple Master sensed Jian Wushuang’s hesitation, so he didn’t conceal it and directly mentioned his possession of a blood-colored inheritance. Jian Wushuang was extremely shocked to hear this!","Not because of the blood inheritance; a discerning person could see that.","It was the increase of 20 percent in basic divine power that startled him.","Initially, his divine power was only 200,000, doubling it didn’t seem like much.","But now, or rather, Blood Demon Temple Master himself, must have at least 10 million basic divine power.","1 percent was 100,000, so increasing by 20 percent meant 2 million.","The power of blood!","“Is it really that powerful?” Jian Wushuang couldn’t help but ask.","Blood Demon Temple Master nodded, “Blood represents the Blood Qi in the divine body. The enhancement of divine power relies on this. The increase of twenty percent is because my divine body is already at its limit. If I were to raise it to another level, I could gain even more.” This time, Jian Wushuang was utterly speechless.","According to the Blood Demon Temple’s master, Ye Lingxiao’s Origin Source was blood- colored, indicating room for growth.","The stronger the Origin Source, the more beneficial it was for practitioners with blood- -colored power.","He would have to remind Ye Lingxiao to be cautious, to avoid exposure.","The temptation was immense.","Even he found himself somewhat tempted, much like how those undergoing Tribulations felt upon encountering practitioners who controlled the essence of life.","Irresistible.","That was Ye Lingxiao.","And he hailed from the Ancient Moon Spacetime!","Initially, the blood-colored power he acquired also came from the Ancient Moon Spacetime,","albeit from the Chen family in the Ancient Wood Continent.","It was a pity that he had already wiped out the Chen family; otherwise, he could have traced","the origin of the blood-colored power!","As for asking the Blood Demon Temple’s master, it was unnecessary.","If there were a source, this guy would likely have found it already.","Perhaps Ye Lingxiao knew!","After reconsidering everything, Jian Wushuang stopped asking further questions.","This matter might be an episode or perhaps an opportunity to enhance divine power.","Once everyone gathered, he would inquire through Wanyan to understand the situation, appealing to emotions and logic!","He also needed to gauge others’ opinions.","In any case, haste was not advisable in such matters.","After discussing the blood-colored power, there was nothing else significant to talk about with the other party, so he let the Blood Demon Temple’s master take him to find Tian Cang. The repair of the pyramid had been completed millions of years ago.","Swish!!","Following the Blood Demon Temple Master, Jian Wushuang quickly arrived amidst the clouds","and mist above Tian Cang Palace.","This was where Tian Cang’s Origin Source Dao Arena was located.","While at Tian Cang Palace, he would relocate the Dao Arena from within his body.","Of course, what he moved out was the main universe.","The main universe, the first condensed universe, subsequent Origin Universes were called","subsidiary universes.","With the Dao Arena’s blessing, practitioners within Tian Cang Palace could benefit greatly.","After all, it was an Eternal Being’s Origin Source Universe.","Having comprehended the Dao up to the Ninth Tribulation realm.","In the entire Northern Spacetime, only three people had reached this level.","If not for urgency, Jian Wushuang also wanted to cultivate here for a while.","The dojo was magnificent, surrounded by melodious sounds.","It was extremely comfortable.","Behind the Dao Arena, there was a small courtyard surrounded by fences.","Tian Cang usually practiced there.","Generally, the lectures in the Dao Arena were given by avatars, and the true self rarely","appeared.","This was why it was such a mysterious place that had existed for eternity.","Ordinary people could never see the true form.","Even if it was an avatar, only the Lords of the universes in Tian Cang Palace could see it.","Throughout Tian Cang Palace, the number of Universe Lords was actually not many. Compared to the millions and millions of other sects, Tian Cang Palace had only about a","hundred thousand.","While passing through the Dao Arena, Jian Wushuang noticed.","Tian Cang Palace still followed an elite route, not accepting everyone indiscriminately.","Most were elites among their peers.","Each possessed formidable divine power.","This was why there was a constant stream of super strong individuals being born.","Just the Universe Masters at the Sixth Tribulation numbered in the thousands, indicating the","depth of Tian Cang Palace.","Based on this number, there were probably only dozens of Universe Masters at the Seventh","Tribulation.","Eighth Tribulation ones were even rarer, perhaps only a few.","There was no way around it; the current level of life was insufficient.","In the future, there would be more Eighth Tribulation experts.","It would become more and more exciting!","As the two landed in the courtyard, they saw Tian Cang, who had already opened the courtyard","door, smiling and waiting for Jian Wushuang.","“Senior Tian Cang, thank you for your trouble!” Jian Wushuang expressed his gratitude","promptly upon landing."]},{"number":5998,"title":"Chapter 5998: Babata","paragraphs":["Chapter 5998: Babata","This time, he really owed him a big favor.","Repairing the pyramid was one of his top priorities, even more important than harnessing the power of Blood.","Upon hearing this, Tian Cang waved his hand dismissively, “It’s just a small effort. Anything that can be done is not a big deal. On the contrary, I feel guilty for having Jian Wushuang use the Realm God Token this time!”","“Don’t say that...”","After exchanging pleasantries, Tian Cang sent away the Blood Demon Temple Master and then invited Jian Wushuang into the courtyard.","There was a plain wooden table and two small chairs in the courtyard.","Extremely simple!","For an ordinary person, it might signify poverty, but for a strong cultivator, it was a virtue. It was simplicity, plain and unadorned!","The two sat down together, and Elder Tian Cang took out the tea leaves he cultivated and brewed the tea himself.","As they drank tea, they discussed the matter of the pyramid.","“Wushuang, take a look!” Tian Cang held out the pyramid, which spun in the palm of his hand and flew towards Jian Wushuang.","The previously existing indentations on the top were also repaired.","Most importantly, Jian Wushuang unexpectedly sensed a faint vitality within it.","Jian Wushuang stared at the pyramid in astonishment. “What’s this?”","Although the vitality was weak, it couldn’t escape his mental power.","It was definitely the aura of Life.","“Haha, this time it’s also lucky. I didn’t expect to obtain a metal brain from an old friend. I tried putting it into the pyramid, and it unexpectedly matched well. With its presence, all you need to do is infuse it with the power of Life to enhance the level of the metal brain. This way, the mechanical pyramid can be continuously improved!” Tian Cang explained.","Upon hearing this, Jian Wushuang couldn’t help but stand up again and bow deeply.","It truly helped him a lot.","This pyramid might not be able to assist Eternal Beings, but it was of great help to him.","Seeing this, Tian Cang quickly stopped Jian Wushuang.","At the same time, he also realized that Jian Wushuang was someone who repaid kindness and felt that he had gained a lot from this transaction.","Not only did he obtain the Realm God Token, but he also established karmic ties with Jian Wushuang, Wuzuo, and others.","In the future, these people would achieve great things no less than him, and they would naturally remember this favor. When they arrived at the Realm God Continent, they would help each other.","Jian Wushuang was delighted to find the metal brain in the pyramid, which could give birth to mechanical life in the future, continuously repair the pyramid, and even improve its level in the future.","How could this not make him happy?","As soon as he got it, he couldn’t help but play with it, using his mental power to manipulate the pyramid.","Tian Cang also saw that Jian Wushuang was no longer interested in reminiscing, so he didn’t say much more.","After becoming familiar with the pyramid, Jian Wushuang thanked Tian Cang again and prepared to leave.","“I know you have important matters to attend to, so I won’t keep you. But if you need help, you must ask, don’t be polite!” Tian Cang’s expression was firm, obviously not just saying polite words.","Jian Wushuang was also not polite. “Senior Tian Cang, rest assured, if I need help, I will definitely ask for it. I won’t hesitate to trouble you!”","“Good, keep the token safe. We’ll discuss more in the future!”","“Definitely!” Jian Wushuang leaped into the air and waved goodbye.","He tore through the space directly and left Tian Cang Palace.","After arriving in Tian Cang Domain, he took out the pyramid and began to travel at full speed.","Heading towards the Ancient Moon Spacetime.","Now, inside the pyramid, the surrounding space was neatly arranged. With a casual swipe of his hand, he created a cave, then separated several more caves.","Once everyone gathered, they each had their own cave to cultivate in.","In addition to the caves, he also created a huge courtyard.","There were fighting areas, cultivation areas, and places to rest.","In the middle of the courtyard was a not-too-big control room.","At this moment, Jian Wushuang stood in the control room, facing a huge screen that displayed","the scene outside the pyramid.","Beside him was a floating metal brain, a crystal ball without limbs.","It was similar to the one Babidi had.","“Master!” The voice from the crystal ball wasn’t as cold as imagined; instead, it had","emotions.","Jian Wushuang touched it and infused a large amount of Life force and divine power into the","crystal ball.","The crystal ball instantly turned green.","A pair of eyes also appeared inside the ball.","This startled Jian Wushuang, but then he remembered the metal brain from before, which could also change its shape. He asked, “Can you change your appearance at will?”","“Of course!” The metal brain transformed into an extremely ugly little monster.","Jian Wushuang quickly persuaded, “Forget it, let’s return to your original appearance!”","As soon as he finished speaking, the metal brain reverted to its original form. Thinking that he hadn’t given the other party a name yet, Jian Wushuang hesitated for a moment, and a glint flashed in his eyes. “I’ll call you Babata from now on!”","Let’s commemorate Babidi!","“Alright!” The Light Brain wobbled a bit, seeming somewhat excited.","Jian Wushuang glanced at the Light Brain and casually crafted a metal puppet. Although its appearance wasn’t anything remarkable, it looked much more pleasing to the eye compared to the transformations the Light Brain could make.","“Babata, from now on, you’ll reside within this puppet!”","The puppet had two bent horns, a slender yet symmetrical figure, and eyes similar to Babidi’s,","but with dark red skin and a stylish cloak.","Babata entered it, feeling extremely happy. After circling around the control room for a few laps, he stopped and obediently stood beside Jian Wushuang.","Having such a convenient metallic lifeform, Jian Wushuang almost entirely delegated the task","of controlling the pyramid to Babata.","Seated on the throne, Jian Wushuang crossed his legs and said, “Babata, explain to me","thoroughly the functions of the pyramid!”","“Yes, Master!” Babidi raised his hand, and a sky screen appeared above.","The sky screen listed all the functions of the pyramid.","Originally, the pyramid was named “Gustaf’s Tribe Flying Ship!” The name was a bit lengthy,","so Jian Wushuang, being accustomed to calling it the pyramid, decided to change it. Babata casually took out a small stick and pointed to the sky screen. “Master, let me first guide you through the protective functions and speed aspects of the pyramid!” “Alright!” Jian Wushuang nodded, sipping wine as he listened to Babata’s explanation.","The defense of the pyramid was quite simple. It required immense divine power to form a shield, somewhat akin to the Shield of LIfe of Danbao.","Currently, the shield’s level was the universe-level.","Universe level shields were categorized into stars, black holes, and mysteries.","A star-level shield could withstand attacks of tens of millions of divine power, the lowest tier","of shields.","Top-tier experts of the Eight Tribulation could break through with consecutive attacks.","Its upper limit was 10 million divine power, but it couldn’t withstand the relentless bombardment of experts with 8 million divine power."]},{"number":5999,"title":"Chapter 5999: Black Radiance Essence","paragraphs":["Chapter 5999: Black Radiance Essence","The maximum defense could withstand attacks from ordinary Eighth Tribulation realm experts.","Then there’s the black hole-level shield.","Currently, the pyramid could only deploy a shield at the level of a black hole.","It could withstand attacks of up to 15 million units of divine power.","Once the shield is broken, further attacks on the pyramid could weaken the assault, but it would also cause damage to the pyramid itself.","When the Blood Demon Temple Master attacked them before, the pyramid’s autonomous shield was at this level.","Upon hearing this, Jian Wushuang couldn’t sit still and quickly asked the question that concerned him the most, “Babata, isn’t the pyramid itself capable of absorbing divine power attacks?”","“Master, absorbing divine power attacks requires a kind of essence called Black Radiance Essence, and the absorbed attacks would also harm the pyramid itself. In simple terms, activating the star shield can absorb attacks below ten million divine power, but it will consume the Black Radiance Essence. Once the Black Radiance Essence is depleted, it can no longer absorb.”","After Babata finished explaining, Jian Wushuang slumped into the throne. This was quite different from what he had imagined.","There are no free lunches in the world.","Absorbing divine power attacks could empower the shield and create Life warriors.","But it requires a more special treasure.","“Black Radiance Essence!”","He had no idea what that was.","“Master, don’t worry. The Black Radiance Essence can be said to be the energy center of the pyramid’s interior, and it is needed in all aspects!” With a flick of his hand, Babata pulled out the internal structure diagram of the pyramid and continued to explain, pointing at the blueprint, “After talking about defense, let’s talk about offense. The divine power required for attacks also needs the support of Black Radiance Essence, otherwise, pure divine power cannot reach that level of power.”","The levels of attack are similar to defense.","There are four levels in the cosmic realm.","Star, black hole, secret realm, and universe.","To unleash a star attack, one must first inject 10 million divine power, and then, with the addition of Black Radiance Essence, it can erupt into a true peak attack, capable of severely injuring an ordinary peak Eighth Tribulation expert.","It can even instantly kill top-tier experts of the Eighth Tribulation realm.","A black hole attack can reach up to 15 million divine power.","The pyramid’s attack is currently at the customized secret realm level.","With divine power reaching up to 20 million.","Of course, it also consumes a lot of Black Radiance Essence.","When the Blood Demon Temple Master attacked the pyramid, triggering its self-defense mechanism, the resulting attack was at the secret realm level.","Similar to the power of the attack on Chi Jiuxiao back then.","As for the Universe level, it requires even more Black Radiance Essence, which the pyramid currently doesn’t have in such abundance.","After listening to the explanations on defense and attack, Jian Wushuang couldn’t sit still anymore and hurriedly asked, “What exactly is the Black Radiance Essence?”","Now he understood that the operation of the pyramid depended on this thing. He needed to get more of it.","“The Black Radiance Essence is an extremely dark substance, a special product of the mechanical clan, similar to the Origin Source of cultivators! To be precise, it is the primordial stone bred within the master’s universe!”","Jian Wushuang slapped his head. Knowing its origin, he felt dumbfounded.","Where was he going to get it?","There probably wasn’t any in the entire Northern Spacetime.","Old man Tian Cang must be aware of this, yet he hadn’t mentioned it proactively, indicating he didn’t have it either.","“Realm God Continent!” Jian Wushuang’s eyes lit up as he thought of the Realm God Continent.","There were strong beings from the four major spacetimes there.","Surely, there must be members of the Machine Clan there.","Even the powerful beings from the Starry Sky practiced there.","All the gods of the Northern Spacetime were in the Realm God Continent.","Perhaps he could only get it there.","But now his Realm God Token had been given away.","Even if it hadn’t, he couldn’t possibly go to the Realm God Continent now!","“Babata, how much Black Radiance Essence is left now?”","“There are seventeen units left!”","“Can it sustain a secret realm-level attack?”","“It can sustain one secret realm-level attack, seventeen black hole-level attacks, and one","hundred and seventy star-level attacks!” Babata explained in detail.","Universe-level attacks required 100 units of Essence of Black Radiance, and they could only be","used after the pyramid was fully repaired.","He didn’t dare to think about that.","Sustaining one secret realm-level attack was probably enough.","But he couldn’t use the secret realm-level shield anymore, only the black hole-level shield.","As for divine power, that was simple.","He could create a divine power avatar and continuously infuse it with divine power.","The pyramid still had one crucial function left: producing Life warriors.","This also required Black Radiance Essence. Star-level Life warriors possessed tens of millions of divine power. If he wanted to create a perfect star-level warrior, with defenses and attacks","comparable to a peak Eighth Tribulation realm expert, he would need 10 units of Black","Radiance Essence.","Jian Wushuang immediately dismissed this idea.","It was too extravagant.","He didn’t lack Life or divine power.","What he lacked were Black Radiance Essences, and the perfect star-level warrior required","some treasures from the Machine Clan to refine its body.","That was what he lacked.","A series of bad news made his mood plummet.","Babata sensed his low spirits.","“Master, don’t be sad. The consumption of Black Radiance Essence during the journey is minimal. Currently, maintaining the speed of the black hole-level will only consume one unit of Black Radiance Essence per era!”","If the earlier news was considered bad, then this was indeed good news.","Jian Wushuang sighed weakly. “How long does it take to reach the Qishen Temple?”","He blurted out Qishen Temple subconsciously, and immediately regretted it.","He didn’t even know its location; how could Babata?","But to his surprise, Babata immediately calculated the time.","“To reach the Qishen Temple, it will take four eras, passing through twenty-seven main currents of the middle reaches of the Northern Spacetime. There is a high probability of encountering a Sixth Tribulation Universe Master. I have already planned the route for you,","Master!”","Babata moved a piece of sky in front of Jian Wushuang, displaying a winding route on top.","Jian Wushuang was suddenly delighted. “Babata, you actually know the coordinates of the","Qishen Temple?”","“Master’s Life force contains causality. I can sense the position of the Qishen Temple, as well as the Ancient Moon Spacetime that Master wants to go to. I can predict both!” Babata explained proudly.","This time, Jian Wushuang felt like he had hit the jackpot.","He also experienced the convenience of the Machine Clan.","It was basically like walking while lying down.","Everything was arranged for him.","“Now, how long until we reach the Primordial White Heaven in the Ancient Moon Spacetime,","and where are we currently?” Jian Wushuang asked a series of questions.","But Babata casually replied, “Currently, we are in the Tian Cang Eternal Realm. It will take","another two spacetime rivers to reach the Ancient Moon Spacetime, and at our current speed,","it will take four hundred years.”","“As for Universe Masters in the vicinity, there is one of the Sixth Tribulation realm, ten universes away from the pyramid. Within the diameter of the pyramid, there are approximately one hundred and seventy-four Universe Masters. There is no threat or enemy to Master, so please relax as we proceed. Thirty years later, we will encounter the influence of a strong Eighth Tribulation expert, and then we will activate stealth flight!”"]},{"number":6000,"title":"Chapter 6000: Jian Wushuang’s Trump Cards","paragraphs":["Chapter 6000: Jian Wushuang’s Trump Cards","The detailed plan impressed Jian Wushuang greatly.","Finally receiving some good news, he comforted himself.","Jian Wushuang shrugged and stood up. “Babata, activate the concealed flight directly and head to the Primordial White Heaven of Ancient Moon Spacetime at the fastest speed possible, and find the location of this blessed land.”","With Babata’s presence, he no longer needed to painstakingly search for the specific location of the Tongtian Buddha’s Cave.","He delegated everything to Babata.","He then returned to his cave residence; he wouldn’t waste the 400 years of time.","The promotion of the Origin Source couldn’t be delayed.","With three universes reaching completion, he could face the Seventh Tribulation.","Although his realm had reached a certain level, the lack of treasures slowed down his advancement.","He dared not delay.","Moreover, he obtained Wes’s ultimate secret technique, “Extreme Freedom Intent Technique.”","Although only the first half, it was still difficult to comprehend.","It would be considered good if he could master it at the Seventh Tribulation realm; for now, he needed to familiarize himself with it.","Once mastered, his combat power would increase exponentially.","The Extreme Freedom Intent Technique consists of five levels: initiation, minor achievement, major achievement, peak, and completion","The first half covers initiation, minor achievement, and major achievement.","According to Weiss, reaching the major achievement at the Ninth Tribulation realm would make him practically invincible.","As for the latter half, it depended on fate.","This fate lay within the Realm God Continent.","But that was too distant.","He didn’t know how long he would have to wait.","Instead of dwelling on it, he started to familiarize himself with the Extreme Freedom Intent Technique to see what it could truly bring him.","From observing Weiss’s demonstrations, he could only discern that it was a combat-oriented secret technique.","It was special in that it could overcome opponents of the same level or even different strength.","That was the peculiarity of the Extreme Freedom Intent Technique.","On the way to Ancient Moon Spacetime, he devoted himself entirely to the Extreme Freedom Intent Technique.","Returning to the Qishen Temple.","Repairing the pyramid was the first step.","Afterward, he still had to undergo Tribulations.","Becoming the Universe Master of the Seventh Tribulation, then enhancing his basic divine power.","Finally, it was the Extreme Freedom Intent Technique.","Mastering the Extreme Freedom Intent Technique to initiation.","By then, if he couldn’t match Mie Sheng, he could still overcome him with the Extreme Freedom Intent Technique.","Apart from these general goals.","He also had his own secret techniques to cultivate.","The first two sword moves of the Starry Sky Chronicles had already been perfected.","The Reincarnation Sword was still somewhat difficult.","But he understood much more about the fourth sword move, Spacetime, compared to Reincarnation.","And it was more adept in his hands.","This was largely thanks to the Skysight Heavenly Chessboard.","By simulating to the end, witnessing the birth and destruction of the river of time, his","perception of time grew, and he gained insight into the establishment of subsidiary universes through spacetime.","The Starry Sky Chronicles, the first five sword moves.","They weren’t necessarily ranked.","Like the first sword move, it could mean Death or Life.","The third sword move could represent Reincarnation or Spacetime.","The fifth sword move had to be about Spacetime Reincarnation.","It was the continuation of the Dao.","Even though the sixth sword wasn’t bound to any specific Dao, he could sense that when the sixth sword emerged, “it could rival Eternal Beings!”","It was the stance of an invincible sword.","But first, he needed to perfect his Dao cultivation.","Only after mastering Spacetime Reincarnation could he truly achieve invincibility with the sixth sword move.","In simple terms, there was no need to cultivate the sixth sword move; it was about going with","the flow.","Of the nine sword moves in the Starry Sky Chronicles, he had a direction for the first six sword moves, but he had no clue about the following three.","Those would have to be deciphered later.","Apart from the Starry Sky Chronicles, he also had the Eternal Ancient Transformation to cultivate.","Currently, the Super Eternal Ancient Transformation hadn’t reached their perfect state.","At the peak of perfection, the Super Eternal Ancient Transformation could amplify divine power a hundredfold.","Following that logic, with a base divine power doubling every fiftyfold, once it reached perfection, it would double twice, resulting in a quadruple increase in base divine power.","His current base divine power was one million five hundred thousand.","That was the divine power of his divine body.","Wearing the Tribulation Armor added another million.","That also added to the divine body.","So, his base divine power came to 2.5 million.","Using the Super Eternal Ancient Transformation would double that.","That made it 5 million.","At that time, his divine power would be 7.5 million.","With the blessings of the Origin Source Dao Arena and the three major universes, it would","increase by 60 percent.","Adding another 4.5 million.","That would make it 12 million divine power.","As a Universe Master of the Sixth Tribulation realm, 12 million divine power equaled the peak power of the Eighth Tribulation realm.","And that didn’t even count the divine power he would gain after successfully transcending the","Tribulation.","With all this progress, he had the hope of rivaling perfected Eighth Tribulation experts.","That is, those with over 15 million divine power.","The Blood Demon Temple Master barely reached this level.","While cultivating, he also planned his progress.","The Eternal Ancient Transformation and the Starry Sky Chronicles were also being","continuously practiced.","The power of the Beast God, which he had relied on initially, had somewhat fallen into disuse.","The power of the Beast God was indeed a valuable treasure.","It had played a significant role from the Dao Lord to now.","Without the Super Eternal Ancient Transformation, it wouldn’t have been replaced.","It was a pity that it was now neglected.","However, Jian Wushuang temporarily couldn’t think of a better way.","“If I could still use the power of the Beast God after using the Super Eternal Ancient Transformation, that would be great!” With this idea in mind, Jian Wushuang actually tried","several times, but unfortunately, all failed.","Which was normal.","After using the Super Eternal Ancient Transformation, the burden on the divine body had reached its limit, and using the power of the Beast God again was impossible.","Not only could the divine body not support it, but even the Beast God Armor couldn’t either.","Initially, in the Moro Spacetime, the Qishen Temple had refined nine great Beast God Armors.","The Candle Dragon was just one of them.","If he could collect the other Beast God Armors, perhaps he could support the Super Eternal Ancient Transformation.","By then, he would only need to enhance his divine body a bit more, and it was really possible","to cover it together.","Super Eternal Ancient Transformation plus the power of the Beast God.","It was scary to even think about.","“Moro Spacetime, Qishen Temple, Beast God Armors!” Jian Wushuang clenched his fist,","burying this idea in his heart as well.","Mie Sheng had transactions with the Qishen Temple; it was possible to encounter Qishen.","...","Ancient Moon Spacetime!","The Primordial White Heaven among the Nine Heavens and Ten Lands.","Different from other places, the Primordial White Heaven was the most stable and undamaged space in the entire Ancient Moon Spacetime.","Even the gates of the Ancient Moon Divine Religion were stationed here.","In terms of overall strength, it was much stronger than the Ancient Wood Continent in the","past.","But compared to the top powers of the Ancient Wood Continent now, it was almost the same. Because of the strength of Divine Wood King and the joining of Lord Hengmu, the current","Ancient Wood Continent was in its infancy, gathering many Universe Masters.","It had a momentum to surpass the Primordial White Heaven.","However, the Ancient Moon Sect didn’t care about this at all.","In the Primordial White Heaven, it wasn’t just the Ancient Moon Religion.","There was also an eight-star sect.","“Bai Divine Mountain!”","Established by the Patriarch of the Bai Family in the Primordial White Heaven.","When it came to Bai Divine Mountain, no one would think of the Bai Family Patriarch.","Instead, they would mention the contemporary Pope of the Ancient Moon Religion.","She was from the Bai Family.","A Universe Master at the peak of the Eighth Tribulation realm.","She was also the current strongest in the Ancient Wood Continent."]}]);
